ND 0.6
Filter', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (28, 5, 209, '4 x 4 Schneider Neutral Density 0.9 Filter', '4-x-4-schneider-neutral-density-0-9-filter', 'The 4 × 4 Schneider Neutral Density 0.9 Filter lets you adjust exposure without affecting color balance by reducing the amount of light that reaches the film. Key features include:

Slows shutter speeds to better capture movement
Allow the use of wider apertures in bright conditions
Lets you capture bright subjects without overexposure
Water White Glass maintains optical clarity and sharpness

Versatile ND Filter. The 4 × 4 Schneider Neutral Density 0.9 Filter provides three stops of exposure adjustment, reducing ISO by 1/8.

Common Uses. Neutral Density filters are commonly used for slowing shutter speeds to capture movement in subjects like waterfalls, clouds, and cars, and they also allow the use of wider apertures in bright conditions to decrease depth of field. ND filters decrease the effective ISO of film with ISO ratings above 400 so that you can use it in bright outdoor conditions, and they let cine and video cameras capture bright subjects like snow and sand without overexposing the image.

Schneider Build Quality. This filter is constructed from Water White Glass for optical clarity and sharpness, and Schneider’s Edge Seal protects it from edge-chipping and delamination while helping reduce edge reflections and flare.', 71000.0, '{"Brand":"Schneider","Filter Format":"4×4","Filter Type":"Neutral Density","General":"Filter TypeSolid NDDensity0.9 (3-Stop)RotatingNoFront Accessory Thread / BayonetUnthreadedRectangular Size4 × 4″ / 101.6 × 101.6mmCoatingsMulti-CoatingFilter Thickness0.16\\" / 4mmFilter MaterialGlass","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Support Type":"Filter","Mfr. Model Number":"68-040944"}', '4 × 4
