Pastel Tones. In addition to softening contrast, it’s used to mute colors for exquisite pastel tones.', 93000.0, '{"Brand":"Tiffen","Filter Format":"4×4","Filter Type":"Flare Effect","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Support Type":"Filter"}', 'Just the filter', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
