Lens
Barrel', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (96, 4, 3, 'AJA P-Tap to D5/10-PC Connector Cable', 'aja-p-tap-to-d5-10-pc-connector-cable', 'The AJA P-Tap to D5/10-PC Connector Cable is an extended power solution for select AJA Mini-Converters. The D5/10-PC connector attaches to the DC input of compatible converters like the FiDO-2R-12G and FiDO-2T-12G, while the D-Tap connector plugs into an optional battery or other D-Tap power source. This cable is 18" long.', 36000.0, '{"Brand":"AJA","Cable Type":"Power and Accessory","Connector":"D-Tap","Item Type":"Cable","Length":"1.5’"}', 'Just the cable', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (97, 6, 12, 'APC SurgeArrest 8-Outlet Surge Protector', 'apc-surgearrest-8-outlet-surge-protector', 'The APC SurgeArrest 8-Outlet Surge Protector protects up to 8 of your electronics against surges. If there are stock issues when renting, we have a 6-Outlet strip available. Key features include:

2630 Joules surge protection energy rating
8x total outlets / 4x block-sized
2x USB charging ports (5V 2.4A combined)
6-foot power cord with flat-end space saving plug

Guaranteed Surge Protection. APC uses multi-stage suppression circuitry to ensure sensitive electronics are protected.  This model is rated for 2630 Joules surge protection.

8-Outlets. This model includes a total of eight outlets, four of which are BlockSpace outlets for connecting oversized transformer blocks.

2x USB Charging Ports. Charge and protect smartphones, tablets, cameras, and all other USB-enabled devices via two USB ports.  Total available power output between the two USB ports are 5V 2.4A.

Quality A/V experience. EMI/RFI noise filter maintains audio/video quality by protecting your equipment from electromagnetic and radio frequency interference.

2 LED Indicators. Illuminates when there is a unit and wall wiring issues.

Flexible Cable Management. With its 6-foot rotating power cord & flat right angle plug, the APC SurgeArrest 8-Outlet Surge Protector simplifies placement.', 71000.0, '{"Brand":"APC","Connectivity":"Outlets8 (4 Block-Sized)USB Ports2x USB Type-AEthernetNoneCoaxialNoneRJ11None","Electrical":"AC Input Power104 to 126 VAC, 60 HzRated Current15 AUSB Output5 V, 2.4 AClamping Response Time< 1 nsSurge Energy Rating2630 JoulesEMI/RFI Noise Filtration35 to 70 dB (1 kHz to 10 MHz)","Item Type":"Power","Mfr. Model Number":"P8U2","Physical":"Cable Length8’ / 2.4mCable ManagementNone","Power Type":"Surge Protector"}', 'Just the
APC
