Cine Build. All of the Master Primes feature consistent focus, iris, and zoom ring positions for ease of use with follow-focus, zoom-control, and F/I/Z wireless systems. Most of the Master Primes, including this lens, have uniform 114mm front diameters so that you can use the same size filters, matte-box adapters, and the like. The 25mm has focus marks set in feet, a compact 8-inch length, a 14-inch minimum focusing distance, and is a reasonably lightweight 5.1 lbs.

