Power and Memory. You can power the ALEXA 35 via an optional ARRI B-Mount battery adapter and separately available batteries. The B-Mount system can power both 12 and 24V accessories, which saves you weight and space when you’d otherwise need to use two separate battery types. The ALEXA 35 offers MFX/ARRIRAW and MFX/ProRes capture to 1 or 2TB Codex Compact drives with resolutions up to 4.6K and frame rates up to 120p.', 13032000.0, '{"Brand":"ARRI","Camera Mount":"Canon EF and PL","Camera Type":"Broadcast","Compatible Media":"Compact Drive","Dimensions":"8 × 6 × 5.8″ (L x W x H)","I/O Connectivity":"Pogo, USB-C, 10-Pin LEMO Ethernet, 3.5mm Headphone, 6-Pin LEMO Line In, and 5-Pin LEMO Timecode","ISO Range":"160-6400","Item Type":"Camera","Maximum Video Resolution":"4K","Mfr. Model Number":"K0.0041724","Screen Type":"Fixed","Sensor Size":"Super35","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Weight":"6.4 lb.","Wireless Connectivity":"Wi-Fi"}', 'ARRI
