INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (137, 3, 17, 'ARRI ALEXA Mini Cage', 'arri-alexa-mini-cage', 'The ARRI ALEXA Mini Cage surrounds the ARRI ALEXA Mini with mounting points for ARRI standard rosette, 1/4"-20 & 3/8"-16 threaded stud, and 15mm rail accessories. Key features include:

Works with the ARRI Alexa Mini
Upper and lower 15mm rod mounts
Left and right side ARRI standard rosette adapters
A plethora of 1/4" & 3/8" threaded holes

Need 15mm Support Rods? No one accessory rod length works for all circumstances, so you’ll choose or provide your own for this rental. We offer rods from Wooden in 6-inch, 9-inch, 12-inch lengths.

Lightweight & Unobtrusive.  This ARRI ALEXA Mini Cage is a lightweight way to add options for mounting accessories to an ARRI ALEXA Mini. Size is a main selling point of the ALEXA Mini and this cage keeps it small.

Mounting Options. This cage adds an ARRI standard rosette on both the right and left of the camera body as well as holes for 15mm LWS spaced rods on both the top and bottom plates. The top, bottom, and side plates include multiple mounting points for 1/4"-20 and 3/8"-16 threaded post accessories. We also include a RMB-3 rod mount accessory bracket for attaching 15mm and 19mm rods and accessories at various points around the cage.

Shoulder Pad. The CSP-1 shoulder pad gets you closer to a shoulder-ready Alexa Mini configuration with only the need to provide or rent grips and rods where needed. We have options like the Zacuto Wooden Dual Trigger Grips. They will require 15mm rods like the Wooden 15mm Rod Pair – 15in

Compatibility. This cage is designed by ARRI specifically for the ALEXA Mini. It will not work with any other camera. If you are renting our ARRI ALEXA Mini Premium Package, you do not need this cage as it is already included. This cage does not include a viewfinder mount or rods.', 486000.0, '{"Brand":"ARRI","Camera Support Type":"Cage","Item Type":"Camera Support"}', 'ARRI
