	Zeiss Compact Prime CP.3 Cine 6-Lens Set PL
	Angenieux EZ-1 30-90mm T2.0 S35 PL

CineMilled Counterbalance Kit for DJI Ronin 2
	DJI Focus Wireless Follow Focus System
	SmallHD Cine 7 HDMI / SDI Monitor w/ ARRI Control', 4579000.0, '{"Brand":"ARRI","Camera Mount":"PL","Camera Type":"Cinema","Codec / Format Support":"ProRes 4444XQ, 4444, 422(HQ), 422, 422(LT) MXF/ARRIRAW","Compatible Media":"CFast","Dimensions":"Length: 185 mm/7.3\\"\\nWidth: 125 mm/4.9\\" \\nHeight: 140 mm/5.5\\"","Filter Type":"Built-in motorized ND filters 0.6, 1.2, 2.1","Item Type":"Camera","Maximum Video Resolution":"4K","Recording Formats":"ProRes:\\n 4:3 2.8K: 2880 × 2160 up to 50 fps (padded to 2944 × 2160)\\n 4K UHD: 3840 × 2160 (up-sampled from 3.2K)\\n 3.2K: 3200 × 1800\\n 2K Cine 16:9: 2048 × 1152\\n HD: 1920 × 1080\\n S16 HD: 1920 × 1080 (up-sampled from 1600 × 900)\\n\\n Anamorphic ProRes: (with 2x in-camera de-squeeze)\\n 2.39:1 2K Anamorphic: 2048 × 858\\n HD Anamorphic: 1920 × 1080\\n\\n MXF/ARRIRAW:\\n (in-camera recording to MXF-wrapped ARRIRAW files)\\n Open Gate: 3424 × 2202\\n 2.8K 16:9: 2880 × 1620\\n\\n MXF/ARRIRAW Open Gate: (with active image area matching 4:3 ProRes modes)\\n 4:3 2.8K (OG 3.4K): 2880 × 2160 (recording in open-gate 3.4K)\\n 2.39:1 Anamorphic (OG 3.4K): 2560 × 2145 (recording in open-gate 3.4K)\\n 16:9 HD Anamorphic (OG 3.4K): 1920 × 2160 (recording in open-gate 3.4K)","Sensor":"ARRI ALEV III CMOS with Bayer pattern color filter array","Sensor Size":"Super35","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Wireless Connectivity":"Wi-Fi"}', 'ARRI
