	3-prong power cable', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (141, 3, 17, 'ARRI ALEXA Mini LF Cage - 15mm LWS', 'arri-alexa-mini-lf-cage-15mm-lws', 'The ARRI ALEXA Mini LF Cage surrounds the ALEXA Mini LF with mounting points for ARRI standard rosette, 1/4"-20 & 3/8"-16 threaded stud, 15mm studio, & 15mm LWS rail accessories. Key features include:

Works with the ARRI ALEXA Mini LF
15mm studio & 15mm LWS rail compatibility
Left and right side ARRI standard rosette adapters
A plethora of 1/4" & 3/8" threaded holes

Need Support Rods? No one accessory rod length works for all circumstances, so you’ll choose or provide your own for this rental. We offer pairs of 15mm rods in lots of length. See them here.

Full Cage With Rear Accessory Bracket. This ARRI ALEXAMini Cage is a lightweight way to add options for mounting accessories to an ARRI ALEXA Mini LF. Size is a main selling point of the ALEXA Mini LF and this cage can be configured to keep it small. This cage features a rear accessory bracket for attaching an ARRI Power Splitting Box Mk II in either Gold Mount or V-Mount.

Mounting Options. This cage adds an ARRI standard rosette on both the right and left of the camera body, holes for 15mm studio spaced lower support rods, holes for 15mm LWS spaced lower support rods, & holes for top-plate-mounted 15mm LWS spaced rods. The top, bottom, and side plates include multiple mounting points for 1/4"-20 and 3/8"-16 threaded post accessories.

Compatibility. This cage is designed by ARRI specifically for the ARRI ALEXA Mini LF. It will not work with other cameras. This cage does not include a viewfinder mount, battery plate, or rods.', 679000.0, '{"Brand":"ARRI","Camera Support Type":"Cage","Item Type":"Camera Support"}', 'MAP-2 top plate
RMB-3 rod mount w/ reduction insert
CCH-2 top handle
MSB-2 side bracket
MSB-3 side bracket
RAB-1 rear bracket
CBP-2 15mm bridge
	15mm
LWS adapter
CBP-1
QR plate
	12-inch dovetail
	2mm hex driver
	3mm hex driver', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
