Cinematic Super 35 live TV camera
UHD 4K60, 2K, or HD Video/ProRes
Adapter eliminates external cables to the fiber backend
AMIRA Advanced / UHD 4K / Look Library lic. Pre-installed

An AMIRA Built for Broadcast. The Amira Live is a more streamlined live-tv-type camera that delivers an ARRI cinema-standard image. With SUP 6.1, ARRI introduces enhanced multi-camera functions like an always-welcomed faster boot-up time, improved sharpness and noise reduction, user-button intercom talkback for easier shoulder-mounted communication, and a green tally viewfinder function.

One Cable to Rule Them All. The AMIRA Live features internal cabling between the camera body and the 1820 Fiber Camera Adapter for a cleaner and more reliable configuration. It allows the transport of all video and data over a single SMPTE-311 fiber cable. One cable makes it easier for camera operators, offers faster setup and reduced risk of accidental cable disconnection or damage.

3.2K ALEV III Sensor. The AMIRA Live utilizes the ALEV III CMOS sensor, which provides low noise, natural skin tones, true colors, and fourteen stops of dynamic range. Scenes with a high contrast range, which are not possible to capture with conventional broadcast cameras, can be recorded in all their detail thanks to the high dynamic range of the ARRI 3.2K image sensor.

ARRIRAW & UHD 4K60 ProRes. Versatile recording options include 2.8K ARRIRAW, UHD 4K60 ProRes, and 1-200 fps capture in 2K and HD ProRes for slow-motion, intervalometer, and stop-motion effects.

Simultaneous Recording and Streaming. Record in-camera to CFast 2.0 cards while simultaneously transmitting live, cinema-quality HD, or UHD images to a broadcast facility, viewing monitor, or social media platform.', 8586000.0, '{"Audio Recording":"4-Channel 24-Bit 48 kHz LPCM Audio","Brand":"ARRI","Camera Mount":"PL","Camera Type":"Cinema","Compatible Media":"CFast","Dimensions":"12.2 × 5.9 × 5.5″","Dynamic Range":"14 stops","Inputs/Outputs":"Video1 x D-Sub 24W7 Input/Output2 x BNC (6G-SDI) OutputAudio2 x XLR 3-Pin Mic/Line (48 V Phantom Power) Input1 × 1/8\\" / 3.5 mm TRS Stereo Headphone Output1 x XLR 5-Pin Mic/Line (48 V Phantom Power) InputPower1 x LEMO 8-Pin (10.5 to 34VDC) Input1 x Fischer 3-Pin (24VDC) Output1 x LEMO 2-Pin (12VDC) Output1 x Hirose 4-Pin (12VDC) Output1 x LEMO 6-Pin (24VDC) OutputOther1 x BNC (Timecode) Input/Output1 x BNC (Return) Return Input/Output1 x LEMO 6-Pin Control Input/Output1 x Hirose 12-Pin Data 1 x RJ45 (Ethernet) Control/Data2 x Unspecified USB (USB 2.0) Data","Internal Video Recording Modes":"ARRIRAW2880 × 1620 from 0.75 to 48.00 fpsMPEG-2/ProRes 422/ProRes 422 HQ/ProRes 422LT/ProRes 4444/ProRes 4444XQ3840 × 2160 from 0.75 to 59.94 fps3200 × 1800 from 0.75 to 59.94 fps2048 × 1152 from 0.75 to 200 fps1920 × 1080 from 0.75 to 200 fps","Item Type":"Camera","Maximum Frame Rate":"200","Maximum Video Resolution":"4K","Memory Card Slot":"Dual Slot: CFast (CFast 2.0)","Screen Type":"Fixed","Sensor":"26.4 × 14.85 mm (Super35) CMOS","Sensor Size":"Super35","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Weight":"11.5 lb.","Wireless Connectivity":"Wi-Fi and Bluetooth"}', 'ARRI
