Compatibility. The ARRI AMIRA PL LDS Lens Mount allows users to pair popular PL Mount lenses with an ARRI AMIRA. It will also work with an ALEXA MINI, but if you need L-Bus support, you’ll want to rent the ARRI Titanium PL Mount LDS with L-Bus Connector.

ARRI LDS Via 12-pin Hirose. Display lens data like t-stop, focal length, and focus distance in status overlays or on connected monitors when used with compatible PL lenses. LDS communication is supported by a Hirose 12-pin connector on the lens mount.', 350000.0, '{"Brand":"ARRI","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Mount":"PL","Lens Support Type":"Lens Mount","Mfr. Model Number":"K2.0001107"}', 'ARRI
