Bridge
Plate (19mm)', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (171, 3, 17, 'ARRI Camera Control Panel CCP-1 for ALEXA Mini', 'arri-camera-control-panel-ccp-1-for-alexa-mini', 'This ARRI CCP-1 Camera Control Panel for ALEXA Mini is a compact control panel and monitor for the ALEXA Mini and only the ALEXA Mini. Key features include:

Works with the ARRI ALEXA Mini
Menu interface with live view display
User-customizable function buttons
Extended cable for off-camera use

ALEXA Mini Compatibility. Please note that this control panel is only compatible with the ALEXA Mini and will not work with an ARRI AMIRA or ARRI ALEXA Mini LF.

Off-Camera Control. The CCP-1 Camera Control Panel for ALEXA Mini from ARRI provides camera control in a compact form that connects to the camera’s viewfinder port. Use this panel to control the camera when employing an onboard monitor in place of an electronic viewfinder (EVF).

Two Cables Included. We include a 59-inch and 29-inch cable with this rental to give you the freedom to operate away from the camera with the convenient alternative of keeping cable clutter off set. Need a cable shorter than 29-inches? We can also send you a 19-inch cable if you request it in the special instructions box at checkout.

ARRI-Standard 3/8 Mounting. The rear of this control panel features a 3/8-16" female insert with ARRI-standard location pins for adapting to readily available grip arms and brackets.', 643000.0, '{"Brand":"ARRI","Camera Support Type":"Controller","Item Type":"Camera Support","Mount":"Unknown"}', 'Camera
Control
Panel
CCP-1
ALEXA
Mini to
CCP-1
Cable 59"
ALEXA
Mini to
CCP-1
Cable 29"', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (172, 3, 17, 'ARRI Camera Control Panel CCP-1 for AMIRA', 'arri-camera-control-panel-ccp-1-for-amira', 'The ARRI Camera Control Panel CCP-1 for AMIRA offers compact camera control for the ARRI AMIRA. Key features include:

Control panel for AMIRA
L-bracket mount included
29in and 59in cables included
Separates controls from viewfinder

Compact Camera Control. The ARRI Camera Control Panel CCP-1 for AMIRA can be used to control your ARRI AMIRA camera, rather than using an electronic viewfinder (EVF). With separately available cables, this panel can be daisy-chained to the MVF-1.', 850000.0, '{"Brand":"ARRI","Camera Support Type":"Controller","Item Type":"Camera Support"}', 'ARRI
CCP-1
