INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (180, 2, 17, 'ARRI Enso Prime 105mm T2.1 (LPL)', 'arri-enso-prime-105mm-t2-1-lpl', 'The ARRI Enso Prime 105mm T2.1 (LPL) is a lightweight and versatile full-frame prime lens capable of capturing stunning close-ups with minimal focus breathing and natural, high-resolution imaging. Key features include:

T2.1 max aperture | full-frame and S35 coverage
23.5-inch minimum focusing distance
Cooke /i & ARRI LDS-2 lens communication
1:4 magnification ratio

Meet The Enso. The sleek and simple design behind this ARRI Enso Prime 105mm T2.1 (LPL) is maintained across each focal length, including the 18mm, 24mm, 32mm, 47mm, and 75mm lenses!

Uniform Design. Shared Features. Designed to capture natural image detail with a stunning bokeh through both full-frame and Super 35 camera sensors, the ARRI Enso lenses share a T2.1 maximum aperture and a 1:4 magnification ratio. That 0.25x magnification for each lens equips you with a close minimum focusing distance, which is just 23.5 inches for this 105mm lens.

Gears, Metadata, More. The cohesive nature of these lenses don’t stop there–– each lens of the Enso lines comes supplied with Cooke /i and ARRI LDS-2 lens communication, providing metadata to your LPL-mount camera. Sporting a classic 95mm front diameter, these lenses are compatible with most standard matte boxes. Since the lenses do not have any filter threading, matte box filters can be used in place of your usual screw-on filter! Thanks to the consistent gear positioning of each focal length, lens swapping feels more intuitive. These gears are marked in feet, promoting precision adjustments for both focus and iris.

Vintage Elements Available. Looking to push creative boundaries even further? You might be interested in the six-filter ARRI Enso Vintage Elements Kit! These six rear diopters consist of three positive 100P, 200P, and 350P variations, and three negative 100N, 200N, and 350N variations designed to produce different intensities of bokeh effects.', 2918000.0, '{"Angle of View":"19.8°","Brand":"ARRI","Dimensions":"3.7 × 4.8″ (ø x L)","Filter Type":"Matte Box Mount","Focal Length":"105-105","Focus Rotation":"318º","Focus Type":"Manual Focus Only","Front Lens Diameter":"95mm","Gearing":"0.8 MOD focus, iris","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"Full-Frame and VistaVision","Lens Mount":"LPL","Lens Type":"Cine, Telephoto, and For Mirrorless","Maximum Aperture":"2.1","Maximum Magnification":"0.25x","Mfr. Model Number":"K2.0048098","Minimum Focusing Distance":"1.9’","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Weight":"3.5 lb.","Zoom Type":"Fixed Focal Length"}', 'ARRI
