INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (188, 2, 17, 'ARRI Enso Prime Core Set (LPL)', 'arri-enso-prime-core-set-lpl', 'The ARRI Enso Prime Core Set (LPL) is a collection of 6 compact prime lenses designed with uniform characteristics, metadata capabilities, and a consistent 1:4 magnification ratio. Key features include:

18, 24, 32, 47, 75 & 105mm lenses
ARRI LPL mount
Cooke/i & ARRI LDS-2 lens communication
Standard 95mm front diameter

Prime to the Core. This ARRI Enso Prime Core Set (LPL) supplies you with access to 6 unbelievably compact and lightweight prime lenses, which are offered here in focal lengths of 18mm, 24mm, 32mm, 47mm, 75mm, and 105mm. Each lens remains very consistent externally and internally, all sharing a standard 95mm front diameter, a 1:4 magnification ratio, and a T2.1 aperture.

Uniform Design and Metadata Capabilities. Developed with balanced optical parameters to promote sharp imaging, each of these lenses provide metadata through Cooke/i & ARRI LDS-2 lens communication directly to your camera. Short minimum focusing distances and a consistent 1:4 magnification ratio across the entire line help capture immersive close-ups with minimal focus breathing, stunning bokeh, and a gentle focus fall-off.

Gears and More. Sporting a classic 95mm front diameter, these lenses are compatible with most standard matte boxes. Since the lenses do not have any filter threading, matte box filters can be used in place of your usual screw-on filter! Thanks to the consistent gear positioning of each focal length, lens swapping feels more intuitive. These gears are marked in feet, promoting precision adjustments for both focus and iris.

Vintage Elements Available. Looking to push creative boundaries even further? You might be interested in the six-filter ARRI Enso Vintage Elements Kit! These six rear diopters consist of three positive 100P, 200P, and 350P variations, and three negative 100N, 200N, and 350N variations designed to produce different intensities of bokeh effects.', 15525000.0, '{"Aperture Blades":"11","Brand":"ARRI","Filter Type":"Matte Box Mount","Focus Rotation":"318º","Focus Type":"Manual Focus Only","Front Lens Diameter":"95mm","Gearing":"0.8 MOD focus, iris","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"Full-Frame and VistaVision","Lens Mount":"LPL","Lens Type":"Cine, Wide Angle, Standard, Telephoto, Kit, and For Mirrorless","Maximum Aperture":"2.1","Maximum Magnification":"0.25x","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Weight":"40.0 lb.","Zoom Type":"Fixed Focal Length"}', 'ARRI
