INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (189, 5, 17, 'ARRI Enso Vintage Elements Kit', 'arri-enso-vintage-elements-kit', 'The ARRI Enso Vintage Elements Kit is a collection of six interchangeable rear optics for ARRI Enso Prime lenses that allow you to capture multiple looks with a single lens set. Key features include:

Six rear diopters with positive and negative strengths
Magnetic holding system for simple swaps
Built-in chip for carrying LDS-2 metadata
Designed only for ARRI Enso Prime lenses

All The Filters. This ARRI Enso Vintage Elements Kit includes six filter adapters with 100P, 200P, and 350P positive strength diopters, as well as 100N, 200N, and 350N negative strength diopters. Each filter element attaches magnetically to the rear of any of the Enso Prime lenses, and effectively opens the lens aperture range, changes the exposure stops, and multiplies the focal length by different percentages across the line.

Positively Enso. Designed purely for Enso, this kit produces smeary, soft-edged bokeh in the background with Petzval-like swirl at the frame edges with the three positive diopters. The included negative diopters have the opposite effect, producing out-of-focus highlights with intense highlights and diffused cores that add an edge to your imaging.

LDS-2 Data. Enso lenses and VEs are equipped with ARRI’s LDS-2 Lens Data System, with high data rates and absolute encoders for fast initializing. Enso lenses also support Cooke /i for the use of Enso lenses on third-party cameras supporting Cooke /i.', 1618000.0, '{"Brand":"ARRI","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Support Type":"Filter"}', 'ARRI
