Three 2-pin LEMO, two 3-pin Fischer, one 4-pin Hirose, & USB power outputs
Mounts to the Alexa Mini LF cage via quick release latch or 15mm LWS rod mount

Gold Mount Power. The ARRI Gold Mount Power Splitting Box Mk II attaches to the rear of the ARRI Alexa Mini LF cage or to 15mm LWS rods and supports Gold Mount batteries. Please note that no batteries are included with this rental, and we also rent a V-Mount version.

Power Distribution. This battery plate provides options for powering accessories that use 3-pin Fischer, 2-pin LEMO, 4-pin Hirose, or 5V USB. The plate also passes power through from an 8-pin LEMO DC input to an 8-pin LEMO output for camera power from other sources.

Batteries & Chargers Not Included. This rental does not include Gold Mount batteries or a charger, but we have lots of options available for rental separately here.', 268000.0, '{"Brand":"ARRI","Item Type":"Power","Mount":"Unknown","Power Type":"Battery Plate"}', 'Gold
