LMB 4 × 5″ Matte Box. The versatile and modular LMB 4 × 5″ Matte Box from ARRI is the the heart of this kit. Its configuration is incredibly easy to adjust with the included 1- and 2-filter stationary stages, three 4 × 5.65″ and 4 × 4″ combo filter trays, and a top/bottom flag. The carbon fiber flag feature slide-out wings to provide extra shade, and attaches to the matte box through captive screws.

Clamp Adapters. Included with this kit are a selection of clamp adapters to fit a range of lens barrels. You’ll receive 80mm, 95mm, 110mm, 114mm, and 156mm individual adapters that attach to the matte box through the screw-on clamp center and keyhole-type slots.

