Driver
	3/16
Driver', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (215, 6, 23, 'ATOMOS D-Tap DC Power Adapter w/ Cable', 'atomos-d-tap-dc-power-adapter-w-cable', 'The ATOMOS D-Tap DC Power Adapter with Cable offers alternate powering options for our ATOMOS recorders. Key features include:

Dummy battery with a D-tap input
Three-foot D-tap to D-tap cable included
Excellent value
Battery rig not included

Dummy Battery. At the heart of the ATOMOS D-Tap DC Power Adapter is the dummy battery, which is essentially a Sony L-series battery with a D-tap input. From there, you just plug in the included three-foot D-tap to D-tap cable and connect it to your Anton Bauer/V-Mount battery rig.

Battery Rig Not Included. This rental doesn’t include any batteries, battery plates, or chargers. We offer all of these as separate rental items, and you can view some options under Recommended on the left-hand side of this page or view our Gold Mount options here and our V-Mount options here.', 75000.0, '{"Battery System":"D-Tap","Brand":"Atomos","Item Type":"Power","Power Type":"Power Adapter and Power Cable"}', 'D-tap dummy battery
	3-ft.
D-tap to
D-tap cable', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (216, 1, 25, 'AViPAS AV-1081 HDMI PTZ Camera (Dark Gray)', 'avipas-av-1081-hdmi-ptz-camera-dark-gray', 'The AViPAS AV-1081 HDMI PTZ Camera (Dark Gray) is a 1080p PTZ camera designed for video conferencing. Key features include:

1920×1080 video recording
10x optical zoom and 5x digital zoom
60.9° angle of view
IR remote controller included

Confer With Ease. Intended for video conferencing, the AViPAS AV-1081 HDMI PTZ Camera (Dark Gray) captures Full HD 1080p video at a 60.9° angle of view and has a varifocal lens with a 4.7-47mm equivalent made possible by the 10x optical zoom and 5x digital zoom. Everything can be controlled by the included IR controller.

Control Options. The AV-1081 is not NDI-capable but can be controlled by connecting the camera to a computer via ethernet. The DB9 cable isn’t included by default with this rental, but one can be requested at checkout in the Special Instructions box if you need it to connect to other devices. The camera can also be controlled by an optional Elgato Stream Deck if you want to integrate this camera into your existing streaming setup. Manuals for all of these control options are included in the Resources section of this page.', 164000.0, '{"Brand":"AViPAS","Camera Type":"PTZ","Compatible Media":"External Storage","Focal Length":"4.7 to 47mm","Inputs/Outputs":"1x HDMI Female\\n1x RJ45 Female\\n1x 3.5mm Stereo Line Level Input\\n1x Mini-DIN 8-Pin Input","Item Type":"Camera","Maximum Video Resolution":"1080p","Range":"Pan: 270° (-135 to 135°)\\nTilt: 60° (-30 to 30°)","Resolution":"1920×1080p","Sensor Size":"1-Inch","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"No","Weight":"3.1 lb."}', 'AV-1081
PTZ
Camera
AC adapter
