Case', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (217, 6, 2, 'Accell PowerSquid Flexible 5-Outlet Surge Protector', 'accell-powersquid-flexible-5-outlet-surge-protector', 'The Accell PowerSquid Flexible 5-Outlet Surge Protector is a cost-friendly yet effective power strip that is rated to handle sensitive electronics.

1080 Joules surge protection energy rating
5x total outlets
Accommodates up to 5 bulky transformer plugs
3-foot power cord with flexible squid outlet arms

Guaranteed Surge Protection. When the PowerSquid reaches its maximum joule rating it will stop conducting power, ensuring your connected equipment is not exposed to harmful surges.

5-outlets. This model includes a total of five outlets, and the squid outlet arms are flexible enough to work with up to 5 bulky transformer plugs with ease.

Quality A/V experience. EMI/RFI noise filter isolates your equipment from power generated noise for a superior sound and picture when used with an audio or video device.

LED Indicators. A green power indicator will illuminate when power is achieved, a red indicator will illuminate when you are surge protected, and  a green LED will illuminate when you have achieved grounded power.

Flexible Cable Management. Unlike a power strip, the squid outlet arms can help prevent damage to a power plug of a connected device. In the case of sudden pull force on a connected device’s power cord, the flexible arms bend to the direction of the pull. The flexible power outlet arms bend to counter pull force from most any direction.', 39000.0, '{"Brand":"Accell","Cable Length":"3-foot","EMI/RFI Noise Filtration":"Up to 40dB","Item Type":"Power","Mfr. Model Number":"D080B-008K","Outlets":"5","Power Type":"Surge Protector","Surge Energy Rating":"1080 joules"}', 'Just the
Accell
PowerSquid
Flexible 5-Outlet
Surge
Protector', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
