Thunderbolt 5. The Lensrentals Thunderbolt 5 USB Cable 3ft retains the ability to transfer files from and connect to Thunderbolt 4 devices, just at a much faster pace. With a doubled data transfer speeds of 80Gb/s compared to the Thunderbolt 4, this cable works overtime to quickly transfer high-bandwidth files and charge even the most power-hungry devices.', 43000.0, '{"Brand":"Anker","Cable":"240W 48V/5A","Item Type":"Power","Maximum Power":"Output: 65 W","Power Output":"2x USB-C 65 A Shared 1x USB-A 22.5 A","Power Type":"Charger, Power Adapter, and Kit"}', 'Anker 735
