Compact Power Supply. Charge and supply power to a variety of devices with this Anker 8-in-1 USB-C Power Strip and Charging Station! Sporting 4 AC outlets, 2 USB-C ports, and 2 USB-A ports, this power strip features a 5-foot cable with a 3-prong plug with 45° swivel capabilities. The available 20W USB-C ports can charge an iPhone 15 to 53% in just 30 minutes!', 32000.0, '{"Brand":"Anker","Cable Length":"5ft","Dimensions":"4.72 × 3.15 × 0.71″","Item Type":"Power","Mfr. Model Number":"A91C3","Ports":"2x USB-C 2x USB-A 4x AC outlets","Power Type":"Power Distributor and Hub","Thickness":"0.7\\"","Voltage":"1.2E+2 Volts (AC)"}', 'Anker 8-in-1
