Cinema Power. The Cine 90 is designed to power up your power-hungry cinema cameras like the RED Epic-X Dragon and RED Scarlet-X Dragon.

12A Continuous Load. This 14.4 V, 90 Wh battery offers 12 amps of continuous power load, making it stable for power-hungry cine cameras that require a constant minimum. Its output is also perfectly suited for LED lights that accept V-Mount.

Charger Not Included. In order to provide you with maximum flexibility, batteries, chargers, and mounting plates are all separate rental items. This way, if you want four batteries but only one charger—and if you weren’t aware, the AB intelligent chargers are more expensive than the batteries—you don’t have to pay for four chargers too. If your camera accepts V-Mount batteries directly, you don’t have to pay for an adapter plate. If you order just a battery, we’ll assume that you already have an appropriate Bauer charger and just need an extra battery.', 86000.0, '{"Brand":"Anton Bauer","Item Type":"Power","Power Type":"Battery"}', 'Just the battery', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (268, 6, 9, 'Anton Bauer CINE 90 V-Mount Power Kit', 'anton-bauer-cine-90-v-mount-power-kit', 'The Anton Bauer CINE 90 V-Mount Power Kit offers one click shopping for those needing a little (or a lot) of extra juice for their next shoot. Here’s what you get:

(4) Anton Bauer CINE 90 V-Mount Batteries
Anton Bauer LP2 Dual V-Mount Battery Charger

Newer, Less Expensive Options Available. Our Anton Bauer Dionic XT90 V-Mount Power Kit 4-Pack and 8-Pack include newer batteries at a lower cost than this kit.

The Anton Bauer CINE 90 V-Mount Battery is an advanced AB V-mount battery. The Cine 90 is designed to power up your power hungry cinema cameras like the RED Epic-X Dragon and RED Scarlet-X Dragon.

This 14.4V, 90Wh battery offers 12 amps of continuous power load, making it stable for power-hungry cine cameras that require a constant minimum.  Additionally, its output is perfectly suited for V-Mount-accepting LED lighting.

The Anton Bauer LP2 Dual V-Mount Battery Charger is a compact “smart charger” designed and optimized for the Anton Bauer Digital & Cine 90 V-Mount Batteries. The LP2 offers the same simultaneous, multi-chemistry charging that allocates the most power to the highest-charged battery. Using a feature AB refers to as InterActivity, the charger communicates with the battery and assigns the best charge routine possible based on the battery’s cell chemistry. Anton Bauer also touts the Performance Series / LP2 chargers as being 40% more efficient.', 439000.0, '{"Brand":"Anton Bauer","Item Type":"Power","Power Type":"Battery, Charger, and Kit"}', '(4)
