8A Continuous Load. This 14.4 V, 98 Wh battery offers 8 amps of continuous power load, making it suitable for many cinema cameras that require a constant minimum output as well as LED lighting. It features a weather-resistant D-Tap port and a USB port for powering compatible accessories.

Five-LED Life Gauge. You’ll always know how much battery capacity is left, thanks to the five-LED power gauge. Each of its LEDs represents 20% of the remaining battery life. You can activate the gauge with the press of a button, and it automatically turns off to save power.

Charger Not Included. In order to provide you with maximum flexibility, batteries, chargers, and mounting plates are all separate rental items. This way, if you want four batteries but only one charger—and if you weren’t aware, the AB intelligent chargers are more expensive than the batteries—you don’t have to pay for four chargers too. If your camera accepts V-Mount batteries directly, you don’t have to pay for an adapter plate. If you only order a battery, we’ll assume that you already have an appropriate Anton Bauer charger and just need an extra battery.', 64000.0, '{"Accessory Ports":"1x D-Tap Output\\n1x USB Type-A Output","Brand":"Anton Bauer","Capacity":"98 Wh","Depth":"1.9\\"","Height":"3.7\\"","Item Type":"Power","Maximum Load":"8 A","Mfr. Model Number":"8675-0162","Operating Temperature":"14 to 122°F / -10 to 50°C","Output Voltage":"14.4 VDC","Power Type":"Battery","USB Output":"5 V","Width":"6.0\\""}', 'Just the battery', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (292, 6, 9, 'Anton Bauer Gold Mount Plus to V-Mount Converter (26 to 14V)', 'anton-bauer-gold-mount-plus-to-v-mount-converter-26-to-14v', 'The Anton Bauer Gold Mount Plus to V-Mount Converter allows you to safely power your equipment. Key features include:

Converts Output Voltage to 14 Volts
2 x P-Tap Power Outputs
Converts Gold Mount Plus to Gold Mount
Digital Resettable Fuse with Indicator

Power When You Need It. This Gold Mount Plus to V-Mount Converter from Anton Bauer enables you to use a Gold Mount Plus battery safely on cameras, lights, and other devices that power via V-mount batteries. The converter drops the output voltage of your Gold Mount Plus battery from 26 to 14V, making it compatible with standard V-mount battery outputs, and it features two 14V P-Tap outputs for accessories.

Safety Features.A digital resettable fuse helps protect your battery, and the converter features a status display indicator.', 96000.0, '{"Brand":"Anton Bauer","Item Type":"Power","Physical":"Weight: 7.1 oz","Power I/O":"2 x D-Tap","Power Input":"Gold Mount+: 26 VDC","Power Output":"Gold Mount: 14 VDC","Power Type":"Power Adapter"}', 'Anton
Bauer
Gold
Mount
Plus to
V-Mount
Converter (26 to 14V)', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (293, 6, 9, 'Anton Bauer Gold Mount Power Kit for 4-Pin XLR Devices', 'anton-bauer-gold-mount-power-kit-for-4-pin-xlr-devices', 'This Anton Bauer Gold Mount Power Kit includes everything you’ll need to power XLR4-powered devices using standard Gold Mount batteries. Click here for an updated version. Key features include:

Long battery life
Dual D-Tap connections
15mm rail mount
For XLR4-powered devices

Long Battery Life. With the one included Digital 90 battery, you’ll get roughly eight hours of power. Keep in mind that this estimate is just for powering the camera itself. Start adding monitors, recorders, and other devices, and power time comes back down to Earth. The included Twin 60 battery charger lets you recharge the Digital 90 after depletion. Click here for an updated version or here for an updated version in v-mount.

Dual D-Tap. The included AB Gold Mount plate features two D-Tap connections for powering additional accessories via the one battery source. We don’t include any accessory D-Tap cables with the rental, but we rent a wide variety that you can find here.

15mm Rail Mount. The AB Gold Mount plate is attached to a Wooden Camera Battery Slide with integrated 15mm rail mount, allowing simple attachment to popular shoulder mounts and baseplates like the Zacuto Cine EVF Recoil and Universal Baseplate.', 236000.0, '{"Brand":"Anton Bauer","Item Type":"Power","Power Type":"Battery, Charger, and Kit"}', 'AB
QRC-Dual
PT
Gold
Plate w/Rail
Mount
AB
Digital 90 battery
AB
