Adapt a V-Mount Camera. Want to use AB Gold Mount batteries with a Sony V-mount camera? This is what you need.

Adds D-Tap. The adapter adds three D-Tap inputs for powering additional accessories.', 86000.0, '{"Brand":"Anton Bauer","Item Type":"Power","Power Type":"Power Adapter"}', 'Gold to
V-Mount
Adapter', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (295, 6, 9, 'Anton Bauer LP2 Dual Gold Mount Battery Charger', 'anton-bauer-lp2-dual-gold-mount-battery-charger', 'The Anton Bauer LP2 Dual Gold Mount Battery Charger is a compact simultaneous charger. Key features include:

Simultaneous two-battery charging
Priority charging for quick changeover
Software-optimized charging
Wi-Fi network integration

Priority Charging. When you’re simultaneously charging two batteries, the LP2 detects which one has the strongest charge and prioritizes it. This ensures that you’ll have a fully charged battery as quickly as possible.

Software-Optimized Charging. This charger’s internal software monitors compatible batteries’ charging processes and discharge curves. The monitoring allows the LP2 to charge each battery according to its own characteristics.

Wi-Fi Network Integration. The LP2 includes integrated Wi-Fi for fleet management by rental facilities, ENG/EFP/OB vehicles, and broadcast-equipment depots.', 139000.0, '{"Brand":"Anton Bauer","Dimensions":"7.2 × 9 × 3.6″","Item Type":"Power","Power Type":"Charger","Voltage":"100 to 240 VAC, 50 to 60 Hz and"}', 'LP2
Dual
Gold-Mount
