Four-Pin XLR Output. Enables powering of a camera or any other accessory from the charger. If you’re using wall power, you can simultaneously charge batteries. If you’re out in the field, you can use two Gold Mount batteries to provide power through the charger.

Touchscreen Interface. The simple-to-use touchscreen display provides activity and status updates, as well as management functionality.', 121000.0, '{"Brand":"Anton Bauer","Item Type":"Power","Power Type":"Charger"}', 'Charger
