BMPCC4K 20-inch', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (314, 6, 9, 'Anton Bauer Titon Base Kit for Canon C100/C100 Mark II', 'anton-bauer-titon-base-kit-for-canon-c100-c100-mark-ii', 'The Anton Bauer Titon Base Kit for Canon C100/C100 Mark II is a one-click power solution for Canon C100/C100 Mark II/C300. Key features include:

68Wh 14.4V, lithium-ion battery
P-Tap and Fast-Charge USB ports
1/4"-20 mounting system w/ quick release
20-inch Canon C100/C100 Mark II/C300 power cable

Compact Titon Power. The Anton Bauer 68Wh Titon Base Battery provides the reliable power of a Titon lithium-ion battery in a slim, lightweight form. Rather than using the standard Anton Bauer locking battery connectors, the Titon Base sports three P-Tap ports and one high-speed USB port for delivering nearly universal, dependable power when paired with compatible cables.

