8A Continuous Load. This 14.4 V, 68 Wh power bank offers 8 amps of continuous power load, making it perfect for NP-FZ100 compatible cameras. An advanced onboard LCD fuel gauge displays remaining runtime while in use and the battery charge level when not working as an external power source.

Integrated QR System. The Titon Base incorporates a simple, 1/4"-20 mounting system, allowing you to wedge the battery between a camera or accessory and its tripod, lightstand, or other support accessory. Three 1/4-20 inserts are strategically spaced on the bottom, allowing you to establish the proper center of gravity for your rig, and a single built-in quick-release plate snaps into the top of the battery for easy transitions between mounted and handheld work.

20-Inch D-Tap Power Cable. The Wooden D-Tap to Sony NP-FZ100 20-inch Power Cable that is included in this kit is for use with NP-FZ100 compatible cameras and allows for the camera to be powered by batteries and battery plates featuring d-tap ports.

This NP-FZ100 adapter will work with:

Sony Alpha a7R IV
	Sony Alpha a7 III
	Sony Alpha a7C
	Sony Alpha a6600', 146000.0, '{"AC input Power":"100 to 240 VAC, 50 / 60 Hz","Accessory Ports":"3 x D-Tap Output\\n1 x USB Type-A Output 5 VDC","Battery":"Lithium-Ion","Battery System":"NP-FZ","Brand":"Anton Bauer","Cable Length":"20\\" / 50.8 cm","Capacity":"68 Wh","Connector":"1 x P-Tap Male (Right-Angle)\\n1 x 20-inch Sony NP-FZ100","Dimensions":"4 × 1.1 × 5.6″ / 10.1 × 2.9 × 14.2 cm","Indicator":"LED","Item Type":"Power","Maximum Load":"8 A (Peak)","Output Connectors":"D-Tap","Output Voltage":"14.4 VDC","Power Output":"D-Tap: 16.7 VDC at 1.5 A","Power Type":"Battery, Charger, Kit, and Battery Base","USB Output":"5 V, 2 A"}', 'Titon
