Compact Titon Power. The Anton Bauer Titon Base Battery provides the reliable power of a Titon lithium-ion battery in a slim, lightweight form. Rather than using the standard Anton Bauer locking battery connectors, the Titon Base sports three P-tap ports and one high-speed USB port for delivering nearly universal, dependable power when paired with compatible cables.

