Power Trip. Using the 16in Kondor Blue D-Tap to USB-C Power Cable, your mirrorless camera, laptop, or external accessory can be powered from any V-Mount or Gold Mount battery that has an available D-tap port. This cable provides up to 65W of power and allows you to hot swap batteries as you please. On one end of this cable you’ll find a D-tap connector, and on the other end you’ll find a USB-C connector.', 146000.0, '{"Battery":"Capacity68 Wh Maximum Amperage8A Voltage14.4 V Dimensions1.14″ × 3.98″ × 5.59″\\t Weight520g Inputs/Outputs3x P-Tap (Input/Output)1x USB (5V 2A)","Brand":"Anton Bauer","Cable":"Cable Length16\\"  Weight1.4 oz \\t Voltage ControlRegulated LED IndicatorsNo   Connectors1 x D-Tap Male1 x USB-C Male","Charger":"Charge Time ~6 hr (10A batteries)","Item Type":"Power","Power Type":"Battery, Charger, Kit, and Battery Base"}', 'Anton
