Extremely Low Anamorphic Distortion. The Atlas Orion 21mm T2 2X Anamorphic Prime (PL) offers an anamorphic view without as much distortion as some other options. The 2x anamorphic lens produces double the width of a traditional image so you don’t have to decide what to leave out of the shot.

Standardized 136mm Outer Diameter. The Atlas Orion 21mm is natively compatible with a wide variety of matte boxes and filters. This lens covers full-frame and large format, as well as VistaVision when used with a 1.6x LF Extender (not included).', 2064000.0, '{"Anamorphic Squeeze":"2x","Angle of View":"124°","Aperture Blades":"14","Brand":"Atlas","Dimensions":"5.4 × 7.4″ (ø x L)","Filter Type":"Matte Box Mount","Focal Length":"21-21","Focus Rotation":"270º","Focus Type":"Manual Focus Only","Front Lens Diameter":"136mm","Gearing":"0.8 MOD focus, iris","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"APS-C and Super35","Lens Mount":"PL","Lens Type":"Anamorphic, Cine, For Mirrorless, and Wide Angle","Maximum Aperture":"2.0","Mfr. Model Number":"ORIO-0021-300S","Minimum Focusing Distance":"1.5’","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"No","Weight":"6.9 lb.","Zoom Type":"Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Atlas
