Built-In 20x Zoom. Alongside its 1/1.8" UHD CMOS sensor, the A-Eye 4K’s integregrated zoom lens boasts an optical zoom range of 20x and, for closer shots, an additional 16x digital zoom. With the optional Atomos A-Eye PTZ Camera Remote Control Unit, you can quickly position or change cameras over IP or through the RS-232 port.

Power and Design. The A-Eye, like most PTZ cameras, is supported and fueled by PoE+ and a DC input. To keep your subjects on track with which cameras are in use during multi-camera productions, these cameras are equipped with tally lights. Additionally, you can connect an external mic or headset through the 3.5mm in/out ports, or utilize the built-in microphone.', 529000.0, '{"Brand":"Atomos","Camera Mount":"Unknown","Camera Type":"PTZ","Compatible Media":"External Storage","Item Type":"Camera","Maximum Video Resolution":"4K","Sensor Size":"1-Inch","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"No"}', 'Atomos
