Power and Design. The A-Eye, like most PTZ cameras, is supported and fueled by PoE+ and a DC input. To keep your subjects on track with which cameras are in use during multi-camera productions, these cameras are equipped with tally lights. Additionally, you can connect an external mic or headset through the 3.5mm in/out ports, or utilize the built-in microphone.', 368000.0, '{"Brand":"Atomos","Camera Type":"PTZ","Compatible Media":"External Storage","Control":"Pan/TiltTilt: 120° (-30 to 90°) at 1.7 to 100°/s Pan: 340° (-170 to 170°) at 1.7 to 69.9°/s  Tally LightYes Supported Control ProtocolsIPNDI|HX3RS-232RS-485VISCA","Imaging":"Image Sensor1/2.8\\"-Type CMOS Sensor ResolutionEffective: 2.07 Megapixel IR Cut FilterNo Focus ControlAutofocusManual Focus","Interface":"Video I/O1x HDMI 1.4 Output1x BNC (3G-SDI) Output1x RJ45 (NDI) Output1x USB-A 3.0 / 3.1/3.2 Gen 1 Output Audio I/O1x 1/8\\" / 3.5 mm TRS Stereo Line Input1x 1/8\\" / 3.5 mm TRS Stereo Line Output Other I/O1x D-Sub 8-Pin (RS-232) Control Input1x D-Sub 8-Pin (RS-232) Control Output1x Block 2-Pin (RS-485) Control Input/Output1x USB-A (USB 3.0) Built-In MicrophoneStereo Built-In SpeakerNo","Item Type":"Camera","Lens":"Optical Zoom Ratio20x Max Digital Zoom16x","Maximum Video Resolution":"1440p","Mfr. Model Number":"#ATOMAEHD20","Power":"PoE SupportPoE+ 802.3at Power I/O1x DC (12VDC) Input","Sensor Size":"1-Inch","Stabilization":"No","Video Capture":"External Recording ModesSDI/BNC / HDMI / RJ45 / USBDCI 2K (2048 × 1080) up to 60.00 fps Embedded AudioHDMI/IP/NDI/SDI/USB Audio RecordingAAC Audio Broadcast OutputNTSC/PAL","Weather Sealing":"No","Weight":"7.1 lb."}', 'Atomos
