	RED cameras
	ARRI cameras', 39000.0, '{"Brand":"Belden","Cable Type":"Audio and Video","Connector":"SDI and Coax","Item Type":"Cable","Length":"2.6’"}', 'Belden 2.6ft 179DT 12G-SDI
BNC
Cable', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (437, 4, 28, 'Belden 2.6ft Ultra Thin 3G-SDI BNC Cable', 'belden-2-6ft-ultra-thin-3g-sdi-bnc-cable', 'The Belden 2.6ft Ultra Thin 3G-SDI BNC Cable is an ultra-miniature, 1080p-ready coax cable with Neutrik Rear TWIST BNC connectors capable of 3 GHz video transmission. This version measures 2.6ft and is suited for gimbal monitoring. Key features include:

9221 Ultra-miniature RG-59 Coax Cable
Neutrik Rear TWIST Tiny BNC Connector w/ Black boot
Supports up to 3 GHz Transmission
