	Sony HXR-NX5R, PXW-FS5, PXW-FS7M2, PXW-Z150, PXW-X180
	Panasonic AG-DVX200, AU-EVA1, Varicam LT
	Blackmagic Design Studio Camera 4K 2, Micro Studio Camera 4K, URSA Mini 4.6K, URSA Mini Pro 4.6K
	RED cameras
	ARRI cameras', 25000.0, '{"Brand":"Belden","Cable Type":"Audio and Video","Connector":"SDI and Coax","Item Type":"Cable","Length":"2.6’"}', 'Belden 2.6ft cable
