INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (440, 4, 28, 'Belden 25ft Cat 6A Ethernet Cable', 'belden-25ft-cat-6a-ethernet-cable', 'The Belden 25ft Cat 6A Ethernet Cable is a .265” OD, high-throughput ethernet cable with a small bend radius and uniform heat flow dissipation for demanding video applications. Key features include:

Works great for NDI and HDBaseT systems
Up to 10 Gbps transfer speed
Dual, male RJ45 connectors
100 watt PoE support

Premium Ethernet Cable. This Belden 25ft Cat 6A ethernet cable is made from high-quality, .265” OD Belden 10GXS32 cable that’s capable of transmitting up to 10 Gbps of data and 100 watts of energy in PoE applications. The cable is sleeved in heat dissipating Polyolefin with a bendable PVC outer jacket.

Male RJ45 Connectors. This is a male by male cable for connecting two devices with RJ45 female ports. If you need a male by female extension cable, check out the Belden 150ft Cat 6A Ethernet Cable Extension. Please note that long runs of cable may require a repeater. If you have questions, please contact us.

Great for NDI & HDBaseT. This cable has enough throughput for intensive video applications like NDI, NDI HX, and HDBaseT, and in some situations, removes the need for a separate power supply thanks to its compatibility with four-pair power over ethernet. It also works perfectly for simply connecting two network devices.', 54000.0, '{"Brand":"Belden","Cable Type":"Ethernet","Connector":"Ethernet","Item Type":"Cable","Length":"25.0’"}', 'Just the cable', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (441, 4, 28, 'Belden 3ft 12G-SDI BNC Cable', 'belden-3ft-12g-sdi-bnc-cable', 'The Belden 3ft 12G-SDI BNC Cable is an ultra-miniature, 4K-ready coax cable with Neutrik Rear TWIST BNC connectors. This 3-foot cable is capable of 12GHz video transmission. Key features include:

179DT ultra-miniature RG-179 coax cable
Neutrik Rear TWIST Tiny BNC Connector w/gray boot
Supports up to 12 GHz transmission
3-foot length w/angled adapter included

Need A Lighter, More Flexible Cable? This is a great lightweight BNC option, but if you’d like the lightest, most flexible cable we offer, check out this Belden 2.6ft SDI cable. It’s perfectly suited for gimbal monitoring.

Ultra-Miniature Coax Cable. The Belden 3ft 12G-SDI BNC Cable is TINY. It’s hard to overstate how lightweight the 2.54mm diameter ultra-miniature coax cable is. This listing is for our 3-foot version of the cable, which is perfectly suited for applications where high video bandwidth is needed but weight reduction is of the utmost importance.

Neutrik Rear TWIST Connectors. Neutrik makes great connectors in general, but this design ups the ante. Inferior BNC connectors twist at the metal BNC coupler and can be difficult to detach in tight quarters. This rear twist connector can be turned at the boot, and it’s hard to go back. This 3-foot cable features a gray boot to help distinguish it from our other lengths of SDI cables. We include an angled BNC adapter to help with awkward SDI port placement.

12 GHz Signal Transmission. All of our Belden SDI cables are 4K-ready and rated for 12G transmission at their respective lengths. These cables are also fully backwards compatible with 6G and 3G applications.

