INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (480, 1, 31, 'BirdDog X4 Ultra PTZ 3-Camera & KBD Controller Kit', 'birddog-x4-ultra-ptz-3-camera-kbd-controller-kit', 'The BirdDog X4 Ultra PTZ 3-Camera & KBD Controller Kit provides you with three X4 PTZ Cameras and the KBD Controller. Key features include:

Sony 1/1.8" UHD CMOS sensor
Wi-Fi 6 wireless connectivity
1280 × 720 controller display
NDI|HX2 & NDI|HX3 support

Add a multicamera PTZ system to your production kit with this 3 x X4 Ultra PTZ Cameras & KBD PTZ Controller Combo from BirdDog. This complete PTZ capture and streaming solution includes three X4 Ultra PTZ cameras and a KBD PTZ controller. The BirdDog X4 Ultra PTZ 3-Camera & KBD Controller Kit includes:

(3) BirdDog X4 Ultra PTZ Camera – Black
	BirdDog KBD PTZ Controller with Integrated Screen

HALO Tally, Almost Angelic. The BirdDog X4 Ultra PTZ Camera adds a glow to your production with its HALO tally system. This gleaming border around the camera directs your talent to exactly which camera they need to be looking at, keeping audiences engaged and your footage smooth.

Seamless AI Tracking. Featuring intuitive AI controls, the X4 evolves your tracking capabilities and expands & adapts as your needs for production grow.

Network and Wi-Fi Capabilities. Ensuring superior network performance, this PTZ reduces network impact while still retaining top-notch image quality through NDI|HX3. The X4 is also equipped with Wi-Fi 6 to promote smooth and stable streaming across the board.

Built-In Battery Power. A built-in battery supplies up to 4 hours of continuous use, and can be easily recharged via the USB-C port.

Comfort Control. Control up to four of your BirdDog PTZ cameras with this BirdDog KBD PTZ Controller with Integrated Screen! Compatible with most X- and P-Series cameras, this controller gives you a comfortable and accessible solution for switching, control, pairing, and much more.

Innovative Design. Made from ocean-bound plastics and recyclable aircraft-grade aluminum, the KBD not only makes an impact environmentally, but also physically. This controller features an array of menu buttons and functions, and a joystick that’s accompanied by a comfortable hand rest area.

‘Fun’-ctions and Modes. The KBD offers a new Effortless Camera Settings Sync function, which allows you to copy and paste settings across X-Series cameras, like the X4 and X5. Not only does this controller offer NDI|HX2 and NDI|HX3 support, it also supports VISCA-IP, ONVIF, RS-232, and RS-422 for broadened versatility.

X5 Ultra Available. If the X4 doesn’t meet all of your needs, we do have the X5 Ultra available, which comes equipped with 20x optical zoom and 12G-SDI output!', 1639000.0, '{"Brand":"BirdDog","Camera Type":"PTZ","Item Type":"Camera"}', '(3)
