Strapped In. Right-handed photographers can find easy access and secure gear attachment with this Blackline I Right Camera Strap from BlackRapid! This nylon strap uses its breathable polyester mesh and TPE foam shoulder pad to comfortably sit along your shoulder, while a removable under arm strap ensures more security for your attached gear.

