Blackmagic Design Cinema Camera 6K – L-Mount
	Blackmagic Pocket Cinema Camera 6K/Pro/G2 Battery Grip
	Blackmagic Pocket Cinema Camera Pro EVF for 6K/Pro/G2
	Blackmagic 19.5-Inch Mini XLR to XLR Female Cable
	SanDisk CFexpress 256GB Extreme Pro 1700MB/s Type B
	SanDisk Professional Pro-Reader CFexpress Type B', 914000.0, '{"Brand":"Blackmagic","Camera Mount":"L","Camera Type":"Cinema","Compatible Media":"CFexpress Type B","Environmental":"Operating Temperature32 to 104°F Storage Temperature-4 to 113°F Operating Humidity0 to 90%","Exposure Control":"Shutter TypeElectronic Rolling Shutter ISO Sensitivity Range400 to 3200 (Extended: 100 to 25,600) Advertised Dynamic Range13 Stops","Focus Type":"Auto and Manual Focus","General":"Battery TypeSony L-Series Power Consumption30 W Shoe MountNo Accessory Mounting ThreadNo Material of ConstructionCarbon Fiber, Polycarbonate Dimensions (W x H x D)7.08 × 3.7 × 4.8″ Weight2.65 lb","Image Sizes":"3:2 Raw 24.6 MP","Imaging":"Lens MountLeica L Lens CommunicationYes, with Autofocus Support Sensor ResolutionEffective: 24.6 Megapixel Image Sensor36 × 24 mm (Full-Frame) CMOS Image StabilizationNo Built-In ND FilterNo Internal Filter HolderNo Capture TypeStills & Video","Interface":"Media/Memory Card SlotSlot 1: CFexpress Type B Video I/O1 x HDMI (Unspecified Signal) Output/li> Audio I/O2 x Mini XLR Mic/Line (+48 V Phantom Power) Input1 × 1/8\\" / 3.5 mm TRS Stereo Mic/Line Input1 × 1/8\\" / 3.5 mm TRS Stereo Headphone Output/li> Power I/O1 x Proprietary (12 to 20VDC) Input/li> Other I/O1 x USB-C (USB 3.2 / 3.1 Gen 1) Control/Video Input/Output/li> WirelessBluetooth Control/li> Mobile App CompatibleYes: iOS OnlyApp Name: BlackMagic Camera ControlFunctionality: Adjust Settings, Remote Control*As of September, 2023: Check with manufacturer for the most up-to-date compatibility/li> Global Positioning (GPS, GLONASS, etc.)No/li>","Internal Video Recording Modes":"Blackmagic RAW 12-Bit6048 × 40326048 × 3200 up to 48.00 fps6048 × 2520 up to 60.00 fps4096 × 3072 up to 50 fpsDCI 4K (4096 × 2160) up to 60.00 fps1920 × 1080 up to 120 fps H.2646048 × 40326048 × 3200 up to 48.00 fps6048 × 2520 up to 60.00 fps4096 × 3072 up to 50 fpsDCI 4K (4096 × 2160) up to 60.00 fps1920 × 1080 up to 120 fps","Item Type":