Lens Compatibility and Power. With so many shooting formats, both full-frame and Super 35/APS-C L-mount lenses can be paired with this camera, as well as anamorphic lenses. Check out our L-mount cinema lens sets, including the Cooke SP3 Set with 6 professional L-mount primes, or the Sirui 1.6x Anamorphic Set with 4 high-quality anamorphics ranging from 35-100mm. Power the camera with the included 12V DC power cable or with BP-U series batteries, which are available separately. A BP-U100 will get you about 3 hours of runtime.', 1150000.0, '{"Brand":"Blackmagic","Camera Mount":"L","Camera Type":"Cinema","Compatible Media":"CFexpress Type B","General":"Accessory Mounts9x 1/4\\"-203x 3/8\\"-164x M4No shoe mountBattery TypeBP-U seriesDimensions (W x H x D)4.17 × 4.69 × 5.94″Mfr. Model NumberCINECAMCPYXM12LFLMonitorEVF not included (available here)4\\" fixed touchscreenWeight3.5 lb.","Imaging":"ISODynamic Range: 16 stopsISO Range: 200-3,200 (25,600 expanded)Max ResolutionDCI 12K (12288 × 6480)ND FiltersNoSensor98.8MP Large Format CMOSShutterElectronic rollingStabilizationNo","Inputs/Outputs":"Audio I/O1x 3.5mm headphone jack1x 3.5mm mic jack1x 3-pin mini-XLR mic/line (+48V phantom power)Other I/O1x USB-C (data)1x BNC (ref/TC)1x EthernetPower I/O1x 2-pin LEMO (12V DC)1x BP-U battery portStorage I/O2x CFexpress Type B slots1x SSD with URSA Mini Recorder (not included)Video I/O1x BNC (12G-SDI)","Item Type":"Camera","Maximum Video Resolution":"12K","Screen Type":"Touchscreen and Fixed","Sensor Size":"Full-Frame","Stabilization":"No","Video Capture":"CompressionBlackmagic RAWFormat.BRAWResolutionOpen-gate 12K (12,288 × 6480) up to 40 fpsAnamorphic 12K (12,288 × 5112) up to 60 fps9K (9408 × 6264) up to 50 fpsAnamorphic 9K (9312 × 3864) up to 80 fpsOpen-gate 8K (8192 × 5360) up to 72 fpsAnamorphic 8K (8192 × 3408) up to 112 fpsOpen-gate 4K (4096 × 2680 ) up to 72 fpsAnamorphic 4K 4096 × 1704) up to 112 fps","Weather Sealing":"No","Wireless Connectivity":"Bluetooth"}', 'Blackmagi