INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (519, 1, 32, 'Blackmagic Design Studio Camera 6K Pro (EF)', 'blackmagic-design-studio-camera-6k-pro-ef', 'The Blackmagic Design Studio Camera 6K Pro (EF) is a Canon EF-mounted studio production solution offering 6K imaging and a plethora of new updates to the Studio Camera series. Key features include:

Live Streaming
Remote controlled ND filters
Raw recording to external USB-C disks
7" touchscreen LCD

6K Resolution, EF-Mounted Production. The Blackmagic Design Studio Camera 6K Pro (EF) boasts a large 6K sensor that uses the same imaging technology used in digital film cameras, and features a resolution of 6144 × 3456, which produces truly cinematic images with support for frame rates from 23.98 up to 60 fps. Unlike simpler broadcast cameras, this camera offers a built-in DaVinci Resolve primary color corrector, which allows the user to manipulate color in creative and artistic ways that dramatically affect the mood of a scene and can be easily controlled using a switcher. To ensure color correction is easily attainable, the Studio 6K offers 13 stops of dynamic range to provide darker blacks and brighter whites. This unit is equipped with a Canon EF mount that is compatible with a wide array of cine-style and photographic lenses, and can also be controlled remotely, eliminating the shake and vibration of manually adjusting your lens.

What’s Changed? Similar to the Studio Camera 4K Plus, the 6K Pro incorporates many previous add-ons from Blackmagic, like control knobs, easily readable tally lighting, a 7-inch touchscreen LCD, and a slide plate mounting system with 15mm LWS rod mounts. The 6K Pro now offers shock and wind resistant built-in microphones placed strategically on the edges of the screen, and also offers a 3.5mm jack for monitoring your audio in real time. You’ll also have the ability to record BRAW to external hard drives and camera control via Blackmagic’s ATEM Mini line of switchers.

External SSD Recording. This camera features dual USB Type C ports that allow users to record Blackmagic RAW directly to external SSDs for quick transport of files to a computer for editing. Please note that external USB Type C SSDs are the only type of media accepted by this camera.

Connection, Your Way. Like most Blackmagic models, an HDMI connection is available to support video, tally, control, and record trigger for a broadcast-style workflow using a single HDMI cable. Two 12G-SDI connections are available, one for camera video, and the other for program return. A single 10G Ethernet port is also included to obtain camera video, program return, tally, talkback, camera control, and even power using a regular Cat 6a Ethernet cable.

Power Trip. We mentioned above that this unit can be powered using an Ethernet connection, but this unit can also be fueled via a 12 VDC locking power connector, and also offers a power supply with five different AC socket adapters for different countries. When going the ethernet route, the entire camera and its accessories can be fueled without the need for extra unnecessary cables.

Additional Features. Not only does this unit offer live streaming, built-in ND filters in three sizes, and balanced XLR audio inputs, it keeps everything in a compact and lightweight design. All of the benefits of having a fully functional broadcast camera are made miniature with this unit, and allows this camera to push the boundaries of how we view cinema broadcast.', 625000.0, '{"Audio Recording":"ProRes: 2-Channel 24-Bit 48 kHz LPCM Audio","Brand":"Blackmagic","Camera":"Lens MountCanon EF Mount Shutter Speed1/5000 to 1/24 Second Built-In ND FilterMechanical Filter Wheel with Clear, 2-Stop (1/4), 4-Stop (1/16), 6-Stop (1/64) ND Filters Built-In Microphone TypeStereo Broadcast System CompatibilityNTSCPAL","Camera Mount":"Canon EF","Camera Type":"Broadcast","Compatible Media":"External Storage","Display":"Display TypeFixed Touchscreen LCD Size7\\" Resolution1920 × 1200","Environmental":"Operating Temperature32 to 104°F Storage Temperature -4 to 113°F Operating Humidity0 to 90%","General":"Accessory Mount2 × 1/4\\"-20 Female Tripod Mount3/8\\"-16 Female Dimensions (W x H x D)10.77 × 7.83 × 6.59″ (Without Protrusions) Weight4.28 lb","Imaging":"Sensor ResolutionNot Specified by Manufacturer ISO Sensitivity100 to 25,600 Gain0 to 18 dB Sensitivityf/11 at 2000 lux 89.9% Reflectance (UHD 4K60)f/12 at 2000 lux 89.9% Reflectance (UHD 4K60) Signal-to-Noise Ratio63 dB","Interfaces":"CCU I/ONone Video I/O1 x BNC (12G-SDI) Input1 x BNC (12G-SDI) Output1 x HDMI Output Audio I/O2 x XLR 3-Pin Mic/Line (+48 V Phantom Power) Input on Camera Body1 × 1/8\\" / 3.5 mm TRS Stereo Microphone Input1 × 1/8\\" / 3.5 mm TRRS Headphone/Mic Input/Output1 x XLR 5-Pin Intercom Input/Output Other I/O1 x RJ45 (10 Gigabit Ethernet) Control/Data/Monitor/Video Input/Output2 x USB-C (USB 3.2 / 3.1 Gen 1) Data/Video Input/Output","Item Type":"Camera","Maximum Video Resolution":"6K","Power":"Power I/O1 x XLR 4-Pin (12VDC) Input1 x Barrel (12VDC) Input Power Consumption59 W","RAW Recording":"Blackmagic RA