The Blackmagic Design URSA Cine 12K LF Gold Mount Kit (LPL) includes:

Blackmagic Design URSA Cine 12K LF Camera Body
	Blackmagic Design Gold Mount Battery Plate for URSA Cine
	Blackmagic Design Lens Mount for URSA Cine (LPL)
