INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (530, 1, 32, 'Blackmagic Design URSA Cine 12K LF V-Mount Kit (LPL)', 'blackmagic-design-ursa-cine-12k-lf-v-mount-kit-lpl', 'The Blackmagic Design URSA Cine 12K LF V-Mount Kit (LPL) is a comprehensive bundle designed around the Blackmagic Design URSA Cine 12K LF. Key features include:

Large format full-frame 12K sensor
V-Mount power
12G-SDI output; USB-C expansion ports
Netflix approved camera

Please feel free to click any of the below highlighted links for additional specifications, or read further for more information on each individual item!

The Blackmagic Design URSA Cine 12K LF V-Mount Kit (LPL) includes:

Blackmagic Design URSA Cine 12K LF Camera Body
	Blackmagic Design V-Mount Battery Plate for URSA Cine
	Blackmagic Design Lens Mount for URSA Cine (LPL)
	Blackmagic Design 19mm Baseplate for URSA Cine 12K
	Blackmagic Design 24V 250W Power Supply for URSA Cine
	Blackmagic Design 8TB Media Module
	Blackmagic Design URSA Cine Top Handle

Revolutionary 12K Sensor. The Blackmagic Design URSA Cine 12K LF (LPL) sports a stellar new sensor designed to capture cinema-quality imaging at all resolutions from 4K to 12K. Building on the technology of the URSA Mini Pro 12K, this sensor provides larger photo-sites that lead to 16 stops of dynamic range. At all resolutions, this camera delivers rich, quality colors thanks to its unique RGBW architecture.

Format Friendly. The URSA Cine’s large-format sensor creates a flexible environment for aspect ratios, lenses, and delivery formats. With a stunning 3:2 open gate image, you can easily reframe your shots in post-production. There’s plenty of benefits to this redesigned sensor, including the ability to shoot in 4K, 8K, or 12K using the entire sensor without cropping and retaining the full field-of-view. You can even shoot with classic cinema lenses using one of the three available 9K Super 35 modes!

Monitoring and Camera Control. To monitor your productions, the URSA Cine sports a fold-out monitor with a 5-inch touchscreen on one side and an external color status LCD on the other. With the dedicated assist station located on the right-side of the camera, you have access to another 5-inch HDR touchscreen that helps prevent the need for external monitors.

Inputs and Outputs. To meet the demands of high-end productions, the URSA Cine is packed out with connections all around. You’re provided with 7-pin LEMO and 3-pin Fischer connectors for record start/stop, a standard 24V 8-pin LEMO connector for camera power, and an additional 2-pin LEMO 12V connection to power lower-voltage accessories. For external monitoring, you have access to two 12G-SDI outputs, plus a 10G Ethernet connection for syncing to Blackmagic Cloud media.

Built-In Filters. For those moments you’re in need of light reduction and minimized interference, this camera has built-in OLPF and ND filters. The integrated OLPF is precisely matched to that stellar sensor we’ve chatted about, and is designed to minimize the interference that comes along with shooting materials and fabrics. The three integrated ND filters are available to you in reductions of 2-, 4- and 6-stops. Even in the harshest of lighting, these filters can save the day of production.

Internal Recording Available. This URSA Cine is the first digital film camera that comes equipped with the ultra-fast Blackmagic Media Module to internally store up to 8TB of footage! This storage solution allows you to record at the highest resolutions and frame rates for hours, and even access your files over 10G Ethernet. If you’re using several URSA Cine cameras with the modules, you can add up to three of them to the separately available Blackmagic Design Media Dock to gain access to more files at once, speeding up post-production and turnaround times.

Wireless Capabilities and Streaming. Like most cameras of this generation, the URSA Cine is capable of WiFi and 10G Ethernet connections. With a built-in hardware engine that supports RTMP and SRT streaming, the URSA Cine can stream directly to clients or major streaming platforms. While live streaming, you can use the USB-C port to connect an Apple or Android device to gain internet connection!

V-Mount Powerhouse. This camera requires a decent amount of power, which can be easily taken care of with our selection of V-Mount batteries. Alongside the V-Mount battery plate, the URSA Cine is also equipped with an 8-pin LEMO power connector in the rear and additional LEMO and Fischer connectors in the front to power accessories.

Blackmagic OS. Equipped with Blackmagic OS, the URSA Cine is an intuitive device with user-friendly controls. This operating system allows each of the camera’s features run independently, resulting in smoother control of the camera. With this interface, you’ll tap and swipe to adjust settings and features. All advanced features, like on-screen focus and exposure tools, HDR, metadata entry, and Blackmagic RAW settings, can be accessed and controlled with ease!
Battery Plate. This V-mount Battery Plate from Blackmagic Design is specifically designed to work with the URSA Cine camera. The sturdy plate enables the attachment of a single third-party V-mount battery directly to the rear of your camera without the need for any extra cabling.

Lens Mount. Use your high-end cinema lenses on your URSA Cine camera with this LPL Lens Mount from Blackmagic Design. Designed to easily integrate with the URSA Cine camera, this compact, interchangeable adapter facilitates the seamless employment of LPL lenses with your camera. This adapter includes contact pins to read and record lens metadata.

Baseplate. The included Blackmagic Design 19mm Baseplate for URSA Cine 12K provides you with both 19mm and 15mm studio rod mounts and ARRI standard rosettes on either side for rod and accessory mounting. Want to add a baseplate with just the 15mm rod mounts? We have the Blackmagic Design 15mm LWS Baseplate available too! Please note that in order to connect either baseplate to another surface, you will need access to an ARRI-standard dovetail plate.

Power Supply. The Blackmagic Design 24V 250W Power Supply for URSA Cine is an alternative power bank for the Blackmagic URSA CIne camera. This power cable is capable of outputting 24V, 250W power to the camera through its 8-pin LEMO connector.

Top Handle. The Blackmagic Design URSA Cine Top Handle pairs well with the Blackmagic Design URSA Cine EVF and is designed for the Blackmagic URSA Cine and PYXIS line of cameras. It provides a secure grip and easy transport of these cameras while offering more customization options for rigging.', 2404000.0, '{"Brand":"Blackmagic","Camera Mount":"LPL","Camera Type":"Cinema","Compatible Media":"Internal Storage","Item Type":"Camera","Maximum Video Resolution":"12K","Screen Type":"Touchscreen and Swivel","Sensor Size":"Full-Frame","Weather Sealing":"No","Wireless Connectivity":"Wi-Fi and Bluetooth"}', 'Blackmagic
