Power Supply. The included Blackmagic Design 24V 250W Power Supply for URSA Cine outputs 24V, 250W power to the camera through its 8-pin LEMO connector.', 4329000.0, '{"Brand":"Blackmagic","Camera Mount":"PL","Camera Type":"Cinema","Compatible Media":"SSD","Imaging":"ISODynamic Range: 16 StopsMax Resolution17K ND FiltersNo Sensor50.8 × 23.3 mm (Large Format) CMOS StabilizationNo","Inputs/Outputs":"Audio I/O2 x XLR1 × 3.5mm Other I/O1 x RJ451x BNC (Reference, Timecode) Power I/O1 × 8 pin Lemo1 × 7-pin Storage I/O1 x Blackmagic Media Module 8TB Video I/O2 × 12G-SDI","Item Type":"Camera","Maximum Video Resolution":"17K","Screen Type":"Touchscreen and Swivel","Sensor Size":"Large Format","Stabilization":"No","Video Capture":"CompressionBlackmagic RAW (3:1, 5:1, 8:1, 12:1, 18:1)H.264 (8-bit) FormatBlackmagic RAW Resolution17K 2.2:1 open gate up to 60 fps12K 2.4:1 up to 90fps8K 2.2:1 open gate up to 100 fps8K 2.4:1 up to 170 fps","Weather Sealing":"No","Wireless Connectivity":"Wi-Fi and Bluetooth"}', 'Blackmagic
