INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (541, 1, 32, 'Blackmagic Design URSA Mini Pro 12K OLPF (PL)', 'blackmagic-design-ursa-mini-pro-12k-olpf-pl', 'The Blackmagic Design URSA Mini Pro 12K OLPF (PL) is a PL-mount compatible, 12K cinema camera capable of RAW capture and adds an OLPF to the URSA Mini Pro 12K. Key features include:

User-changeable PL lens mount
Dual CFast 2.0 or SD card recording
4K Super16 up to 220 fps
Netflix approved camera

What’s Changed? The external body of the Blackmagic Design URSA Mini Pro 12K OLPF (PL) is mostly unchanged in this update, and instead, the sensor is the star of the show. Blackmagic has implemented their own sensor design that can record up to 12K at 60fps. That quite a jump from the previous 4.6K sensor used in the Mini Pro G2. Recording and control options remain largely the same aside from the removal of any codecs other than Blackmagic RAW. You’ll find no ProRes options here.

Professional Features. With the URSA Mini Pro 12K, you get a raft of external controls that eliminate menu diving for focus assist, frame rate, and exposure settings. There’s an exterior LCD that provides at-a-glance shooting data, a four-position ND filtration wheel (0/2/4/6-stops), and dual CFast 2.0 and UHS-II capable SD memory card slots. Carried over from the Mini Pro G2 is recording to USB Type-C SSD drives, and a new Blackmagic Design URSA Mini Pro 12K Recorder allows for full-quality 12K recording to compatible 2.5-inch SSDs.

PL Mount & OLPF. This camera is compatible with cinema lenses that utilize ARRI’s PL (positive lock) mount. There is also an added layer of lens communication with lenses capable of sharing lens data via Cooke i/Technology. The included optical low pass filter (OLPF) is a new addition to this series, and helps minimize unwanted image interface. Please note that this rental does not include a battery plate.

Looking for an SSD? If you’re looking for an SSD recording solution for this camera, check out the Blackmagic Design URSA Mini Pro 12K Recorder.', 1304000.0, '{"Brand":"Blackmagic","Camera Mount":"PL","Camera Type":"Cinema","Compatible Media":"CFast and SD","Environmental":"Operating Temperature32.0 to 104.0°F Storage Temperature -4 to 113°F Operating Humidity0 to 90%","Exposure Control":"Shutter TypeElectronic Rolling Shutter ISO Sensitivity125 to 3200 Advertised Dynamic Range14 Stops","Focus Modes":"Automatic, Manual Focus","Focus Type":"Auto and Manual Focus","General":"Accessory Mount4 × 1/4\\"-20 Female1 x ARRI/Hirth Rosette Dimensions (W x H x D)9.2 × 5.92 × 5.87″ Weight5.62 lb","Imaging":"Lens MountARRI PL Lens CommunicationYes Sensor ResolutionEffective: 79.6 Megapixel (12,288 × 6480) Image Sensor27.03 × 14.25 mm (Super35) CMOS Image StabilizationNone Built-In ND FilterMechanical Filter Wheel with Clear2-Stop (1/4)4-Stop (1/16)6-Stop (1/64) ND Filters Capture TypeStills & Video","Interface":"Media/Memory Card SlotDual Slot: CFast (CFast 2.0)Dual Slot: SD/SDHC/SDXC (UHS-II) Video I/O1 x BNC (12G-SDI) Input1 x BNC (12G-SDI) Output1 x BNC (3G-SDI) Output Audio I/O2 x XLR 3-Pin Mic/Line (+48 V Phantom Power) Output1 × 1/8\\" / 3.5 mm TRRS Headphone/Mic Input/Output Power I/O1 x XLR 4-Pin Input1 x Molex 12-Pin Input/Output1 x XLR 4-Pin (12VDC) Output Other I/O1 x USB-C (USB 3.2 / 3.1 Gen 2)1 x USB-C Data Input WirelessNone Mobile App CompatibleYes\\n*As of January, 2023: Check with manufacturer for the most up-to-date compatibility Global Positioning (GPS, GLONASS, etc.)None","Item Type":"Camera","Maximum Photo Resolution":"MP","Maximum Video Resolution":"12K","Monitor":"Size4.0\\" Display TypeArticulating Touchscreen LCD Secondary DisplaySide: Status Display","Screen Type":"Touchscreen and Swivel","Sensor Size":"Super35","Still Image Capture":"Aspect Ratio1:12:14:34:516:9 Image File FormatRaw","Video Capture":"Internal Recording Modes\\nBlackmagic RAW 12-Bit1228