INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (548, 3, 32, 'Blackmagic PYXIS Pro Grip', 'blackmagic-pyxis-pro-grip', 'The Blackmagic PYXIS Pro Grip connects to the side of the PYXIS 6K and PYXIS 12K cameras. Key features include:

Hand strap, record start/stop, & zoom rocker
Includes locking USB-C cable
Right-hand side only
3x customizable function buttons

Comfortable Placement of Controls. Improve comfort when hand-holding a PYXIS 6K/12K camera with this PYXIS Pro Grip, which attaches via locking USB-C cable to the right side of the camera and offers more ergonomic access to a record start/stop button, three function buttons, and a configurable zoom rocker. The hand strap is adjustable and all the operations are placed conveniently nearly the operator’s thumb and fingers. This is a good add-on for broadcast, ENG, and run-and-gun setups.

Compatible Configurations. It has not been officially validated by the manufacturer whether this Pro Grip, the PYXIS Monitor, and the Pro Handle can all be used together. However, we did our own in-house tests and got the following results in a variety of configurations:

Camera + Monitor: Worked on PYXIS 6K and PYXIS 12K
	Camera + Pro Grip: Worked on PYXIS 6K and PYXIS 12K
	Camera + Pro Handle: Worked on PYXIS 6K and PYXIS 12K
	Camera + Monitor + Pro Grip: Tested with Canon Compact-Servo 18-80mm T4.4 L IS EF on PYXIS 12K and worked. Did not work with PYXIS 6K.
	Camera  + Monitor + Pro Handle: Tested with Canon Compact-Servo 18-80mm T4.4 L IS EF on PYXIS 12K and worked. Did not work with PYXIS 6K.
	Camera + Monitor + Pro Grip + Pro Handle: Tested with Canon Compact-Servo 18-80mm T4.4 L IS EF on PYXIS 12K and worked. Did not work with PYXIS 6K.

For any configuration or compatibility questions, please feel free to contact us.', 82000.0, '{"Brand":"Blackmagic","Camera Support Type":"Handle and Controller","Item Type":"Camera Support","Mfr. Model Number":"CINEURSABC/BG","Weight":"0.6 lb."}', 'Blackmagic
PYXIS
Pro
Grip
	5.5"
Blackmagic locking, angled
USB-C cable
