INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (549, 1, 32, 'Blackmagic Pocket Cinema Camera 4K (MFT)', 'blackmagic-pocket-cinema-camera-4k-mft', 'The Blackmagic Pocket Cam 4K is a predecessor to the BMPCC 6K and provides DCI 4K image capture in RAW and ProRes 422 to CFast 2.0, SD, and external USB-C drives. Key features include:

Micro 4/3, 18.95 × 10mm, CMOS sensor
13 stops of dynamic range
DCI 4K capture to RAW and ProRes
Records to CFast 2.0, SD UHS-II, & external USB-C drives

Updated M4/3 DCI 4K Sensor. Blackmagic has made some much needed improvements to the second iteration of the Pocket Cam, and it all starts with a larger, higher resolution sensor. It offers DCI 4K capture up to 60p in 12-bit Blackmagic RAW and a number of 10-bit ProRes 422 options. Frame rates can be extended to 120 fps when shooting in cropped 1080p. Looking for an updated version of this camera with 6K capture? Check out the Blackmagic Pocket Cinema Camera 6K.

Dual ISO Sensitivity. Low-light sensitivity is improved over the gen-one Pocket Cinema Cam by an increase in the sensor size, but also thanks to a new dual ISO feature. It allows users to modify the camera’s native ISO to reduce noise at higher sensitivities. The BMPCC 4K ISO range extends up to ISO 25,600.

Micro 4/3 Lens Compatibility. The camera has an active micro four-thirds lens mount for compatibility with a wide range of lenses from manufacturers like Panasonic & Olympus. Use existing adapters to enable the use of EF lenses, PL lenses, C-mount lenses, and more.

High Battery and Media Demands. To allow the capture of 4K/60 RAW files, the BMPCC 4K takes CFast 2.0 and SD UHS-II, and you’ll only get about 7 minutes per 256GB at that format. External USB-C drives can also be used for longer record times with a lower cost per gigabyte. Power is provided by common Canon LP-E6 or LP-E6n batteries but be warned, this camera will eat through a fully charged battery in approximately one hour. Please plan your power and memory needs accordingly.

Other Features. The camera has a big 5" touchscreen monitor on the back, but video can be monitored externally via the full size HDMI port. It provides high quality audio input and 48V phantom power to microphones via its mini XLR input. Use of professional microphones will require an XLR female to mini XLR adapter cable, which is not included with the rental.

Need an Adapter? Metabones has developed some EF adapters specifically for this camera. Check out the Metabones Canon EF to BMPCC4K Speed Booster T Ultra and the Metabones Canon EF to BMPCC4K Speed Booster T XL.

Need a Memory Card? You’ll need an ultra-fast memory card for a camera this powerful, and we recommend the Sony 128GB SF-G Tough Series UHS-II SDXC. This camera can take full advantage of its superior 299 MB/s max write speed and 300 MB/s max read speed for high-resolution, high-bitrate capture.', 268000.0, '{"Brand":"Blackmagic","Camera Mount":"Micro 4/3","Camera Type":"Cinema","Compatible Media":"CFast and SD","Imaging":"Sensor \\t\\tType: CMOS \\t\\tSize: 18.96 × 10mm Maximum Resolution 4096 × 2160 \\tApproximate Crop Factor \\t\\tFull Sensor Scan: x1.9 Windowed Sensor Scan (UHD/HD): x4 \\tISO \\t\\tDynamic Range: Up to 13 stopsSensitivity Range: 100-25,600 Native ISO: Dual 400 and 3200","Inputs/Outputs":"Audio Inputs1x mini XLR (XLR adapter not included!)3.5mm stereo mini-jackAudio ControlsMic/LinePhantom power +48vAudio Output3.5mm stereo mini-jackVideo OutHDMI Type-A Additional Inputs/OutputsDC In: 12V DC (with supplied AC adapter)USB Type-C","Item Type":"Camera","Maximum Frame Rate":"120","Maximum Video Resolution":"4K","Monitoring":"LCD Panel5” Fixed Widescreen Color LCDResolution: 1920 × 1080TouchscreenInternal MicrophoneStereo (front mounted)","Physical":"Dimensions (W x H x D)7 × 3.8 × 3.4″Accessory Mounts1/4-20 (center top and bottom)","Power Supply":"AC AdapterSuppliedBatteryType: LP-E6 (supplied)Operating Time: Approximately 1 hrCharging Time: Approximately 2.5 hrAdditional Battery CompatibilityType: LP-E6n","Recording":"Formats CinemaDNG ProRes 422 HQ ProRes 422 ProRes 422 LT ProRes 422 Proxy Modes 4096 × 2160p/3840 × 2160p: 23.98/24/25/30/50/60 1920 × 1080p: 23.98/24/25/30/50/60 \\t Storage Rates (based on 30fps) \\t\\tCinemaDNG Raw: 4K DCI – 272 MB/s, 4K UHD – 255 MB/s, HD – 66 MB/s \\t\\tCinemaDNG RAW 3:1: 4K DCI – 129 MB/s, 4K UHD – 122 MB/s, HD – 32 MB/s \\t\\tCinemaDNG 4:1: 4K DCI – 97 MB/s, 4K UHD – 92 MB/s, HD – 24 MB/s \\t\\tApple ProRes 422 HQ: 4K DCI – 117.88 MB/s, 4K UHD – 110 MB/s, HD – 27.5 MB/s \\t\\tApple ProRes 422: 4K DCI – 78.63 MB/s, 4K UHD – 73.6 MB/s, HD – 18.4 MB/s \\t\\tApple ProRes 422 LT: 4K DCI – 54.63 MB/s, 4K UHD – 51 MB/s, HD – 12.75 MB/s MediaCFast 2.0SDXC UHS-II","Screen Type":"Touchscreen and Fixed","Sensor Size":"Micro 4/3","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"No","Weight":"1.5 lb.","Wireless Connectivity":"Bluetooth"}', 'Pocket
Cinema
Camera 4K
