LC-E6 charger', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (550, 6, 32, 'Blackmagic Pocket Cinema Camera 4K / 6K Battery Grip', 'blackmagic-pocket-cinema-camera-4k-6k-battery-grip', 'The Blackmagic Pocket Cinema Camera 4K / 6K Battery Grip greatly extends shooting time by allowing the use of two Sony NP-F (L-series) batteries. Key features include:

Compatible with BMPCC4K/6K/6K PL
Extends battery life with two NP-F (L-series) battery slots
Extends the camera’s grip and lens support spacing
Includes two Blackmagic NP-F570 batteries and a dual charger (rental only)

More Power. The Blackmagic Pocket Cinema Camera 4K / 6K Battery Grip holds two Sony NP-F550-sized batteries to effectively multiply your shooting time by 3.4x with the included batteries.

Extended Grip. This battery grip adds about 50% more area to the BMPCC4K, BMPCC6K EF, or BMPCC6K PL for larger hands or when you need higher lens spacing for rail systems.

Need Additional Batteries? This grip uses different batteries than the BMPCC 4K & 6K cameras, but this rental includes two Blackmagic NP-F570 batteries as well as a Sony AC-VQ1051D charger. You can rent additional compatible batteries, like the Hawk-Woods DV-F590 L-Series Batteries, if you need them.', 107000.0, '{"Battery System":"NP-F","Brand":"Blackmagic","Item Type":"Power","Power Type":"Battery and Battery Grip"}', 'Battery grip
Battery tray
	(2)
Blackmagic
NP-F570 battery
AC-VQ1051D charger
Polarized cable', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (551, 1, 32, 'Blackmagic Pocket Cinema Camera 6K (EF)', 'blackmagic-pocket-cinema-camera-6k-ef', 'The Blackmagic Pocket Cinema Camera 6K is the predecessor to the Blackmagic Pocket Cinema Camera 6K G2.  It offers 6K RAW & DCI 4K ProRes 422 to CFast 2.0, SD, & external USB-C drives. Key features include:

Super35, 23.1 × 12.99mm, CMOS sensor
13 stops of dynamic range
6K capture to RAW and ProRes
Records to CFast 2.0, SD UHS-II, & external USB-C drives

Updated 6K, S35 Sensor. Blackmagic has quickly embiggened the M4/3 sensor found in the BMPCC4K to a 6K, Super35 version in the Blackmagic Pocket Cinema Camera 6K. It offers full-sensor, 6K capture up to 50p in 12-bit Blackmagic RAW and a number of 10-bit ProRes 422 options. Frame rates can be extended to 120 fps when shooting in cropped 1080p.

Dual ISO Sensitivity. Low-light sensitivity should get a slight increase thanks to the increase in sensor size, and dual native ISO has made the jump to the 6K sensor. This feature modifies the camera’s native ISO to reduce noise at higher sensitivities. The BMPCC 6K ISO range extends up to ISO 25,600.

Canon EF Lens Compatibility. The camera has an active Canon EF lens mount for compatibility with a wide range of lenses from Canon and third-parties like Sigma.

High Battery and Media Demands. To allow the capture of 6K/50 RAW files, the BMPCC6K takes CFast 2.0 and SD UHS-II, and you’ll only get about 8 minutes per 256GB at that format. External USB-C drives can also be used for longer record times with a lower cost per gigabyte. Power is provided by common Canon LP-E6 or LP-E6n batteries, but be warned, this camera will eat through a fully charged battery in approximately 45 minutes. Please plan your power and memory needs accordingly.

Other Features. The camera has a big 5" touchscreen monitor on the back, but video can be monitored externally via the full size HDMI port. It provides high quality audio input and 48V phantom power to microphones via its mini XLR input. Use of professional microphones will require a Blackmagic 19.5-Inch Mini XLR to XLR Female Cable, which is not included with the rental.', 429000.0, '{"Brand":"Blackmagic","Camera Mount":"Canon EF","Camera Type":"Cinema","Compatible Media":"CFast and SD","Imaging":"Sensor Type: CMOS Size: 23.1 × 12.99mm (Super35) Maximum Resolution 6144 × 3456 Approximate Crop Factor Full Sensor Scan: 1.558x Windowed Sensor Scan (HD 120fps): 3.388x ISO Dynamic Range: Up to 13 stopsSensitivity Range: 100-25,600 Native ISO: Dual 400 and 3200","Inputs/Outputs":"Audio Inputs1x mini XLR (XLR adapter not included!)3.5mm stereo mini-jackAudio ControlsMic/LinePhantom power +48vAudio Output3.5mm stereo mini-jackVideo OutHDMI Type-A Additional Inputs/OutputsDC In: 12V DC (with supplied AC adapter)USB Type-C","Item Type":"Camera","Maximum Frame Rate":"50","Maximum Video Resolution":"6K","Monitoring":"LCD Panel5” Fixed Widescreen Color LCDResolution: 1920 × 1080TouchscreenInternal MicrophoneStereo (front mounted)","Physical":"Weight1.98 lbDimensions (W x H x D)7 × 4 × 3.8″Accessory Mounts1/4-20 (center top and bottom)","Power Supply":"AC AdapterSuppliedBatteryType: LP-E6 (supplied)Operating Time: Approximately 45 minCharging Time: Approximately 2.5 hrAdditional Battery CompatibilityType: LP-E6n","Screen Type":"Touchscreen and Fixed","Sensor Size":"Super35","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"No","Wireless Connectivity":"Bluetooth"}', 'Blackmagic
