INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (573, 2, 35, 'Blazar Remus 33mm T1.8 1.5x Anamorphic EF (Silver Flare)', 'blazar-remus-33mm-t1-8-1-5x-anamorphic-ef-silver-flare', 'The Blazar Remus 33mm T1.8 1.5x Anamorphic for EF mount offers a classic widescreen look and cine-style build while being more affordable than other anamorphic lens brands. Key features include:

1.5x squeeze ratio covering up to 3:2 open gate large formats
Elegant oval bokeh and silver flaring
150º focus rotation and unified gear positions
Very portable while maintaining a wide max aperture

Anamorphic Look for Less. With a goal of maintaining portability and affordability, Blazar has expanded creative possibilities with a set of 1.5x full frame primes. With wide compatibility with multiple aspect ratios, including covering up to 3:2 open gate large formats, the Blazar Remus 33mm T1.8 1.5x is a versatile choice that can be paired with a lot of different kinds of EF-mount cameras – all while being a lot more budget-friendly than most anamorphics.

Critical Characteristics. Remus lenses preserve a lot of the characteristics of 2x anamorphic lenses, including oval bokeh, 3D-like effects, shallow depth of field, and flaring, but the lower factor allows these lenses to be both smaller and lighter. When paired with a full frame camera, a 1.5x 33mm provides a spherical equivalent/horizontal focal length of around 22mm.

Suitable for Solo Shooters. Easily swap out different Remus primes without having to adjust your follow focus setup thanks to unified and industry-standard 0.8 MOD gearing. The focus rotation is 150-degrees, which makes focusing by hand easier, and the 77mm front threading will accommodate affordable and readily-available filters. The outside diameter is 80mm, which is compatible with most pro matte boxes for using high-end drop-in filters. A port for adding lens support is on the barrel of the lens, which is handy for heavier matte box setups.

Widescreen for a Wider Audience. Adding a cinematic and artistic touch to your footage is now more accessible than ever because of brands like Blazar, Vazen, and Sirui challenging the high-end likes of ARRI, Cooke, and Atlas. What sets Blazar apart from its current low-cost competitors is their ample sensor coverage and retro look. The Blazar Remus 33mm T1.8 1.5x Anamorphic is a great option for full-frame EF-mount cameras like the Blackmagic PYXIS 6K and the C500 Mark II.

Convenient Prime Packages. Expand your options beyond just the 33mm. We have created the following lens sets for creators to easily explore all that the Blazar Remus collection has to offer. The lenses in these sets are unified both physically and optically so that swapping out different focal lengths is a breeze.

