INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (588, 2, 35, 'Blazar Remus Anamorphic 5-Lens Set (PL, Silver Flare)', 'blazar-remus-anamorphic-5-lens-set-pl-silver-flare', 'The Blazar Remus Anamorphic 5-Lens Set for PL mount includes the following lenses:

Blazar Remus 33mm T1.8 1.5x Anamorphic PL, Silver Flare
	Blazar Remus 50mm T2.0 1.5x Anamorphic PL, Silver Flare
	Blazar Remus 65mm T2.0 1.5x Anamorphic PL, Silver Flare
	Blazar Remus 85mm T2.8 1.5x Anamorphic PL, Silver Flare
	Blazar Remus 125mm T4.0 1.5x Anamorphic PL, Silver Flare

These lenses offer a classic widescreen look and cine-style build while being more affordable than other anamorphic lens brands. Key features include:

1.5x squeeze ratio covering up to 3:2 open gate large formats
	Elegant oval bokeh and silver flaring
	150º focus rotation and unified gear positions
	Very portable while maintaining a wide max aperture

Anamorphic Look for Less. With a goal of maintaining portability and affordability, Blazar has expanded creative possibilities with a set of 1.5x full-frame primes. With wide compatibility with multiple aspect ratios, including covering up to 3:2 open gate large formats, Blazar Remus lenses are a versatile choice that can be paired with a lot of different kinds of PL-mount cameras – all while being a lot more budget-friendly than most anamorphics.

Special Note for 33mm. While these lenses are compatible with a wide variety of PL-mount cameras, there are some limitations with the 33mm lens. The 33mm lens has a 17.3mm rear element protruding from the back of the PL mount which does not fit all camera systems.

Critical Characteristics. Remus lenses preserve a lot of the characteristics of 2x anamorphic lenses, including oval bokeh, 3D-like effects, shallow depth of field, and flaring, but the lower factor allows these lenses to be both smaller and lighter.

Suitable for Solo Shooters. The lenses in this set are unified both physically and optically so that swapping out different focal lengths is a breeze. They are equipped with industry-standard 0.8 MOD gearing and the focus rotation is 150º, which makes focusing by hand easier. The 77mm front threading will accommodate affordable and readily-available filters. The outside diameter is 80mm, which is compatible with most pro matte boxes for using high-end drop-in filters. A port for adding lens support is on the barrel of the lens, which is handy for heavier matte box setups.

Widescreen for a Wider Audience. Adding a cinematic and artistic touch to your footage is now more accessible than ever because of brands like Blazar, Vazen, and Sirui challenging the high-end likes of ARRI, Cooke, and Atlas. What sets Blazar apart from its current low-cost competitors is their ample sensor coverage and retro look.', 1186000.0, '{"Anamorphic Squeeze":"1.5x","Aperture Blades":"16","Brand":"Blazar","Filter Size":"77.0mm","Filter Type":"Screw-On and Matte Box Mount","Focus Rotation":"150º","Focus Type":"Manual Focus Only","Front Lens Diameter":"80mm","Gearing":"0.8 MOD focus, iris","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"Full-Frame","Lens Mount":"PL","Lens Type":"Anamorphic, Kit, Cine, For Mirrorless, Wide Angle, Standard, and Telephoto","Mfr. Model Number":"RE-5L-PLS","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"No","Weight":"12.0 lb.","Zoom Type":"Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Blazar
