INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (589, 2, 35, 'Blazar Remus-M 100mm T2.8 1.5x Anamorphic (E, Silver Flare)', 'blazar-remus-m-100mm-t2-8-1-5x-anamorphic-e-silver-flare', 'The Blazar Remus-M 100mm T2.8 1.5x Anamorphic (E, Silver Flare) is a compact lens that mirrors the optical design of the Blazar Remus, now with mirrorless E-Mount camera compatibility. Key features include:

1.5x squeeze ratio
80mm front diameter; 77mm filter thread
Fast T2.8 aperture; 16-blade iris
Silver flare effect

Anamorphic Look for Less. With a goal of maintaining portability and affordability, Blazar has expanded creative possibilities with a set of 1.5x full-frame primes. With wide compatibility with multiple aspect ratios, including covering up to 3:2 open gate large formats, the Blazar Remus-M 100mm T2.8 1.5x Anamorphic (E, Silver Flare) is a versatile choice that can be paired with mirrorless E-mount cameras – while being a lot more budget-friendly than most anamorphics.

Suitable for Solo Shooters. Easily swap out different Remus primes without having to adjust your follow focus setup thanks to unified and industry-standard 0.8 MOD gearing. The focus rotation is 150-degrees, which makes focusing by hand easier, and the 77mm front threading will accommodate affordable and readily-available filters. The outside diameter is 80mm, which is compatible with most pro matte boxes for using high-end drop-in filters. A port for adding lens support is on the barrel of the lens, which is handy for heavier matte box setups.

Widescreen for a Wider Audience. Adding a cinematic and artistic touch to your footage is now more accessible than ever because of brands like Blazar, Vazen, and Sirui challenging the high-end likes of ARRI, Cooke, and Atlas. What sets Blazar apart from its current low-cost competitors is their ample sensor coverage and retro look. The Blazar Remus 100mm T2.8 1.5x Anamorphic is a great option for full-frame E-mount cameras like the Sony Alpha a1 II.

Convenient Prime Packages. Expand your options beyond just the 100mm. We have created the following lens sets for creators to easily explore all that the Blazar Remus collection has to offer. The lenses in these sets are unified both physically and optically so that swapping out different focal lengths is a breeze.

