INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (617, 1, 38, 'Bolin Technology R9-418F 4K PTZ Camera (Black)', 'bolin-technology-r9-418f-4k-ptz-camera-black', 'The Bolin Technology R9-418F is a 4K PTZ camera designed specifically for broadcasting or streaming events. Key features include:

Sony 1" 14.2MP CMOS sensor
Built-in Zeiss 9.3-111.6mm f/2.8-4.5 lens
Up to UHD 4K30p over IP, HDMI, and 6G-SDI
±170° pan range, -30 to 90° tilt range

Tackle Complex Venues. The Bolin R9-418F PTZ camera offers exceptional low light sensitivity, which gives it an edge among PTZ cameras. It features comprehensive image parameter settings and a large, low-noise, back-illuminated Sony sensor, making it a great choice for challenging environments, such as concert halls, theaters, and churches. With the latest AI-powered face detection technology and extremely quiet pan and tilt movements, the Bolin R9-418F can target and follow a subject as they move around a stage. This camera is equipped with FreeD protocol support, enabling real-time tracking for AR/VR purposes when paired with software from brands like Disguise, Mo-Sys, Unreal Engine, and StYpe.

Large Output Interface. Output HDMI, 6G-SDI, and IP video in resolutions up to 4K30p, ensuring pro-grade reliability in any production setting. Simultaneously output SDI, HDMI, and IP in independent formats for different application uses. There is also an optical SDI SFP+ slot for optional 12G-SDI expansion (requires a 12G-SDI optical fiber module). Connect directly to a switcher over HDMI/SDI while powering the camera continuously with wall power or via PoE (power-over-Ethernet). HDMI, SDI, and IP signals all have audio streaming embedded. You also have the option of connecting external mics via the 10-pin LEMO mic/line port and a LEMO-to-XLR adapter (not included). This camera also supports genlock and is equipped with front and rear tally lights.

Quality Optics. The fast and bright Zeiss Vario-Sonnar T lens offers an 18x optical zoom in 4K and 24x zoom in Full HD and maintains exceptional clarity across the entire range. Optical image stabilization is there to assist you in harsh environments with strong vibrations and built-in ND filters help in sunny weather. With 255 positions in speeds up to 70 degrees a second, the Bolin R9-418F PTZ camera is a reliable choice for sports, news, live events, and more.', 1318000.0, '{"Brand":"Bolin Technology","Camera Mount":"Unknown","Camera Type":"PTZ","Item Type":"Camera"}', 'Bolin
Technology
R9-418F 4K
PTZ camera
Bolin
HDMI support bracket
Bolin 12V 4A power adapter
Non-polarized cable
Bolin
VCC-RC-2
IR remote
