INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (619, 1, 38, 'Bolin Technology Range IP65 NDI PTZ Camera', 'bolin-technology-range-ip65-ndi-ptz-camera', 'The Bolin Technology Range IP65 NDI PTZ Camera is a PoE++ supported PTZ camera the captures UHD 4K capture through its 8.4MP 1/1.8" image sensor. Key features include:

Supports multiple live streams at once
IP65 weatherproof
25x optical zoom; 16x digital zoom
Autofocus and manual focus

New Product – Coming Soon.

Place your reservation now! We fill orders on a first-come, first-served basis. Please note that included items and rental cost could change as we finalize this listing.

If the listed rental price increases between your preorder and ship dates, don’t worry—you’ll be locked in at your original pre-order price. And if the price decreases, you’ll still pay the lower price. We’ll always contact you to confirm pricing before we ship your order.

UHD 4K PTZ. If you’re on the hunt for a reliable and versatile PTZ for your next livestream, sporting event, or presentation, you’ve found your match–– the Bolin Technology Range IP65 NDI PTZ Camera! Through its 1/1.8" CMOS sensor, this camera offers 8.4MP image capture and true 4K60 video capture with a 25x optical zoom and 16x digital zoom. Even in low light environments, the Range delivers clear imaging with natural colors. With a 59.2° horizontal field of view, the entire scene can be covered and captured.

All-Weather Animal. Shooting outdoors? Weather forecast kind of crappy? No worries, the Range is rated IP65 for both indoor and outdoor use, even in rainy or dusty environments. It operates in extreme weather from -40 to 140°F, and features a windshield-style wiper for the screen to prevent water drop and dust buildup.

Focusing, Pan/Tilt, and More. Alongside standard manual focusing, the Range uses a Time-of-Flight (TOF) sensor to enable quick and accurate autofocusing. Its built-in gyroscope also uses sensors to detect shake and vibration, which allows the camera to enable its 3-axis stabilization and automatically adjust the pan, tilt, zoom, and roll functions. This camera offers 340° pan, 210° tilt, and 270° roll axis. A built-in lip-sync adjustment ensures that your video and audio capture are synchronized, while the brushless motors of the camera deliver a quiet, smooth filming experience. Accidental camera bump? No worries, Zero Deviation Position has your back, and automatically corrects positioning and returns to its intended framing.

Connection Opportunities. The Range is outfitted for all of your livestreaming, audio, and power needs. It features an RJ45 port that supports PoE++ control, two XLR inputs for mic and line-level audio support, a 12G-SDI port, and BNC Timecode port, and HDMI 2.0 port, a standard USB-C port, and finally, its dedicated power input for the included AC adapter.

Mounting, Memory, and The Rest. With singular 1/4"-20 female and 3/8"-16 female screws, you can easily mount wireless microphones, transmitter, and more directly to the Range. It accepts microSD cards up to 128 TB, and features a side-view LCD screen for immediate visuals on IP address, resolution, video format, and codec settings.', 1461000.0, '{"Brand":"Bolin Technology","Camera Type":"PTZ","Compatible Media":"microSD","Dimensions":"10.1 × 8.9 × 6.6″","Field of View":"Horizontal: 59.2 to 2.5° Vertical: 34.6 to 1.4°","Focusing":"Autofocus and Manual Focus","Item Type":"Camera","Maximum Aperture":"1.6-7.6","Maximum Video Resolution":"4K","Mfr. Model Number":"RANGE","Minimum Focusing Distance":"5.9\\"","Mounting":"1/4\\"-20 Female; 3/8\\"-16 Female","Operating Temperature":"-40 to 140°F","Pan and Tilt":"Pan: 340° (-170 to 170°) at 0.05 to 70°/s  Tilt: 210° (-30 to 180°) at 0.05 to 70°/s","Power":"PoE++; Hirose 4-Pin (12 to 36VDC) Input","Screen Type":"Fixed","Sensor Size":"1/1.8\\"-Type CMOS","Stabilization":"Yes","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Weight":"11.35 lb","Wireless Connectivity":"Wi-Fi","Zoom":"Optical: 25x Digital: 16x"}', 'Bolin
