Packed With Power. This Bolt PP-500DR Dual-Outlet Power Pack with Removable Battery recycles flashes in a literal second on full power, allowing you to capture every moment. On a full charge, the interchangeable battery included with the power pack will deliver up to 2,700 flashes, but just in case, you can find an additional one to rent here.

Dual Flash Power. Thanks to two connection outlets on the power pack, you are able to fuel two compatible flashes at the same time. Both outlets offer locking connectors for cable security, while the removable battery can be charged while in use with the included AC adapter. Need to charge other devices, like a smartphone or tablet? There’s a USB port available too!

Carry Light. All together, battery and power pack, this unit only comes in at 19.4 ounces. We also include the dedicated belt clip for an easy carry solution.', 75000.0, '{"Battery Capacity":"5800 mAh","Brand":"Bolt","Carrying Options":"Belt Clip, Strap Lugs","Charging Time":"4.5 Hours","Chemistry":"Lithium-Ion","Dimensions":"6.3 × 1.6 × 4.3″","Item Type":"Power","Maximum Output":"voltage11.1 VDC","Number of Flashes":"2700","Outputs":"2x Flash Power Socket 1x USB-A","Power Type":"Battery, Portable Power, and Power Adapter","Recycle Time":"1 Sec (Full Power)"}', 'Bolt
