Armor Up. The Bright Tangerine Basic Cage for Sony BURANO allows you to start with the basics and customize your setup with a variety of accessories to perfectly suit your needs. This foundation includes the BUD compatible bottom plate, sliding top plate, and NATO side plates. The Bottom Plate is tailor-made for the Sony BURANO. It utilizes the wide BUD dovetail standard shared with the ARRI BUD-1 for the ALEXA 35, and the BUD-3 for the ALEXA MINI & ALEXA MINI LF. The sliding top plate is equipped with dovetail plates for quick release and monitor balance adjustment.

Accessory Mounting Galore. There are various accessory mounting options with threaded points, MAP M4 & QD sockets for flexible rigging. The Left and Right Side Plates feature integrated NATO rails, threaded points, and ARRI rosettes to meet diverse rigging needs. This basic cage kit is designed to be highly compatible with a wide array of accessories from both Sony and third-party providers.', 229000.0, '{"Brand":"Bright Tangerine","Camera Support Type":"Cage","Item Type":"Camera Support","Mounting":"Multiple 1/4″ threads Multiple 3/8″ threads"}', 'Bright
