Shoulder Rig Support. Mount a variety of camera configurations with the Bright Tangerine Create Shoulder Rig (VCT-14)! Through its top plate and safety stops, you can securely mount your setup with a separately available Manfrotto, DJI, or Arca Swiss plate without fear of accidentally dismounting. To broaden compatibility, this shoulder rig can be mounted on a VCT-14 tripod or gimbal!

Universal and Customizable. Featuring a multi-dovetail design, this shoulder rig can mount most any camera system. The central channel of this rig offers up to 7.9 inches of sliding travel, depending on the size of your dovetail! For accessory mounting, the rig provides two ARRI-style rosettes for separately available handgrips, five M4 threads for monitors and other small accessories, and dual rod ports for separately available 15mm rods.

Shoulder Pad. The EVA foam padded shoulder base is equipped with a rubber coating that promotes flexibility and rigidity in handheld configurations. The pad’s four magnetic connections match up with the magnets on the rig’s base, and allows for up to four configurations for optimal personalization!', 186000.0, '{"Accessory Mounting":"5x M4 Female Thread2x ARRI Rosette w/ M6 Female Thread","Brand":"Bright Tangerine","Camera Compatibility":"Universal","Camera Mount":"Quick Release Plate","Camera Support Type":"Baseplate","Dimensions":"10.3 × 3.9 × 2.2″","Item Type":"Camera Support","Material":"Aluminum","Mfr. Model Number":"B6000.1050","Rod Standard":"15 mm LWS / 60 mm Spacing","Tripod Mount":"Shoulder Mount: VCT-14","Weight":"2 lb"}', 'Bright
