Handheld Powerhouse. Maximize your mounting accessories with this Bright Tangerine Short Create NATO Top Handle! Attaching to your setup of choice via an integrated NATO rail, this handle can be mounted forward or backward, and slides to maintain balance. It offers 1/4"-20, 3/8"-16, and MAP M4 threads to mount a variety of accessories such as monitors, microphones, and more.', 79000.0, '{"Attachment Method":"1x NATO Rail Clamp (Built-In)","Brand":"Bright Tangerine","Camera Support Type":"Handle","Dimensions":"5 × 2.5 × 1″","Item Type":"Camera Support","Material":"Aluminum","Mfr. Model Number":"#B4013.1017","Mounting Options":"4x M4 Female Thread Multiple Anti-Twist 1/4\\"-20 Female Thread Multiple Anti-Twist 3/8\\"-16 Female Thread 1x Cold Shoe (Built-In)","Rotation":"No","Weight":"7.1 oz"}', 'Bright
