II hood w/soft cap
Soft carrying case', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (698, 2, 49, 'Canon 500mm f/4L IS II', 'canon-500mm-f-4l-is-ii', 'The Canon 500mm f/4L IS II is a premium supertelephoto lens designed for Canon EF mount cameras.  Key features include:

Increased image sharpness and reduced chromatic aberration
Improved 4-stop, 3-mode image stabilization
Electronic “power” focus
20% lighter than predecessor

The Canon 500mm f/4L IS II is the updated version of the highly popular Canon 500mm f/4L IS. It offers increased image sharpness and reduced chromatic aberration thanks to its redesigned fluorite optics.

It features an improved 4-stop image-stabilization system with an IS mode that only activates when you fully press the shutter button (useful for panning with fast-moving subjects). Additionally, it gains Canon’s Power Focus mode which serves as an electronic follow focus.

Canon has managed to shed 1.5 lbs from the 500mm f/4L IS II, while improving dust and water sealing, and repositioning buttons and switches for improved ergonomics and operation.', 1386000.0, '{"Angle of View":"5°","Aperture Blades":"9, rounded","Brand":"Canon","Dimensions":"5.75 × 15.08″ (ø x L)","Filter Size":"52mm","Filter Type":"Drop-In","Focal Length":"500-500","Focus Type":"Autofocus","Groups/Elements":"12/16","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"Full-Frame","Lens Mount":"Canon EF","Lens Type":"Supertelephoto and For DSLR","Maximum Aperture":"4","Maximum Magnification":"0.15x","Mfr. Model Number":"5124B002","Minimum Focusing Distance":"12.14’","Stabilization":"Yes","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Weight":"7.02lb","Zoom Type":"Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Hood
Tripod foot
Soft lens cover
Soft carrying case
Hard case for transport
Rear cap', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (699, 2, 49, 'Canon 50mm f/1.2L', 'canon-50mm-f-1-2l', 'The Canon 50mm f/1.2L is better than comparable lenses when used in the f/1.2 to f/2.8 range and has superb bokeh. Key features include:

Excellent for wide-aperture shots
Requires autofocus microadjustment
L-series build quality

Superb Bokeh. The Canon 50mm f/1.2 L has been somewhat controversial. Bryan Carnathan’s review is perhaps the most accurate. He claims that it’s better than other lenses in this range from f/1.2 to about f/2.8 and has superb bokeh.

Alternative. If you’ll be shooting stopped down past f/2.8 you may be better served by the Canon 50mm f/1.4, but for wide-aperture shots, this lens is the choice.', 211000.0, '{"Angle of View":"46°","Aperture Blades":"8, rounded","Brand":"Canon","Dimensions":"3.38 × 2.58″ (ø x L)","Filter Size":"72mm","Filter Type":"Screw-On","Focal Length":"50-50","Focus Type":"Autofocus","Groups/Elements":"6/8","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"Full-Frame","Lens Mount":"Canon EF","Lens Type":"Standard and For DSLR","Maximum Aperture":"1.2","Maximum Magnification":"0.15x","Mfr. Model Number":"1257B002","Minimum Focusing Distance":"1.48’","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Weight":"1.3lb","Zoom Type":"Fixed Focal Length"}', '50mm f/1.2L
