Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (701, 2, 49, 'Canon 50mm f/1.8 STM', 'canon-50mm-f-1-8-stm', 'The Canon 50mm f/1.8 STM is a solid, low-cost, normal-range prime lens. Key features include:

f/1.8 aperture
Fast, smooth autofocus
Compact build
Great value

Nifty Fifty. A classic focal length, the 50mm is widely used for just about every type of photography. It offers a field-of-view similar to what the human eye sees with no distortion.

Fast Aperture. The f/1.8 aperture allows both the ability to shoot with a shallow depth-of-field, as well as in lower lighting conditions.

STM Auto-Focus Motor. The STM stepping motor provides fast, smooth operation for both still and video use. It supports the Movie Servo AF mode found in several DSLRs enabling continuous focus while recording. There’s also a AF/MF switch for quickly swapping modes.', 61000.0, '{"Angle of View":"46°","Aperture Blades":"7, rounded","Brand":"Canon","Dimensions":"2.72 × 1.54″ (ø x L)","Filter Size":"49mm","Filter Type":"Screw-On","Focal Length":"50-50","Focus Type":"Autofocus","Groups/Elements":"5/6","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"Full-Frame","Lens Mount":"Canon EF","Lens Type":"Standard","Maximum Aperture":"2.8","Maximum Magnification":"0.21x","Mfr. Model Number":"0570C002","Minimum Focusing Distance":"13.78\\"","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"No","Weight":"5.64oz","Zoom Type":"Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Canon 50mm f/1.8
STM
