L-series build quality
Great value

Updated Version Available. Please not that we offer the more feature-rich Canon 70-200mm f/2.8L IS III, which includes image stabilization, at a comparable price.

Remarkable Quality for a Low Price. The Canon 70-200mm f/2.8L is great for photographers shooting sporting events or those who know they’ll be using fast shutter speeds.', 361000.0, '{"Angle of View":"34°-12°","Aperture Blades":"8, rounded","Brand":"Canon","Dimensions":"3.33 × 7.62″ (ø x L)","Filter Size":"77mm","Filter Type":"Screw-On","Focal Length":"70-200","Focus Type":"Autofocus","Groups/Elements":"15/18","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"Full-Frame","Lens Mount":"Canon EF","Lens Type":"Telephoto and For DSLR","Maximum Aperture":"2.8","Maximum Magnification":"0.16x","Mfr. Model Number":"2569A004","Minimum Focusing Distance":"4.92’","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Weight":"2.9lb","Zoom Type":"Variable Focal Length"}', '70-200mm f/2.8L
