Added Stability. This grip offers a more stable and secure hold on the Canon EOS 5D Mark III, 5DS, and 5DS R, making them easier to hand-hold at lower shutter speeds.

Improved Ergonomics and Controls. The BG-E11 also serves as a vertical grip, making it popular with portrait and event photographers. It gives you a slew of vertically positioned controls for shooting in portrait orientation. These include a shutter release, a top adjustment dial, an AF/FE lock button, an autofocus multi-controller, and a new autofocus-point selection joystick.

Need Additional Batteries? This rental includes one battery in addition to the battery that comes with the Canon EOS 5D Mark III, 5DS, or 5DS R camera you’re renting. You can rent additional LP-E6 or LP-E6N batteries if you need them.', 75000.0, '{"Brand":"Canon","Item Type":"Power","Power Type":"Battery and Battery Grip"}', 'BG-E11 battery grip
