Servos. The 70-200 offers servo control for zoom focus and iris, with power being supplied by the camera.

ZSG-C10 Zoom Grip Included. This grip offers rocker control over zoom, as well as buttons for one-shot auto focus, and recording start-stop.  It features a rosette adapter and interfaces with the Compact-Servo’s drive via a single cable, meaning it can be either mounted directly to the lens itself or used detached from the lens like in place of a handgrip in a shoulder mount configuration.', 904000.0, '{"Brand":"Canon","Filter Type":"Screw-On","Focus Type":"Autofocus","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"Super35","Lens Mount":"Canon EF","Lens Type":"Cine","Stabilization":"Yes","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Zoom Type":"Variable Focal Length"}', 'Lens
