	112mm protective filter
Hard case', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (795, 2, 49, 'Canon Cine-Servo 17-120mm T2.95-3.9 EF', 'canon-cine-servo-17-120mm-t2-95-3-9-ef', 'The Canon Cine-Servo 17-120mm T2.95-3.9 EF is one of the first ENG-style motorized zoom lenses for the Canon EF mount. Key features include:

Constructed for professional production needs
ENG-style hand grip with a zoom rocker
Perfect for Super 35/APS-C crop sensor cameras
Pairs well with many EF-mount cameras

Motorized Zoom. The Canon Cine-Servo 17-120mm T2.95-3.9 EF features an ENG-style hand grip with a zoom rocker. Power is provided by a 12-pin Hirose connector (we provide a D-Tap adapter).

Cinema Construction. Designed for professional production needs, the lens has dual focus drive gears (0.8 & 0.5), a zoom drive gear (0.5), and an iris drive gear (0.4). The 11-blade stepless aperture produces natural, circular bokeh and a soft light beam when shooting bright subjects. The built-in 3/8”-16 threaded mount attaches to an included Wooden Camera 15mm Universal Lens Support.

Super 35 Sensor Coverage. The Canon 17-120mm T2.95-3.9 is designed specifically for image sensors measuring 26.2 × 13.8mm and smaller. That makes it perfect for Super 35 and APS-C crop-sensor cameras, offering a focal length roughly equivalent to 27-192mm.

Try it with any of these EF-mount cameras. This lens works well with the EF version of the Canon C500 MK II when paired with the EU-V2 and Canon 12-Pin to 12-Pin Interface Extension Cable 15.7-inch.', 3036000.0, '{"Brand":"Canon","Diameter":"6.9\\"","Front Lens Diameter":"114mm","General":"Dimensions (ø x L)6.9 × 10.4\\"Weight6.4 lb.","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Mount":"Canon EF","Lens Type":"Ultra Wide Angle, Wide Angle, Standard, and Telephoto","Minimum Focusing Distance":"2.8’"}', 'Canon
