	Maintains optical quality of lens while retaining autofocus / IS capabilities (if featured)', 79000.0, '{"Brand":"Canon","Camera Mount":"Canon RF","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Mount":"Canon EF","Lens Support Type":"Mount Adapter"}', 'Canon
