Great Walking-Around Lens. The replacement lens for the infamous 17-85 IS, the 15-85 has Canon’s 4-stop image stabilization and USM for quick focusing. It’s small enough and has the right range to make an excellent walk-around or primary lens on crop-frame cameras.', 146000.0, '{"Angle of View":"84° 30’-18° 25’","Aperture Blades":"7, rounded","Brand":"Canon","Dimensions":"3.21 × 3.44″ (ø x L)","Filter Size":"72mm","Filter Type":"Screw-On","Focal Length":"15-85","Focus Type":"Autofocus","Groups/Elements":"12/17","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"APS-C","Lens Mount":"Canon EF","Lens Type":"Ultra Wide Angle, Wide Angle, Standard, and For DSLR","Maximum Aperture":"3.5-5.6","Maximum Magnification":"0.17x","Mfr. Model Number":"3560B002","Minimum Focusing Distance":"1.15’","Stabilization":"Yes","Weather Sealing":"No","Weight":"1.27lb","Zoom Type":"Variable Focal Length"}', 'Canon 15-85mm
