Image Stabilization. The in-lens stabilizer helps to eliminate camera shake by up to 3.5 stops.', 79000.0, '{"Angle of View":"27° 50’-6° 15’","Aperture Blades":"7, rounded","Brand":"Canon","Dimensions":"2.76 × 4.38″ (ø x L)","Filter Size":"58mm","Filter Type":"Screw-On","Focal Length":"55-250","Focus Type":"Autofocus","Groups/Elements":"12/15","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"APS-C","Lens Mount":"Canon EF","Lens Type":"Standard, Telephoto, and For DSLR","Maximum Aperture":"4-5.6","Maximum Magnification":"0.29x","Mfr. Model Number":"8546B002","Minimum Focusing Distance":"2.79’","Stabilization":"Yes","Weather Sealing":"No","Weight":"13.23oz","Zoom Type":"Variable Focal Length"}', 'EF-S 55-250mm
