Canon Locking EF Lens Mount. This C300 Mark III features a locking EF mount, designed for heavier cinema lenses, and is compatible with all of Canon’s servo-zooms, EF Cinema, and EF lenses—over 100 lenses, including compact primes, super telephotos, specialty tilt-shifts, macros, and fisheyes. Please note that you’ll need to set the camera to a cropped sensor mode to use some cine and EF-S lenses.

