Case', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (911, 1, 49, 'Canon ME20F-SH Multi-Purpose Camera', 'canon-me20f-sh-multi-purpose-camera', 'The Canon ME20F-SH is a multi-purpose camera that’s capable of capturing images in the darkest conditions. Key features include:

2.26MP HD Full Frame 35mm CMOS sensor
Expandable sensitivity up to 4,000,000 ISO
External monitor/recorder required
Built-in ND and IR filters

High Sensitivity. Adjectives that could be used to describe this camera’s low-light capabilities include: ridiculous, incredible, stupendous, and mind-blowing. If seeing is believing, then the ME 20F SH will leave no doubt. With a top ISO of 4,000,000, you can capture images at 0.0005 LUX. Its full-frame 35mm sized sensor is just a mere 2.2 megapixels but with huge photosites, 7.5x larger than those found Canon’s standard DSLR sensors to be exact, for gathering massive amounts light.

Built-in IR Cut Filter. In addition to 1/8 and 1/64 ND Filters, the Canon ME20F SH features an IR Cut filter on its internal filter wheel. This allows you to use the IR cut filter just as you’d use the built-in ND filters.

Versatile Form Factor. The ME20 F-SH is another in the line of cameras that’s best described as “small boxes with lens mounts.” What this configuration may lack in out-of-box ergonomics, it more than makes up for with a high ceiling for mounting potential.

Pro Lensing Features. The Canon ME20F-SH features a locking EF mount, providing a stronger attachment to the camera than a standard EF mount. It also features a 12-pin lens terminal.

External Monitor/Recorder Required. Please note, this camera does not feature a menu interface, live view, or a recording solution. Click here for recommended monitors and recorders.

AC Powered. This rental is powered off of the AC adapter and does not include a dedicated battery solution. If you need a portable power solution, we recommend our Wooden Camera Power Kit for 4-pin XLR in gold or v-mount.', 2839000.0, '{"Aspect Ratio":"HD: 16:9","Brand":"Canon","Camera Mount":"Canon EF","Camera Type":"Cinema","Compatible Media":"External Storage","Formats":"1920 × 1080p 50, 59.94, 1920 × 1080PsF 25 / 29.97, 1920 × 1080i: 50 / 59.94, 1280 × 720p: 50 / 59.94, 768 × 576p: 50, and 640 × 480p: 59.94","Image Sensor":"HD Full Frame 35mm CMOS Image Sensor (2.59 MP)","Inputs/Outputs":"Video OutputsHDMI Output HDMI (59.97p & 50p, 29.97p, 25p, 23.98p)","Item Type":"Camera","Maximum Frame Rate":"60","Maximum Video Resolution":"1080p","ND Filters":"Clear, 1/8 = ND0.9 (3 stops), and 1/64 = ND1.8 (6 stops)","Sensor Size":"Full-Frame","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"No"}', 'ME20F-SH
XLR4
AC adapter
	3-prong power cable', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (912, 2, 49, 'Canon MP-E 65mm 1-5x Macro', 'canon-mp-e-65mm-1-5x-macro', 'The Canon MP-E 65mm 1-5x Macro is a unique specialty macro lens that can magnify an object up to 5 times. Key features include:

Up to 5x magnification
Full-frame compatible
Focusing rail and macro flash recommended

Specialty Lens for Experienced Macro Shooters. The Canon MP-E 65mm 1-5x Macro can magnify an object up to 5x, which would fill a 35mm frame with a grain of rice. This is a unique specialty lens best used by experienced macro shooters. It’s a good idea to use a focusing rail and macro flash with this lens. If you don’t have a macro flash we strongly recommend the Canon MT-26EX-RT Macro Twin Lite.

How Macro Is It? Now, a little bit of math to keep things in perspective. The MP-E’s resolving power is limited by the size of the pixels on your sensor at most aperture and focus distance combinations. Since typical pixels are 5-10 µm square and the MP-E can give up to 5x magnification, this means it’s capable of picking out features only a few micrometers across. For comparison, human hair varies in thickness from 17-180 µm. Crazy.', 250000.0, '{"Angle of View":"18º40’","Aperture Blades":"6","Brand":"Canon","Dimensions":"3.2 × 3.8-9\\" (ø x L)","Filter Size":"58.0mm","Filter Type":"Screw-On","Focal Length":"65-65","Focus Type":"Manual Focus Only","Groups/Elements":"8/10","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"Full-Frame","Lens Mount":"Canon EF","Lens Type":"Macro, Specialty, For DSLR, and Telephoto","Maximum Aperture":"2.8","Maximum Magnification":"5x","Mfr. Model Number":"2540A002","Minimum Focusing Distance":"9.4\\"","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"No","Weight":"1.94 lb.","Zoom Type":"Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Canon
MP-E 65mm 1-5x
Macro
Front & rear caps
Tripod ring
Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
