INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (927, 1, 49, 'Canon PowerShot V10 Vlog Camera', 'canon-powershot-v10-vlog-camera', 'The Canon PowerShot V10 Vlog Camera is a pocket-sized vlogging camera that sports a 19mm wide-angle lens and high-quality stereo sound recording. Key features include:

Full HD up to 59.94 fps
Built-in 30° stand
For vlogging and live streaming
20.9MP 1-inch CMOS sensor

CMOS Sensor and DIGIC X Processing. The Canon PowerShot V10 pairs a 20.9MP 1-inch CMOS sensor and DIGIC X image processor to deliver high-quality video and still in a palm sized device. This unit records for up to an hour of footage in a variety of lighting conditions and boasts a flexible ISO 125-3200 in 4K UHD, ISO 125-3200 in Full HD, and ISO 125-12800 for still photos. The camera’s rolling shutter shoots video between 1/4000-1/25 second and stills between 1/2000-1/8 second. The DIGIC X image processing allows for a wide range of creative options that features 14 color filters and a Smooth Skin shooting mode.

Versatile Video This vlogging camera sports uncropped UHD 4K movie recording at up to 29.97 fps, Full HD high frame rate movie recording at up to 59.94 fps, and live streaming in Full-HD at 30 fps, making it a simple and convenient option for vlogging and content creating. A built-in 30° stand allows for precision shooting from a flat surface, but to shoot vertically, simply set the camera on its side, and it will adjust accordingly. UVC capability allow the PowerShot V10 to be used as a web camera to stream live video in Full HD without additional computer software to services like YouTubeLive and FacebookLive, along with other online web conferencing software.

19mm Autofocus Lens and Touchscreen LCD. With a 97.5° angle of view during video shooting and a 100.2° angle of view for stills, this 19mm wide-angle lens is the cherry on top of this vlogging camera. The broadness of the wide-angle lens allows you to capture an entire scene or take self-facing video without stretching your arm out. Autofocus is accomplished with contrast detection across the entire frame, with the options for Face Tracking and area-specific autofocus in 31 individual zones when shooting stills. Additionally, the lens has the ability to open to f/2.8 to further expand upon the camera’s low-light capabilities. A large 2-inch 460,000-dot touchscreen provides a built-in interface for controlling focusing points, navigating menus, and reviewing imagery. This screen also features a 180°, upward-tilting design for rear- and front-facing viewing.

Connectivity Corner. This device offers multiple connectivity point, both wired and wireless. With Bluetooth and Wifi capabilities, you can easily utilize functions such as remote live view, file viewing, and transfer from this unit to compatible smart devices using the Canon Control App while simultaneously preserving your battery life. Physically, the camera features a USB-C port, a micro-HDMI port, and a microphone port for video recording.', 139000.0, '{"Brand":"Canon","Camera":"Image SensorCMOS Sensor ResolutionActual: 20.9 MegapixelEffective: 13.1 Megapixel","Camera Type":"Compact","Compatible Media":"microSD","Display":"Display Type180° Tilting Touchscreen LCD Size2\\" Resolution460,000 Dot","Exposure Control":"Shutter Speed1/4000 to 1/25 Second in Video Mode1/2000 to 1/8 Second in Video Mode ISO Sensitivity\\nPhoto125 to 12,800 Video125 to 6400\\n Exposure MeteringEvaluative Exposure ModesAutoManual Self-Timer2 Sec10 Sec Remote ControlOptional","Features":"Image StabilizationDigital Scene ModesNone Environmental ProtectionNone White Balance ModesAutoCloudyCustomDaylightFluorescent (White)ShadeTungsten Creative EffectsYes Built-In MicYes Built-In SpeakerNo Built-In Light/FlashLight – NoFlash – No Accessory ShoeNone Tripod Mounting ThreadNone","General":"ColorBlack Supported LanguagesArabicCzechDanishDutchEnglishFinnishFrenchGermanGreekHebrewHindiHungarianIndonesianItalianJapaneseKoreanMalaysianNorwegianPersianPolishPortugueseRomanianRussianSimplified ChineseSpanishSwedishThaiTraditional ChineseTurkishUkrainianVietnamese BatteryBuilt-In Lithium-Ion Battery, 3.6 VDC, 1250 mAhBattery Charge Time: 2 hours Charging MethodUSB Power AdapterNone Operating Temperature32 to 104°FHumidity: 10 to 90% Dimensions (W x H x D)3.5 × 2.5 × 1.4″ Weight7.4 oz (Body Only)7.4 oz (With Recording Media)","Inputs/Outputs":"Video I/O1 x Micro-HDMI Output Audio I/O1 × 1/8\\" / 3.5 mm TRS Stereo Microphone Input Power I/O1 x USB-C Input Wireless2.4 GHz Wi-Fi (802.11b/g), Wi-Fi 4 (802.11