INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (946, 5, 49, 'Canon RF 24-105 f/2.8L IS USM Z Power Zoom Adapter Kit', 'canon-rf-24-105-f-2-8l-is-usm-z-power-zoom-adapter-kit', 'The Canon RF 24-105 f/2.8L IS USM Z Power Zoom Adapter Kit combines Canon’s 24-105 f/2.8L lens & PZ-E2 Zoom Adapter for smooth zoom control. Key features include:

Thumb rest for handheld comfort
Adapter easily attaches/detaches from lens
Fast, quiet, and accurate Nano USM autofocus system
5.5 stops of optical image stabilization

Canon RF Mount. The Canon RF 24-105mm f/2.8L IS USM Z belongs to Canon’s line of RF-mount lenses. It’s compatible with Canon RF-mount cameras. but does not work with Canon EF-mount cameras.

Fast, Versatile Midrange Zoom. This lens’s standard zoom range and fast, constant f/2.8 aperture makes it perfect for portraiture, wedding and event photography, photojournalism, video applications, studio sessions, and low-light shoots. Using an APS-C camera? You’ll get an approximate 38.4-168mm focal length.

Optical Image Stabilization. The built-in optical image stabilization system provides up to 5.5 stops of correction, allowing you to shoot hand-held, in lower light, and at lower shutter speeds without worry. When you use this lens with a compatible camera’s in-body Coordinated Image Stabilization system, you’ll get eight stops of correction.

Nano USM Autofocus. This autofocus system uses dual Nano USM motors to ensure fast, accurate, and nearly silent performance that’s great for photo and video applications. You also get full-time manual focusing, and an eleven-blade aperture that helps produce pleasing bokeh.

Advanced Optical Design. This lens’s 18-group/23-element optical design includes 4 Ultra-Low Dispersion elements and 3 aspherical elements which combine to reduce chromatic and spherical aberrations, color fringing, and distortion for maximum clarity, color accuracy, sharpness, and rendering. Super Spectra and Air Sphere coatings on the lens elements help minimize ghosting and flare.

Multiple Control Rings. The 24-105 is the first Canon RF-mount lens to include a stepless aperture ring, which lets you adjust exposure and background blur when capturing video with compatible cameras. Its smooth action is akin to what you’d find in a cine lens. The focus ring has soft click-stops to let you track focus adjustment, while the manual-focus ring lets you fine-tune your image.

High-Quality Build. This lens boasts a weather-resistant build that protects against the elements so you can use it in adverse conditions. Canon has applied a fluorine coating to the front element that keeps debris, water, oil, and fingerprints from sticking. Focusing and zooming are handled internally, which keeps the lens barrel from moving during those functions.

Precise Zoom Control. This Canon PZ-E2 Power Zoom Adapter is designed specifically for the included Canon RF 24-105mm f/2.8L IS USM Z lens and provides precision zoom control. To adjust the zoom speed, there is a small dial (labeled Z.S for Zoom Speed) located near the bottom of the adapter.

Power Talk. The adapter sources power directly through contacts on the lens, but can also be fueled with the separately available PD-E1 USB Power Adapter through the USB-C port.', 729000.0, '{"Angle of View":"83 – 23º","Brand":"Canon","Exterior Design":"Focusing / Control RingYes, with click stopsManual Focus RingElectronic ring systemFull-time Manual focus possibleNo physical limit to ring rotational angleAF / MF SwitchYesDistance ScaleNone (Electronic distance scale possible in viewfinder or LCD monitor, with compatible EOS R-series cameras)Distance Limiter SwitchProvided: Full / 1m to infinityDust / Weather ResistantYes","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Support Type":"Lens Control","Optical Design":"Groups/Elements18/23Ultra-Low Dispersion Elements4Aspherical Elements3Lens CoatingsCanon SSC (Super Spectra Coating), ASC (Air Sphere Coating), Fluorine CoatingAperture Blades11","Zoom Adapter":"ColorBlack Dimensions4.1 × 3.2 × 2.4″ Weight5.5 oz Environmental ProtectionNo"}', 'Canon
