Compatible Accessories. Broaden the capabilities of the RF 70-200mm f/2.8 L IS USM Z by adding on accessories, such as the PZ-E2 Power Zoom Adapter, PZ-E2B 20 Pin Power Zoom Adapter, or RF Extender 1.4x!', 471000.0, '{"Angle of View":"34°-12°","Aperture Blades":"11","Brand":"Canon","Dimensions":"3.5 × 7.8″ (ø x L)","Filter Size":"82mm","Filter Type":"Screw-On","Focal Length":"70-200","Focus Type":"Autofocus","Groups/Elements":"15/18","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"Full-Frame","Lens Mount":"Canon RF","Lens Type":"Telephoto and For Mirrorless","Maximum Aperture":"2.8","Maximum Magnification":"0.3x","Mfr. Model Number":"6593C002","Stabilization":"Yes","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Weight":"2.4lb","Zoom Type":"Variable Focal Length"}', 'Canon
