	Canon RF 70-200mm f/2.8 L IS USM Z – Black
	Canon RF 70-200mm f/2.8 L IS USM Z – White
	Canon RF 200-800mm f/6.3-9 IS USM', 125000.0, '{"Brand":"Canon","Camera Mount":"Canon RF","Dimensions":"2.8 × 0.8″ (ø x L)","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Mount":"Canon RF","Lens Support Type":"Teleconverter","Light Loss":"1 Stop","Magnification":"1.4x","Mfr. Model Number":"4113C002","Weight":"7.9 oz"}', 'Canon
