Stepping Motor Autofocus System. The RF-S 18-150mm f/3.5-6.3 IS STM‘s built-in stepping autofocus motor provides fast and smooth continuous autofocus performance in both still and video shooting. It also offers full-time manual focus adjustment.', 86000.0, '{"Angle of View":"74° 20’ to 10° 25’","Aperture Blades":"7, rounded","Brand":"Canon","Dimensions":"2.7 × 3.3″ (ø x L)","Filter Size":"55mm","Filter Type":"Screw-On","Focal Length":"18-150","Focus Type":"Autofocus","Groups/Elements":"13/17","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"APS-C","Lens Mount":"Canon RF","Lens Type":"Ultra Wide Angle, Wide Angle, Standard, Telephoto, and For Mirrorless","Maximum Aperture":"3.5 to 6.3","Maximum Magnification":"0.44x","Mfr. Model Number":"5564C002","Minimum Focusing Distance":"6.7\\"","Stabilization":"Yes","Weather Sealing":"No","Weight":"10.9oz","Zoom Type":"Variable Focal Length"}', 'Canon
