Canon E3 Connection. This sub-mini connection cable is compatible with entry-level and consumer-grade Canon cameras such as the Canon EOS R / PowerShot G3 X / PowerShot G5 X Mark II / SL3 / T7i.', 29000.0, '{"Brand":"Canon","Camera Support Type":"Shutter Release","Item Type":"Camera Support"}', 'Remote
