1/2.84-inch 21.14MP 4K UHD CMOS sensor
30.6-612mm f/1.8-2.8 20x optical zoom lens
Capture UHD 4K/30p at 150 Mbps & 1080/60p at 35 Mbps
SDI and mini HDMI outputs and 2x XLR inputs

Prosumer Goes 4K. For those of you familiar with previous XA models, you will definitely notice the XA45’s gratuitously upgraded sensor, giving a substantial jump in both resolution and maximum bitrate. This camcorder is capable of recording highly efficient UHD 4K/30p files up to 150 Mbps! Please note, due to the improved recording capabilities, the XA45 can only shoot MP4 (so long, AVCHD!).

Compact & Easy to Use. The Canon XA camcorders are a fantastic option for first time videography or situations requiring a compact, no fuss camcorder. Despite its small stature, the XA45 features both SDI and mini HDMI outputs for external monitoring and a top handle with professional audio inputs.

