Other Notable Features. Dual SD card slots keep you shooting longer without stopping to swap cards and offer simultaneous dual recording. The camera has two options for viewing your image with a flip-out, 3-inch, capacitive-touch LCD and a compact, extendable rear viewfinder. The camcorder has 4 available channels of audio recorded as linear PCM with two of those those providing phantom power through XLR connectors on the top handle.', 532000.0, '{"Brand":"Canon","Camera Type":"Camcorder","Compatible Media":"SD","Imaging":"Sensor \\t\\tType: 1/2.3-inch CMOS \\tEffective Pixels \\t\\t8.29 MP \\tBit Depth \\t\\t4:2:0 8-bit (internal) 4:2:2 10-bit (not in all modes/external recorder required)","Inputs/Outputs":"Audio Input \\t\\t2x XLR \\t\\tMic-in 3.5mm (⅛”) mini jack \\tAudio Output \\t\\tHeadphones 3.5mm (⅛”) mini jack \\tVideo Output \\t\\tSDI \\t\\tMini HDMI \\tAdditional Inputs/Outputs \\t\\tLANC Remote In \\t\\tUSB DC In","Item Type":"Camera","Lens":"Focal Length \\t\\t 29.3-601mm f/1.8-2.8 \\tZoom Type \\t\\t20x Optical Zoom \\t\\t400x Digital Zoom \\tMinimum Focusing Distance \\t\\t0.39” (wide end) \\t\\t1.9’ (throughout the zoom range) \\tIS \\t\\tYes \\t\\tStandard/Dynamic \\tFilter Diameter \\t\\t58mm \\tManual Adjustments \\t\\tZoom/Focus Hybrid ring","Maximum Video Resolution":"4K","Physical":"Dimensions (with accessories) \\t\\t5.2” x 7.1” x 9.1” Weight \\t\\tApproximately 2.5 lbs. \\tAccessory Mounts \\t\\tTripod: 1x ¼”-20 \\t\\tAdditional: Mic holder, cold shoe","Power Supply":"AC Adapter \\t\\tCanon CA-570 (supplied) \\tBattery Compatibility \\t\\tBP-820 (included) BP-828 \\tApproximate Operating Time \\t\\tBP-820: 95 mins.  \\t\\tBP-828: 145 mins. \\tApproximate Charge Time \\t\\tBP-820: 190 mins. \\t\\tBP-828: 260 mins.","Recording":"Media \\t\\t2x SD slots \\t\\tHigh Resolution Class Requirement: SDXC Class 10/U1 or faster  \\tFrame Rates \\t\\t4K UHD: 30p, 24p \\t\\tFHD: 60p, 30p, 24p  \\tFormats \\t\\tVideo: MPEG-4 AVC/H.264 \\t\\tAudio: MPEG-2 LPCM (4 channel)/AAC-LC (2 channel) \\t\\tFile: MP4  \\tModes \\t\\t150 Mbps (3840 × 2160): 23.98p/29.97p 35 Mbps (1920 × 1280):23.98p/29.97p/59.94p) 17 Mbps (1920 × 1080): 23.98p/29.97p/59.94p 5 Mbps (1280 × 720): 59.94p  \\tApproximate Record Times \\t\\t150 Mbps: 0.86 Min/GB 35 Mbps: 3.48 Min/GB 17 Mbps: 6.6 Min/GB 8 Mbps: 16.5 Min/GB   \\tMulti-Slot Recording Methods \\t\\tRelay Dual","Screen Type":"Touchscreen and Swivel","Sensor Size":"1-Inch","Stabilization":"Yes","Viewfinder Type":"Electronic","Weather Sealing":"No"}', 'Camera w/ lens hood and grip strap
