Other Notable Features. Dual UHS-I SD card slots keep you shooting longer without needing to stop to swap out cards. The camera has two options for viewing your image with a flip-out, 3.5-inch, capacitive-touch LCD and a tiltable rear OLED electronic viewfinder. It can also stream HD video to a PC or Mac via UVC1, although it doesn’t support audio output through USB. An On-Screen Display recording mode embeds date, time, timecode, and other relevant data in your original camera files, essentially time-stamping each frame of your footage.', 736000.0, '{"Brand":"Canon","Camera Type":"Camcorder","Compatible Media":"SD","Environmental":"Operating Temperature32 to 72°FStorage Temperature23 to 113°FOperating Humidity85%Storage Humidity60%","Exposure Control":"Shutter Speed1/2000 to 1 SecondMinimum Illumination1.7 Lux at 1/30 Shutter Speed0.1 Lux at 1/2 Shutter SpeedWhite Balance2000 to 15,000K","Focusing":"Focus TypeAuto and Manual FocusFocus ModeAutofocusManual Focus","General":"Battery TypeCanon BP-8 SeriesPower Consumption5.3 WTripod Mounting Thread1/4\\"-20 FemaleAccessory Mount1x Cold Shoe MountDimensions (W x H x D)8.4 × 4.3 × 3.6″Weight2.2 lbs. (Body Only)3.2 lbs. (With Battery, Handle, Recording Media)","Imaging":"Sensor ResolutionActual: 13.4 Megapixel (4268 × 3148)Effective: 8.29 Megapixel (3840 × 2160)Sensor Type1\\"-Type CMOS SensorImage StabilizationOptical in Integrated LensDigitalBuilt-In ND FilterMechanical Filter Wheel with 2 Stop (1/4), 4 Stop (1/16), 6 Stop (1/64) ND FiltersCapture TypeStills & Video","Interface":"Media/Memory Card SlotDual Slot: SD/SDHC/SDXC (UHS-I)Video I/O1x Mini-HDMI 2.0 Output1x BNC (3G-SDI) OutputAudio I/O2x XLR 3-Pin Mic/Line (+48 V Phantom Power) Input1x 1/8\\" / 3.5mm TRS Stereo Headphone Input1x 1/8\\" / 3.5mm TRS Stereo Microphone InputPower I/O1x USB-C InputOther I/O1x USB-C Output","Item Type":"Camera","Lens":"Focal Length8.3 to 124.5mm (35mm Equivalent Focal Length: 25.5 to 382.5mm)Optical Zoom Ratio15xMaximum Aperturef/2.