Handles. In this kit, you get two Cartoni AH842 Telescopic Handles for Focus 18 and 22. These 15.75" handles attach to a fluid head through its rosette connections.

Keep It Rollin’. Supporting up to 220.5 pounds, the Cartoni Dolly will keep your gear stable and and balanced while on the move.', 2364000.0, '{"Brand":"Cartoni","Camera Support Type":"Tripod and Dolly","Item Type":"Camera Support","Load Capacity":"132.0 lb.","Weight":"30.0 lb."}', 'Cartoni
