INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1038, 3, 52, 'Cartoni K103 3-Section Jibo Fluid Jib', 'cartoni-k103-3-section-jibo-fluid-jib', 'The Cartoni K103 is a portable jib with a robust payload of 44 pounds. It can reach up to 6.5 feet and extend out to over 5.5 feet, all while weighing only 33 pounds. Key features include:

Accepts 75mm and 100mm head bowls
Extending rear arm for counterweights up to 55 pounds
Fluid damping module for long, slow moves
Toolless setup

Elevate Your Scene with Ease. Jib and crane movements are an oft-desired feature but pose size and learning curve limitations. Cartoni set out to solve these problems with the K103, a three-section fluid jib with a surprisingly long range without sacrificing portability.

Quick Transport and Setup. With a load capacity of up to 44 pounds, this jib can handle a wide variety of cameras, from small action cams to large cinema rigs. It can be mounted to tripods with both 100mm or 75mm bowl bases (tripod not included) and the fluid head allows your camera to be mounted in a variety of positions, including underslung and side orientations. This 33-pound jib fits inside a convenient wheeled case.

Impressive Rise and Reach. Panning and tilting is de rigueur but why not give yourself the option of diagonal tracking and elevation? Shoot from ground level all the way up to an admirable 6.5 feet! To safely extend out to its maximum of 5.64 feet, this jib includes an extending rear arm that will hold up to 55 pounds of counterweight. A fluid damping module produces just enough drag for long, slow moves. The Cartoni K103 puts professional motion shots within reach for both seasoned and novice filmmakers and is especially useful for on-the-go projects or tight sets.', 1529000.0, '{"Brand":"Cartoni","Camera Support Type":"Jib","Item Type":"Camera Support","Load Capacity":"44.1 lb.","Weight":"33.1 lb."}', 'Cartoni
