INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1062, 3, 57, 'Cognisys StackShot 3X Macro Rail Package', 'cognisys-stackshot-3x-macro-rail-package', 'The Cognisys StackShot 3X Macro Rail Package is an automated macro slider setup designed for intricate focus stacking. Key features include:

Stacks multiple images with different focus points
Automatic physical movement and shutter triggering
Includes a range of shutter-release cables
Excellent value

Automated Process. Once you have the variables dialed in, the StackShot 3X Controller will automatically adjust the focus rail position in your set increments and trigger the camera’s shutter. What you’ll end up with is a number of images with slightly different focus points that can be combined in the software program of your choice (not included).

Key Points to Remember. While the camera’s physical movement and triggering are automated, its settings aren’t. You’ll need to fine-tune the StackShot settings and the camera’s settings. We strongly suggest using full manual-exposure control, white balance, and focus, as even the smallest change can throw off the final stacked image. If you’re using flash, you’ll want to manually set output as well.

Multiple Camera Options. Since many camera manufacturers use their own proprietary connections, we’ve opted to include several of the more popular choices. When you rent this kit, you’ll get shutter-release cables for the following cameras:

1DX II / 5D IV / 5DS / 5DS R / 6D / 7DII
Nikon DSLRs
Olympus OM-D E-M1 / E-M5II / E-M10 / E-P5 / E-PL7
Sony a7 series / a6000 / a5100 / RX100 IV

Please Note: This product takes some time and skill to get good results. You can find the user manual and a how-to guide under Resources on the right-hand side of this page. We can’t guarantee you’ll get the results you want, only that the product will operate correctly.', 239000.0, '{"Brand":"Cognisys","Camera Support Type":"Slider","Item Type":"Camera Support"}', 'StackShot 3x
