	6-foot universal power cable', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1149, 3, 68, 'DJI Briefcase Handle for RS Series', 'dji-briefcase-handle-for-rs-series', 'The DJI Briefcase Handle for RS Series is an ergonomic, foldable handle that lets you create low-angle shots and install additional accessories onto your DJI RS-series gimbal. It features a built-in cold-shoe mount and multiple 1/4"-20 mounting threads that let you add accessories like monitors, wireless gear, and extension arms.', 54000.0, '{"Brand":"DJI","Camera Support Type":"Handle","Item Type":"Camera Support","Mfr. Model Number":"CP.RN.00000225.01"}', 'DJI
Briefcase
