The DJI Extreme Battery is a lithium-ion polymer battery with a capacity of 1770mAh/6.81Wh and a power output of 3.85V. It’s capable of powering your Osmo Action 6, Action 5 Pro, or Action 4 for 160 minutes and can be charged in-camera or with an optional charger.', 86000.0, '{"Battery Capacity":"1770 mAh / 6.81 Wh","Battery Life":"160 minutes","Brand":"DJI","Dimensions":"1.7 × 1.4 × 0.5″","Item Type":"Power","Mfr. Model Number":"CP.OS.00000229.01","Operating Temperature":"-4 to 113°F","Power Type":"Battery and Kit"}', '(3)
