You can use a DJI 30W USB-C charger to recharge the battery in approximately 60 minutes while it’s mounted to the aircraft, and you can recharge this battery outside of the drone with a USB Type-C cable or a compatible charger, like the DJI Two-Way Charging Hub for Mini 3 Pro Batteries.', 86000.0, '{"Battery":"Battery ChemistryLithium-Ion Polymer (LiPo)Battery Capacity3850 mAh / 28.4 WhOutput Voltage7.38 VDCCells2Charging Power58 W (8.5 VDC)Recharge Time101 MinutesMaximum Battery Life47 Minutes","Brand":"DJI","Environmental":"Charging Temperature41 to 104°F","General":"CompatibilityDJI Mini 3 ProCharging PortUSB Type-C","Item Type":"Power","Mfr. Model Number":"CP.MA.00000499.01","Physical":"Weight0.2 lb.","Power Type":"Battery"}', 'DJI
