Mini 3/4', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1171, 6, 68, 'DJI Intelligent Flight Battery for Air 3', 'dji-intelligent-flight-battery-for-air-3', 'Juice your DJI Air 3 with this DJI Intelligent Flight Battery. This is a sleek and compact battery that offers up to 46 minutes of flight time. That’s really only in perfect conditions though, which are few and far between. I’d expect this thing to run for approximately 35-40 minutes in less than ideal weather.', 89000.0, '{"Battery Chemistry":"Lithium-Ion Polymer (LiPo)","Brand":"DJI","Item Type":"Power","Maximum Flight Time":"46 Minutes","Power Type":"Battery"}', 'Just the battery', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
