M3 Compatibility. These filters are only compatible with the DJI Mavic 3 and Mavic 3 Cine. They will not work with other drones from DJI or otherwise.', 71000.0, '{"Brand":"DJI","Filter Format":"Drone/Action","Filter Type":"Neutral Density","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Support Type":"Filter","Mfr. Model Number":"#CP.MA.00000430.01"}', 'DJI
