INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1192, 5, 68, 'DJI Neutral Density Filter Set for Mini 3 Pro (3-Pack)', 'dji-neutral-density-filter-set-for-mini-3-pro-3-pack', 'The DJI Neutral Density Filter Set for Mini 3 Pro (3-Pack) is a set of premium ND filters for the DJI Mini 3 Pro. Key features include:

ND16, ND64, and ND256 filters included
Great for achieving cinematic motion blur
Manages exposure in daylight and other, harsher light
Only for the DJI Mini 3 Pro

Light To Heavy ND Filtration. The DJI Neutral Density Filter Set for Mini 3 Pro (3-Pack) includes ND16, ND64, and ND256 filters, which provide 4, 6, and 8 stops of light reduction, respectively. The more you reduce light, the more you can manually manage exposure to compensate for harsh lighting conditions. The ND16 filter is best for normal daylight, while the ND64 and ND256 are designed for very bright conditions.

Motion-Blur Effect. You can use these filters to properly expose your images while maintaining a lower shutter speed for cinematic motion blur. Motion blur on lower frame-rate footage helps reduce the choppiness you get from shooting at fast shutter speeds.

Compatibility. These filters are only compatible with the DJI Mini 3 Pro with RC Remote and DJI Mini 3 Pro with RC-N1 Remote. They won’t work with other drones from DJI or other manufacturers.', 57000.0, '{"Brand":"DJI","Filter Format":"Drone/Action","Filter Type":"Neutral Density","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Support Type":"Filter"}', 'DJI
Mini 3
Pro
ND
Filter
Case
ND16 filter
ND64 filter
ND256 filter', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1193, 1, 68, 'DJI Osmo Action 4 Camera Standard Combo', 'dji-osmo-action-4-camera-standard-combo', 'The DJI Osmo Action 4 Camera Standard Combo offers updates like a larger sensor and an upgraded microSD slot to its predecessor, the Osmo Action 3. Key features include:

Front & back color touchscreen displays
Waterproof to 59 feet
Fast charge technology
RockSteady 3.0 image stabilization

What’s New? Compared to its predecessor, the Osmo Action 3, the Action 4 offers the same dual touchscreen LCDs and RockSteady stabilization, but also includes an updated microSD slot that accepts larger cards, a larger 1/1.3" 
 sensor with a higher megapixel count, and a new 10-bit D-Log M color mode.

Stream Like a Pro. With the DJI Osmo Action 4 Camera Standard Combo, the opportunities for use are endless. Whether you’re streaming or just filming your day-to-day, this rental captures up to 160 minutes of whatever you need to share with the world. This camera doubles as a webcam for a more dynamic communication experience, and can capture up to DCI 4K60, UHD 4K120, and 1080p240 video, as well as raw and JPEG still photos.

Dive Into It. The Action 4 camera has been updated to be waterproof to 59-feet, so you can dive deeper for incredible underwater footage.

Voice Control & Image Stabilization. When your hands are tied making top-notch content, this camera also offers voice control and voice prompts for easy adjustments. When you short press the Quick Switch button, the camera will voice broadcast the current shooting mode. Even if the camera is installed on a helmet or other hard-to-see location, you can accurately select the required mode and be confident you’ll never miss the moment you want to record. You can even add up to five sets of custom parameters to the shooting mode list. It also features enhanced RockSteady 3.0 image stabilization, front and back color OLED touchscreens, and the handy invisible selfie stick technology. This updated intelligent stabilization algorithm fuels the latest version of RockSteady EIS, which can effectively eliminate camera shake in all directions. It supports use while recording at up to 4K120, providing a stable and immersive first-person perspective.

Dual Touchscreens & Horizon Steady. The front screen is convenient for vlogging and framing selfies and supports commonly used touch control functions. No more turning the camera around for parameter adjustments, mode switching, or video playback. When the camera is switched between horizontal and vertical orientations, the user interface adapts accordingly. The touchscreens are also sensitive enough to be operated easily with wet hands. The HorizonSteady smart stabilization feature helps to eliminate camera shake in all directions, and even horizontally corrects tilt at any angle. That means footage can remain horizontally level, even through heavy bumps and 360° rotations. In addition, you can activate HorizonBalancing, which corrects the tilt horizontally within ±45° and supports recording stable 4K60 videos.

Editing, Templates, and Apps. The LightCut video editor app is thoroughly optimized for use with the Action 3. It can automatically select clips and intelligently match them with pre-installed exclusive templates to generate ready-to-share video edits. After shooting, simply let the AI select your highlight moments and generate 4K HD videos. The DJI Mimo app unlocks the power of your smartphone to get the most out of the Osmo Action 3. It uses cloud computing and AI algorithms to eliminate the selfie stick for skiing and snowboarding scenarios, giving you breathtaking footage that looks like it was shot by a pro.

Testing…Testing… The Action 4 is compatible with the optional DJI Mic, which is portable, easy to mount, and features a transmission distance of up to 820’. The camera can also connect to other external microphones via the universal 3.5mm connector. A hidden microphone at the bottom of the Action 4 even suppresses wind noise, giving you more audio-recording confidence in windy or high-speed scenarios.

Fueled For Greatness. The Osmo Action 4 doesn’t just handle cold weather, it allows you to continuously record for up to 150 minutes in temperatures as low as -4°F. The battery capacity limits have been pushed even further with the Osmo Action 4 to allow 2.5+ hours of use, and enables you to capture entire adventures all on a single charge. Additionally, this camera supports fast-charge technology. In just 18 minutes, it can be powered up to 80%, which is enough for approximately two hours of shooting.', 111000.0, '{"Brand":"DJI","Camera":"Image Sensor1/1.3\\"-Type CMOS Sensor ResolutionNot Specified by Manufacturer Sensor Crop While Recording4K (3840 × 2880) in 4:34K (3840 × 2160) in 16:92.7K (2688 × 2016) in 4:32.7K (2688 × 1512) in 16:91080p (1920 × 1080) in 16:9","Camera Type":"Action","Compatible Media":"microSD","Display":"Display TypeFixed Touchscreen LCD Display Size2.25\\" Resolution640 × 360 Secondary DisplayFront: 1.4\\" LCD Live-View Monitor","Exposure Control":"Shutter Speed1/8000 to 30 Seconds in Photo Mode ISO SensitivityPhoto/Video: 100 to 12,800 Shooting ModesTime-Lapse Movie Interval Recording.5 Second1 Second2 Seconds3 Seconds4 Seconds5 Seconds6 Seconds8 Seconds10 Seconds15 Seconds20 Seconds25 Seconds30 Seconds40 Seconds Self-TimerNone Remote ControlMimo App (Optional)","Features":"Image StabilizationDigital Scene ModesPreset: Yes Environmental ProtectionAdvertised as Submersible to 59.1’ / 18 mTest Methodology Not Supplied Creative EffectsYes Built-In MicYes Built-In SpeakerYes Built-In Light/FlashLight – NoFlash – No Wireless2.4 / 5 GHz Wi-Fi (802.11a/b/g), Bluetooth 5.0 Mobile App CompatibleYes: Android & iOSApp Name: Mimo AppAs of July, 2022: Check with manufacturer for the most up-to-date compatibility Accessory ShoeNone Tripod Mounting ThreadNone","General":"Supported LanguagesEnglishTraditional Chinese BatteryRechargeable Lithium-Ion Polymer Battery Pack, 3.85 VDC, 1770 mAhMax Runtime: 2.6 Hours per Charge Charging MethodUSB Charging Time\\t1.5 Hours Operating Temperature -4 to 113°F Dimensions (W x H x D)1.7 × 1.3 × 2.8″ / 44.2 × 32.8 × 70.5 mm Weight5.1 oz","Inputs/Outputs":"Inputs1 x USB-C Video OutputNone Microphone InputVia USB Adapter Headphone JackNo","Item Type":"Camera","Maximum Video Resolution":"4K","Optics":"Maximum Aperturef/2.8 Minimum Focus Distance1.3’ Fixed FocusYes Angle of View155°","Recording":"Media/Memory Card SlotSingle Slot: microSD/microSDHC [512 GB Maximum] Video Format3840 × 2880 at 24/25/30/48/50/60 fps (MP4)3840 × 2160 at 24/25/30/48/50/60/100/120 fps (MP4)2688 × 2016 at 24/25/30/48/50/60 fps (MP4)2688 × 1512 at 24/25/30/48/50/60/100/120 fps (MP4)1920 × 1080p at 24/25/30/48/50/60/100/120/200/240 fps (MP4) Slow Motion Mode120 fps Recorded at 3840 × 2160p120 fps Recorded at 2688 × 1512p120 fps Recorded at 1920 × 1080p240 fps Recorded at 1920 × 1080p Still Image SupportJPEG / Raw: 10 MP (3648 × 2736) ChannelsStereo Audio FormatAAC Sampling FrequencyAAC: 48.0 kHz Bit RateAAC: 16.0-Bit IP StreamingNone","Screen Type":"Touchscreen and Fixed","Sensor Size":"1-Inch","Stabilization":"Yes","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Wireless Connectivity":"Wi-Fi and Bluetooth"}', 'DJI
