INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1195, 1, 68, 'DJI Osmo Action 6 Camera Standard Combo', 'dji-osmo-action-6-camera-standard-combo', 'The DJI Osmo Action 6 is a compact action camera and an update to the Action 5. Key features include:

38MP 1/1.1" CMOS sensor
50GB built-in storage
Up to UHD 4K120 video
Waterproof to 65.6’

6th Gen Action Cam. The Action 6 is similar to the Action 5 in many ways. They both have three built-in microphones, the same touchscreens, and nearly identical video specs. This iteration of the DJI Osmo Action camera, however, offers a unique, and larger, 1/1.1 square sensor. This allows for versatile cropping of 4K footage without quality loss and also improves low light performance. There are some physical refinements in the Action 6 as well. The quick release is dual-direction and more versatile than in the prior model and the side door has been redesigned with a much more secure latching system. Overall the camera is taller to accommodate the larger sensor. There is also slightly more internal storage (support for microSD cards up to 1 TB remains the same). Charging time is slightly faster but it is otherwise the same battery and performance found in the Action 5.

A First for Action Cams: Variable Iris. To improve low-light performance, DJI boldly decided to use actual lens blades inside the tiny lens so that shooters had access to both f/2 and f/4 maximum apertures. Action cams typically have fixed apertures, limiting control over depth of view and exposure. You can let the camera choose which is best for a given scenario or you can manually change it. This design ushers in a whole new family of interchangeable lenses. It also makes the Action 6 slightly heavier.

New Modes. Video performance and stabilization features are virtually the same between the Action 6 and Action 5 but there are a couple of new modes for night and long-exposure shooters. The first is Starburst Mode, which will create cool stylized points of light without a filter, and SuperNight Mode for improved noise reduction in very dark scenes. There are also a few more field-of-view options, including one that has the Dewarp feature but for ultrawide shots.

A Reliable Flagship. With dual touchscreens, flexible D-Log M for grading, 4K slow-motion (plus 32x super slow-motion in full HD), and multiple stabilization modes, the DJI Osmo Action 6 is an ideal choice for sports, traveling, vlogging, and underwater shooting.

Housings and Lens Accessories Available. Expand your creative capture with the Action 6 lens filters, accessories, and underwater housing! We carry the FOV Boost Lens, Macro Lens, and ND Filter Set – 3 as separately rentable products, but we also have them all in one rental with the Creative Filter Kit available. If you’re interested in extending the waterproof depth rating from 65.6-feet to 197-feet, we carry the individual Underwater Housing Unit along with the Osmo Action 6 Underwater Kit, which provides you with this camera, extra power accessories, and more.', 146000.0, '{"Brand":"DJI","Camera Type":"Action","Compatible Media":"microSD","General":"Accessory Mounts1x proprietary quick release baseBattery Type1950mAh rechargeable li-ion 1SDimensions (W x H x D)2.9 × 1.3 × 1.9″Mfr. Model NumberCP.OS.00000505.02Monitor2x touchscreens (1.46\\" front, 2.5\\" back)Weight5.3 oz.","Imaging":"ISODynamic Range: 13.5 stopsPhoto: 100-25,600Video: 100-25,600 (51,200 in SuperNight mode)Max ResolutionUHD 4K (3840 × 3840)7K stills (7168 × 5376)ND FiltersNoSensor38MP 1\\"-Type square CMOSShutter1/8,000 sec.-30 sec.StabilizationElectronic IS","Inputs/Outputs":"Power I/O1x USB-C","Item Type":"Camera","Lens":"Angle of View155ºMax Aperturef/2-4Min Focusing Distance0.7\\"Zoom2x digital","Maximum Video Resolution":"4K","Screen Type":"Touchscreen and Fixed","Sensor Size":"1-Inch","Stabilization":"Yes","Video Capture":"CompressionHEVCFormat.MP4Resolution4K (3840×3840) at 24, 25, 30, 48, 50, 60 fps4K (3840×2880) at 100, 120 fps2.7K (2688×2016) up to 120 fpsFHD (1920 × 1080p) up to 240 fps","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Wireless Connectivity":"Wi-Fi and Bluetooth"}', 'DJI
