ND8, ND16, and ND32 filters
3-5 stops of light reduction
Only for Osmo Action 6
AF-coated glass; Water and stain-proof

Neutral Density For Daylight. The DJI Filter set for Osmo Action 6 offers a simple solution for reducing light intake, extending shutter speeds, enhancing motion blur, and maintaining exposure during daylight shooting. The included filters range in light reduction stops, with the ND8 providing 3-stops, the ND16 providing 4-stops, and the ND32 providing 5-stops. These filters require no tools for attachment, and are made of an AF-coated glass that is both water and stain-proof.', 75000.0, '{"Brand":"DJI","Coatings":"Multi-Coated","Exposure Reduction":"3-Stop / 4-Stop / 5-Stop","Filter Format":"Drone/Action","Filter Type":"Neutral Density","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Support Type":"Filter","Material":"Glass, Magnalium","Mfr. Model Number":"CP.OS.00000525.02"}', 'DJI
