Tripod', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1203, 1, 68, 'DJI Osmo Pocket 3 Creator Combo', 'dji-osmo-pocket-3-creator-combo', 'This DJI Osmo Pocket 3 Creator Combo comes equipped with an Osmo Pocket 3 and it’s compatible accessories, including a tripod, battery handle, and wide-angle lens attachment. Key features include:

3-axis gimbal stabilizer
1-inch CMOS sensor
2-inch rotatable screen
Up to 166 minutes of battery life

Smooth ’N’ Steady. With this DJI Osmo Pocket 3 Gimbal, you can capture smooth, handheld footage in a compact form without sacrificing video quality or high resolutions, which can reach UHD 4K120. This camera is a quick draw for those on-the-go vloggers out there, sporting a rotatable two-inch touchscreen that allows you to change orientations in a flash. For more info on this camera, click on the highlighted blue link above.

Wide-Angle Lens. The DJI Wide-Angle Lens attaches to the lens of your Osmo Pocket 3 to extend the field of view to 108°.

Battery Handle. Increase your Osmo Pocket 3’s battery life by 62% with the DJI Battery Handle. This hot-swappable attachment sports an internal, rechargeable 950mAh battery features a USB-C port on the backside to support external accessories like wired microphones, wireless microphone receivers, or wired headphones. You can mount this camera with the battery handle attached onto any accessory with a 1/4"-20 screw.

Mini Tripod. The DJI Osmo Mini Tripod enables the Osmo Pocket 3 to be positioned on any flat surface. The camera is attached via a 1/4"-20 mounting screw, and can even be used as a handle with any attachment that has a 1/4"-20 screw.

Windscreen Not Included. By default, this rental doesn’t include the Mic 2 windscreen. If you need it, please request it in the Special Instructions box during checkout and we’ll include it with your order at no additional cost.', 350000.0, '{"Brand":"DJI","Camera Type":"Action","Compatible Media":"microSD","Display":"Display TypeFixed Touchscreen LCD Display Size2.0\\" Resolution314 × 556 Secondary DisplayNo","Features":"Image StabilizationIntegrated 3-Axis Gimbal White Balance ModesAuto Built-In SpeakerNo Built-In Light/FlashLight – NoFlash – No Wireless2.4 / 5 GHz Wi-Fi Mobile App CompatibleYes: Android & iOSApp Name: DJI Mimo\\n*As of October, 2023: Check with manufacturer for the most up-to-date compatibility Accessory ShoeNo Tripod Mounting ThreadNo","General":"BatteryRechargeable Lithium-Ion Polymer Battery Pack, 7.70 VDC, 1300 mAhMax Runtime: 2.6 Hours per Charge Charging MethodUSB Charging Time0.5 Hours Operating Temperature32 to 104°F Dimensions (W x H x D)5.5 × 1.7 × 1.3″ / 139.7 × 42.2 × 33.5 mm Weight6.3 oz","Inputs/Outputs":"Inputs1 x USB-C Microphone InputNo Headphone JackNo","Item Type":"Camera","Maximum Video Resolution":"4K","Optics":"35mm-Equivalent Focal Length20mm Maximum Aperturef/2 Minimum Focus Distance7.9\\" Fixed FocusYes Angle of ViewWide: 180°","Recording":"Media/Memory Card SlotSingle Slot: microSD (Unspecified Type) (UHS-II) [512 GB Maximum] Slow Motion Mode120 fps Recorded at 3840 × 2160p100 fps Recorded at 3840 × 2160p120 fps Recorded at 2688 × 1512p240 fps Recorded at 1920 × 1080p120 fps Recorded at 1920 × 1080p Still Image SupportJPEG / Raw9.4 MP Audio FormatAAC Sampling FrequencyAAC: 48.0 kHz Bit RateAAC: 16.0-Bit IP StreamingUVC/UAC1920 × 1080","Screen Type":"Touchscreen and Fixed","Sensor Size":"1-Inch","Stabilization":"Yes","Video Format":"3840 × 2160p at 24/25/30/48/50/60 fps (130 Mb/s MP4 via H.264/AVC, H.265/HEVC) 2688 × 1512p at 24/25/30/48/50/60 fps (130 Mb/s MP4 via H.264/AVC, H.265/HEVC) 1920 × 1080p at 24/25/30/48/50/60 