Non-polarized cable', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1211, 6, 68, 'DJI Power Kit for Mavic 3', 'dji-power-kit-for-mavic-3', 'The DJI Power Kit for Mavic 3 is a multi-battery power solution for the DJI Mavic 3 / Cine. Kit includes:

(3) DJI Intelligent Flight Battery for Mavic 3
	DJI Mavic 3 Battery Charging Hub w/ 65W Portable USB Charger
	DJI 65W USB Car Charger for Mavic 3

The DJI Power Kit for Mavic 3 lets you sequentially charge up to three Mavic 3 flight batteries, starting with the one that has the most remaining power.

The Advanced Charging Hub optimizes charging for maximum efficiency, fully charging three batteries in under 6 hours.  For charging on the go, we’ve also bundled the car charger that uses a 12VDC power source.

The Intelligent Flight Battery automatically monitors voltage, power draw, and temperature, and reports it to you via the Mavic 3’s remote controller and DJI’s Fly app. It also includes built-in overcharge and overdrain protection.', 354000.0, '{"Brand":"DJI","Item Type":"Power","Power Type":"Kit, Battery, Charger, and Hub"}', 'DJI
