Hub for
Avata 360', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1237, 6, 68, 'DJI Two-Way Charging Hub for Mini 4 / Mini 3 & 4 Pro', 'dji-two-way-charging-hub-for-mini-4-mini-3-4-pro', 'The DJI Two-Way Charging Hub for Mini 4 / Mini 3 & 4 Pro charges up to three Intelligent Flight and Intelligent Flight Plus batteries far more quickly and efficiently than the standard charger. Key features include:

Simultaneous three-battery charging
Charges the battery with the most power first
For DJI Mini Pro 3 / 4 and Mini 4 batteries
Doubles as a power bank for mobile devices

Intelligent Three-Battery Charging. The DJI Two-Way Charging Hub for Mini 4 / Mini 3 & 4 Pro  lets you sequentially charge up to three Mini 3 Pro, Mini 4, and Mini 4 Pro Intelligent Flight Batteries, starting with the one that has the most remaining power. This hub is compatible with the DJI Intelligent Flight Battery for Mini 3 / 4 and DJI Intelligent Flight Battery for Mini 4 Pro.

Rapid Charging. This hub optimizes charging for maximum efficiency. It fully charges one Intelligent Flight Battery in about 56 minutes, and charges three of them in roughly 3 hours. It charges one Intelligent Flight Battery Plus in approximately 78 minutes, and three of them in just under 4 hours. Status LEDs on the side of the hub indicate each battery’s level, charging speed, and charging status.

Doubles as a Power Bank. When the hub has Intelligent Flight Batteries inserted and isn’t plugged into the wall, you can use the batteries as a series of power banks to recharge your mobile device. When you’re charging a mobile device, the hub discharges the battery with the least power first so that you’re not giving up a fuller battery that would be of more use in your Mini 3 Pro.', 54000.0, '{"Brand":"DJI","Compatibility":"DJI Mini 3 Pro","Inputs/Outputs":"USB I/O1x USB Type-C (Charging Only) Female Input1x USB Type-A (Charging Only) Female Output","Item Type":"Power","Mfr. Model Number":"CP.MA.00000500.01","Power":"Power SourceUSBDC Input Power5 to 12 VDC at 3 AOutput Power5 V / 2 A","Power Type":"Charger and Hub"}', 'DJI
