DJI Ronin 4D 4-Axis Cinema Camera 6K Combo Kit
	DJI Ronin 4D 4-Axis Cinema Camera 8K Combo Kit', 111000.0, '{"Brand":"DJI","Camera Mount":"DJI DL","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Mount":"Sony E","Lens Support Type":"Mount Adapter","Mfr. Model Number":"CP.RN.00000192.01","Physical":"Dimensions (ø x D): 3.5 × 3.9″\\nWeight: 0.3 lb."}', 'X9
