Tango Takeover. This PL mounted DZOFilm Tango 65-280mm T2.9 S35 Zoom lens adds a variety of ENG-style functions and incredible optics to any compatible S35 video camera. Boasting a quick aperture that extends from T2.9 to T4 as you zoom in, its 16 diaphragm blades help produce enticing and smooth bokeh.

Satisfying Color Capture. This zoom lens offers exceptional color rendition that captures intricate close ups with sharp facial details, making it a great fit for fashion projects, documentaries, and sports. The entire Tango lineup maintains incredible color consistency, including the EF version of this lens. Additionally, this lens offers advanced optical design that successfully corrects chromatic aberrations, even further ensuring premier image quality.

Coated Ring Marks. On the lens, you’ll find that all focus, zoom, and aperture marks are finished with a luminous paint. The addition of the luminous paint enhances clarity in low-light productions, allowing focus pullers and camera operators to easily find the markings, resulting in a more efficient on-set experience.', 1554000.0, '{"Aperture Blades":"16","Brand":"DZOFilm","Dimensions":"4.5 × 10.5″ (ø x L)","Filter Size":"105.0mm","Filter Type":"Matte Box Mount and Screw-On","Focal Length":"65-280","Focus Rotation":"270º","Focus Type":"Manual Focus Only","Front Lens Diameter":"114mm","Gearing":"0.8 MOD focus, iris, zoom","Groups/Elements":"17/21","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"APS-C and Super35","Lens Mount":"PL","Lens Type":"Standard, Telephoto, Supertelephoto, Cine, and For Mirrorless","Maximum Aperture":"2.9","Mfr. Model Number":"DZO-T6528029IPL","Minimum Focusing Distance":"3.6’","Parfocal/Varifocal":"Parfocal","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"No","Weight":"8.73 lb.","Zoom Ratio":"4.3x","Zoom Type":"Variable Focal Length"}', 'DZOFilm
