INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1328, 2, 73, 'DZOFilm VESPID PRIME II 105mm T1.9 (PL)', 'dzofilm-vespid-prime-ii-105mm-t1-9-pl', 'The DZOFilm VESPID PRIME II 105mm T1.9 (PL) is a compact, full-frame cine prime lens offering remarkable upgrades to the original VESPID PRIME line. Key features include:

Updated optical design
T1.9-T22 aperture
Full-frame/VistaVision coverage
Cooke /i technology metadata

What’s Changed? The original wasp of the cine lens world, the VESPID PRIME, packed precision and speed in its compact build, but the upgrades made to create this DZOFilm VESPID PRIME II 105mm T1.9 (PL) are hard to miss. Featuring full optical and handling upgrades, this lens opens up a world of creativity and more accurate workflows. Now with a faster T1.9 maximum aperture, redesigned lens elements and optical design, and enhanced distortion control, each move you make is met with precise, stable imagery.

Optics and Elements. Crafted from precision-polished aspherical elements with multi-layer nano coatings, this lens captures imagery with spectacular resolution, suppressed chromatic aberration, and minimal reflections. Its 10-blade aperture produces round, pleasing bokeh, and its 46.5mm image circle allows use on large-format cameras while maintaining almost no focus breathing.

Cinema Design. This lens’s cine-style aperture and focusing rings boast standard 0.8 mod gears so that you can easily install a follow focus system, lens motor, or lens control system. Its 80mm front diameter lets you use almost any cine-style matte box. It boasts a generous 65° of iris rotation and an extended 300° smooth focus throw.

Variety of VESPID PRIME II. Not only do we carry this 105mm lens, we have the entire VESPID PRIME II collection at a click! You can individually grab the 18mm, 24mm, 35mm, 50mm, and 85mm, or check out the entire 6-Lens Kit.', 300000.0, '{"Aperture Blades":"10","Brand":"DZOFilm","Dimensions":"3.1 × 3.4″ (ø x L)","Filter Size":"77.0mm","Filter Type":"Screw-On and Matte Box Mount","Focal Length":"105-105","Focus Rotation":"300º","Focus Type":"Manual Focus Only","Front Lens Diameter":"80mm","Gearing":"0.8 MOD focus, iris","Groups/Elements":"8/12","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"Full-Frame and VistaVision","Lens Mount":"PL","Lens Type":"Telephoto, Cine, and For Mirrorless","Maximum Aperture":"1.9","Mfr. Model Number":"DZO-V2105IH","Minimum Focusing Distance":"3’","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Weight":"1.8 lb.","Zoom Type":"Fixed Focal Length"}', 'DZOFilm
