INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1397, 1, 86, 'Freefly Ember S5K 4TB Standard Micro V-Mount Kit (E Mount)', 'freefly-ember-s5k-4tb-standard-micro-v-mount-kit-e-mount', 'The Freefly Ember S5K Standard Micro V-Mount Kit includes:

FREEFLY Ember
	FXLion NANO V-Lock Camera Cage Plate
	Freefly NATO Rail for Ember S5K and Wave – 62mm
	Freefly NATO Rail Clamp
	Freefly Cheese Plate for Ember Camera
	Freefly Adjustable Accessory Mount
	(2) Anton Bauer Titon Micro 90 V-Mount Battery
	Anton Bauer VM2 Dual V-Mount Charger w/ 4-Pin XLR Output

Pushing Limits. The FREEFLY Ember is designed to push the limits of size, performance, and ease of use. FREEFLY’s philosophy behind this unit is to make it as easy to use as any run-of-the-mill camera—all you have to do is start recording and stop recording to gain optimal images and color. With upgrades to its predecessor, the FREEFLY Wave, this unit offers a global shutter and continuous recording of high-speed footage directly to its internal 4TB SSD.

Plate. Designed for Fxlion NANO batteries and compatible with third-party micro V-mount batteries, the NANO V-Lock Camera Cage Plate attaches to a cage and provides a battery plate with a D-Tap port for camera power. Included are a battery plate and mounting plate with 1/4"-20 screws for attaching to a cage. The battery plate will support standard V-mount batteries as well, but it’s compact and not designed for them.

Sweet Quick-Release With the Freefly NATO Rail for Ember S5K and Wave (2.4"), you can easily attach NATO accessories, like a monitor, extension arm, or light, to either a Freefly Ember or Freefly Wave camera. This unit stays put and flush to the top or side of your camera using 1/4"-20 screws or the included M3 screws.

Tiny But Tough. Using the Freefly NATO Rail Clamp in conjunction with the NATO Rail allows you to add additional accessories to your Ember or Wave camera.  As far as external attachment option, you can attach a monitor, light, handle, or magic arm onto your rig or camera. There are ten M3 mounting threads and two 1/4"-20 threads for multiple mounting options, and the clamp is secured using a spring-loaded locking lever.

Cheese Plate. The Freefly Cheese Plate for Ember Camera provides an abundance of mounting options to your Freefly Ember or Wave camera. This unit sports a bounty of M3, 1/4"-20, and 3/8"-16 threads along the edges and main surface, as well as mounting slots that allow you to attach a variety of accessories, such as top handles, monitors, articulating arms, and more. The plate mounts onto the camera using the existing screws from your camera body.

Accessory Mount. The Freefly Adjustable Accessory Mount is a tiny, compact option for mounting accessories such as a monitor to a FREEFLY Ember or Wave camera. Using the two included M3 screws, you can mount the low profile accessory mount to your camera, while a 1/4"-20 anti-twist screw on top is available to mount the accessory of your choice.

Compact Power. The Titon 90 V-Mount Battery was our replacement for the tried and true AB Digital 90 battery and now the same performance with even more capacity can be had with the more compact Anton Bauer Titon Micro 90 V-Mount Battery.

Dual Vertical Charging. The Anton Bauer VM2 Dual V-Mount Charger w/ 4-Pin XLR Output can fill up two 98 Wh V-mount batteries in around 6 hours. The charger has a vertical orientation and features simultaneous battery charging with intelligent safety technology. It works with select Anton Bauer V-Mount batteries like the Anton Bauer Titon 90 V-Mount Battery.', 3843000.0, '{"Brand":"Freefly","Camera Mount":"Sony E","Camera Type":"Cinema","Compatible Media":"Internal Storage","Item Type":"Camera","Maximum Video Resolution":"5K","Sensor Size":"Super35","Weather Sealing":"No","Wireless Connectivity":"Wi-Fi"}', '(2)
