Nikon Z to Canon EF. This Fringer EF-NZ II Canon EF to Nikon Z Autofocus Adapter provides a durable, weather sealed solution for Nikon Z camera to Canon EF/EF-S lens use.

Durable Autofocus. This adapter sports a reliable metal-alloy construction with brass mounting rings to prevent premature wear-and-tear. Its weather sealed design keeps it operating even in crappy weather conditions, and to prevent too much stress on the adapter, a detachable tripod food with a 1/4"-20 thread is available.

Techy Talk. Electronic communication between the lens and camera is supported with this adapter, as well as autofocus and auto exposure features. If the lens is capable of generating Exif metadata, this adapter can easily transfer that data to be saved with image files.', 100000.0, '{"Brand":"Fringer","Camera Mount":"Nikon Z","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Mount":"Canon EF","Lens Support Type":"Mount Adapter"}', 'Fringer
