1:2 Macro. With a focal length equivalent to 90mm after sensor crop factor, the GF 120mm f/4 Macro R LM OIS WR provides GFX users a 1:2 macro lens for capturing the little things in life…  It has a minimum focus distance of just 1.5’, focus range limiter switch, and 5-stop effective optical image stabilization for handholding in a pinch.

Build Quality. Like the GFX, Fuji’s GF lenses are dust and weather-sealed for shooting in challenging conditions.  Each lens features a manual aperture ring with new C (Command) position to allow aperture adjustment via command dial.', 550000.0, '{"Angle of View":"25.7°","Aperture Blades":"9","Brand":"Fuji","Dimensions":"3.5 × 6″ (ø x L)","Filter Size":"72.0mm","Filter Type":"Screw-On","Focal Length":"120-120","Focus Type":"Autofocus","Groups/Elements":"9/14","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"Medium Format","Lens Mount":"Fuji G","Lens Type":"Telephoto, Macro, and For Mirrorless","Maximum Aperture":"4.0","Maximum Magnification":"0.5x","Minimum Focusing Distance":"1.48’","Stabilization":"Yes","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Weight":"2.16 lb.","Zoom Type":"Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Fuji
