Manual Controls. Like many other GF lenses, the GF 20-35mm f/4 features a manual aperture ring with a C (Command) position to allow aperture adjustment via command dial.

Linear Autofocus Motor. The linear motor provides fast, quiet, and accurate autofocus performance, while its internal-focusing design allows its physical length to remain unchanged while giving you consistent performance throughout the entire focusing range.

High-Quality Optics. The GF 20-35mm f/4’s ten-group/fourteen-element design includes three extra-low dispersion elements, one aspherical extra-low dispersion element, and three aspherical elements to minimize chromatic aberrations, and to produce clear, high-contrast images.

