Lightweight, Weather-Resistant Build. The GF 55mm f/1.7’s dust-, freeze-, and weather-resistant construction protects it from inclement conditions and lets you work in temperatures down to 14°F. The lens’s front element has a fluorine coating that helps keep it debris- and moisture-free, and the lens weighs in at just 1.72 lb.', 471000.0, '{"Angle of View":"52.9°","Brand":"Fuji","Filter Type":"Screw-On","Focus Type":"Autofocus","General":"Dimensions (ø x L)3.7 × 3.9″ / 94.7 × 99.3mmWeight1.7 lb. / 780 g","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"Medium Format","Lens Mount":"Fuji G","Lens Type":"Wide Angle","Maximum Magnification":"0.17x","Mfr. Model Number":"600023613","Optical Design":"Groups/Elements10/14Diaphragm Blades11, Rounded","Stabilization":"Yes","Weather Sealing":"No","Zoom Type":"Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Fuji
