INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1436, 1, 89, 'Fuji GFX 100RF Medium Format Mirrorless (Black)', 'fuji-gfx-100rf-medium-format-mirrorless-black', 'The Fuji GFX 100RF is a compact rangefinder-style camera with a built-in 28mm-equivalent lens and a 102MP medium format sensor. Key features include:

Large 43.8 × 32.9mm BSI CMOS II sensor
4-stop ND filter inside leaf shutter lens
DCI 4K30p recording
Digital teleconverter for 45mm, 63mm, 80mm

Large Format, Small Form Factor. The first of its kind, the GFX 100RF mixes the high-resolution quality of medium format with a sleek and lightweight rangefinder-style body. Equipped with a fixed 35mm (28mm equivalent in 35mm terms) prime lens, this camera is dedicated to an active image-making experience. It is sleek, tactile, well-suited for travel and street photography, and makes for a very stylish everyday carry.

Custom Creative Control. Create your own distinct look with 20 film simulations, nine aspect ratios, and a digital teleconverter for 45mm, 63mm, and 80mm focal lengths that mimic three popular GF lenses. The built-in lens has a leaf shutter that can sync with strobes and flashes up to 1/4,000th of a second. It also has a 4-stop ND filter – ideal for shallow depth of field shooting in bright conditions or for smooth motion effects.

Large Feature Set, Expertly Crafted. This is truly a unique point-and-shoot. Not only are you working with 100+ megapixels, the processor also sets a new standard for medium format speeds with up to 6 frames-per-second shooting. A redesigned pixel structure and microlens layout of the sensor improves sharpness and autofocus accuracy. This complements a newly-designed lens with excellent image quality and focusing down to under 8 inches. Autofocus performance is supported by improved algorithms and AI subject detection. Expand your creative storytelling with 4K30p 4:2:2 10-bit recording in F-Log2 and 13+ stops of dynamic range. ProRes 4:2:2 codec is available when recording directly to an SSD via the USB-C port.

Shoot in Style. The GFX 100RF has a rangefinder-inspired design, complete with an offset viewfinder similar to the ones found in the Fuji X100VI, X-Pro3, and GFX 50R. There are two newly-designed physical functions: a dial for aspect ratio and a lever for teleconverter cropping. Taking advantage of the massive sensor, the default wide angle prime lens can be digitally converted to 45mm, 63mm, and 80mm. The aspect ratios pay homage to large format 8 × 10 cameras, Fuji legacy analog cameras like the TX-1 and GA645, classic 35mm format cameras, and more. While smaller and lighter than other GFX cameras, this machined-aluminum body is still packed with useful tools, including dual SD slots, headphone and microphone jacks, and a micro-HDMI port. Lastly, the large touchscreen and intuitive menu interface make composition and customization quick and easy.', 1079000.0, '{"Brand":"Fuji","Camera Type":"Mirrorless and Medium Format","Compatible Media":"SD","General":"Accessory Mounts1x 1/4\\"-20 (bottom)Battery TypeNP-W235Dimensions (W x H x D)5.3 × 3.6 × 3″FlashHot shoe onlyLens MountFixed lens onlyMfr. Model Number16938039MonitorEVF3.2\\" tilting touchscreenWeight1.6 lb.Wireless2.4/5 GHz Wi-FiBluetooth 4.2","Imaging":"FocusContrast, phase detection425 pointsISODynamic Range: 14 stopsPhoto: 80-12,800 (40-102,400 expanded)Video: 100-12,800 (100-25,600)Max ResolutionPhoto: 11,648 × 8736Video: DCI 4K (4096 × 2160)ND FiltersBuilt into lensSensor102MP Medium Format CMOSShooting SpeedUp to 6 fpsShutterElectronic: 1/16,000 sec.-60 min.Electronic: 1/4,000 sec-1/8 sec. (video mode)Mechanical: Mechanical: 1/4,000 sec.-60 min.StabilizationDigital only (video mode only)","Inputs/Outputs":"Audio I/O1x 3.5mm headphone jack1x 3.5mm mic jackOther I/O1x USB-C (data, shared with power)Power I/OUSB-C (shared with data)1x NP-W235 battery portStorage I/O2x SD UHS-II slotsVideo I/O1x Micro-HDMI","Item Type":"Camera","Lens":"Filter Size49mm (adapter required)Focal Length35mm (28mm equivalent)Focus TypeAutofocus and Manual FocusMax Aperturef/4Min Aperturef/22Min Focusing Distance7.9\\"Prime/ZoomPrime","Maximum Video Resolution":"4K","Screen Type":"Touchscreen and Tilt","Sensor Size":"Medium Format","Stabilization":"Yes","Video Capture":"CompressionH.265/HEVCH.264/AVCFormat.MOV.MP4ResolutionDCI 4K (4096 × 2160) up to 29.97 fpsUHD 4K (3840 × 2160) up to 29.97 fpsDCI 2K (2048 × 1080) up to 59.94 fpsFHD 1080p (1920 × 1080) up to 59.94 fps","Viewfinder Type":"Electronic","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Wireless Connectivity":"Wi-Fi and Bluetooth"}', 'Fuji
