Film Simulation and Filters. Offering 20 Fuji-style film stock simulations, the EXTERNA steps into classic looks from standard Black & White to heartwarming Nostalgic Negative. Complimenting the sensor are a built-in variable electronic ND filter and optical low-pass filter (OLPF), which provide immediate exposure stops and reduce deviation in color. The variable ND filter features a dial control that accesses various filters between ND 0.6 to ND 2.1, in total offering 7 stops in .015 increments. This camera also features dual-base ISO, autofocus and manual focus, and over 14 stops of dynamic range (when recorded in F-Log2 C).

