Electronic Contacts.The built-in electronic contacts enable both autofocus and autoexposure capability, as well as transferring lens information to the embedded image EXIF data.', 46000.0, '{"Brand":"Fuji","Camera Mount":"Fuji X","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Mount":"Fuji X","Lens Support Type":"Extension Tube"}', 'Fuji
MCEX-11
Front & rear caps
