Versatility. The 1/4"-20 tripod mount is positioned along the camera’s optical axis to facilitate panning shots, while the bottom of the plate has rails that let you use a quick-release plate.', 86000.0, '{"Brand":"Fuji","Camera Support Type":"Baseplate","Item Type":"Camera Support"}', 'Just the grip', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1453, 6, 89, 'Fuji NP-T125 Battery', 'fuji-np-t125-battery', 'Our cameras are shipped with a single battery. If you also rent a battery grip, it’ll include a second battery. If you still need additional batteries, you’re in the right place!

The Fuji NP-T125 battery works with:

Fuji GFX 50R Medium Format Mirrorless Camera
	Fuji GFX 50S Medium Format Mirrorless Camera
	Fuji GFX 100 Medium Format Mirrorless Camera
	Fuji VG-GFX1 Vertical Battery Grip', 64000.0, '{"Brand":"Fuji","Item Type":"Power","Power Type":"Battery"}', 'Just the battery', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1454, 6, 89, 'Fuji NP-W126S Battery', 'fuji-np-w126s-battery', 'Our cameras are shipped with a single battery. If you also rent a battery grip, it’ll include a second battery. If you still need additional batteries, you’re in the right place!

The Fuji NP-W126S is the spare battery for the latest-generation X-Series cameras and their accessories. It’s also compatible with previous-generation cameras that use the Fuji NP-W126 battery, but those models won’t see any performance advantage with this S-model battery.

This battery works with:

Fuji X100VI – Black / Silver
	Fuji X-H1
	Fuji X-Pro3
	Fuji X-Pro2
	Fuji X-S10
	Fuji X-T2
	Fuji X100F
	Fuji X-T30 II
	Fuji X-T20
	Fuji X-T10
	Fuji X-E4
	Fuji X-T3 and its VG-XT3 Battery Grip
	Fuji X-T1 and its VG-XT1 Battery Grip
	Fuji X-E3
	Fuji X-E2S
	Fuji BC-W126S Charger', 82000.0, '{"Brand":"Fuji","Item Type":"Power","Power Type":"Battery"}', 'Just the battery', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1455, 6, 89, 'Fuji NP-W235 Battery', 'fuji-np-w235-battery', 'Dedicated to the FUJIFILM X-T4 mirrorless camera, the NP-W235 Rechargeable Lithium-Ion Battery is a spare or replacement item for the one originally included with the camera.

The Fuji NP-W235 Battery is the spare battery for the Fuji X-S20, Fuji X-H2S, Fuji X-T4, Fuji GFX 100S, and Fuji GFX 50S II. The camera ships with a single battery. If you also rent a Fuji FT-XH File Transmitter Grip, Fuji VG-XH Vertical Battery Grip, or Fuji VG-XT4 Vertical Battery Grip, it’ll include a second battery. If you still need additional batteries, you’re in the right place!

If you’re using multiple batteries, we also recommend the Fuji NP-W235 Dual Charger.', 75000.0, '{"Brand":"Fuji","Item Type":"Power","Power Type":"Battery"}', 'Just the battery', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1456, 2, 89, 'Fuji TCL-X100 II Telephoto Lens', 'fuji-tcl-x100-ii-telephoto-lens', 'The Fuji TCL-X100 II Telephoto Lens is an add-on lens designed specifically for the Fuji X100V and X100F.  Key features include:

For Fuji X100V and X100F only!
Provides 50mm equivalent focal length
Electronic contacts for auto-detection
High-quality optics

For X100V and X100F Only. While this is an update to the previous Fuji TCL-X100 Telephoto Conversion Lens, this new TCL-X100 II is designed for the X100V and X100F only.

1.4x Telephoto Conversion Lens. When attached, this lens provides 50mm equivalent focal length.

Electronic Contacts. This is the primary new feature to this update.  It allows the X100V or X100F camera to auto-detect when the conversion lens is mount, auto-applying distortion correction and swapping viewfinder frame lines to 50mm when using the hybrid viewfinder.

High Quality Optics. The Fuji TCL-X100 II was designed with the same optical quality demand as the X100V and X100F lenses.  This means optical performance remains the same.', 100000.0, '{"Brand":"Fuji","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Mount":"Fuji X","Lens Type":"Telephoto","Mfr. Model Number":"16534742"}', 'TCL-X100
II
Lens
	67mm protective filter
Front & rear caps', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1457, 3, 89, 'Fuji TG-BT1 Bluetooth Tripod Grip', 'fuji-tg-bt1-bluetooth-tripod-grip', 'The Fuji TG-BT1 Bluetooth Tripod Grip is a contoured accessory grip for handheld shooting that can control select Fuji X-series cameras via Bluetooth. It also doubles as a compact tabletop tripod. Key features include:

Bluetooth camera control
Larger, more comfortable grip when shooting hand-held
Doubles as a compact tabletop tripod
Works with select Fuji X-series cameras

Bluetooth Camera Control. The Fuji TG-BT1 Bluetooth Tripod Grip lets you use Bluetooth connectivity to wirelessly start and stop video recording, take pictures, and control the zoom when you’re using a compatible lens.

Improved Stability and Convenience. This contoured grip provides a more stable and comfortable grip when shooting hand-held, and its buttons are positioned for easy accessibility. Its integrated head has a tilting design for easy positioning at different angles and attaches to your camera via 1/4"-20 mount.

Easy Directional Changes and Tilting. As mentioned above, the TG-BT1 has easy angle-adjustment capabilities that let you position your camera to capture stills and movies of yourself and others, while its 90° lock positions let you work in vertical orientation without worry. In addition, a quick-tilt function lets you easily set the camera at just the right angle for just about any subject or point of view.

Tabletop Tripod. In addition to being a more comfortable accessory grip, the TG-BT1 doubles as a sleek, durable tabletop tripod for hands-free shooting.

Compatible Cameras:

Fuji X-H2S
	Fuji X-H2
	Fuji X-T5 – Black
	Fuji X-T5 – Silver
	Fuji X-T4
	Fuji X-T3
	Fuji X-T30 II
	Fuji X-T30
	Fuji X-S10
	Fuji X half', 104000.0, '{"Brand":"Fuji","Camera Attachment":"1/4\\"-20 Male","Camera Support Type":"Controller and Tripod","Item Type":"Camera Support","Mfr. Model Number":"16780975"}', 'Fuji
TG-BT1
Bluetooth
