Exceptional Portability. By omitting a viewfinder and pop-up flash (this camera has a tilting LCD and hot shoe only), the X-M5 is able to stay pocket-sized while still being an interchangeable-lens system with useful ports, like USB-C, 3.5mm mic jack, and micro-HDMI (capable of 6.2K RAW out). It maintains the sleek and retro look of Fuji’s other X-series bodies and can take full advantage of Fuji’s extensive line of X-mount lenses. To maintain portability, this camera pairs best with “pocketable” lenses such as the XF 27mm f/2.8 R WR and the XF 18mm f/2 R.', 225000.0, '{"Brand":"Fuji","Camera Mount":"Fuji X","Camera Type":"Mirrorless","Compatible Media":"SD","Item Type":"Camera","Maximum Video Resolution":"6K","Screen Type":"Touchscreen and Swivel","Sensor Size":"APS-C","Stabilization":"Yes","Weather Sealing":"No","Wireless Connectivity":"Wi-Fi and Bluetooth"}', 'Fuji
