INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1475, 1, 89, 'Fuji X-T5 (Black) IR Modified (720nm)', 'fuji-x-t5-black-ir-modified-720nm', 'This is a Fuji X-T5 that comes equipped with an internal 720nm infrared (IR) filter. Key features include:

Modified with an internal 720nm IR filter
6.2K 30p, 4K 60p, FHD 240p 10-bit video
425-point intelligent hybrid autofocus system
Five-axis, seven-stop image stabilization system

What’s Changed? This Fuji X-T5 (Black) IR Modified (720nm) features an infrared filter designed to block visible light and only allow IR light to pass through to the lens and camera. We’ve had this X-T5 modified for IR photography by the good people at Kolari Vision. The low-pass filter was removed and replaced with the internal 720nm IR filter. This is really the only distinction between this version of the X-T5 and the regular X-T5.

This Thing is Different. For those of you who aren’t familiar with IR photography, the look is very different. You’ll want to read up on shooting in IR and the post-processing required for the images.

40MP APS-C X-Trans 5 BSI Sensor. The X-T5’s newly designed, rear-illuminated APS-C 40MP X-Trans 5 BSI sensor gives you a randomized pixel array that promotes exceptional image quality throughout its normal ISO range of 125-12,800.

