INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1499, 2, 89, 'Fuji XF 18mm f/1.4 R LM WR', 'fuji-xf-18mm-f-1-4-r-lm-wr', 'The Fuji XF 18mm f/1.4 R LM WR is a fast-aperture wide-angle prime designed for Fuji X-mount mirrorless cameras. Key features include:

Great for street, travel, nature, and architectural shooting
Fast, nearly silent autofocus with manual override
High-quality optical design for maximum sharpness
Durable, weather-sealed build

Fast, Versatile Wide-Angle Prime. With a focal length equivalent to 28mm after crop factor, the Fuji XF 18mm f/1.4 R LM WR gives you a high-quality wide-angle lens that’s ideal for low-light use. Additionally, the wide f/1.4 aperture enables images with a very shallow depth of field and great subject/background separation.

Target Market. Documentary, travel, landscape, nature, architectural, and even astrophotography photographers will greatly benefit from this lens, as well as anyone who needs a wide angle and speed.

Advanced Optical Design. The nine-group/fifteen-element optical design features three aspherical elements and one extra-low dispersion element. These combine effectively to eliminate chromatic, spherical, and axial aberrations while keeping distortion to a minimum. This results in images with consistent edge-to-edge sharpness and illumination. Fuji’s Super EBC coating helps to eliminate flare and ghosting.

Linear Autofocus Motor. The autofocus motor provides fast, nearly silent performance for still and video use. Its inner-focusing and inner-zooming design keeps the physical size of the lens the same while ensuring extremely fast operation. A manual focusing ring offers smooth, even rotation for when you need to make precision adjustments.

