Advanced Optical Design. The ten-group/fifteen-element optical design features two aspherical elements and three extra-low dispersion elements. These combine effectively to eliminate chromatic, spherical, and axial aberrations while keeping distortion to a minimum. This results in images with consistent edge-to-edge sharpness, illumination, and color rendering. Fuji’s Super EBC coating helps to eliminate flare and ghosting.

