All-Weather Gear. Much like the 50-140mm lens, this teleconverter‘s sealed construction reduces the chances of dust, water, or even the cold from affecting performance.', 100000.0, '{"Brand":"Fuji","Camera Mount":"Fuji X","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Mount":"Fuji X","Lens Support Type":"Teleconverter","Mfr. Model Number":"16516271"}', 'Fuji 2x
