High-Quality Optics. Through the use of an aspheric fifth lens element, the XF 35mm provides aberration-free images with great corner-to-corner sharpness. It also features Fuji’s Super EBC Coating to help minimize ghosting and lens flare.

High-Quality Build. The metal barrel’s classic design not only gives the lens a solid feel, but it’s also a perfect visual match for the X-Mount cameras.', 168000.0, '{"Angle of View":"44.2°","Aperture":"f1.4-16","Autofocus":"Autofocus","Brand":"Fuji","Dimensions":"Length: 2.17\\"","Hood Included":"Yes","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Mount":"Fuji X","Lens Type":"Standard","Mfr. Model Number":"16240755","Minimum Aperture":"16.0"}', 'Fuji 35mm lens
