INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1526, 1, 89, 'Fuji instax WIDE Evo Hybrid Instant Film Camera', 'fuji-instax-wide-evo-hybrid-instant-film-camera', 'The Fuji instax WIDE Evo Hybrid Instant Film Camera is a hybrid wide-format camera capable of capturing digital stills with film effects and instantly printing bordered, one-step style film, available for purchase separately. Key features include:

Accepts instax WIDE film packs
16MP Sensor, fixed 16mm f/2.4 lens
Internal memory and microSD slot available
10 lens effects | 10 film effects

Best of Both Worlds. Itching to feel the nostalgia of taking film photos, but still want the option to take digital photos with cool effects? The Fuji instax WIDE Evo Hybrid Instant Film Camera is right up your alley! Sporting internal memory and a microSD card slot, your printed polaroid-style photos can be digitally saved after they’re captured!

Film Sold Separately. This rental will not natively come with any packs of the dedicated instax WIDE Instant Film, so you’ll need to either buy it through us or on your own. We currently carry FUJIFILM instax Wide Monochrome Instant Film and FUJIFILM instax WIDE Instant Film – 20 Exposures.

Fixed Integrated Lens. Through its fixed 16mm f/2.4 lens and 16MP sensor, the WIDE Evo creates a stunning rendition of photos from way back. It offers 10 film effects, 10 lens effects, and 6 film styles, giving you ample room to perfect your creative stills. A physical Wide-Angle switch located on the front of the camera allows you to capture even more friends, scenery, and whatever your heart desires.

Convenient Features. Alongside the wide-angle switch, the WIDE Evo features a film dial and lens dial to scour through those previously mentioned effects, a manual print crank for physical copies of your shots, and a degree control ring around the lens that grants you access to hundreds of more effect options! The built-in flash saves you in dark moments, and when the photographer wants to join in on the picture, a tripod mounting thread and 2/10 second self timer are available. A selfie mirror on the front of the camera gives you a good glimpse of what’s being captured, while the integrated 3.5-inch LCD screen displays perfect and accurate imaging–– what you see is what you print.

Removable Battery-Free Bliss. Fueling the built-in battery only through the available USB-C port, this camera is capable of printing about 100 photos before needing a recharge, which takes 2-3 hours. You can keep updated on your battery life on the LCD screen, and after 2 minutes on standby, the camera automatically shuts down to conserve battery life.

instax WIDE Evo App. To prevent limiting you to direct camera memory or printing with this camera, the instax WIDE Evo App is available for both Android and iOS! Not only does this app allow you to transfer photos from the camera to the phone wirelessly, you can also print existing photos on your phone from the camera!', 125000.0, '{"Brand":"Fuji","Camera Type":"Film and Compact","Compatible Media":"microSD and Internal Storage","Item Type":"Camera","Screen Type":"Touchscreen and Fixed","Sensor Size":"1/3 and Film","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"No","Wireless Connectivity":"Bluetooth"}', 'Fuji instax
WIDE
