Cable', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1527, 1, 89, 'Fuji instax mini Evo Cinema Hybrid Instant Camera', 'fuji-instax-mini-evo-cinema-hybrid-instant-camera', 'The Fuji instax mini Evo Cinema Hybrid Instant Camera combines instant photography, stills, and Super 8 inspired videography into one portable, vertical camera. Key features include:

10 decade-accurate effects
Built-in flash and continuous LED
Accepts instax mini instant film
1.54" LCD and viewfinder attachment

Instant Classic. Set nostalgia to the wayside and indulge in the redesigned, decade-inspired experience of the Fuji instax mini Evo Cinema Hybrid Instant Camera! Through its 28mm-equivalent lens and 5MP CMOS sensor, this camera captures resolutions of 2560 × 1920 for stills and 600 × 800 for videos, with the option to print 318 dpi stills and videos. Unlike Harry Potter, the printed 15-second “videos” feature a thumbnail and QR code to scan and enjoy on your mobile device.

Era-Accurate Capture. A true 3-in-one capture device inspired by the remarkable Super 8 of the 1960’s, this camera features analog-style controls and a vertical, one-handed design. The rotating GenDial on the side presents 10 decade choices and 10 intensity levels to produce a grainy, charming effect that matches the decade of choice, all the way from the 1930’s to the 2020’s!

Wireless and Evo App. Featuring Wi-Fi and Bluetooth capabilities, the Evo Cinema easily integrates into your mobile device lineup. While video mode only records up to 15 seconds at a time, the instax mini Evo app gives you everything you need to edit, trim, combine, or merge clips into 30 second videos! The creative control doesn’t end there, though. You can also print existing photos from your camera roll, add opening titles and end credits to your video creations, or memorialize your print with a poster layout.

Memory, Flash, and More. To ensure one-handed capabilities, this camera was built to be incredibly lightweight at just 9.5 ounces. Its internal storage is capable of holding up to 10 video clips or 50 still images, but the microSD slot accepts cards up to 256 GB. The convenient USB-C port offers a simple charging solution to its built-in battery, which fuels the camera, built-in flash, and built-in LED light. Use the optical viewfinder or 1.54" LCD screen to perfectly frame your subject, or use the integrated selfie mirror and 2-10 second timer to include yourself in the memories!', 125000.0, '{"Brand":"Fuji","Built-in Flash":"Yes, Flash & Continuous","Camera Type":"Compact","Compatible Media":"microSD","Dimensions":"1.6 × 5.2 × 3.9″","ISO Range":"100 -1600","Item Type":"Camera","Mfr. Model Number":"16956043","Screen Type":"Fixed","Sensor Size":"Film and 1/5","Stabilization":"No","Video Resolution":"5MP","Viewfinder Type":"Electronic","Weather Sealing":"No","Weight":"9.5 oz","Wireless Connectivity":"Wi-Fi"}', 'Fuji
