INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1529, 2, 90, 'Fujinon 19-90mm T2.9 Cabrio Premier (PL)', 'fujinon-19-90mm-t2-9-cabrio-premier-pl', 'The Fujinon 19-90mm T2.9 Cabrio Premier (PL) is an ENG-style motorized zoom lens for high-end productions. Key features include:

Perfect for Super 35mm and APS-C crop-sensor cameras
Detachable ENG-style hand grip with a zoom rocker
Standard 0.8 pitch gears for focus, zoom, and iris control
Nine-blade stepless aperture diaphragm

Power Zoom. The Fujinon 19-90mm T2.9 Cabrio Premier features a detachable ENG-style hand grip with a zoom rocker. The lens is powered by either an external connector or the PL mount’s Cooke/i Technology interface.

Super 35 Sensor Coverage. The Cabrio 19-90MM T2.9 is designed specifically for image sensors measuring 27.45 × 15.44mm and smaller. That makes it perfect for Super 35mm and APS-C crop-sensor cameras, offering a focal length roughly equivalent to 29-135mm.

Designed for Professionals. It features film-industry standard 0.8 pitch gears for focus, zoom, and iris control. The luminous barrel markings provide visibility in dark shooting situations. The fast T2.9 aperture allows great low-light performance and subject/background separation, with a nine-blade stepless aperture diaphragm that accommodates minute exposure adjustments with pleasing bokeh and out-of-focus highlights. This lens also has a built-in 3/8-16" threaded mount for attaching the included Wooden Camera 15mm Universal Lens Support.

Need more reach? We also carry the Fujinon 20-120mm T3.5 Cabrio Premier – PL.', 3036000.0, '{"Brand":"Fujinon","Dimensions":"Length: 8.8\\"","Front Lens Diameter":"114mm","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Mount":"PL","Lens Type":"Wide Angle, Standard, and Telephoto","Zoom Method":"Manual or motorized"}', 'Lens
