Designed for Professionals. It features film-industry standard 0.8 pitch gears for focus, zoom, and iris control. The luminous barrel markings provide visibility in dark shooting situations. The T3.5 aperture is useful, and the nine-blade stepless cine-style aperture diaphragm accommodates minute exposure adjustments with pleasing bokeh and out-of-focus highlights. This lens also has a built-in 3/8-16" threaded mount for attaching the included Wooden Camera 15mm Universal Lens Support.', 1832000.0, '{"Angle of View":"63º41’-11º49’","Aperture Blades":"9","Brand":"Fujinon","Dimensions":"4.5 × 8.9″ (ø x L)","Filter Type":"Matte Box Mount","Focal Length":"20-120","Focus Rotation":"200º","Focus Type":"Manual Focus Only","Front Lens Diameter":"114mm","Gearing":"0.8 MOD zoom, focus, iris","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"APS-C and Super35","Lens Mount":"PL","Lens Type":"Wide Angle, Standard, Telephoto, Cine, Broadcast, and For Mirrorless","Maximum Aperture":"3.5","Mfr. Model Number":"XK6X20","Minimum Focusing Distance":"2.8’","Parfocal/Varifocal":"Parfocal","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"No","Weight":"6.4 lb.","Zoom Ratio":"6x","Zoom Type":"Variable Focal Length"}', 'Fujinon 20-120mm
