We rent the Fujinon 20-pin D-Tap Cable to power Fujinon Cabrio lenses with servo grips from a d-tap power source. It will not power devices other than Fujinon Cabrio series lenses.', 111000.0, '{"Brand":"Fujinon","Cable Type":"Control","Connector":"D-Tap","Connectors":"D-tap\\n20-pin Hirose","Item Type":"Cable"}', 'Just the cable', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1534, 2, 90, 'Fujinon 85-300mm T2.9-4.0 Cabrio Premier (PL)', 'fujinon-85-300mm-t2-9-4-0-cabrio-premier-pl', 'The Fujinon 85-300mm T2.9-4.0 Cabrio Premier (PL) is an ENG-style motorized zoom lens for high-end productions. Key features include:

Perfect for Super 35mm and APS-C crop-sensor cameras
Detachable ENG-style hand grip with a zoom rocker
Standard 0.8 pitch gears for focus, zoom, and iris control
Nine-blade stepless aperture diaphragm

Power Zoom. The Fujinon 85-300mm T2.9-4.0 Cabrio Premier features a detachable ENG-style hand grip with a zoom rocker. The lens is powered by either an external connector or the PL mount’s Cooke/i Technology interface.

Super 35 Sensor Coverage. The Cabrio 85-300mm T2.9-4.0 is designed specifically for image sensors measuring 27.45 × 15.44mm and smaller. That makes it perfect for Super 35mm and APS-C crop-sensor cameras, offering a focal length roughly equivalent to 128-450mm.

Designed for Professionals. It features film-industry standard 0.8 pitch gears for focus, zoom, and iris control. The luminous barrel markings provide visibility in dark shooting situations. The fast T2.9 aperture allows great low-light performance and subject/background separation, with a nine-blade stepless aperture diaphragm that accommodates minute exposure adjustments with pleasing bokeh and out-of-focus highlights. This lens also has a built-in 3/8-16" threaded mount for attaching the included Wooden Camera 15mm Universal Lens Support.', 3807000.0, '{"Brand":"Fujinon","Dimensions":"Length: 9.8\\"","Front Lens Diameter":"114mm","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Mount":"PL","Lens Type":"Telephoto and Supertelephoto"}', 'Fujinon 85-300mm lens
