SS-15D Control Kit. The Fujinon SS-15D includes a focus position demand unit, a zoom rate demand unit, two mounting clamps, and two 12-pin communication cables. It provides remote control over the focus and zoom of the 5.5-100mm f/1.8-2.9 B4 lens for smooth and precise adjustments.', 4057000.0, '{"Angle of View":"82.2-5.5º","Aperture Blades":"9","Brand":"Fujinon","Dimensions":"3.7 × 9.5″ (ø x L)","Filter Type":"Matte Box Mount","Focal Length":"5-100","Focus Rotation":"225º","Focus Type":"Manual Focus Only","Front Lens Diameter":"95mm","Gearing":"0.8 MOD zoom, focus, iris","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"2/3","Lens Mount":"B4","Lens Type":"Ultra Wide Angle, Wide Angle, Standard, Telephoto, Broadcast, Cine, and For Mirrorless","Maximum Aperture":"1.8","Mfr. Model Number":"UA18X5.5BERD, SS-15D","Minimum Focusing Distance":"1.31’","Parfocal/Varifocal":"Parfocal","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"No","Weight":"4.8 lb.","Zoom Ratio":"18x","Zoom Type":"Variable Focal Length"}', 'Fujinon
