Adjustable Sizing. All four straps are adjustable to ensure a comfortable fit and even allows for use with heavy jackets and outerwear.', 43000.0, '{"Brand":"GoPro","Camera Support Type":"Harness","Item Type":"Camera Support"}', 'GoPro
