8.9-inch maximum length; 4.6-inch minimum length
Compatible with most GoPro cameras

Portable Extension Pole and Tripod. The GoPro Shorty’s pocket-sized build makes it the perfect option for setting up quick tripod shots and for grabbing impromptu handheld shots, and the standard three-prong accessory interface makes it easy to lock your GoPro in place. The Shorty can extend to 8.9 inches and retract down to 4.6 inches.

Compatibility. The GoPro Shorty is compatible with the GoPro HERO8 Black, GoPro HERO7 Black, GoPro HERO6 Black, HERO5 Black, HERO5 Session, HERO4 Black, HERO4 Silver, HERO+ LCD, HERO+, HERO Session, and HERO.', 29000.0, '{"Brand":"GoPro","Camera Support Type":"Tripod","Dimensions":"Length:\\n8.9\\" (Extended)\\n4.6\\" (Retracted)","Item Type":"Camera Support"}', 'GoPro
Shorty', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1615, 6, 100, 'GoPro Supercharger', 'gopro-supercharger', 'The GoPro Supercharger is a wall charger that lets you simultaneously charge two GoPro devices or other USB Type-C and Type-A devices. Key features include:

Charge two GoPro devices at once
Great for the GoPro Karma Grip
Continuously power your GoPro during long captures
High-speed charging over USB-C; cable included

Dual Charging. The GoPro Supercharger’s USB Type-C and USB Type-A ports let you simultaneously charge two GoPro devices or other compatible USB devices. This means it can charge two USB-C cameras or devices if you provide a USB-A to USB-C cable.

Optimized for GoPro Devices. The included USB 3.1 Type-C to Type-C cable lets you charge a GoPro Karma Grip up to 70% faster; GoPro batteries up to 45% faster; and a GoPro HERO8 Black, GoPro HERO9 Black, GoPro HERO10 Black, or GoPro HERO11 Black up to 20% faster. It also lets you continuously power your GoPro during long shoots, such as time-lapses.', 50000.0, '{"Brand":"GoPro","Inputs/Outputs":"Additional Inputs/Outputs       1x USB Type-C 1x USB Type-A","Item Type":"Power","Power Output":"Maximum: 27.5 W; USB Type-C: 5.1 VDC, 3 A / 5.5 VDC, 3 A / 12 VDC, 1.67 A; USB Type-A: 5.1 VDC, 1.5 A","Power Type":"Charger"}', 'GoPro
