A to
C cable', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1617, 4, 100, 'GoPro USB-C to 3.5mm Mic Adapter', 'gopro-usb-c-to-3-5mm-mic-adapter', 'The GoPro USB-C to 3.5mm Mic Adapter works with select GoPro action cameras to successfully and easily record high-quality audio from an external source. Key features include:

Lets you record high-quality audio from external sources
3.5mm analog stereo input
Internal analog-to-digital signal converter
Pass-through USB port

Analog Stereo Input. The GoPro USB-C to 3.5mm Mic Adapter for HERO5/6/7/8’s 3.5mm analog stereo input accepts mic or line-level signals, and is compatible with powered and unpowered mics.

Action Cam Compatibility. This adapter works well with GoPro’s HERO5, HERO6, HERO7, HERO8, HERO9, HERO10, HERO11, HERO12, and HERO13 action cameras.

Analog-to-Digital Signal Converter. An internal analog-to-digital conversion has 106 dB of headroom for clean recordings.

Pass-Through USB Port. The adapter uses the camera’s USB port, but includes a pass-through USB port so you can still charge your camera while you’re using the adapter.', 57000.0, '{"Brand":"GoPro","Cable Type":"Audio and Accessory","Connector":"USB-C and 3.5mm","Item Type":"Cable","Length":"0.5’"}', 'Just the adapter', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
