INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1635, 2, 104, 'Hasselblad XCD 20-35mm f/3.2-4.5 E', 'hasselblad-xcd-20-35mm-f-3-2-4-5-e', 'The Hasselblad XCD 20-35mm f/3.2-4.5 E is a versatile ultra-wide zoom for the X1D, X1D II and X2D 100C camera systems. Key features include:

Great for landscape, cityscape, and architectural subjects.
Stepping motor focus system with responsive AF performance
Optics designed for 100MP medium format sensors
Compact leaf shutter with 1/2000-second sync

Reproduce Majestic Landscapes and Cityscapes. The ultra-wide zoom range of the Hasselblad XCD 20-35mm f/3.2-4.5 E is ideal for capturing both the natural world and urban landscapes. With an effective 16-27mm zoom and one of the largest max apertures in Hasselblad’s medium format fleet, you can capture stunning vistas, sunsets, and interiors.

Small, Powerful Leaf Shutter. The Hasselblad XCD 20-35mm f/3.2-4.5 E greatly expands lighting options with its central lens leaf shutter capable of flash sync speeds up to 1/2000 of a second. This allows you to use a flash in bright sunlight to highlight your subject while darkening the ambient light with fast shutter speeds.

Advanced Optical and Autofocus Design. A stepping motor and the focusing drive mechanism of this lens offers accurate, rapid, and quiet autofocus. The internal focusing design benefits manual focusing, providing smooth and predictable handling. Three aspherical elements reduce distortion and ensure sharpness.

Build Quality. Hasselblad has streamlined the design of the XCD 20-35mm f/3.2-4.5 E with a metal lens barrel, engraved control rings, and an elegant nameplate. Every Hasselblad lens is manufactured under strict tests to ensure ideal performance.

Try it with These X-Mount Cameras. This lens is compatible with X-system Hasselblad cameras, such as the Hasselblad X1D, X1D II and the X2D 100C. It is also compatible with Hasselblad’s smallest medium format camera body, the 907X, which is paired with the 100MP CFV 100C digital back for a beautiful hybrid of iconic film camera aesthetics and cutting-edge digital capture. This digital back offers optimal color reproduction thanks to its Hasselblad Natural Colour Solution (HNCS), making it a great choice for this lens when shooting nature.', 1114000.0, '{"Angle of View":"108-76°","Brand":"Hasselblad","Focus Type":"Autofocus and Manual Focus","General":"Dimensions (ø x L)3.2 × 4.6\\"Weight1.8 lb.","Item Type":"Lens","Leaf Shutter":"Yes, up to 1/2000-second sync speed","Lens Mount":"Hasselblad X","Lens Type":"Ultra Wide Angle","Max Magnification":"0.09-0.16x","Mfr. Model Number":"CP.HB.00000792.01","Min Focusing Distance":"1’","Optical Design":"Groups/Elements12/16","Stabilization":"No"}', 'Hasselblad
