INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1646, 2, 104, 'Hasselblad XCD 75mm f/3.4 P', 'hasselblad-xcd-75mm-f-3-4-p', 'The Hasselblad XCD 75mm f/3.4 P is a standard-view prime for the X1D, X1D II and X2D 100C camera systems. Key features include:

Great for portraits, still life, and street photography
Stepping motor focus system with responsive AF performance
Optics designed for 100MP medium format sensors
Compact leaf shutter with 1/2000-second sync

Creating Stunning Portraits. The 75mm focal length (59mm equivalent in 35mm terms), plus the relatively fast max aperture, makes the Hasselblad XCD 75mm f/3.4 P ideal for portraits. This slightly-long length offers a unique view compared to your average go-to 50mm portrait.

Small, Powerful Leaf Shutter. The Hasselblad XCD 75mm f/3.4 P greatly expands lighting options with its central lens leaf shutter capable of flash sync speeds up to 1/2000 of a second. This allows you to use a flash in bright sunlight to highlight your subject while darkening the ambient light with fast shutter speeds.

Advanced Optical and Autofocus Design. A stepping motor and the focusing drive mechanism of this lens offers accurate, rapid, and quiet autofocus. The internal focusing design benefits manual focusing, providing smooth and predictable handling. Three aspherical elements reduce distortion and ensure sharpness.

Build Quality. Hasselblad set out to create a portrait lens that was portable enough to take with you everywhere – which is great news for street photographers. This lens is 24% shorter than prior portrait-length XCD lenses and also about 45% lighter! Every Hasselblad lens is manufactured under strict tests to ensure ideal performance.

Try it with These X-Mount Cameras. This lens is compatible with X-system Hasselblad cameras, such as the Hasselblad X1D, X1D II and the X2D 100C. It is also compatible with Hasselblad’s smallest medium format camera body, the 907X, which is paired with the 100MP CFV 100C digital back for a beautiful hybrid of iconic film camera aesthetics and cutting-edge digital capture. This digital back offers optimal color reproduction thanks to its Hasselblad Natural Colour Solution (HNCS), making it a great choice for this lens when shooting still life work or taking portraits out in nature.', 421000.0, '{"Angle of View":"40°","Brand":"Hasselblad","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Mount":"Hasselblad X","Lens Type":"Standard","Mfr. Model Number":"CP.HB.00000894.01"}', 'Hasselblad
XCD 75mm f/3.4
