INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1723, 3, 117, 'Insta360 2-in-1 Invisible Selfie Stick + Tripod', 'insta360-2-in-1-invisible-selfie-stick-tripod', 'The Insta360 2-in-1 Invisible Selfie Stick + Tripod is a lightweight tripod solution for all Insta360 cameras. Key features include:

Combo selfie stick and mini tripod
Lightweight aluminum construction
1/4"-20 camera mounting screw
Extends from 9.6 to 42.9" in length

For The Masses. With the Insta360 2-in-1 Invisible Selfie Stick + Tripod, your point of view is top priority. Whether you decide to use it as a selfie stick or a mini tripod, this lightweight telescoping unit is guaranteed to fit any Insta360 camera you have. This accessory will extend from 9.6 to 42.9" in length.

Mounting And Tripod Talk. Your Insta360 camera will mount directly to the top of this unit using the 1/4"-20 mounting screw. No hassle, no extra accessories needed. While the tripod legs at the end will allow your to set up on a flat surface, they also fold down to create a handle with a comfortable grip.', 25000.0, '{"Brand":"Insta360","Camera Mount":"1 × 1/4\\"-20","Camera Support Type":"Tripod","Item Type":"Camera Support","Length":"9.64 to 42.9\\"","Material":"Aluminum","Tripod":"IntegratedFoldable"}', 'Insta360 2-in-1
Invisible
Selfie
Stick +
Tripod', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1724, 1, 117, 'Insta360 Ace Pro Action Camera', 'insta360-ace-pro-action-camera', 'The Insta360 Ace Pro Action Camera is a wide angle, versatile action camera designed to deliver 8K photo and video whether you’re shooting on the go, in the studio, or taking things down underwater. Key features include:

2.4" flip touchscreen
151° wide-angle Leica f/2.6 lens
90-minute runtime
Directional/stereo audio

Compact. Action Packed. Despite the tiny nature of the Insta360 Ace Pro Action Camera, vloggers and adventure-enthusiasts alike will find that this camera delivers the high-quality footage we all deserve. Producing 8K photo and video through its large 1/1.3" sensor, the Ace Pro features an automatic HDR mode and excellent low-light performance to capture vibrant, sharp color across the board.

Leica Wide-Angle. The Ace Pro sports a state-of-the-art Leica f/2.6 lens, which allows you to capture up to a 151° field of view.

Take It With You, Wherever You Go. Whether you’re vlogging your adventure, getting cool shots in the studio, or taking a dive, the Ace Pro can take it all. This camera is built to endure most types of weather, from a chilling -4°F to a scorching 104°F, and is even waterproof to protect it from the rain. Want more water? The Ace Pro by itself is waterproof up to nearly 33 feet, but with the separately available Dive Case, you can take it down to 197 feet under the surface.

Battery Powered. This camera accepts one Ace Pro Battery, which we send out with this rental. You can always add a couple more to your order to ensure your adventure isn’t cut short! This is a 1650mAh capacity battery designed solely for the Ace Pro, and it can either be charged internally with the camera and the included USB-C cable, or with the separately available Fast Charge Hub for quicker charging times and more batteries charging at once.

In-Camera and App Effects. Not only does this camera provide multiple built-in effects, like TimeShift, Dynamic Time-Lapse, Starlapse, Loop Recording, Pre-Recording, Timed Capture, and Auto Dash, there’s even more stored in the Insta360 app for iOS and Android devices! Through the app, you can use effects like Invisible Selfie Stick, which automatically detects a selfie-stick and makes it disappear, AI Warp, which transforms your footage with customizable AI effects, or Motion Blur to capture that cool, immersive shot without the need for an ND filter.

Optional Accessories. Since this camera holds similar physical qualities to the GoPro line of cameras, many GoPro accessories can be used with the Ace Pro! You can find a selection of compatible accessories in the Recommended section of your screen.', 139000.0, '{"Brand":"Insta360","Camera":"Image Sensor1/1.3\\"-Type CMOS Sensor ResolutionEffective: 48 Megapixel (7680 × 4320)","Camera Type":"Action","Compatible Media":"microSD","Display":"Display TypeTilting Touchscreen LCD Display Size2.4\\" Secondary DisplayFront: 0.9\\" LCD Status Display","Exposure Control":"Shutter Speed\\t1/8000 to 120 Seconds in Photo/Video Mode ISO Sensitivity Range100 to 6400 Exposure ModesAuto, Manual, Scene Modes Shooting ModesTime-Lapse Movie Interval RecordingNo Burst PhotoNo Continuous ShootingNo Self-TimerNo Remote ControlNo","Features":"Image StabilizationDigital Scene ModesPreset: Yes Environmental ProtectionAdvertised as Water Resistant/Submersible to 32.8’ White Balance ModesAuto Creative EffectsYes Built-In MicYes Built-In SpeakerNo Built-In Light/FlashLight – NoFlash – No Wireless2.4 / 5 GHz Wi-Fi (802.11a/b/g)Wi-Fi 4 (802.11n)Wi-Fi 5 (802.11ac)Bluetooth Video OutputAudio OutputControl Mobile App CompatibleYes: Android & iOS Accessory ShoeNo","General":"BatteryRechargeable Lithium-Ion Battery Pack, 5 VDC, 1650 mAhMax Runtime: 2 Hours per ChargeBattery Charge Time: 1 hour Charging MethodUSB Charging Time1 Hour Operating Temperature -4 to 104°F","Inputs/Outputs":"Inputs1 x USB-C 3.1/3.2 Gen 2 Microphone InputVia USB Adapter Headphone JackNo","Item Type":"Camera","Maximum Video Resolution":"8K","Mfr. Model Number":"CINSAAJA_ACEPRO01","Optics":"35mm-Equivalent Focal Length16mm Maximum Aperturef/2.6 Minimum Focus Distance11.5’ Fixed FocusYes Angle of ViewWide: 151°","Physical":"Dimensions (W x H x D)2.8 × 2.05 × 1.5″ Weight6.3 oz","Recording":"Media/Memory Card SlotSingle Slot: microSD/microSDHC/microSDXC (UHS-I) [1 TB Maximum / U3/V30 or Faster Recommended] Video Format7680 × 4320p 