INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1732, 1, 117, 'Insta360 GO 2 Action Camera High-Capacity Edition (64GB)', 'insta360-go-2-action-camera-high-capacity-edition-64gb', 'The Insta360 GO 2 Action Camera High-Capacity Edition (64GB) is an ultra-compact wide-angle action camera that records up to 64GB of internal storage. This is the predecessor to the 64GB GO 3. Key features include:

10 minute video clips at 3K 2560 × 1440
Shoot in slow motion up to 120 fps
iOS/Android App control with automatic editing feature
64GB internal storage

10 minute clips at 3K. The Insta360 GO 2 Action Camera High-Capacity Edition (64GB) offers the same easy-to-use style of stabilized footage capture as its predecessor, but greatly expands on its limitations. Rather than short-burst recording, the GO 2 can now record for 10 minutes at a time and increases the max resolution to 2560 × 1440p, with 1080p HDR as an option as well. You can now also record slow-motion 1080p video at 120 fps as well as use hyperlapse for fast-motion action shots. Video is captured with built-in Insta360 FlowState image stabilization, which uses an internal 6-axis gyro to smooth out your recordings.

Charging Case. The GO comes built into a waterproof casing that lets you shoot in up to 13’ of water, but it also comes with a charging case, which features a larger 1100mAh capacity battery than the original GO model to provide up to 150 minutes of recording time. Although the camera has a built-in battery, the Charge Case provides an alternative power solution. Per charge, it lets you capture approximately 15-minute clips.

Built-In Video Processing. The compact camera also offers modes for timelapse, hyperlapse, interval, and slow motion recording. Timelapse is capable of condensing 8 hours into 9 minutes, hyperlapse recording processes 30 minutes in to 5 minutes, and with interval recording the camera can capture for up to 7 days.

Unique Mounting. One of the largest selling points of the GO is its magnetic pendant mounting system. Worn like a necklace inside clothing, the pendant mount allows the camera to magnetically attach to the outside of your shirt for unobtrusive POV shooting. We also include the pivot stand for more traditional mounting. Please note that the magnetic pendant interferes with pacemakers.', 107000.0, '{"Brand":"Insta360","Camera Type":"Action","Compatible Media":"Internal Storage","Item Type":"Camera","Maximum Video Resolution":"3K","Physical":"Dimensions2.1 × 0.9 × 0.8″Weight0.9 oz","Recording":"Video ResolutionsStandard:\\n2560 × 1440p 24/25/30 fps\\n1920 × 1080p 24/25/30 fpsSlow Motion:\\n 1920 × 1080p 120fpsStill Image(2560 × 1440)(2560 × 2560)(1440 × 2560)(2938 × 1088)","Sensor Size":"1-Inch","Stabilization":"Yes","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Wireless Connectivity":"Wi-Fi and Bluetooth"}', 'Insta360
GO 2
