INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1734, 1, 117, 'Insta360 GO 3 Action Camera (64GB)', 'insta360-go-3-action-camera-64gb', 'The Insta360 GO 3 Action Camera (64GB) builds off its predecessor, the GO 2, with its ability to record 2.7K footage. Key features include:

Miniature action camera with action pod
64GB flash memory
Waterproof to 16 feet
Time-lapse, time shift, loop recording

Big Improvements Come in Tiny Packages. This GO 3 camera may be a little bigger than its predecessor, but still only weighs a whopping 1.2 ounces. It’s seriously so small you can fit it in your pocket. Despite its teensy nature, this unit is still capable of being mounted, hung, or attached anywhere your heart desires, even your pet’s collar.

POV Perfection. Using this camera allows you to get those perfect wide angle POV shots in high 2.7K resolution. Any footage recorded on this device will save directly to the 64gb internal memory, or you can even download the companion app to get the footage directly to your smartphone. This iOS/Android app also offers remote functions and auto editing!

Smooth Sailing. The built-in Insta360 FlowState image stabilization smooths out those would-be rough shots, even in slow motion. You have the ability to record up to 1080p video at 120 fps, as well as utilize 360° horizon lock to keep your video set on the horizon no matter the action.

Built-In Effects. This camera offers several different effects, like TimeShift to mimic speeding up time and space, PureShot HDR Photo to expand your dynamic range for vivid colors, slow motion for dramatic shots, and Time-Lapse to create fun day or night lapse shots.

Innovative Action Pod and Voice Control. Also featured with this rental is the innovative action pod that fits your GO 3 snug and tight. This accessory features a 2.2" flip up touchscreen for previewing, and adds an additional hour and a half to the typical 45 minute runtime. Voice control is also included for hands free control of your device.

Additional Features. This unit features two built-in mics to capture and record audio, but you can also pair your AirPods! The camera is waterproof for up to 16 feet, and when used inside the Action Pod, the GO 3 is IPX4 water-resistant.

Please Note. If you have a pacemaker, please do not wear GO 3 on your chest or use the Magnet Pendant due to its magnetism.', 125000.0, '{"Battery":"BatteryRechargeable Battery Pack, 1270 mAhMax Runtime: 2.5 Hours per ChargeBattery Charge Time: 1 hours Charging MethodUSB Charging Time1 Hours","Brand":"Insta360","Camera Type":"Action","Compatible Media":"microSD","Connectors":"Inputs1 x USB-C 3.1/3.2 Gen 2 On Charge Case Outputs1 x USB-C 3.0 / 3.1/3.2 Gen 1 On Charge Case Microphone InputNo Headphone JackNo","Display":"Display TypeFixed LCD Display Size2.2\\" Secondary DisplayNo Shutter Speed1/8000 to 1/30 Seconds in Video Mode","Exposure Control":"ISO Sensitivity RangePhoto/Video: 100 to 3200 in Manual Mode Exposure ModesModes: Auto Shooting ModesAction FreezeSuper Slow Motion MovieTime-Lapse Movie Remote ControlNo","Features":"Image StabilizationDigital Scene ModesPreset: Yes Environmental ProtectionAdvertised as Submersible to 16.4’\\nManufacturer Testing: IPX4 White Balance ModesAutoCustom  Creative EffectsYes Built-In MicYes Built-In SpeakerNo Built-In Light/FlashLight – NoFlash – No Wireless5 GHz Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 5.0 Mobile App CompatibleYes: Android & iOSFunctionality: Access Stored Files, Adjust Settings, Firmware Update, Remote Control, Setup, View Live Feed\\nAs of June, 2023: Check with manufacturer for the most up-to-date compatibility Accessory ShoeNo Tripod Mounting ThreadNo","Item Type":"Camera","Maximum Video Resolution":"2K","Operating Temperature":"-4 to 104°F","Optics":"35mm-Equivalent Focal Length11.24mmMaximum Aperturef/2.2Fixed FocusYes","Physical":"Dimensions (W x H x D)2.1 × 1 × 0.9″ (Without Protrusions)2.5 × 1.8 × 1.2″ (With Protrusions) Weight1.3 oz (Body Only)3.4 oz","Recording":"Media/Memory Card SlotNo Internal Storage64 GB Video Format2720 × 1536 at 24/25/30 fps (80 Mb/s MP4)2560 × 1440p at 24/25/30 fps (80 Mb/s MP4)1920 × 1080p at 24/25/30 fps (80 Mb/s MP4) Slow Motion Mode120 fps Recorded at 1920 × 1080p Channels2.0-Channel Stereo Aud