Please note, this battery base will not work with the mounting bracket found in the ONE R configurations.', 29000.0, '{"Brand":"Insta360","Item Type":"Power","Power Type":"Battery Base"}', 'ONE
RS battery base', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1745, 1, 117, 'Insta360 ONE RS Twin Edition', 'insta360-one-rs-twin-edition', 'The Insta360 ONE RS Twin Edition is part of Insta360’s modular action camera system including the 4K Boost and 360 lens mods, and an update to the the Insta360 ONE R line of cameras. Key features include:

Includes 4K Boost and 360 lens mods
Up to 6K widescreen / 5.7K 360° video
Waterproof at depths of 16’ or less
1.2 hour battery life

Updated Modular Action System. The Insta360 ONE RS Twin Edition combines the system’s brain, or Core, with two of the three interchangeable lenses in the ONE RS lineup. When assembled on the battery base and in the mounting bracket, all components of the RS system are waterproof at depths of 16’ or less. Each lens mod supports video capture at 4K and above.

360 Lens Mod. One of the mods included with this configuration is the 360 lens, capable of shooting 5.7K 360° footage. If you use a selfie stick or mount, creative effects can eliminate them from the footage, and you can also reframe a shot after recording to get the perfect angle.

4K Boost Mod. This kit also includes a 4K Boost mod, which captures 4K60 video, 48MP stills, and 6K widescreen video with in-camera stabilization and front or rear facing recording options. The 1/2" sensor is supported by Active HDR and can shoot 200 fps at 1080p.

Core Module. Each configuration of the One RS includes the Core Module, packed with three microphones with noise reduction and a touchscreen display, which can be oriented to support standard recording or selfie recording. Also included with each configuration is the battery base, rated for up to 1.2 hours per charge, and a mounting bracket, which is necessary for any underwater shooting.', 89000.0, '{"Brand":"Insta360","Camera Type":"360","Compatible Media":"microSD","Item Type":"Camera","Maximum Video Resolution":"6K","Screen Type":"Touchscreen and Detachable","Sensor":"1/2\\"-Type CMOS Sensor","Sensor Size":"1-Inch","Stabilization":"Yes","Video Format":"4K Boost Mod6016 × 2560 up to 25fps4000 × 3000 up to 30 fps3840 × 2160 up to 60 fps2720 × 1530 up to 100 fps1920 × 1080 up to 200fps","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Wireless Connectivity":"Wi-Fi and Bluetooth"}', 'ONE
