X5', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1754, 3, 117, 'Insta360 Utility Frame for X3', 'insta360-utility-frame-for-x3', 'This Insta360 Utility Frame is designed to protect your Insta360 X3 camera while adding more mounting points for accessories to complete your loadout. Key features include:

Camera inserts without the need for tools
Doesn’t block any camera ports or access points
Allows mounting of microphones and fill lights
Enables horizontal shooting

Easy Insertion. The Insta360 Utility Frame features a hinged top that allows you to slide the camera inside and lock it in place without the need for any tools.

Full Access to Camera Ports. The frame doesn’t block any of the Insta360 X3 camera’s ports or access points—including its 1/4"-20 integrated screw.

Mount Multiple Accessories. Fill lights, shotgun microphones, and other accessories can be mounted to the frame via cold shoe mounts on either side and two 2-prong mounts.

Shoot Horizontally. A detachable 2-prong mount can convert one of the cold shoe mounts for mounting the camera on its side for horizontal shooting.', 54000.0, '{"Brand":"Insta360","Camera Support Type":"Cage","Dimensions":"5.2 × 2.5 × 1.8″","Item Type":"Camera Support","Mfr. Model Number":"CINSBAQF","Mounting Options":"2-Prong Mount (x2)\\nCold Shoe Mount (x2)"}', 'Insta360
Utility
Frame
	2-prong mount adapter
Silicone lens cover
Hardware kit', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1755, 3, 117, 'Insta360 Utility Frame for X5', 'insta360-utility-frame-for-x5', 'This Insta360 Utility Frame is designed to protect your Insta360 X5 camera while adding more mounting points for accessories. Key features include:

Easy installation, hinged top panel
Maintains access to ports
Vertical or horizontal use

Easy Insertion. The Insta360 Utility Frame features a hinged top that allows you to slide the camera inside and lock it in place without the need for any tools.

Full Access to Camera Ports. The frame doesn’t block any of the Insta360 X5 camera’s ports, access points, or the screen.

Mount Multiple Accessories. Fill lights, shotgun microphones, and other accessories can be mounted to the frame with one of the two cold shoe mounts. There are also three 1/4’-20 threaded mount points.

Lens Protection. This frame comes with a silicone lens cap, which protects the dual lenses when the camera is not in use.', 68000.0, '{"Brand":"Insta360","Camera Support Type":"Cage","General":"Accessory Mounts3x 1/4\\"-202x Cold shoesDimensions (W x H x D)5.7 × 2.4 × 0.8″MaterialAluminum, silicone, & foamMfr. Model NumberCINSBAHNWeight2.2 oz.","Item Type":"Camera Support"}', 'Insta360
