Modern Manual Focus. This fully manual-focus lens features a positive focus lock mechanism to help prevent focus shifting, while a hard click stop indicates the infinity position on the focus ring for easy use when you’re working in low-visibility conditions.', 114000.0, '{"Angle of View":"126°","Brand":"Irix","Dimensions":"Length: 4.1\\"","Groups/Elements":"10/16","Hood Included":"Yes","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Mount":"Nikon F","Lens Type":"Ultra Wide Angle","Mfr. Model Number":"IL-11BS-NF"}', 'Irix 11mm f/4
