High Capacity, Broad Compatibility. The included Ballhead 5K can handle up to 11 lbs. of equipment with ease. You can use its standard 1/4"-20 threaded screw to mount compatible DSLRs, mirrorless cameras, and speedlights. The included Arca-type compatible quick-release plate lets you quickly and easily attach and detach your gear on the fly.

