This battery only works with the Kenyon KS-4×4 Gyro.', 64000.0, '{"Brand":"Kenyon","Item Type":"Power","Power Type":"Battery"}', 'Just the battery', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1778, 3, 125, 'Kessler 100mm Ball Kit', 'kessler-100mm-ball-kit', 'The Kessler 100mm Ball Kit is an add-on accessory for adapting heads and sliders to heavy-duty video tripods. Key features include:

Mount fluid heads or sliders to a 100mm bowl tripod
Includes a 75mm fixed-ring mount
3/8" stud for video-tripod compatibility
Excellent value

100mm Half Ball. Need to mount a flat-mount fluid head or sliders to a 100mm bowl tripod? You’ve come to the right place! The Kessler 100mm Ball Kit also features a 75mm fixed-ring mount, letting you use it with 75mm bowl tripods as well.

3/8" Stud. The 3/8" stud makes this ball compatible with most heavy-duty video tripods.', 71000.0, '{"Brand":"Kessler","Camera Support Type":"Ball Head and Slider","Item Type":"Camera Support"}', '100mm
Half
