Oh How The Tables Have Turned…. This Kessler Crane Turntable Kit w/ 12-inch White Surface Top is a rotating solution for use with both the V-Mount & Gold Mount CineShooters and Second Shooter motion control systems, adding even more versatility to these already powerful and compact workhorses. For commercial work, add some flavor to bland product shots. For wedding films, step up your detail shots during bridal prep. No matter what kind of shoot you are on, the Turntable Kit adds even more options to your arsenal.', 207000.0, '{"Brand":"Kessler","Camera Support Type":"Turntable","Item Type":"Camera Support","Speed":"Second Shooter Controller360 degrees @ 4.4 seconds (2 key frame move)  Second Shooter Plus Controller /CineShooter360 degrees @ 3 seconds (2 key frame move)","Weight Capacity":"50 lbs (22.6 kg) on center"}', 'Kessler
