Please note that we also offer the more feature-rich Kessler All-Terrain Outrigger Feet.', 82000.0, '{"Brand":"Kessler","Camera Support Type":"Slider","Item Type":"Camera Support"}', '', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1801, 3, 125, 'Kessler Parallax for 3ft CineSlider', 'kessler-parallax-for-3ft-cineslider', 'The Kessler Parallax is an accessory for the Cineslider that adds assisted panning and fixed-point shooting capabilities. Key features include:

Fixed-point shooting
Parallax effect and Travel Pan move
Does not restrict normal linear movement
Slider not included

Parallax and Travel Pan Moves. Add a unique Parallax effect or Travel Pan move for sweeping landscapes or interiors to separate your slides from the competition.

Non-Intrusive. When installed, the Parallax doesn’t hinder you from doing a normal linear move. Just zero out the system and you’re all set.', 221000.0, '{"Brand":"Kessler","Camera Support Type":"Slider","Item Type":"Camera Support"}', 'Kessler
Parallax', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1802, 3, 125, 'Kessler Pocket Dolly 3 Traveler', 'kessler-pocket-dolly-3-traveler', 'The Kessler Pocket Dolly Traveler 3 is an update to the Kessler PD Traveler. Key features include:

New carriage brake and improved mounting options
Nineteen inches of travel with a fifteen-pound capacity
New weighted crank for more consistent operation
Flat-mount adapter included

The Kessler Pocket Dolly Traveler 3 is an update to the Kessler PD Traveler.

What’s New. The Pocket Dolly Traveler v3.0 adds a carriage brake to keep things locked down and to keep the camera from sliding away. There are also more mounting options, with additional 3/8”-16 threaded holes at each end of the slider.

Traveler Length. You get 19” of travel with a 15-lb. capacity limit in a slider that’s physically 27.5” in length and 5.3 lbs. itself.

Smoother Cranking. A new weighted crank aids in more consistent manual operation by acting as a counterweight to your camera.

Motion-Control Capable. The Pocket Dolly 3 is compatible with the Kessler Second Shooter Plus to provide additional options for time-lapse and repetitive-motion control.

Flat-Mount Adapter Included. Since the slider only has female threads, we include the Flat Mount Adapter. This adds a male 3/8-16" threaded stud for attaching tripod heads.', 118000.0, '{"Brand":"Kessler","Camera Support Type":"Slider","Item Type":"Camera Support"}', 'Kessler
Pocket
Dolly
Carrying
Case
Kessler
Pocket
Dolly
Handle
Kessler
Flat
Mount
Adapter', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1803, 3, 125, 'Kessler Pocket Jib Pro', 'kessler-pocket-jib-pro', 'The Kessler Crane Pocket Jib PRO offers a compact and portable jib option for camera rigs up to 50 pounds offering about 80 inches of reach and weighing 26.7 pounds. Key features include:

Supports up to 50 pounds of equipment
Telescopes to 80 inches
100mm bowl for attaching fluid heads
Counterweights not included

Fifty Pound Capacity. The Kessler Crane Pocket Jib PRO is the perfect balance of strength and portability. The jib can handle up to 50 lbs of gear while collapsing to an overall length of 46in. for travel. Fully extended, you’ll get around 80 inches of reach and the jib weighs in at 26.7 lbs.

Compatibility. The jib will need a very strong tripod to hold the weight of the jib plus your rig, so we recommend pairing it with Kessler’s heavy duty K-Pod tripod. On the other end of the jib you’ll find a 100mm bowl to attach any compatible 100mm half ball fluid head. The Manfrotto 509HD is a great option, and at under 10 pounds, there’s still room for a 40 pound camera. We do include a compatible 100mm-75mm bowl adapter with this rental.

Counterweights Not Included. You’ll need to source counterweights to balance the jib. Shipping sand and concrete isn’t very economical, but we do send clamps to secure gym-style free weights. If you have no way to source weights yourself, we do offer Impact 15lbs and Impact 25lbs shot bags as separate rental items.', 596000.0, '{"Brand":"Kessler","Camera Support Type":"Jib","Dimensions":"74.5 × 9.25 × 10″","Item Type":"Camera Support"}', 'Kessler
