Built For Greatness. Curated from optical glass, this filter offers incredible clarity, does not affect coloration of the image, and is ideally used with other filters. The included metal filter case makes for easy & safe storage and transport.', 79000.0, '{"Brand":"LEE","Density":"1.8 (6-Stop)","Dimensions":"6 × 6″","Filter Format":"Lee SW150","Filter Type":"Neutral Density","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Support Type":"Filter","Material":"Glass","Mfr. Model Number":"#SW150LS","Thickness":"0.1\\""}', 'LEE 150 × 150mm
