INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1834, 5, 132, 'LEE 150 x 170mm 0.3 Split Neutral Density Filter Kit', 'lee-150-x-170mm-0-3-split-neutral-density-filter-kit', 'The LEE 150 × 170mm 0.3 Split Neutral Density Filter Kit helps you balance exposure when working in high-contrast situations. Key features include:

Neutral density 0.3 provides a 1-stop reduction in light in selective areas.
Constructed from optical resin for overall clarity and durability.
Compatible for use with the LEE SW150 filter holder.
Includes padded filter pouch.

Controlled Exposure. The LEE 150 × 170mm 0.6 Split Neutral Density Filter Kit consists of the LEE 150 × 170mm Hard Graduated 0.3 ND Filter and LEE 150 × 170mm Soft Graduated 0.3 ND Filter. Both filters are uniquely designed to control brightness in difficult lighting & balance exposure in high-contrast situations. The filter’s design places the 0.3, 1-stop density at the top of the filter and then transitions to clear by the center of the filter for a gradual, natural appearance.

Hard-edge & Soft-edge. The hard-edge transition between the density and clear areas is well-suited for photographing scenes with an even, distinct horizon line, while the soft-edge transition between the density and clear areas is well-suited for photographing scenes with an indistinct or undefined horizon line. Additionally, both filters can be used for wide-angle lenses.

Built to Last. The LEE 150 × 170mm Hard Graduated 0.3 ND & LEE 150 × 170mm Soft Graduated 0.3 ND filters are constructed from optical resin, making it less likely to shatter if an accident occurs. In addition to durability, the optical resin helps to maintain high clarity. The included filter pouch protects the filter when not in use, and the separately rented LEE SW150 Mark II Filter System Holder protects it while in use.', 129000.0, '{"Brand":"LEE","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Support Type":"Filter"}', 'LEE 150 × 170mm
