Everything is Better in 3’s. The LEE 150 × 170mm SW150 Hard Edge Graduated ND Filter Kit is a set of 3 filters with varying neutral density that help to darken specific areas of an image, such as bright skies, while allowing for a normal, unaffected exposure in the other regions of the image. The included 0.3, 0.6, and 0.9 filters are currently only compatible with the separately rented LEE SW150 Mark II Filter System Holder for Wide-Angle Lenses. This filter provides up to a 1, 2, or 3-stop reduction in light in selective areas without affecting the coloration of the image.

