Built to Last. The LEE 150 × 170mm Soft Graduated 0.9 ND filter is constructed from optical resin, making it less likely to shatter if an accident occurs. In addition to durability, the optical resin helps to maintain high clarity. The included filter pouch protects the filter when not in use. The SW150 Mark II Filter System Holder is rented separately, but is the recommended filter holder for this item.

Controlled Exposure. This filter is uniquely designed to control brightness in difficult lighting & balance exposure in high-contrast situations. The filter’s design places the 0.9, 3-stop density at the top of the filter and then transitions to clear by the center of the filter for a gradual, natural appearance. The soft-edge transition between the density and clear areas is well-suited for photographing scenes with undefined a horizon line or when working with wide-angle lenses.', 86000.0, '{"Brand":"LEE","Density":"0.9 (3-Stop)","Dimensions":"5.9 × 6.7″","Filter Format":"Lee SW150","Filter Type":"Neutral Density","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Support Type":"Filter","Material":"Resin","Mfr. Model Number":"#SW150-9NDG-S","Thickness":"0.08\\""}', 'LEE 150 × 170mm
Soft
Graduated 0.9
ND
Filter
Padded filter pouch', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1845, 5, 132, 'LEE SW150 Mark II Filter System Holder for Wide-Angle Lenses', 'lee-sw150-mark-ii-filter-system-holder-for-wide-angle-lenses', 'The LEE SW150 Mark II Filter Holder is a two-stage, rotating filter tray for the SW150M2 filter system that allows you to stack up to two lenses to the front of a wide angle lens when paired with a compatible LEE adapter ring. Key features include:

Rotating holder for LEE SW150 Mark II system
Two filters supports stacking for precise light control
Included Lightshield prevents back reflection
Separately available lens adapter ring required

SW150 M2 System. The SW150 Mark II fits to a range of lenses via a custom lens adaptor ring designed for a particular lens model. Need help finding the right gear for your lens? No problem! Contact us and a tech will be happy to help you determine the best options for your shoot!

Designed for Wide Angles. This 150mm Filter holder has been specially designed for particular ultra-wide lenses which have petal lens shades, or lenses with filter threads too large for smaller filter holder systems.

Tools Free Filter Holder. The LEE SW150 Mark II Filter Holder secures to a separately available lens adapter ring, to provide a 2-slot, rotating filter solution complete with an included light shield that prevents unwanted back reflections.

Lens Adapter Ring Required. Please note, this rental only includes the filter holder and requires an adapter ring to attach to a lens. Adapter rings are available as separate rental items.', 75000.0, '{"Brand":"LEE","Dimensions":"8.75 × 8.35 × 3.15″","Filter Format":"Lee SW150","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Support Type":"Filter Tray","Mfr. Model Number":"#SW150FH"}', 'LEE
