We don’t include a battery charger with the rental of a LINK 800WS Flash Unit, or the LINK Battery, so if you need one, or any spares, you’ve come to the right place!', 68000.0, '{"Brand":"Paul C. Buff","Charge Time":"Full charge : 1.5 hrs","Indicator":"Yes","Item Type":"Power","Power Type":"Charger"}', 'Battery charger
