INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1887, 2, 133, 'Leica 35mm f/1.4 Summilux-M for Leica M (Silver)', 'leica-35mm-f-1-4-summilux-m-for-leica-m-silver', 'The Leica 35mm f/1.4 Summilux-M for Leica M (Silver) is an ultra-fast wide-angle prime for Leica M-mount cameras. Key features include:

Ultra-fast wide-angle prime
Painterly, dreamlike bokeh at maximum aperture
Sharp, nearly distortion-free images at smaller apertures
Stainless steel front ring; hood with 46mm filter thread

Ultra-Fast Wide-Angle Prime. Using the Leica 35mm f/1.4 Summilux-M (Silver) at smaller apertures gives you razor-sharp, nearly distortion-free images; however, using it with a fully open aperture in backlit conditions produces painterly, dreamlike images that incorporate a unique bokeh effect.

Advanced Optical Design. The 35mm f/1.4 is characterized by exceptionally brilliant contrast, superb resolution and detail rendition, and virtually coma-free images. The complex five-group/seven-element optical design produces an image quality that’s unsurpassed in compact 35mm lenses, even at full aperture.

Compact, High-Quality Build. This updated version of the 35mm features a stainless steel front ring; a lockable focus ring; and a round lens hood that lets you use 46mm filters. That said, this lens is still plenty compact and lightweight—it’s just 1.4 inches long and weighs under half a pound.', 718000.0, '{"Angle of View":"Full-Frame (24 × 36mm)62.5°, 53.6°, 37.2°For M8 (18 × 27 mm)49.0°, 41.5°, 28.3°; equivalent focal length approx. 47.5mm","Aperture Blades":"10","Brand":"Leica","General":"Dimensions (ø x L)2.6 × 1.4″Weight0.4 lb.BayonetLeica M bayonet with 6-bit encoding","Groups/Elements":"5/7","Hood Included":"Yes","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Mount":"Leica M","Lens Type":"Wide Angle","Macro Reproduction Ratio":"1:26.3","Mfr. Model Number":"11301"}', 'Leica 35mm f/1.4
