The Leica BP-SCL7 is a rechargeable 1800mAh capacity, 7.4V battery for the Leica M11-P – Black, Leica M11, and M11 Monochrom. Leica estimates that you can get up to 700 shots when this battery’s fully charged.', 104000.0, '{"Brand":"Leica","Item Type":"Power","Mfr. Model Number":"24026","Power Type":"Battery"}', 'Just the battery', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1912, 1, 133, 'Leica D-Lux 7', 'leica-d-lux-7', 'The Leica D-Lux 7 is an advanced, large-sensor point-and-shoot camera with a compact design. We now have the redesigned D-Lux 8 available! Key features include:

17MP 4/3-inch MOS sensor
Large rear touchscreen LCD
4K UHD and Full HD capture
Fast, accurate autofocus

17MP 4/3-Inch MOS Sensor. The Leica D-Lux 7’s large 17MP sensor outputs images with a maximum effective resolution of 17MP in the 4:3 ratio. Thanks to this larger-than-normal sensor, the D-Lux 7 offers great low-light performance with an extended ISO range of 100-25,600.

Fast-Aperture Normal-Range Zoom. This camera includes a great 24-75mm f/1.7-2.8 equivalent (post-sensor crop), which covers the wide to short tele/portrait focal range with a fast, variable aperture. This allows for low-light shooting and shallow depth-of-field. The inclusion of an optical image stabilization system helps to minimize camera shake at slower shutter speeds.

4K Video and Photo. The D-Lux 7 offers 3840 × 2160 4K Ultra HD video recording at 30 or 24 fps in MP4 format. When 4K isn’t necessary, you can also capture Full HD 1080p video at 60 or 30 fps in MP4 or AVCHD formats. There’s a built-in stereo mic for quick audio capture. There’s no external mic input, though, so you’ll have to record higher-quality audio externally. Please note that for 4K capture, you must use a memory card that’s UHS-I Class 3 or faster.

Light-Speed Autofocus. This camera’s contrast-based autofocus system functions at extremely fast speeds.

Built-In Electronic Viewfinder and Touchscreen LCD. The 1240k 3.0-inch rear LCD adds touchscreen functionality, and can also be used for image composition and review, giving you multiple options. The 2,764k-dot resolution integrated electronic viewfinder offers 100% coverage and encompasses the entire Adobe RGB color space, allowing extremely faithful color reproduction.

Manual Controls. There are physical dials/rings for quick manual adjustment of shutter speed, aperture, focus, and exposure compensation. You also have multiple programmable buttons that can be customized to suit your needs.

Other Notable Features. The built-in Wi-Fi and Bluetooth provide wireless control and viewing options via the free Leica FOTOS App. You can get up to 11 fps burst shooting using the mechanical shutter and 40 fps in electronic shutter mode. The built-in EVF means there’s no pop-up flash, but a small removable flash is included. Images are recorded to SDHC/XC memory cards (remember, UHS-I Class 3 or faster for 4K video), and the rechargeable battery is rated for 300 shots per charge.', 357000.0, '{"Aspect Ratio":"1:1, 3:2, 4:3, 16:9","Audio":"Built-In Mic: With Video (Stereo)","Battery":"1 x BP-DC15 Rechargeable Lithium-Ion Battery Pack, 7.2 VDC, 1025 mAh","Brand":"Leica","Built-in Flash":"No","Camera Type":"Compact","Compatible Media":"SD","Connectivity":"HDMI D (Micro), USB 2.0 Micro-B","Continuous Shooting":"Up to 11 fps at 17 MP\\n\\nUp to 7 fps at 17 MP\\n\\nUp to 5.5 fps at 17 MP\\n\\nUp to 2 fps at 17 MP\\n\\nUp to 30 fps at 8.3 MP","Dimensions":"W x H x D: 4.6″ × 2.6″ × 2.5″","Exposure Compensation":"-5 EV to +5 EV (in 1/3 EV Steps)","Exposure Modes":"Aperture Priority, Manual, Program, Shutter Priority","External Flash Connection":"Hot shoe","File Format":"Still Images: JPEG, RAW\\n\\nMovies: AVCHD, MP4\\n\\nAudio: AAC, Dolby Digital 2ch","Filter Thread":"43mm","Flash Modes":"Auto, Auto/Red-Eye Reduction, First-Curtain Sync, Forced On, Forced On/Red-Eye Reduction Off, Second-Curtain Sync, Slow Sync, Slow Sync/Red-Eye Reduction","Focus Range":"Normal: 1.64’ to Infinity / 50 cm to Infinity\\n\\nWide: 1.18\\" to Infinity / 3 cm to Infinity\\n\\nTelephoto: 11.81\\" to Infinity / 30 cm to Infinity","Item Type":"Camera","Lens":"11 Elements in 8 Groups; 5 Aspherical\\n\\nEffective Focal Length: 10.9 to 34mm (35 mm Equivalent: 24 to 75mm)\\n\\nAperture: f/1.7 (W) to f/2.8 (T) to f/16 (T)","Maximum Resolution":"4736 × 3552","Maximum Video Resolution":"4K","Memory Type":"SD, SDHC, SDXC","Pixels":"Actual: 21.77 Megapixel\\nEffective: 17 Megapixel","Screen Type":"Touchscreen and Fixed","Self Timer":"2, 10 Sec","Sensor Size":"Micro 4/3","Sensor Type":"Micro 4/3","Shutter Speed":"Type: Mechanical\\nSpeed: 60 to 1/4000 Second\\n\\nType: Electronic\\nSpeed: 1 to 1/16000 Second\\n\\nType: Electronic\\nSpeed: 30 to 0 Minute in Time Mode\\n\\nType: Electronic\\nSpeed: 1/2 to 1/16000 Second in Movie Mode","Stabilization":"No","Video Clip Length":"Up to 29 minutes 59 seconds","Video Recording":"Yes, NTSC/PAL","Video Resolution":"3840 × 2160p: 30 fps, 25 fps, 24 fps\\n\\n1920 × 1080p: 60 fps, 50 fps, 30 fps, 25 fps, 24 fps\\n\\n1280 × 720p: 30 fps, 25 fps","Viewfinder":"Type  Electronic    Coverage   100%","Viewfinder Type":"Electronic","Weather Sealing":"No","White Balance":"Auto, Cloudy, Color Temperature, Daylight, Flash, Incandescent, Shade, White Set 1, White Set 2, White Set 3, White Set 4","Wi-Fi":"Yes, Wi-Fi 4 (802.11n) Built In","Wireless Connectivity":"Wi-Fi and Bluetooth","Zoom":"Optical: 3.1x\\n\\nIntelligent Zoom: 6.2x\\n\\nDigital: 4x\\n\\nExtra Optical Zoom (EZ): 4.3x\\n\\nExtra Optical Zoom (EZ): 6.2x"}', 'Leica
