Smart and Rugged. Crafted from aluminum and a fabric covering on the top, this unit also features foreign object detection and thermal protection to ensure safe charging. To support charging up to 3 devices at once, there is an included extra USB-A port.', 93000.0, '{"Brand":"Leica","General":"Wireless Charging PowerUp to 10 W Wireless Charging TechnologyQi Inputs/Outputs1 x USB-A Internal BatteryNone Cable Length6.6’","Item Type":"Power","Physical":"Material of ConstructionAluminum, Fabric Dimensions6.7 × 0.4 × 3.5″ Weight1.1 lb","Power Type":"Charger"}', 'Leica
