Cinematic Bokeh and Magnification. Each of the THALIA lenses boasts a fifteen-blade aperture that maintains a circular iris through all aperture stops. This produces an extremely pleasing cinematic bokeh effect in which out-of-focus elements of your shot maintain their structure. A magnificent 1:2 magnification captures immersive and detailed close-ups.', 2643000.0, '{"Angle of View":"52.4° (Super 65), 36.2° (Full Frame), 25.5° (Super 35)","Brand":"Leitz","Compatibility":"Full Frame","General":"Dimensions (ø x L)3.7 × 6.1″Weight3.6 lb.Gearing0.8 MOD270° FocusFront Lens Diameter95mm","Hood Included":"No","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Mount":"LPL","Lens Type":"Standard and Macro","Max Magnification":"0.5x","Mfr. Model Number":"11454-005","Min Focusing Distance":"11.8\\"","Optical Design":"Groups/ElementsN/AAperture Blades15Image Circle60mmFormat65mm"}', 'Leitz
