Center-Locking Focus. The Sol 45’s center-locking feature facilitates fast and easy focusing by letting you twist the lens into the lock position when your subject is in the center of the frame.

Dual Bokeh Blades. If you’re looking to add even more creative effects to your photos, you’re in luck. The Sol 45mm has two bokeh blades—each on its own hinged arm at the edge of the lens—which you can use to add subtle lines and textures to bokeh. Just bring the blades into the lens’s field of view and then rotate them horizontally, vertically, or diagonally to find the effect that suits you.', 61000.0, '{"Aperture Blades":"2","Brand":"Lensbaby","Dimensions":"2.9 × 1.5″ (ø x L)","Filter Size":"46.0mm","Filter Type":"Screw-On","Focal Length":"45-45","Focus Type":"Manual Focus Only","Groups/Elements":"2/3","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"Full-Frame","Lens Mount":"Sony E","Lens Type":"Specialty, Standard, Tilt-Shift, and For Mirrorless","Maximum Aperture":"3.5","Maximum Magnification":"0.17x","Mfr. Model Number":"LBS45X","Minimum Focusing Distance":"14\\"","Stabilization":"No","Tilt/Shift":"± 8.5° tilt","Weather Sealing":"No","Weight":"0.6 lb.","Zoom Type":"Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Lensbaby
Sol 45mm f/3.5 for
