Keepin’ It Tidy. Tangle-free cord management helps cords stay organized for the next use, while the cord-locking system keeps cords in place and secure. The extension cord reel features easy grip comfort handles for smooth rewind.', 79000.0, '{"Brand":"Link2Home","Cable Type":"Power","Color":"Orange","Connector":"AC Plug","Dimensions":"9.85 in. × 7.95 in. × 13.15 in.","Item Type":"Cable","Length":"50 ft","Maximum Amperage":"13 Amps","Voltage":"120 Volt","Weight":"10.65 lb."}', 'Link2Home 50-foot
