Included Lens Support. This rental includes a Tilta 15mm LWS Rod Lens Support that helps support the weight of heavy lenses when you’re using a 15mm rod support system.', 279000.0, '{"Brand":"MTF Services","Camera Mount":"Canon EF","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Mount":"B4","Lens Support Type":"Mount Adapter"}', 'Adapter
Tilta 15mm
Lens
