5-Inch Casters With Independent Locks. This dolly rides on three 5-inch casters with cable guards and individual wheel locks.

Folding Design. The dolly folds up to 25.5 inches in length, making it easy to transport and ship.

Tripod Not Included. This rental doesn’t include a tripod, but we rent lots of compatible options separately below:

