Ingenious Large-Format Tripod. Amp up the style in your studio with the Manfrotto 161MK2B Professional Video Tripod! Weight about. 17.5 pounds, this sturdy, aluminum tripod features a rigid mid-level spreader that won’t allow the 3-section legs to be accidentally knocked wider apart. All 3 legs of the 161MK2B are equipped with twist locks to secure their placement, allowing full control over locking force.

Dimensions at a Glance. At full extension, this tripod reaches 95-inches on its own, and just over 105-inches with the help of the self-geared locking center column. For low shots, it can reach down to about 17-inches, and when it’s ready to travel, closes down to 41-inches.', 454000.0, '{"Brand":"Manfrotto","Camera Support Type":"Tripod","Closed Length":"41.3\\"","Head Type":"3/8\\"-16 Male","Item Type":"Camera Support","Leg Sections":"3","Load Capacity":"44.1 lb","Material":"Aluminum","Maximum Height":"105.1\\"","Mfr. Model Number":"161MK2B","Minimum Height":"17.3\\"","Weight":"17.5 lb"}', 'Manfrotto 161MK2B
