INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2030, 3, 142, 'Manfrotto 290 Xtra Tripod/MH804 Head Kit', 'manfrotto-290-xtra-tripod-mh804-head-kit', 'This Manfrotto 290 Xtra Tripod/MH804 Head Kit is an aluminum tripod and pan-and-tilt head duo designed to hold up to 22 pounds of gear. Key features include:

67.5 inch max height with head attached
Retractable handles
Four leg angle positions
RC2 quick-release system

Aluminum 3-Leg Tripod. One of the two main components of this Manfrotto 290 Xtra Tripod/MH804 Head Kit is the 3-legged aluminum 290 Xtra Tripod. This tripod system can extend from it’s shortest height at 12 inches all the way to 63.2 inches, and each of the 3 legs are provided with convenient flip locks to secure the height you choose. Four adjustable leg angles open you to a variety of positioning options.

Pan-and-Tilt Head. The Manfrotto MH804 Head is a durable and lightweight pan-and-tilt head designed to support up to 22 pounds of gear. This tripod head provides you with a bubble level to ensure your gear is evenly mounted, and can be easily attached to support systems with a 3/8"-16 mount. As for pan/tilt functions, the MH804 can rotate 360°, tilt 90° forwards or 30° backwards, as well as 90° sideways for portrait orientation.

Handles and QR Plate. On the head, you’ll find two telescopic control handles that are used to adjust and lock in the pan and tilt. To ensure smooth control when working with heavier loads, the MH804 offers integrated counterbalance springs. We also include the compatible 200LT-PL Quick Release Plate, which hosts a 1/4"-20 mount to attach your gear to.', 121000.0, '{"Brand":"Manfrotto","Camera Support Type":"Tripod and Fluid Head","Center Column":"Center Column Sections1 Center Column Extension TypeRapid Lateral / 90-Degree Center ColumnNo","General":"Load Capacity22 lb Head Mount Type3/8\\"-16 Male Maximum Working Height63.2\\" Max Height without Center Column53.9\\" Minimum Working Height12\\" Closed Length\\t23.4\\" Diameter2.36\\" MaterialsAluminum Alloy Weight3.9 lb","Item Type":"Camera Support","Legs":"Leg Lock TypeFlip Lock Leg Positions4 Positions Independent Leg SpreadYes Leg Sections3"}', 'Manfrotto 290
Xtra
