Wherever You Go. Like most tripods, you can secure this on a dolly and roll through flat, indoor surfaces with ease. If you need stability in rougher, outdoor terrains, there are two spiked feet with rubber overshoes available for you! The legs feature an internal locking system that ensures your gear stays exactly how you positioned it.

100mm Bowl, 75mm Adapter. This tripod is topped off with a 100mm bowl, which is widely compatible with our inventory of fluid heads. We also include a 100m to 75mm bowl adapter for even broader compatibility. If you prefer a fluid head with a flat base, we have a 75mm bowl adapter available separately!', 164000.0, '{"Brand":"Manfrotto","Camera Support Type":"Tripod","Item Type":"Camera Support","Legs":"Head Mount Type100 mm Bowl Primary MaterialAluminum Leg Sections3 Foot FeaturesDual Spiked","Load Capacity":"55.0 lb.","Mfr. Model Number":"#MVTTWINMAUS","Physical":"Maximum Working Height60\\" Minimum Working Height23\\" Closed Length27\\" Spreader SupportMid-Level (Included) Weight7.2 lb","Weight":"7.8 lb."}', 'Manfrotto
