Telephoto Friendly. Ensure telephoto lens and camera safety with this Manfrotto Heavy Telephoto Lens Support w/ 357PLV Plate! Capable of securing up to 44.1 pounds, this support device allows you to tilt and lock your setup in place without fear of your gear toppling over.

Swing Into Action. This lens support features a swing with a 1/4"-20 camera/lens mount, and a frame with a 3/8"-16 tripod mount. When you push the swing away from you, your lens will capture everything above, and when you pull the swing towards you, your lens will capture lower-angle shots! The swing itself has three height settings, so it’ll work with most setups!', 100000.0, '{"Brand":"Manfrotto","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Support Type":"Support Bracket"}', 'Manfrotto 393
