Center Column. The redesigned center column can host accessories like an LED or reflector using the included Easy Link attachment. The column can be positioned horizontally, giving you the opportunity to shoot low angle or macro photography. The 3/8"-16 threaded tripod head now includes a bubble level that rotates 360° to ensure your camera is level from every direction.', 125000.0, '{"Brand":"Manfrotto","Camera Support Type":"Tripod","Center Column":"Center Column Sections1 Center Column Extension TypeRapid Lateral / 90-Degree Center ColumnYes","General":"Load Capacity\\t44 lb Head Mount Type3/8\\"-16 Male Maximum Working Height67\\" Max Height without Center Column55\\" Minimum Working Height3.5\\" Closed Length24\\" MaterialsAluminum Alloy Weight5.5 lb","Item Type":"Camera Support","Legs":"Leg Lock TypeFlip Lock Independent Leg SpreadYes Leg Sections3 Bubble LevelYes"}', 'MT055XPRO3
