11-lb. Capacity. The Manfrotto MVH500AH Fluid Head is rated to hold up to 11 lbs static weight, with the pre-set spring-loaded counterbalance supporting up to 5.3 lbs. This is perfect for small DSLRs, mirrorless cameras, and small camcorders.

Flat Base. With its 3/8"-16 threading, you can easily attach the MVH500AH to standard tripods. This also makes it a great choice for slider use.

Sliding Quick-Release System. The quick-release system enables more balancing options for front or back-heavy rigs. It features a secondary safety system to keep your camera secure. Both 1/4"-20 and 3/8"-16 screws are included for attaching a variety of cameras.

Spring-Loaded Counterbalance. With up to 5.3 lbs supported, the head provides -70°/+90° tilt range front to back.', 96000.0, '{"Brand":"Manfrotto","Camera Support Type":"Fluid Head","Fluid Head":"Type \\t\\tManfrotto MVH500AH  \\tCamera Mounting Plate \\t\\t500PL QR Plate \\t\\t¼-20 and ⅜ compatibility (screws included)  \\tPan Arm \\t\\t500HLV Pan Bar (1 included)  \\tFlat Base \\t\\t2.36” diameter \\t\\t⅜”-16 female tripod connection  \\t Capacity \\t\\tApproximately 11 lbs.  \\tSize \\t\\t4.13” working height \\t\\t1.98 lbs.","Item Type":"Camera Support"}', 'MVH500AH
