INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2101, 5, 150, 'Metabones Canon EF Lens to BMPCC4K Speed Booster T Ultra', 'metabones-canon-ef-lens-to-bmpcc4k-speed-booster-t-ultra', 'Metabones Canon EF to BMPCC4K Speed Booster T Ultra allows you to mount any full-frame Canon EF-mount lens to the Blackmagic Pocket Cinema Camera 4K. Key features include:

For the Blackmagic Pocket Cinema 4K Camera
Wider focal length and increased aperture
Electronic communication with the camera
Sturdy design with built-in tripod foot

Blackmagic Compatibility. While this adapter appears to be the same as the Metabones Canon EF to Micro 4/3 Speed Booster T Ultra, it is only compatible with Blackmagic cameras and has been specifically designed around the Blackmagic Pocket Cinema Camera 4K. Otherwise it retains its 0.71x focal-length increase, its 1-stop maximum-aperture increase, and its autofocus support on a wide variety of Canon EF-mount lenses.

Lens Compatibility. This adapter allows complete control over most EF-mount full-frame lenses from both Canon and third parties. Smooth Iris is supported with the latest Canon (2009+), Tamron (SP series 2013+) and Sigma (2016+) lens models as well as image stabilization for lenses that have that capability. For a more detailed list of compatible lenses please see the manufacturer’s site here or contact us.

Wider Focal Length and Increased Aperture. This version of the Speed Booster widens the mounted lens’s focal length by 0.71x, reducing the overall sensor-crop factor from 2.02x to 1.43×. It also increases the mounted lens’s maximum aperture by 1 stop.

Electronic Communication. The adapter’s mount has electric contacts that allow you to use compatible lenses’ autofocus, aperture-control, and image-stabilization functions. This adapter doesn’t require a separate power source for most lenses, and EXIF data is transferred and embedded into your footage.

Sturdy Design with Built-In Tripod Foot. The aluminum-alloy barrel, brass mounts and rubber gaskets give it a solid feel, with an Arca-Swiss compatible tripod foot that lets you mount the adapter itself directly to a tripod. The Arca-Swiss tripod foot has also been tailor made to match the height of the Blackmagic Pocket Cinema Camera 4K. This ensures the lens’s weight doesn’t put additional stress on the camera’s mount.

Designed Specifically for the BMPCC4K. Metabones has designed this product similar to its regular Micro 4/3 counterpart but the optics have been optimized for the filter stack thickness of 2.4mm found on the Blackmagic cameras, as opposed to the 4mm filter stack on other Micro 4/3 cameras. This adapter has been designed exclusively for Blackmagic Design Pocket Cinema Camera 4K and can’t be attached to any other Micro 4/3 cameras from Panasonic or Olympus. If you need the standard adapter, you can find it here.', 164000.0, '{"Brand":"Metabones","Camera Mount":"Micro 4/3","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Mount":"Canon EF","Lens Support Type":"Mount Adapter"}', 'Metabones
Canon
EF to
BMPCC4K
Speed
Booster
T
Ultra', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2102, 5, 150, 'Metabones Canon EF Lens to BMPCC4K Speed Booster T XL', 'metabones-canon-ef-lens-to-bmpcc4k-speed-booster-t-xl', 'Metabones Canon EF to BMPCC4K Speed Booster T XL allows you to mount any full-frame Canon EF-mount lens to the Blackmagic Pocket Cinema Camera 4K. Key features include:

For the Blackmagic Pocket Cinema 4K Camera
Wider focal length and increased aperture
Electronic communication with the camera
Sturdy design with built-in tripod foot

Blackmagic Compatibility. While this adapter appears to be the same as the Metabones Canon EF to Micro 4/3 Speedbooster T XL, it’s only compatible with Blackmagic cameras and has been specifically designed around the Blackmagic Pocket Cinema Camera 4K. Otherwise it retains its 0.64x focal-length increase, its 1 1/3-stop maximum-aperture increase, and its autofocus support on a wide variety of Canon EF-mount lenses.

Lens Compatibility. This adapter allows complete control over most EF-mount full-frame lenses from both Canon and third parties. Smooth Iris is supported with the latest Canon (2009+), Tamron (SP series 2013+) and Sigma (2016+) lens models as well as image stabilization for lenses that have that capability. For a more detailed list of compatible lenses please see the manufacturer’s site here or contact us.

Wider Focal Length and Increased Aperture. This version of the Speed Booster widens the mounted lens’s focal length by 0.64x, reducing the overall sensor-crop factor from 2.02x to 1.29×. It also increases the mounted lens’s maximum aperture by 1 1/3 stop to a maximum of f/0.8.

Electronic Communication. The adapter’s mount has electric contacts that allow you to use compatible lenses’ autofocus, aperture-control, and image-stabilization functions. This adapter doesn’t require a separate power source for most lenses, and EXIF data is transferred and embedded into your footage.

Sturdy Design with Built-In Tripod Foot. The aluminum-alloy barrel, brass mounts and rubber gaskets give it a solid feel, with an Arca-Swiss compatible tripod foot that lets you mount the adapter itself directly to a tripod. The Arca-Swiss tripod foot has also been tailor made to match the height of the Blackmagic Pocket Cinema Camera 4K. This ensures the lens’s weight doesn’t put additional stress on the camera’s mount.

Designed Specifically for the BMPCC4K. Metabones has designed this product similar to its regular Micro 4/3 counterpart but the optics have been optimized for the filter stack thickness of 2.4mm found on the Blackmagic cameras opposed to the 4mm filter stack on other Micro 4/3 cameras. This adapter has been designed exclusively for Blackmagic Design Pocket Cinema Camera 4K and can’t be attached to any other Micro 4/3 cameras from Panasonic or Olympus. If you need the standard adapter you can find it here.', 136000.0, '{"Brand":"Metabones","Camera Mount":"Micro 4/3","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Mount":"Canon EF","Lens Support Type":"Mount Adapter"}', 'Metabones
Canon
EF to
BMPCC4K
Speed
Booster
T
XL', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2103, 5, 150, 'Metabones Canon EF Lens to Canon RF Speed Booster T Ultra', 'metabones-canon-ef-lens-to-canon-rf-speed-booster-t-ultra', 'The Metabones Canon EF to Canon RF Speed Booster T Ultra allows you to mount any full-frame Canon EF-mount lens to Canon RF-mount cameras with a crop-factor when shooting in 4K. Key features include:

Canon EF lens to Canon RF body
Wider focal length and increased aperture
Electronic communication with the camera
Not compatible with Canon EOS R5/R6

Lens Compatibility. The Metabones Canon EF to Canon RF Speed Booster T Ultra allows full-frame Canon EF and third-party EF-mount lenses to be used on crop-frame RF-mount cameras like the Canon EOS R and EOS RP that can not shoot full-frame 4K video. This adapter does not support the Canon R5 or R6.

Camera Compatibility. This adapter offers limited autofocus, image stabilization, and aperture control with the RF-mount Canon EOS R and EOS RP cameras and Canon EF-mount lenses. For more information, you can check the manufacturer’s compatibility list here.

Wider Focal Length and Increased Aperture. This version of the Speed Booster widens the mounted lens’s focal length by 0.71x, reducing the Canon EOS R’s UHD 4K video capture crop factor from 1.75x to 1.24x and reducing the Canon EOS RP’s UHD 4K video capture crop factor from 1.63x to 1.15×. It also increases the mounted lens’s maximum aperture by 1 stop. This Speed Booster wasn’t designed for still capture, but it’ll work with a compatible camera set to APS-C mode. You can’t use this Speed Booster to capture 60p FHD video.

Electronic Communication. The adapter’s mount has electric contacts that allow you to use compatible lenses’ autofocus, aperture-control, and image-stabilization functions. For most lenses, the adapter doesn’t require a separate power source, and EXIF data is transferred and embedded into your footage.

Sturdy Design with Built-In Tripod Foot. The aluminum-alloy barrel and brass mounts give it a solid feel, with an Arca-Swiss compatible tripod foot that lets you mount the adapter itself directly to a tripod. This ensures the lens’s weight doesn’t put additional stress on the camera’s mount. Please note that you may need to remove the tripod foot for this adapter to lock into position on certain cameras.', 139000.0, '{"Brand":"Metabones","Camera Mount":"Canon RF","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Mount":"Canon EF","Lens Support Type":"Mount Adapter","Mfr. Model Number":"MBSPEF-EFR-BT1"}', 'Metabones
EF /
RF
Speed
Booster
T
Ultra
Front & rear caps
Lens pouch', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2104, 5, 150, 'Metabones Canon EF Lens to Fuji X-Mount T CINE Smart Adapter', 'metabones-canon-ef-lens-to-fuji-x-mount-t-cine-smart-adapter', 'The Metabones Canon EF to Fuji X T CINE Smart Adapter is a cinema-style electronic adapter that lets you mount Canon EF-mount lenses to Fuji X-mount cameras. Key features include:

32-bit processor
Electronic communication with the camera
Powered by the camera body
Supports phase- and contrast-detect autofocus

32-Bit Processor. The Metabones Canon EF to Fuji X T CINE Smart Adapter’s high-performance 32-bit processor allows it to support phase-detect and contrast-detect autofocus systems, and lets you control the aperture from the camera body. This adapter also supports smooth iris effects and five-axis image stabilization on select lenses.

Canon EF/EF-S Lens To Fuji X Camera. This adapter allows you to mount Canon EF-mount lenses to Fuji X-mount cameras and camcorders. It offers full-frame coverage.

Electronic Communication. This adapter’s programmable function button gives you quick access to frequently used settings and features. The adapter also offers electronic manual focusing, provides in-lens image stabilization, and transmits EXIF data to the camera.

Powered by the Camera Body. This adapter is powered by your camera body. It doesn’t require any additional power source.

Sturdy Design with Built-In Tripod Foot. This adapter’s brass and chromium build ensures durability. It includes a removable Arca-type tripod foot with a 1/4”-20 thread on its base for use with larger lenses. A weather-resistant rubber mount gasket protects your camera from the elements, while a built-in felt flocking prevents reflections.', 107000.0, '{"Brand":"Metabones","Camera Mount":"Fuji X","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Mount":"Canon EF","Lens Support Type":"Mount Adapter","Mfr. Model Number":"MBEF-X-BT2"}', 'Adapter
Adapter foot
Front & rear caps
Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2105, 5, 150, 'Metabones Canon EF Lens to Micro 4/3 Speed Booster T Ultra', 'metabones-canon-ef-lens-to-micro-4-3-speed-booster-t-ultra', 'The Metabones Canon EF to Micro 4/3 Speed Booster T Ultra allows you to mount any full-frame Canon EF-mount lens to Micro 4/3 cameras. Key features include:

Canon EF lens to Micro 4/3 body
Wider focal length and increased aperture
Electronic communication with the camera
Sturdy design with built-in tripod foot

What’s Different. What sets the Speed Booster T Ultra apart from the XL is its 0.71x focal-length increase, its 1-stop maximum-aperture increase, and its autofocus support on select lenses.

Lens Compatibility. The adapter allows full-frame Canon EF and third-party EF-mount lenses to be used on compatible Micro 4/3 cameras.

Camera Compatibility This adapter offers limited autofocus, image stabilization, and aperture control with select Micro 4/3 cameras and Canon EF mount lenses. For more information, you can check the manufacturer’s list here.

Wider Focal Length and Increased Aperture. This version of the Speed Booster widens the mounted lens’s focal length by 0.71x, reducing the overall sensor-crop factor 2x to 1.42×. It also increases the mounted lens’s maximum aperture by 1 stop.

Electronic Communication. The adapter’s mount has electric contacts that allow you to use compatible lenses’ autofocus, aperture-control, and image-stabilization functions. For use with most lenses, the adapter doesn’t require a separate power source, and EXIF data is transferred and embedded into your footage.

Sturdy Design with Built-In Tripod Foot. The aluminum-alloy barrel and brass mounts give it a solid feel, with an Arca-Swiss compatible tripod foot that lets you mount the adapter itself directly to a tripod. This ensures the lens’s weight doesn’t put additional stress on the camera’s mount.', 121000.0, '{"Brand":"Metabones","Camera Mount":"Micro 4/3","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Mount":"Canon EF","Lens Support Type":"Mount Adapter"}', 'EF /
M43
Speed
Booster
T
Ultra
Front & rear caps
