	52mm protective filter', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2128, 3, 154, 'Miller CX14 Combo Live 30 Pedestal (100mm)', 'miller-cx14-combo-live-30-pedestal-100mm', 'The Miller CX14 Combo Live 30 Pedestal (100mm) is a lightweight to medium-duty pedestal support system geared toward broadcast and studio use. Key features include:

Rated for 0 to 30.9 lb payloads
Pneumatic column & dolly combo
100mm half ball fluid head w/ 16-step counterbalance
Easy transport and simple assembly

Studio-Oriented Fluid-Head Tripod. With five steps of drag damping, the included Miller CX14 Fluid Head supports a wide range of horizontal and vertical drag for buttery smooth panning and tilting.

Dynamic Counterbalancing System. The sixteen-step dynamic counterbalancing system compensates for torques as the camera tilts, preventing the camera from inadvertently tipping and ensuring that it is positioned securely at any tilt angle.

Quick Release. The Miller CX14 Fluid Head features a side-load Miller 1205 Euro plate system, enabling quick removal. Additionally, plate offers approximately two and a half inches of sliding range for quick adjustments to balance.

Height Adjustable, Pneumatic Pedestal. The pedestal is anchored by an air-pressurized pneumatic column that allows for easy height adjustments. Dual-bearing wheel ensure smooth movement through studio environments with linear or dolly tracking position locks.

Some Assembly Required. Due to the size, weight, and risk of damage, this pedestal tripod system does not ship assembled. We include everything you need to assemble and pressurize the column but you’ll want to make sure you plan set up time accordingly.', 1964000.0, '{"Brand":"Miller","Camera Support Type":"Tripod, Fluid Head, and Dolly","Fluid Head":"Plate TypeSideload Miller 1205 Euro plateMounting Screws1/4\\"-20, 3/8\\"-16Plate Slide Range2.4\\"Base Mount100mm half ballDrag ControlPan/Tilt: 5-stepVertical Tilt+90° to -75°","Item Type":"Camera Support","Physical":"Weight52.3 lb (assembled)Pedestal Height31.8 to 54.1\\"Load Capacity0 to 30.9 lbs"}', 'Miller
