Cinematic Blue Flare Effect. The Moment 82mm CineFlare Blue Streak Filter adds anamorphic-esque blue flares to stills and video footage without the need for a specialty lens. It works with virtually any camera and lens combination, and you can fully rotate the filter ring to adjust the flare effect to any angle you desire. You can stack this filter with a Cinebloom filter for an ultra-dreamy look.

