High-Quality Optics and Design. This filter is constructed from Schott B270 glass for true-to-life color fidelity and clarity. Each of its glass surfaces is treated with a fifteen-layer oil-, static-, and scratch-resistant coating, which also combats reflections, ghosting, and other aberrations. The front ring has side knurling and lines representing different density values, which help you quickly and precisely mark your spot. By design, the front ring won’t rotate beyond the filter’s range of stop values.', 86000.0, '{"Brand":"Moment","Coatings":"Multi-Coating, Resistance Coating","Density":"1.8 (6-Stop) to 2.7 (9-Stop)","Filter Format":"Screw-On","Filter Type":"Neutral Density","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Support Type":"Filter","Material":"Filter: Glass\\nRing: Aluminum","Mfr. Model Number":"600-055"}', 'Moment 82mm filter
Case', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
