Dual-Streaming Support. These cables are capable of simultaneously delivering dual video streams to a single display.

Bi-Directional Cable. These are passive cables, so they don’t have signal-boosting microchips. This means you can use them without needing any additional power, and that you can plug either end into the source or recipient device.

