Bi-directional cable

Comprehensive Testing. Each of these Monoprice 8-foot Certified Premium Ultra Slim HDMI Male-Male cables is subject to comprehensive testing at an HDMI-authorized test center to ensure they meet the latest HDMI specs.

Super Thin. These ultra-slim cables by Monoprice provide the flexibility expected by modern productions.

4K Resolution and Uncompressed HD. These cables are capable of reliably transmitting a new generation of ultra-high resolution and uncompressed HD video signals.

Dual-Streaming Support. These cables are capable of simultaneously delivering dual video streams to a single display.

Bi-Directional Cable. These are passive cables, so they don’t have signal-boosting microchips. This means you can use them without needing any additional power, and that you can plug either end into the source or recipient device.

