USB charger', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2201, 3, 163, 'Moza Slypod Wireless Remote Controller', 'moza-slypod-wireless-remote-controller', 'The Moza Slypod Wireless Remote Controller is an optional accessory for Moza Slypod and Slypod E motorized sliders. Key features include:

Compatible with Moza Slypod and Slypod E
Intuitive remote with status display window
750mAh internal battery
49-foot wireless range

Wireless Control. The Moza Slypod Wireless Remote Controller is an external remote that can operate Slypod and Slypod Es from up to 49’ away. The backlit display provides an intuitive interface that allows you to cycle through four slider modes and the wheel gives you fine tuned control over slider movements.

Mounting Bracket. The remote features a simple clamp-style mounting bracket that is compatible with light stand and tripod leg tubes ranging from 15mm to 32mm in diameter.

Built-In Battery. The controller is powered by an internal 750mAh battery and charges over USB-C. Please note, while we do include a USB cable, we do not include a charging block. If you need a dedicated charging block, we recommend the ZILR 65W GaN 3-Port USB Type-C AC Wall Charger.', 54000.0, '{"Brand":"Moza","Camera Support Type":"Controller","Item Type":"Camera Support","Mfr. Model Number":"SPDA5"}', 'Moza
