	77mm protective filter
Lens pouch', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2223, 2, 167, 'Nikon 24-120mm f/4G ED AF-S VR', 'nikon-24-120mm-f-4g-ed-af-s-vr', 'The Nikon 24-120mm f/4G ED AF-S VR is a compact zoom in the perfect range for walk-around photography on both FX- and DX-sensor cameras. Key features include:

4-stop vibration reduction
Fast, nearly silent autofocus
Exceptionally smooth zoom ring
FX and DX compatible

Image Stabilization. Nikon’s VR II image-stabilization system allows photographers to work with shutter speeds up to four times slower than usual.

HIgh-Quality Optics. The lens contains two extra-low dispersion elements and three aspherical elements, as well as Nano crystal coatings to maximize image quality and minimize aberrations.

Additional Features. It has a nine-blade aperture ring for smooth out-of-focus highlights and a Silent Wave Motor for fast autofocus.', 246000.0, '{"Angle of View":"84 to 20.3 degrees","Brand":"Nikon","Dimensions":"Length: 4.1\\"","Filter Style":"Nonrotating","Filter Type":"Screw-On","Focus Type":"Autofocus","Focusing System":"Internal, Silent Wave motor, Full time manual","Groups/Elements":"13/17","Hood Included":"Yes","Hood Type":"HB-53","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"Full-Frame","Lens Mount":"Nikon F","Lens Type":"Wide Angle, Standard, and Telephoto","Maximum Aperture":"4.0","Maximum Magnification":"0.24x","Mfr. Model Number":"2193","Stabilization":"Yes","Weather Resistant":"Yes","Weight":"1.6 lb.","Zoom Method":"Front, barrel extends, nonrotating","Zoom Type":"Variable Focal Length"}', 'Hood
