	77mm protective filter
Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2252, 2, 167, 'Nikon 85mm f/1.8G AF-S', 'nikon-85mm-f-1-8g-af-s', 'The Nikon 85mm f/1.8G AF-S is a versatile, compact, fast-aperture lens for Nikon DSLRs and a great low-cost alternative to the Nikon 85mm f/1.4G AF-S. Key features include:

Excellent for portrait, indoor-sports, and street shooting
Fast, silent autofocus with full-time manual focus
FX and DX compatible
Great value

Excellent Image Quality in a Compact Build. The Nikon 85mm f/1.8G AF-S’s reduced size and weight make it easy to keep in your bag at all times, yet it still offers fantastic image quality. The f/1.8 aperture allows for smooth background blur and subject isolation, making this lens perfect for portraiture. It’s compatible with both FX and DX cameras, including those without autofocus motors in-camera (such as the D3100 and D5100).

Fast, Silent Autofocus. This lens has full-time manual focus for easy adjustment, as well as a dedicated AF/MF switch for quickly changing to full manual focus. It’s great for video as well, using Nikon’s Silent Wave Motor to provide fast, silent autofocus.', 111000.0, '{"Angle of View":"28.3 degrees","Brand":"Nikon","Dimensions":"Length: 2.9\\"","Filter Style":"Nonrotating front element","Flare Resistance":"Yes, has Nikon’s Super-Integrated Coating","Focusing System":"Internal, Silent Wave motor, A-F switch, FT manual","Groups/Elements":"9/9","Hood Included":"Yes","Hood Type":"HB-62","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Mount":"Nikon F","Lens Type":"Telephoto","Maximum Magnification":"0.12x","Mfr. Model Number":"2201","Weather Resistant":"No"}', 'Nikon 85mm
Front & rear caps
