Only compatible with the Nikon Z7 and Z6
Dual-slot design enables hot-swapping

More Power. The Nikon MB-N10 lets you use two additional EN-EL15b batteries to increase the battery life on your Z7 or Z6 by approximately 180%. One battery is in the camera, while the other two are in this grip. The dual-slot design means that you can hot-swap the batteries while you’re using the camera, which eliminates downtime over long shoots.

Need Additional Batteries? This rental includes one battery in addition to the battery that comes with the Z7 or Z6 camera you’re renting.', 93000.0, '{"Brand":"Nikon","Item Type":"Power","Power Type":"Battery and Battery Grip"}', 'Nikon
