Stepping Motor Autofocus System. This system uses a stepping motor for smooth, nearly silent performance that’s great for stills and video alike. You also get full-time manual focusing for precision adjustments, while the internal-focusing design means that the lens maintains its length during focusing.', 89000.0, '{"Brand":"Nikon","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Mount":"Nikon Z","Lens Type":"Wide Angle and Standard"}', 'Nikon
