INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2335, 2, 167, 'Nikon Z 24mm f/1.7 DX', 'nikon-z-24mm-f-1-7-dx', 'The Nikon Z 24mm f/1.7 DX is a versatile, compact wide-angle prime with a fast aperture that makes it great for shooting in low light. It’s for DX-format Nikon Z-mount cameras. Key features include:

Only for DX-format Nikon Z-mount cameras
Great for portraiture, street photography, and difficult light
Fast, nearly silent autofocus with full-time manual override
High-quality optical design; durable construction

Nikon Z System. The Nikon Z 24mm f/1.7 DX was designed specifically for DX-format cameras in Nikon’s Z-mount system, like the Nikon Z30, Z 50, and Zfc. Z-mount lenses only work with Z-mount cameras, and Z-mount cameras are only compatible with Z-mount lenses.

Fast Wide-Angle Prime. This lens’s 36mm-equivalent focal length is a popular choice for just about any type of photography. When combined with the fast f/1.7 aperture, this focal length is particularly great for street photography, portraiture, and shooting in difficult light. The aperture also gives you a high degree of subject/background isolation, while the seven rounded aperture blades help contribute to smooth bokeh.

High-Quality Optics. The Nikon 24mm f/1.7’s eight-group/nine-element optical design features two aspherical elements to promote sharpness and color rendering while limiting spherical aberrations and distortion. Nikon has applied a Super Integrated coating to the elements to combat ghosting and lens flare, even when you’re working in bright or backlit conditions.

Stepping Motor Autofocus System. The stepping motor allows for fast, silent, and smooth operation that’s optimized for video. Pairing a speedy AF system together with a continuous manual mechanism allows you to hit your focus with confidence, while the internal-focusing design means that the lens maintains its length during focusing. The 4.7-inch minimum focusing distance lets you get in close.

Durable Build. This lens’s durable, moisture-resistant construction means you can use it in adverse conditions without worry. The exposed elements have a fluorine coating to protect them from debris and smearing. A programmable control ring lets you adjust manual focus, aperture, or exposure compensation.', 86000.0, '{"Angle of View":"61°","Brand":"Nikon","General":"Dimensions (ø x L) – lens only2.8 × 1.6″ / 70 × 40mmWeight – lens only0.3 lb. / 136 g","Hood Included":"Yes","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Mount":"Nikon Z","Lens Type":"Wide Angle","Maximum Magnification":"0.19x","Mfr. Model Number":"20119","Optical Design":"Groups/Elements8/9Aspherical Elements2"}', 'Nikon
