INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2343, 2, 167, 'Nikon Z 35mm f/1.2 S', 'nikon-z-35mm-f-1-2-s', 'The Nikon Z 35mm f/1.2 S is an ultra-fast wide-angle prime designed for Nikon Z-mount cameras. Key features include:

Ultra-fast wide-angle-to-telephoto prime
Smooth, cinematic bokeh that’s great for portraits
Multi-Focus autofocus with dual stepping motors
Advanced optical design with multi-coated elements

Nikon Z System. The Nikon Z 35mm f/1.2 S was designed specifically for cameras in Nikon’s full-frame Z-mount system. Z-mount lenses only work with Z-mount cameras, and Z-mount cameras are only compatible with Z-mount lenses.

Ultra-Fast Wide-to-Telephoto Prime. The 35mm f/1.2 S’s focal length makes it great for event and documentary photography, and lifestyle and environmental portraiture. The extremely bright f/1.2 aperture offers extensive depth-of-field control when working with selective-focus techniques, and allows you to keep shooting even in very low light. Using a DX-mount camera? You’ll get a 53mm equivalent focal length.

Focus on Bokeh. This lens’s combination of wide-angle-to-telephoto focal length and f/1.2 maximum aperture enable you to pair ultra-sharp subjects with smooth, cinematic bokeh that has a superlative sense of depth.

Multi-Focus Autofocus System. This system uses two synchronized stepping autofocus motors to deliver fast, smooth, highly accurate, and nearly silent operation. You also get full-time manual focusing for precision adjustments, and the clickless control ring and ability to suppress focus breathing make it great for video capture. An 11.8-inch minimum focusing distance lets you get in close. Regardless of which focusing distance you’re using, the Multi-Focus System delivers razor-sharp clarity.

Advanced Optics. The 35mm’s fifteen-group/seventeen-element optical system includes one aspherical element and three extra-low dispersion elements for sharpness, clarity, and accurate color rendering. Meso Amorphous, ARNEO, and Nano Crystal coatings help keep ghosting, reflections, and flares at bay, while multiple elements include a Super Integrated Multicoating to further ensure consistent color accuracy.

Weather-Resistant Build, Intuitive Controls. This lens’s durable, moisture-resistant construction means you can use it in adverse conditions without worry. You can use the programmable control ring to adjust manual focus, aperture, or exposure compensation, and you can assign your preferred lens functions to the two customizable L-Fn buttons.', 507000.0, '{"Angle of View":"63°","Brand":"Nikon","Focus Type":"Autofocus","General":"Dimensions (ø x L)3.5 × 5.9″ / 90 × 150mmWeight2.3 lb. / 1060 g","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format Coverage":"Full-Frame","Lens Mount":"Nikon Z","Lens Type":"Wide Angle","Maximum Magnification":"0.2x","Mfr. Model Number":"20124","Minimum Aperture":"f/16","Minimum Focusing Distance":"11.8\\" / 30 cm","Optical Design":"Groups/Elements15/17Aspherical Elements1Extra-Low Dispersion Elements3Aperture Blades11, Rounded"}', 'Nikon
Z 35mm f/1.2
S
