Nikon Z System. The Nikon Z TC-1.4x Teleconverter was designed specifically for cameras and lenses in Nikon’s full-frame Z-mount system. It’s only compatible with Z-mount cameras and lenses.

40% Focal Length Increase. This teleconverter provides 40% more reach to compatible lenses with only one stop of light loss while retaining autofocus capability.

High-Quality Optics. The advanced, four-group/six-element optical design includes an aspherical element, which ensures minimal image degradation, while the durable, weather-resistant barrel and fluorine-coated front and rear elements enable use in harsh conditions.

Maintains Communication. This teleconverter retains full communication between the camera and the lens, enabling metering, autofocus, vibration reduction, and EXIF data transmission

