Wide Range, Tall Lengths. The OBSBOT Extendable Tripod, although initially made for the Tiny 4K AI-Powered PTZ 4K Webcam, can be used with a wide variety of small action cams, mirrorless cameras, and webcams that only need to have a 1/4"-20 mounting thread. This lightweight tabletop tripod pushes boundaries, and lengths, by extending from 7.8 inches to 30.7 feet using the extension bracket. It’s compact, but mighty.', 50000.0, '{"Brand":"OBSBOT","Camera Support Type":"Tripod","Compatibility":"OBSBOT Tiny","Item Type":"Camera Support","Mounting":"1 × 1/4\\"-20 Screw Mount","Physical":"ColorBlack Dimensions7.5 × 1.2 × 1.2″ Weight10.6 oz"}', 'OBSBOT
