	SanDisk SDXC 128GB Extreme Pro 200MB/s UHS-1 U3', 332000.0, '{"Brand":"OM SYSTEM","Camera Type":"Compact","Item Type":"Camera","Waterproof Depth Rating":"Without Housing: 50’With Housing: 147’"}', 'OM
