Rotating Arca-Style. Immerse yourself in precision macro focusing with this 7-inch Oben Macro Focusing Rail (Long)! Designed with a 360° rotating Arca-style plate that moves in 90° increments, your camera-to-subject focusing abilities become more seamless in comparison to handheld shooting. Its quick-release capabilities further ease your workflow.

Stranger Than Friction. Using the integrated folding drive crank, this rail moves your camera in precise millimeter increments, front-to-back or lateral. Adjustable friction control helps accommodate heavy lenses, delivering smooth movements for up to 22 pounds of gear.

Double Dovetail. Featuring Arca-type dovetail mounts on both the top and bottom, this aluminum-build rail is compatible with Arca-style ballheads and clamps. You can even set the rail up for tabletop use with the four removable rubber tips!

Stack ’Em High. With the companion Oben Macro Focusing Rail – Short, you can stack the rails to provide you with both X and Y axis movements. Want them both? Check out our Oben Macro Focusing Rail Kit!', 68000.0, '{"Brand":"Oben","Camera Support Type":"Baseplate","Color":"Black","Dimensions":"7 × 1.75″ (Without Feet) 7 × 2.5″ (With Feet) 6.3\\" (Travel Length)","Item Type":"Camera Support","Material":"Aluminum","Mfr. Model Number":"#FRM-7L","Mounting":"Top: 1x Arca-Type Dovetail Bottom: 1x Arca-Type Dovetail Bottom: 1x 3/8\\"-16 Female Thread with 1/4\\"-20 Bushing Adapter","Weight Capacity":"22 lb"}', 'Oben
