*Lens hood not included!', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2450, 2, 177, 'Olympus 14-42mm f/3.5-5.6 EZ', 'olympus-14-42mm-f-3-5-5-6-ez', 'The Olympus 14-42mm f/3.5-5.6 EZ is an ultra-compact kit lens designed for Micro 4/3 cameras. Key features include:

Great for all-purpose daylight shooting
Fast, nearly silent autofocus system
Compact, lightweight build
Excellent value

Wide to Short Tele Zoom. The 14-42mm offers a focal length equivalent to 28-84mm after sensor crop, making it a good all-purpose lens. The f/3.5-5.6 variable aperture doesn’t give much flexibility for low-light shooting, so you’ll probably want to only use it in outdoor daylight conditions.  For a newer version of this lens, check out the OM SYSTEM M.Zuiko Digital ED 14-42mm f/3.5-5.6 EZ.

MSC Focus and Electronic Zoom. The Movie-Stills-Compatible (MSC) autofocus system and electronic zoom provide fast, nearly silent performance that’s perfect for recording high-definition video without noise from the lens.

Optics and Build. This lens features three aspherical elements to reduce optical aberrations and distortion, one extra-low dispersion element to minimize chromatic aberrations, and one super-high refractive index element for uniform light transmission and increased sharpness. The compact, lightweight design allows the lens to fit nicely in your bag and won’t be a burden to carry around.', 121000.0, '{"Angle of View":"79° – 29°","Brand":"Olympus","Dimensions":"Length: 0.9\\"","Flare Resistance":"Minimal ghosting, minimal loss of contrast","Focusing System":"Internal, stepping motor, MSC","Groups/Elements":"7/8","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Mount":"Micro 4/3","Lens Type":"Wide Angle and Standard","Maximum Magnification":"0.23x","Mfr. Model Number":"V314070BU000","Weather Resistant":"No","Zoom Method":"Barrel extending, electronic"}', 'Olympus 14-42mm f/3.5-5.6
EZ
