*Lens hood not included!', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2453, 2, 177, 'Olympus 25mm f/1.2 ED PRO', 'olympus-25mm-f-1-2-ed-pro', 'The Olympus 25mm f/1.2 ED PRO is a normal-range lens designed for Micro 4/3 cameras. Key features include:

Thin depth of field for subject/background isolation
Versatile field of view
High-quality optics for sharp, accurate images
High-quality, weather-resistant build

Fast Aperture. The ultra-fast f/1.2 aperture provides flexibility to shoot in even the lowest of light. It also enables thin depth of field for subject/background isolation.

Normal Field of View. The 25mm lens on a Micro 4/3 sensor provides an almost 50mm focal length after crop. This offers a normal field of view that’s useful for just about any type of photography.

High-Quality Optics. This lens is features an incredibly complex optical construction. Its nineteen elements in fourteen groups include one Super ED element, two ED elements, three HR elements, one E-HR element and one aspherical element. This lens orchestra works together to control aberrations, making things sharp and clear while reducing color fringing.

High-Quality Build. The build quality matches the high-grade optics. The dust-, splash-, and freeze-proof design keeps you shooting without fear of poor working conditions. There’s a programmable L-Fn button for customization, a manual focus-clutch function, and a depth-of-field scale built onto the lens itself.', 221000.0, '{"Angle of View":"Full Frame: 47°","Brand":"Olympus","Dimensions":"Length: 3.43\\"","Flare Resistance":"Yes and Nano Surface Coating","Focusing System":"Internal focusing and nonrotating","Groups/Elements":"14/19","Hood Included":"Yes","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Mount":"Micro 4/3","Lens Type":"Standard","Maximum Magnification":"0.22x","Mfr. Model Number":"V311080BU000","Weather Resistant":"Yes"}', 'Olympus 25mm lens
