Short Tele / Portrait Length.  It has a 90mm-equivalent focal length in 35mm terms, making it a great portrait-length lens. Its fast, f/1.8 maximum aperture produces images with beautiful, shallow depth of field and is excellent for low-light shooting.

Movie & Still Compatible. The MSC autofocus system provides ultra-fast, nearly silent autofocus for stills and video.

High Quality Optics. The lens’s two extra-high refractive elements eliminate chromatic aberration, ghosting, and flare, giving stills and video excellent contrast and sharpness.', 82000.0, '{"Angle of View":"27 degrees","Brand":"Olympus","Dimensions":"Length: 2.2\\"","Filter Style":"nonrotating front element","Focusing System":"Internal, MSC AF","Groups/Elements":"8/9","Hood Included":"No","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Mount":"Micro 4/3","Lens Type":"Telephoto","Maximum Magnification":"0.11x","Mfr. Model Number":"V311030BU000","Minimum Aperture":"22.0","Weather Resistant":"No"}', '45mm f/1.8 lens
