RS232 7ft', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2483, 4, 197, 'PTZOptics Serial DB9 Male to Female Extender Cable (25ft)', 'ptzoptics-serial-db9-male-to-female-extender-cable-25ft', 'The PTZOptics Serial DB9 Male to Female Extender Cable (25ft) allows you to stretch your serial/VISCA cables over a longer distance, for control of a compatible camera like the PTZOptics 30X-NDI Live Streaming Broadcast Camera with the HuddleCamHD HC-JOY-G3 Serial PTZ Joystick. This serial DB9 Male to Female cables is plenum rated.', 43000.0, '{"Brand":"PTZOptics","Cable Type":"Control, Adapter, and Extender","Connector":"D-Sub","Item Type":"Cable","Length":"25.0’"}', 'Just the cable', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2484, 2, 183, 'Panasonic 100-300mm f/4-5.6 Power OIS II', 'panasonic-100-300mm-f-4-5-6-power-ois-ii', 'The Panasonic 100-300mm f/4-5.6 Power OIS II is a super telephoto zoom designed for the Micro 4/3 system. Key features include:

High-quality optics for sharp, clear images
200-600mm focal length (35mm equivalent)
Fast, accurate, and nearly silent autofocus system
POWER Optical Image Stabilization system

What’s Changed? This update to the original Panasonic 100-300mm f/4-5.6 OIS sees a new Power OIS system that adds compatibility with Panasonic’s cameras with 5-axis Dual IS / Dual IS II.  Additional changes include an autofocus system update for faster performance, smoother automatic exposure changes via new iris, and cosmetic changes to the barrel.

Super Telephoto Zoom. With a focal length equivalent to 200-600mm after crop factor, the Panasonic 100-300mm f/4-5.6 Power OIS II is great for sports, nature, and wildlife photography.

High-Quality Optics. The Leica influence shows in this lens’s optics. The 100-300 features one extra-low dispersion element to reduce chromatic and spherical aberrations throughout the zoom range while keeping your images clear and sharp. A Nano Surface Coating reduces ghosting and flare.

Linear Autofocus Motor. This lens’s linear motor provides fast, accurate, and nearly silent autofocus performance for still images and videos alike.

POWER Optical Image Stabilization. The in-lens stabilizer helps to minimize camera shake. Dual-IS compatibility with supported Panasonic cameras works in tandem with sensor stabilization to further eliminate camera shake.

High-Quality Build. The 100-300mm’s high-quality splash- and dustproof build gives you peace of mind when shooting in adverse conditions.', 204000.0, '{"Angle of View":"12° – 4.1°","Brand":"Panasonic","Dimensions":"Length: 4.96\\"","Groups/Elements":"12/17","Hood Included":"Yes","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Mount":"Micro 4/3","Lens Type":"Supertelephoto","Magnification":"0.21x","Mfr. Model Number":"H-FSA100300"}', 'Lens
Front & rear caps
Lens hood
	67mm protective filter
Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2485, 2, 183, 'Panasonic 12-35mm f/2.8 X Power OIS II', 'panasonic-12-35mm-f-2-8-x-power-ois-ii', 'The Panasonic 12-35mm f/2.8 X Power OIS II is a fast-aperture standard zoom designed for the Micro 4/3 system, and the predecessor to the Panasonic Leica 12-35mm f/2.8 ASPH Vario-Elmarit Power IOS. Key features include:

High-quality optics for sharp, clear images
24-70mm focal length (35mm equivalent)
Fast, accurate, and nearly silent autofocus system
POWER Optical Image Stabilization system

Fast-Aperture Standard Zoom. With a focal length equivalent to 24-70mm after crop factor, the Panasonic 12-35mm f/2.8 X Power OIS II is great for reportage and everyday photography.

High-Quality Optics. The Leica influence shows in this lens’s optics. The 12-35 features four aspherical elements and one extra-low dispersion element to drastically reduce chromatic and spherical aberrations throughout the zoom range while keeping your images clear and sharp. A Nano Surface Coating reduces ghosting and flare.

Linear Autofocus Motor. This lens’s linear motor provides fast, accurate, and nearly silent autofocus performance for still images and videos alike.

POWER Optical Image Stabilization. The in-lens stabilizer helps to minimize camera shake. Dual-IS compatibility with supported Panasonic cameras works in tandem with sensor stabilization to further eliminate camera shake.

High-Quality Build. The 12-35mm’s high-quality splash-, dust-, and freezeproof metal build gives you peace of mind when shooting in adverse conditions.', 204000.0, '{"Angle of View":"84° – 34°","Brand":"Panasonic","Groups/Elements":"9/14","Hood Included":"Yes","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Mount":"Micro 4/3","Lens Type":"Standard","Magnification":"0.17x","Mfr. Model Number":"H-HSA12035"}', 'Panasonic 12-35mm f/2.8
Front & rear caps
Lens hood
	58mm protective filter
Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2486, 2, 183, 'Panasonic 12-60mm f/3.5-5.6 Power OIS', 'panasonic-12-60mm-f-3-5-5-6-power-ois', 'The Panasonic 12-60mm f/3.5-5.6 Power OIS is a compact, normal-range zoom lens for Micro 4/3 cameras and camcorders. Key features include:

Excellent general-purpose travel zoom
Power Optical Image Stabilization system
Fast, silent autofocus
High-quality optics for sharp, clear images

Travel-Friendly Zoom. With a focal range equivalent to 24-120mm after sensor-crop factor, the Panasonic 12-60mm f/3.5-5.6 Power OIS is a great choice as a general-purpose travel zoom. The f/3.5-5.6 variable aperture won’t excel in dark conditions, but that’s not its intended use.

Power Optical Image Stabilization. In-lens stabilizer helps to minimize camera shake. Dual-IS compatibility with supported Panasonic cameras works in tandem with sensor stabilization to further eliminate camera shake.

Fast Autofocus. The inner focus drive system and stepping motor provides fast, silent performance when shooting still images and video.

Optics and Build. One extra-low dispersion element and three aspherical elements reduce optical aberrations while maximizing sharpness and clarity throughout the zoom range. The lens’s dust- and splash-proof construction gives you peace of mind when shooting in the elements.', 136000.0, '{"Angle of View":"4/3 Frame: 84.05° – 20.44°","Brand":"Panasonic","Dimensions":"Length: 2.6\\"","Focusing System":"Internal and stepping motor","Groups/Elements":"9/11","Hood Included":"Yes","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Mount":"Micro 4/3","Lens Type":"Wide Angle, Standard, and Telephoto","Maximum Magnification":"0.27x","Mfr. Model Number":"H-FS12060","Weather Resistant":"Yes","Zoom Method":"Barrel extending"}', 'Panasonic 12-60mm
Hood
Front & rear caps
	58mm protective filter
Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2487, 2, 183, 'Panasonic 14-140mm f/3.5-5.6 II ASPH Power OIS', 'panasonic-14-140mm-f-3-5-5-6-ii-asph-power-ois', 'The Panasonic 14-140mm f/3.5-5.6 II ASPH Power OIS is a versatile, durable wide-angle to telephoto zoom designed for Micro 4/3 cameras. Key features include:

Versatile wide-angle to telephoto zoom
High-quality optical formula for maximum sharpness
Fast, accurate, and nearly silent autofocus system
Built-in optical image stabilization

What’s Changed? Not much.  This updated version sees the addition of weather-sealing that the previous generation Panasonic 14-140mm f/3.5-5.6 OIS lacked.  However, as usual, take “weather-sealed” with a grain of salt with any lens.

Versatile All-in-One Zoom. The Panasonic 14-140mm f/3.5-5.6 II ASPH Power OIS’s versatile 28-280mm equivalent focal length range makes it a solid choice for a range of applications, from landscapes to portraiture. Its 11.8-inch minimum focusing distance and 0.25x maximum magnification make it great for capturing close-up subjects.

High-Quality Optical Design. The twelve-group/thirteen-element optical formula includes three aspherical elements and two extra-low dispersion elements to increase clarity and sharpness while reducing chromatic aberrations and distortion. Multi-coatings have been applied to the elements to combat flare and ghosting.

High-Speed Stepping Autofocus Motor. The stepping motor provides fast, accurate, nearly silent autofocus performance for still and video use. This autofocus system is compatible with Lumix cameras’ high-speed contrast-detection autofocus systems for speeds up to 240 fps.

Optical Image Stabilization. The in-lens stabilizer helps to combat camera shake, allowing you to shoot hand-held at slower shutter speeds.', 139000.0, '{"Angle of View":"75° to 8.8°","Aperture Blades":"7, Rounded","Brand":"Panasonic","Groups/Elements":"12/14","Hood Included":"Yes","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Mount":"Micro 4/3","Lens Type":"Wide Angle, Standard, and Telephoto","Maximum Magnification":"0.25x","Mfr. Model Number":"H-FSA14140"}', 'Panasonic 14-140mm f/3.5-5.6
II
