Stepping Autofocus System. Its stepping motor delivers fast, smooth, and nearly silent autofocus performance to benefit both still photograph and movie recording applications and is compatible with Lumix cameras’ contrast-detection focusing systems.

Sharp Optics. One ultra-high refractive index (UHR) element and two aspherical elements help to reduce chromatic aberrations and distortions for consistent edge-to-edge sharpness and illumination. This design also helps to maintain a compact overall form factor, measuring just two 2” in length and weighing 4.4 oz.', 86000.0, '{"Angle of View":"47º","Brand":"Panasonic","Dimensions":"Length: 2.05\\"","Focusing System":"Internal, stepping motor","Groups/Elements":"7/8","Hood Included":"Yes","Hood Type":"H-H025","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Mount":"Micro 4/3","Lens Type":"Standard","Maximum Magnification":"0.14x","Mfr. Part Number":"H-H025K","Weather Resistant":"No"}', '25mm f/1.7 lens
