High-Quality Optics. The Leica influence shows in this lens’s optics. The 35-100 features two extra-low dispersion elements and one ultra extra-low dispersion element to drastically reduce chromatic and spherical aberrations throughout the zoom range while keeping your images clear and sharp. A Nano Surface Coating reduces ghosting and flare.

