INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2509, 1, 183, 'Panasonic AG-CX370 4K Camcorder w/ NDI HX2 and Auto-Tracking', 'panasonic-ag-cx370-4k-camcorder-w-ndi-hx2-and-auto-tracking', 'The Panasonic AG-CX370 is a broadcast-optimized camcorder that improves on the AG-CX350. Key features include:

1" 15MP 4K UHD MOS Sensor
24.5-490mm f/2.8-4.5 20x optical zoom lens
Vertical video, 5-axis hybrid stabilization
Genlock, 12G-SDI

What’s Changed? The Panasonic AG-CX370 builds on the broadcast-focused AG-CX350 with a few higher-end upgrades to meet the demands of modern video production and live streaming. Key among those is a genlock input terminal for easy multi-camera syncing and 12G-SDI for uncompressed 4K out. While the prior camera offered a 3.5mm stereo jack that supported two-channel audio, this one supports four channels in addition to the standard dual XLR inputs. Lastly, the AG-CX370 is equipped with NDI HX2, which was designed to specifically tackle environments with poor network connections.

Optimized for Live Productions. With built-in NDI HX2 compatibility, the AG-CX370 supports video transmission and camera control over IP when paired with NDI-compatible devices, including switchers and decoders. Stream your content in UHD 4K and simultaneously record in 1080p using standard streaming protocols (you currently cannot stream in 4K while recording in 4K). Please note that simultaneous recording, streaming, and 4K output are not supported when using NDI HX2 mode. When not streaming, you can record uncompressed 4K out over SDI and HDMI at once. Broadcast-ready grading offers 16-axis color correction, skin detail, color temperature, and more. The AG-CX370 also features P2 MXF file format support for simultaneous main and proxy recording in V-Log and Hybrid Log.

Camcorder Convenient, Cinema Features. A fast and long-reaching built-in lens makes this camera pick-up-and-go convenient without giving up some core professional fittings. The lens has three-ring control for zoom, focus, and iris, along with a multistep lever on the handle for smooth zooming at slow speeds. This 24.5-490mm (equivalent) lens has minimal distortion and its i.Zoom technology supports up to 24x zoom in 4K and 32x in 1080p. Built-in hybrid stabilization gives you the option of hand-held shooting and the high-precision autofocus system performs auto-tracking with face detection. Monitoring your footage is easy with simultaneous LCD and EVF viewing and the 3:2 aspect ratio leaves room for timecode and camera status displays. Overall, the AG-CX370 is a great choice for run-and-gun projects, streaming and recording events, and documentary work.', 1204000.0, '{"Brand":"Panasonic","Camera Type":"Camcorder","Compatible Media":"SD","General":"Accessory Mounts2x cold shoesBattery TypePanasonic AG-VBR-seriesDimensions (W x H x D)7.1 × 6.8 × 12.2″Mfr. Model NumberAG-CX370 Monitor3.2\\" articulating touchscreenWeight4.2 lb.","Imaging":"ISOISO Range: 400-12,800Max ResolutionUHD 4K (3840 × 2160)ND FiltersBuilt-in (mechanical)Sensor15.03MP 1\\"-Type MOSShutterElectronic rollingStabilizationOptical, in lens","Inputs/Outputs":"Audio I/O1x 3.5mm headphone jack2x 3-pin XLR mic/lineOther I/O1x USB-C1x USB-A1x BNC (ref/TC)1x BNC (genlock)1x 2.5mm LANCEthernet (LAN, shared with NDI)Power I/O12V DC inputAG-VBR battery portStorage I/O2x SD UHS-II slotsVideo I/OHDMI Type-A1x BNC (12G-SDI)1x 3.5mm TRRS A/V (composite)1x Ethernet (NDI, shared with LAN)","Item Type":"Camera","Lens":"Filter Size67mmFocal Length8.8-176mm (24.5-490mm equivalent)Focus TypeAutofocus and Manual FocusMax Aperturef/2.8-4.5Min Focusing Distance3.9\\"Prime/ZoomZoom (20x optical, 32x digital HD, 24x digital 4K)","Maximum Video Resolution":"4K","Screen Type":"Touchscreen and Swivel","Sensor Size":"1-Inch","St