More Power. The Panasonic DMW-BG1 Battery Grip can be used with your Panasonic G9 II, S5 II, or S5 IIX camera for extended shooting times. This grip accepts one Panasonic DMW-BLK22, which is included with this rental, and can be charged with the separately available Panasonic DMW-BTC15 Charger.

