All-Weather Gear. This teleconverter’s weather-sealed construction reduces the chances of dust, water, or even the cold affecting performance.', 143000.0, '{"Brand":"Panasonic","Camera Mount":"Micro 4/3","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Mount":"Micro 4/3","Lens Support Type":"Teleconverter"}', 'Panasonic
