98p/25p/29.97p/50p/59.94p [100 Mb/s]\\n3840 × 2160 at 23.98p/25p/29.97p [72 Mb/s]\\n1920 × 1080 at 200p/239.76p [200 Mb/s]\\n1920 × 1080 at 100p/119.88p [150 Mb/s]\\n1920 × 1080 at 23.98p/24.00p/25p/29.97p/47.95p/50p/59.94p [100 Mb/s]\\n1920 × 1080 at 50p/59.94p [28 Mb/s]\\n1920 × 1080 at 25p/29.97p [20 Mb/s]\\n1920 × 1080 at 23.98p [24 Mb/s]","Interval Recording":"Yes","Item Type":"Camera","Material":"Magnesium Alloy","Maximum Sync Speed":"1/250 Second","Maximum Video Resolution":"5K","Memory Card Slot":"Slot 1: CFexpress Type B\\nSlot 2: SD/SDHC (UHS-II) [U3/V30 or Faster Recommended]","Metering Range":"0 to 18 EV","Mfr. Model Number":"DC-GH6BODY","Monitor Resolution":"1,840,000 Dot","Monitor Size":"3\\"","Operating Temperature":"14 to 104°F","Other I/O":"1x USB Type-C","Power I/O":"1x USB Type-C Input/Output","SSD Compatibility":"Samsung T5, SanDisk Extreme SSDs, and SanDisk Extreme PRO SSDs up to 2TB","Screen Type":"Touchscreen and Swivel","Self Timer":"2/3/10-Second Delay","Sensor Dimensions":"17.3 × 13mm (Four Thirds) MOS","Sensor Resolution":"Actual: 26.52 Megapixel\\nEffective: 25.2 Megapixel (5776 × 4336)","Sensor Size":"Micro 4/3","Shutter Speed":"Electronic Front Curtain Shutter\\n1/2000 to 60 Seconds\\nUp to 30 Minutes in Bulb Mode\\n\\nElectronic Shutter\\n1/32000 to 1 Second to 60 Seconds in Bulb Mode\\n1/25,000 to 1/8 Second in Movie Mode","Stabilization":"Yes","Still Image Resolution":"4:3 DCF / EXIF / JPEG / RAW\\n25.2 MP (5776 × 4336)\\n\\n3:2 DCF / EXIF / JPEG / RAW\\n5776 × 3848\\n\\n16:9 DCF / EXIF / JPEG / RAW\\n5776 × 3242\\n\\n1:1 DCF / EXIF / JPEG / RAW\\n 4336 × 4336","Tripod Mount":"1x 1/4\\"-20 Female","Video Formats":"NTSC/PAL","Video I/O":"1x HDMI Output","Video Recording Limit":"Unlimited for DCI 4K (4096 × 2160) at 59.94p (4:2:2 10-Bit)","Viewfinder Coverage":"100%","Viewfinder Eye Point":"21mm","Viewfinder Magnification":"Approx. 0.76x","Viewfinder Resolution":"3,680,000 Dot","Viewfinder Type":"Electronic","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Wh