POWER Optical Image Stabilization system

Wide to Short Telephoto Zoom. With a focal length equivalent to 24-120mm after crop factor, the Panasonic Leica 12-60mm f/2.8-4.0 Power OIS is great for landscapes, low-light indoor shooting, and everyday photography.

Optics. The Leica influence shows in this lens’s optics. The 12-60 features four aspherical elements and two extra-low dispersion elements to drastically reduce chromatic and spherical aberrations throughout the zoom range while keeping your images clear and sharp.

Linear Autofocus Motor. This lens’s linear motor provides fast, accurate, and nearly silent autofocus performance for still images and videos alike.

POWER Optical Image Stabilization. The in-lens stabilizer helps to minimize camera shake. Dual-IS compatibility with supported Panasonic cameras works in tandem with sensor stabilization to further eliminate camera shake.

High-Quality Build. The 12-60mm’s high-quality splash-, dust-, and freeze-proof metal build gives you peace of mind when shooting in adverse conditions.', 229000.0, '{"Angle of View":"84° to 20°","Brand":"Panasonic","Dimensions":"Length: 3.39\\"","Groups/Elements":"12/14","Hood Included":"No","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Mount":"Micro 4/3","Lens Type":"Wide Angle, Standard, and Telephoto","Magnification":"3x","Mfr. Model Number":"H-ES12060","Weight":"0.71"}', 'Lens
