INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2578, 1, 183, 'Panasonic Lumix BS1H Full-Frame Cinema Camera', 'panasonic-lumix-bs1h-full-frame-cinema-camera', 'The Panasonic Lumix BS1H Full-Frame Cinema Camera is a pro-grade box-style video-only camera for the L-mount system and an even more video focused counterpart of the DC-S1H. Key features include:

24.2 MP, full-frame MOS sensor with native L-Mount
Up to 5.9K H.264/H.265/HEVC recording to UHS-II SD cards
Dual Native ISO base sensitivity 100/640, extended ISO up to 51,200/204,800
Netflix approved camera

What’s In The Box? The DC-S1H is a hybrid photo/video mirrorless camera, and this Panasonic Lumix BS1H Full-Frame Cinema Camera comes equipped with all the same video features of the S1H, in a more compact, box-style camera housing that can be conveniently mounted on gimbals and hard to reach places. Please note, the BS1H does not have a built-in interface and will require an external monitoring solution in order to access camera settings.

PoE+, and Other Power Options. In addition to the included AC adapter, the BS1H can be powered by separately available batteries like the Panasonic AG-VBR118G High Capacity Battery, and you can pick up a dual charger here. The camera also supports Power-over-Ethernet, which allows for power and remote control for up to 12 BS1H cameras and streaming over a single cat6 or better cable.

24.2 MP, Full-Frame Sensor. The BS1H features a 24.2 MP full-frame sensor with a native ISO sensitivity up to 51,200. Using software, however, the camera can support dual native ISO 50 to 204,800, which extends the dynamic range in more shooting situations, especially when paired with the camera’s preinstalled V-Log L.

DCI 4K At 60 Frames Per Second. Options for DCI and UHD 4K are included here. The camera supports 4K/60p in 4:2:0 10-bit, and can even reach 6K and anamorphic 4K recording. High frame rate shooting is available at up to 240 fps in 1080p.

V-Log Installed. Panasonic did everyone a solid and decided to preinstall V-Log and V-Gamut on all copies of this camera, and it’s compatible with the “Cinema VariCam Look” as well. This provides an extremely flat gamma curve and image that’s capable of 14-stops of dynamic range for additional latitude when grading your footage. The BS1H supports outputting RAW over HDMI and video over SDI simultaneously.

Timecode In/Out.  BNC Timecode and Genlock ports allow for professional time code and sync options without the need for adapters. RJ45 Gigabit LAN also allows for network syncing.

Need a Memory Card? You’ll need an ultra-fast memory card for a camera this powerful, and we recommend the Sony 128GB SF-G Tough Series UHS-II SDXC. This camera can take full advantage of its superior 299 MB/s max write speed and 300 MB/s max read speed for high-resolution, high-bitrate capture.', 579000.0, '{"Brand":"Panasonic","Camera Mount":"L","Camera Type":"Cinema","Compatible Media":"SD","Imaging":"SensorType: Live MOSSize: 35.6 × 23.8 mmEffective Pixels24.2MPISODynamic Range: Up to 14 stopsDefault Sensitivity: 100 – 51,200Expanded Sensitivity: 80 – 204,800","Inputs/Outputs":"Audio InputsMic In (3.5mm stereo mini jack)Audio OutputsHeadphones Out (3.5mm stereo mini jack)Video OutputsHDMI Type-A3G-SDI BNCAdditional Inputs/OutputsRemote: 2.5mm LANCTimecode In/Out: BNCGenlock In: BNC, BBS signal / tri-level syncLAN: RJ-45 / PoE+USB: 3.1 GEN1 Type-C","Item Type":"Camera","Maximum Video Resolution":"4K","Physical":"Dimensions3.7 × 3.7 × 3.1″Weight1.3 lb","Sensor Size":"Full-Frame","Stabilization":"No","Video Format":"Resolution @ framrate4096 × 2160p at 23.98, 24, 25, 29.97 fps3840 × 2160p at 23.98, 24, 25, 29.97 fps3328 × 2496p at 23.98, 24, 25, 29.97 fps1920 × 1080p at 23.98, 24, 25, 29.97 fps","Weather Sealing":"No","Wireless Connectivity":"Wi-Fi and Bluetooth"}', 'LUMIX
BS1H camera
Camera body cap
AC adapter
Non-polarized cable', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2579, 1, 183, 'Panasonic Lumix DC-FZ1000 II', 'panasonic-lumix-dc-fz1000-ii', 'The Panasonic Lumix DC-FZ1000 II is a large-sensor, point-and-shoot bridge camera and an update to the original DMC-FZ1000. Key features include:

4K video and still capture
20.1MP 1-inch high-sensitivity MOS sensor
16x Leica DC Vario-Elmarit zoom
Built-in HYBRID OIS image stabilization

What’s Changed? Compared to its predecessor, the Panasonic Lumix DC-FZ1000 II features a higher-resolution rear LCD with added touchscreen functionality, easy USB charging, and Bluetooth support.

Large Sensor. The 20.1MP 1.0-inch high-sensitivity MOS sensor lets you capture high-quality images and video at higher ISOs. The large sensor and image processor come together to provide great high-speed performance, letting you shoot continuously at up to 12 fps with single-shot AF, 30 fps at 8MP in 4K PHOTO modes, and UHD 4K video recording at 30p. Its Level Shot function automatically detects horizontal lines within an image and keeps it level while you’re shooting.

16x Leica DC Vario-Elmarit Zoom. The integrated lens offers a 25-400mm f/2.8-4 equivalent focal length that covers the wide to super telephoto range. The relatively fast f/2.8-4 variable aperture gives you the flexibility to shoot in low light when needed, as well as limited subject/background isolation.

Five-Axis HYBRID Optical Image Stabilization. This optical image stabilizer offers correction on five different axes, making the somewhat limited f/4 aperture at 400mm much more useful.

4K Video. Rather than just including video to appease the masses, the FZ1000 II features class-leading 4K QFHD video capture at 30p with a high bit rate of 100Mbps in MP4 format. Additionally, it shoots Full HD 1080 video at 60p, 30p, 24p, or 60i in AVCHD. There’s a built-in stereo zoom mic for capturing in-camera AAC or Dolby audio, and a 3.5mm input for connecting an external mic. Please note that 4K capture requires the use of a UHS Speed Class 3 memory card, such as the SanDisk SDXC 256GB Extreme Pro 170MB/s UHS-1 U3.

4K Photo. The 4K PHOTO modes give you three options for taking 8MP stills at 30 fps: 4K Burst mode lets you continuously record the images for up to 15 minutes, giving you a fast frame rate to capture the best moment; 4K Pre-Burst mode records the images one second before and one second after you press the shutter button, giving you 60 frames to choose from; and 4K Burst mode lets you play back your video, pause it at any moment you choose, and pretty the shutter button to save the selected frame as a still. The 4K PHOTO modes also let you produce stromotion images, which combine sequential exposures into one frame for a dynamic look.

Light-Speed Autofocus. Bridge cameras aren’t typically known for their autofocus performance, but the FZ1000 II has a little help from the company’s flagship GH4. Not only does it use the same image processor as the GH4, but it also inherits the LUMIX DFD (Depth From Defocus) technology. This, in combination with the high speed linear AF motor, provides near-instantaneous focus with extreme accuracy.

Other Notable Features. The FZ1000 II offers two methods to compose and view images: the 0.39-inch 2.36k-dot OLED electronic viewfinder and the 3.0-inch 1.24m-dot free-angle rear touchscreen LCD. Both methods offer 100% framing accuracy and anti-reflective coatings for uninhibited performance in bright lighting conditions. Built-in Wi-Fi and Bluetooth connectivity enable wireless image transfer and remote operation with a smartphone, and there’s a wide variety of Creative Control, Scene, and Photo Style modes for in-camera capture. The included DMW-BLC12PP battery is rated for up to 250 shots per charge, while images and video are recorded to SDHC/XC memory cards.', 200000.0, '{"Aspect Ratio":"1:1, 3:2, 4:3, 16:9","Audio Recording":"Built-In Mic: With Video (Stereo)\\nOptional External Mic: With Video (Stereo)","Battery":"1x Rechargeable Lithium-Ion Battery Pack, 7.2 VDC, 1200 mAh","Brand":"Panasonic","Built-in Flash":"Yes","Camera Type":"Compact","Compatible Media":"SD","Connectivity":"HDMI D (Micro), USB 2.0 Micro-B","Continuous Shooting":"Up to 12 fps at 20.1 MP\\nUp to 7 fps at 20.3 MP\\nUp to 2 fps at 20.3 MP\\nUp to 30 fps at 8 MP","Dimensions":"W x H x D: 5.4″ × 3.8″ × 5.2″","Exposure Modes":"Modes: Aperture Priority, Manual, Program, Shutter Priority\\n\\nCompensation: -5 EV to +5 EV (in 1/3 EV Steps)","External Flash Connection":"Hot Shoe","File Format":"Still Images: JPEG, RAW\\nMovies: AVCHD 2.0, MP4\\nAudio: AAC, Dolby Digital 2ch","Flash Modes":"Auto\\nAuto/Red-Eye Reduction\\nFirst-Curtain Sync\\nForced On\\nForced On/Red-Eye Reduction\\nOff\\nSecond-Curtain Sync\\nSlow Sync\\nSlow Sync/Red-Eye Reduction","Focus Range":"Wide: 0.98’ to Infinity / 30 cm to Infinity\\n\\nTelephoto: 3.28’ to Infinity / 1 m to Infinity\\n\\nWide Macro: 1.18\\" to Infinity / 3 cm to Infinity","Interval Recording":"Yes","Item Type":"Camera","LCD":"3.0\\" LCD Rear Touchscreen Swivel (1,240,000 Pixels)","LCD Coverage":"100%","Lens":"Leica DC Vario-Elmarit, 15 Elements in 11 Groups\\n\\n5 Aspherical, 4 ED\\n\\nEffective Focal Length: 9.1 to 146mm (35 mm Equivalent: 27 to 432mm)\\n\\nAperture: f/2.8 (W) to f/4 (T) to f/11","Maximum Resolution":"4864 × 3648","Maximum Video Resolution":"4K","Pixels":"Actual: 20.9 Megapixel\\nEffective: 20.1 Megapixel","Screen Type":"Touchscreen and Swivel","Self Timer":"2, 10 Sec","Sensor":"1\\" MOS","Sensor Size":"1-Inch","Shutter Speed":"Type: Mechanical\\nSpeed: 60 to 1/4000 Second\\n\\nType: Electronic\\nSpeed: 1 to 1/16000 Second\\n120 to 0 Second in Bulb Mode","Stabilization":"Yes","Video Clip Length":"Up to 29 Minutes 59 Seconds","Video Recording":"Yes, NTSC","Video Resolution":"3840 × 2160p: 29.97 fps, 24 fps\\n\\n1920 × 1080p: 120 fps, 59.94 fps, 29.97 fps, 24 fps\\n\\n1920 × 1080i: 59.94 fps\\n\\n1280 × 720p: 30 fps","Viewfinder Coverage":"100%","Viewfinder Type":"Electronic","Weather Sealing":"No","White Balance":"Auto, Cloudy, Color Temperature, Daylight, Flash, Incandescent, Shade, White Set 1, White Set 2, White Set 3, White Set 4","Wi-Fi":"Yes, Wi-Fi 4 (802.11n) Built In","Wireless Connectivity":"Wi-Fi and Bluetooth","Zoom":"Optical: 16x\\nExtra Optical Zoom (EZ): 22.4x\\nExtra Optical Zoom (EZ): 32x\\nIntelligent Zoom: 32x\\nDigital: 4x"}', 'Panasonic
