INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2580, 1, 183, 'Panasonic Lumix DC-G100D', 'panasonic-lumix-dc-g100d', 'The Panasonic Lumix DC-G100D is a Micro 4/3 mount mirrorless camera with a feature set designed for multimedia content creators. Key features include:

Designed for vloggers and multimedia content creators
20.3MP Digital Live CMOS sensor and Venus Engine
Five-axis sensor-shift image stabilization
Nokia OZO audio with subject tracking

Made for Vloggers and Content Creators. The Panasonic Lumix DC-G100D has a range of specialized features designed for vloggers and other multimedia content creators. Its 3.0-inch vari-angle touchscreen LCD and Dedicated Video Selfie Mode make framing and taking selfies almost effortless; its five-axis sensor-shift image stabilization system compensates for camera shake when walking or moving; its 20.3MP MOS sensor and Venus engine produce crisp, detailed stills and UHD 4K30p video; its three built-in microphones capture optimized OZO audio with subject tracking; integrated Wi-Fi and Bluetooth let you quickly and easily share photos and videos, and control the camera; and its compact, lightweight design makes it ideal for shooting on the go.

20.3MP Digital Live CMOS Sensor and Venus Engine. This 20.3-megapixel Micro 4/3 sensor pairs with the updated Venus Engine to deliver sharp, detailed images with high sensitivity, low noise, accurate color reproduction, and quick response times. You get maximum resolution with minimum noise, with an ISO range that tops out at 25600.

UHD 4K Video. You can record UHD 4K video at 24p or 30p at a 100 Mbps bitrate with an 8-bit color depth and 4:2:0 sampling while recording internally. You can also record video externally via the micro-HDMI with 8-bit color depth and 4:2:2 sampling. The DC-G100D comes with V-Log L pre-installed, which will capture a flat, neutral gamma curve that’s well-suited for grading. A dedicated Video Selfie Mode optimizes depth of field and uses Face Detection AF and AE settings to highlight your main subject while also configuring the sound pickup range to best capture audio from your subject. You can use 4x and 2x slow-motion and 8x, 4x, and 2x quick-motion settings with Full HD recording, there are time-lapse and stop-motion video settings, and you get a 3.5mm input for capturing audio with an external mic.

Vlogging-Friendly UI. The DC-G100D’s updated UI was designed specifically for vloggers. Its REC Frame Indicator puts a red border around the image frame while you’re recording. You can use the Frame Marker overlay to highlight which portion of the frame will be displayed in a selected aspect ratio, making it a great tool for direct output to different social-media platforms.

Dual Image Stabilization. The G100D has a built-in five-axis hybrid image stabilization system to help keep your images clear and sharp when you’re walking, riding, or just working in low light. The in-camera stabilization can also be paired with select lens-based image stabilization systems to make sure your shots are steady and rock solid.

4K Photo Modes. While the DC-G100D is purpose-built for vlogging, it also includes three still-shooting modes that use its video-recording capability to capture 8MP stills at a 30fps shooting rate. Burst mode lets you continuously record, Pre-Burst mode records images one second before and one second after you press the shutter button so you get 60 frames to choose from, while Burst (S/S) mode lets you select the frame you want from recorded video footage.

Depth From Defocus Autofocus System. Depth From Defocus is a fancy way of saying the DC-G100D uses contrast detection to acquire focus in conditions down to -4EV. There’s subject-tracking continuous focus for keeping up with moving subjects and face/eye detection capabilities for making portraiture easier. You also get full-time manual-focus override.

Post Focus and Focus Stacking. Post Focus records images as 4K MP4 files at 30 fps and gives you a selection of focus ranges to choose from. During playback, you can use the touchscreen to tap the specific area of the image you want to be in focus, and the camera will create an 8MP JPEG. The Focus-Stacking feature generates images with different points of focus and combines them to produce an extended depth of field.

Nokia OZO Audio. The G100D incorporates Nokia’s OZO audio technology, which uses the three built-in mics to record spatial audio recording with improved richness and accuracy based on the location of the sound. You can manually or automatically configure the mics, and the Tracking setting works with the detected angle of view to deliver crystal-clear audio, making it great for selfie videos, interviews, and the like.

Viewfinder and Touchscreen. The large OLED live viewfinder has a 2.36m-dot resolution and 0.74x magnification that’s great for easy eye-level composition. You can use the 3.0-inch, 1.84m-dot rear touchscreen LCD for image composition, review, playback, and menu navigation. Its free-tilting and swiveling design lets you work from low and high angles, even when you’re shooting in vertical orientation, and you can set the camera’s Video Selfie Mode to automatically start once you rotate the screen forward.

Other Notable Features. Built-in Wi-Fi and Bluetooth connectivity enables wireless image transfer and remote camera operation, and a dedicated Send Images button on the camera’s top plate lets you instantly share images. The DC-G100D is powered by the DMW-BLG10 battery, which is rated for up to 270 shots per charge with the rear LCD, up to 250 shots per charge with the LVF, or roughly 900 shots per charge when you’re using Power Save LVF mode. You can charge the battery in-camera via USB or with AC power. The G100D records to SDHC/XC memory cards via its single card slot, and it fully supports U3 cards for 4K capture. The magnesium-alloy camera body is weather sealed against the elements.', 179000.0, '{"Brand":"Panasonic","Camera Mount":"Micro 4/3","Camera Type":"Mirrorless","Compatible Media":"SD","Environmental":"Operating Temperature32 to 104°F / 0 to 40°COperating Humidity10 to 80%","Exposure Control":"Shutter TypeMechanical Focal Plane Shutter, Electronic Rolling ShutterShutter Speed – Electronic Front Curtain Shutter1/500 to 60 SecondsShutter Speed – Electronic Shutter1/16000 to 1 Second1/16000 to 1/25 Second in Movie ModeBulb/Time ModeBulb Mode, Time ModeISO Sensitivity Range – Photo200 to 25,600 (Extended: 100 to 25,600)ISO Sensitivity Range – Video200 to 6400Metering MethodCenter-Weighted Average, Multiple, SpotPrecise Scan-Rate ControlNoExposure ModesAperture Priority, Auto, Manual, Program, Shutter PriorityWhite-Balance PresetsAuto, Cloudy, Color Temperature, Daylight, Flash, Incandescent, Shade, White Set 1, White Set 2, White Set 3, White Set 4Continuous Shooting – Electronic ShutterUp to 10 fps for up to 20 Frames (RAW) / 480 Frames (JPEG)Interval RecordingYesSelf-Timer2/10-Second Delay","Flash":"Built-In Flash/LightYes, Flash OnlyMaximum Sync Speed1/50 SecondDedicated Flash SystemTTLExternal Flash ConnectionShoe Mount","Focus":"Focus TypeAuto and Manual FocusFocus ModesAutomatic, Continuous-Servo AF, Flexible, Manual FocusAutofocus PointsContrast Detection: 49","General":"Battery Type1x DMW-BLG10PP Rechargeable Lithium-Ion, 7.2 VDC, 1025 mAh (Approx. 270 Shots)Shoe Mount1x Hot ShoeTripod Mounting Thread1x 1/4\\"-20 Female (Bottom)Dimensions (W x H x D)4.55 × 3.25 × 2.13″ / 115.6 × 82.5 × 54.2mm (Without Protrusions)Weight0.7 lb. / 12.42 oz / 352 g (With Battery, Recording Media)","Imaging":"Sensor ResolutionActual: 21.77 MegapixelEffective: 20.3 Megapixel (5184 × 3888)Sensor Dimensions17.3 × 13mm (Four Thirds) MOSSensor Crop (35mm Equivalent)Crop Factor: 2xImage StabilizationDigital, 5-AxisBuilt-In ND FilterNoCapture TypeStills & Video","Interface":"Media/Memory Card Slot1x SD/SDHC/SDXC (UHS-II)Video I/O1x Micro-HDMI (Unspecified Signal) OutputAudio I/O1x 1/8\\" / 3.5mm TRS Stereo Microphone InputPower I/O1x USB-C Input/OutputOther I/O1x USB-C Input/Output (Shared with Power Input)WirelessWi-Fi 4 (802.11n), Bluetooth 4.2Mobile App CompatibleYes: Android & iOSApp Name: Panasonic LUMIX SyncFunctionality: Access Stored Files, Remote ControlGlobal Positioning (GPS, GLONASS, etc.)GPS, via connected smartphone","Item Type":"Camera","Maximum Video Resolution":"4K","Mfr. Model Number":"DC-G100DKK","Monitor":"Display Size3.0\\"Resolution1,840,000 DotDisplay TypeArticulating Touchscreen LCD","Screen Type":"Touchscreen and Swivel","Sensor Size":"Micro 4/3","Stabilization":"Yes","Video Capture":"Internal Recording Modes – MP4 4:2:0 8-BitUHD 4K (3840 × 2160) at 23.98/29.97 fps1920 × 1080p at 29.97/59.94 fpsExternal Recording Modes – 4:2:2 8-Bit via HDMI1920 × 1080Fast-/Slow-Motion SupportYesRecording LimitUp to 10 Minutes in 4KUp to 30 Minutes in 1080pBroadcast OutputNTSCIP StreamingNoBuilt-In Microphone TypeStereoAudio RecordingAAC Audio","Viewfinder":"TypeBuilt-In Electronic (OLED)Resolution2,360,000 DotEye Point20mmCoverage100%MagnificationApprox. 0.74x","Viewfinder Type":"Electronic","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Wireless Connectivity":"Wi-Fi and Bluetooth"}', 'Panasonic
