.2 MP (5328 × 4000)24.2 MP (3792 × 2848)24.2 MP (2688 × 2016)Image Sizes (16:9)96 MP (12,000 × 6736) *Via In-Camera Pixel-Shift96 MP (8496 × 4784) *Via In-Camera Pixel-Shift24.2 MP (6000 × 3368)24.2 MP (4272 × 2400)24.2 MP (3024 × 1704)Image Sizes (1:1)96 MP (8000 × 8000) *Via In-Camera Pixel-Shift96 MP (5664 × 5664) *Via In-Camera Pixel-Shift24.2 MP (4000 × 4000)24.2 MP (2848 × 2848)24.2 MP (2016 × 2016)Image Sizes (65:24)24.2 MP (6000 × 2208)Image Sizes (2:1)24.2 MP (6000 × 3000)Aspect Ratio1:1, 2:1, 3:2, 4:3, 16:9, 65:24Image File FormatJPEG, RAWBit Depth14-Bit","Video Capture":"Internal Recording Modes (H.264/H.265/MOV/MPEG-4 AVC 4:2:2/4:2:0 8/10-Bit)5952 × 3968 at 23.98/24.00/25/29.97 fps [200 Mb/s]5952 × 3136 at 23.98/24.00/25/29.97 fps [200 Mb/s]5888 × 3312 at 23.98/24.00/25/29.97 fps [200 Mb/s]4096 × 2160 at 23.98/24.00/25/29.97 fps [150 Mb/s]3840 × 2160 at 23.98/24.00/25/29.97 fps [72 to 150 Mb/s]1920 × 1080 at 23.98/24.00/25/29.97/47.95/48.00/50/59.94/100/ fps [20 to 150 Mb/s]External Recording Modes (12-Bit via HDMI)5888 × 3312 at 23.98/25/29.97 fpsSensor Crop Modes (Super35/APS-C)4096 × 21603840 × 21603328 × 24961920 × 1080Fast-/Slow-Motion SupportYesGamma CurvePanasonic V-Gamut, V-LogRecording LimitNoneBroadcast OutputNTSC/PALIP StreamingNoneBuilt-In Microphone TypeStereoAudio RecordingMOV: 2-Channel 24-Bit 48 kHz LPCM AudioMP4: 2-Channel 16-Bit 48 kHz AAC Audio","Viewfinder":"TypeBuilt-In Electronic (OLED)Resolution3,680,000 DotEye Point21mmCoverage100%MagnificationApprox. 0.78xDiopter Adjustment-4 to +2","Viewfinder Type":"Electronic","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Wireless Connectivity":"Wi-Fi and Bluetooth"}', 'Panasonic
