INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2611, 3, 186, 'Peak Design Action Camera P.O.V. Kit', 'peak-design-action-camera-p-o-v-kit', 'The Peak Design Action Camera P.O.V. Kit works with the separately available Capture Clip to offer secure action camera body or backpack mounting. Key features include:

Hands-free POV shooting
Full pan and tilt positioning
Supports 1/4"-20 point-and-shoot cameras
Requires Peak Design Capture Clip

Hands-Free Action. Working in tandem with the separately available Capture Clip, the The Peak Design Action Camera P.O.V. Kit offers a versatile solution for action camera & point-and-shoot camera mounting. This kit offers full rotational flexibility while maintaining secure and stabilized hands-free shooting, no matter the weather.

Only for Action and Compact. The plate and mounts included with this kit are specially designed to support lightweight action cameras that are equipped with standard folding finger mounts & compact point-and-shoot cameras equipped with a 1/4-20" thread. The adapter plate starts as the base of this kit, and attaches directly to the Capture Clip. From there, you’ll attach the 1/4-20" point-and-shoot camera plate or the J-arm for action cameras using the appropriate-sized connection screw.

Stable, Breezy, Easy. The included stabilization pad helps you capture that smooth and stable footage you find when using off-the-body action camera stabilizers. Additionally, the adapter plate features a twist-lock screw that ensures your gear stays exactly where it’s positioned.', 36000.0, '{"Brand":"Peak Design","Camera Support Type":"Baseplate and Accessory Kit","Item Type":"Camera Support"}', 'Peak
