INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2614, 3, 186, 'Peak Design Carbon Fiber Travel Tripod', 'peak-design-carbon-fiber-travel-tripod', 'The Peak Design Carbon Fiber Travel Tripod delivers astounding stability and ergonomic design yet weighs less than 3 lbs and packs down to the diameter of a water bottle. Key features include:

Extends to 60 inches; breaks down to just 15.5 inches
20-lb. weight capacity
Built to last
Ergonomic ball head with adjustment and locking rings

Beautifully designed travel tripod. A ground-up redesign of the traditional tripod, the Peak Design Travel Tripod is the result of 4 years of engineering, creating a tripod that packs down to the diameter of a water bottle without compromising height, stability, or features.  The unique design allows quicker, easier setups and takedowns. The legs deploy in seconds, without having to flip over like traditional travel tripod legs, and the five-section aluminum leg cams can be released at the same time.

20-lb. Weight Capacity.  Optimized for a full-frame camera and common telephoto zooms, this travel tripod boasts an impressive 20lb weight capacity.  The question of a tripod’s “weight capacity” or “weight rating” has no simple answer. The exact gear limit is highly dependent on the external conditions such as wind, and technique, but we can say it will safely hold commonly used professional camera gear (like a full-frame DSLR and a 70-200 lens).

Built To Last. This travel tripod’s lightweight carbon fiber construction is designed to withstand heavy use in extreme environments and conditions. The carbon fiber tubes have to be custom made to the odd shape of the legs and this adds significantly to complexity and expense of producing this tripod, but also to minimize the negative space left between the tubes.

Ergonomic Ball Head. Epitomizing the expression less is more, this ball head replaces cumbersome knobs and levers with space-saving locking and adjustment rings. The rings facilitate omnidirectional movements that are locked in place with a simple twist. The center column can be inverted allowing this tripod to also function as a copy stand. There’s a mobile mount that hides away in the Travel Tripod’s center column for easy accessibility. Pull and twist the G-hook at the bottom to release or stow—it’s held inside by a magnet so it won’t fall out.', 246000.0, '{"Brand":"Peak Design","Camera Support Type":"Tripod","Diameter":"3.125\\" / 7.9 cm","Item Type":"Camera Support","Leg Sections":"5","Load Capacity":"20.0 lb.","Material":"Carbon Fiber","Maximum Height":"60\\" / 152.4 cm","Minimum Height":"5.5\\" / 14 cm","Volume":"72.0 cu. in. (1.2 liters)","Weight":"2.8 lb."}', 'Tripod
