Clamp, Clip, Go. With its rotating, two-piece, clamp-style design, this clip can attach to any straps up to 2.5-inches wide & 0.87-inches thick. This includes belts, harness straps, and the small, integrated straps you can find on a variety of Peak Design carrying options! The clip uses two thumbscrews to loosen and tighten the two components, and is equipped with an anti-slip pad for extra stability and security.

