	58mm protective filter
Lens pouch', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2647, 2, 188, 'Pentax SMC FA 50mm f/1.4', 'pentax-smc-fa-50mm-f-1-4', 'The Pentax SMC FA 50mm f/1.4 is a fast-aperture prime lens for Pentax K-mount cameras. Key features include:

75mm-equivalent focal length on an APS-C DSLR
Great for portraiture and low-light event photography
Quick autofocus
Compact build

Fast-Aperture Short Tele. When mounted to an APS-C DSLR, the Pentax SMC FA 50mm f/1.4 provides a 75mm-equivalent focal length, an excellent choice for portraiture, low-light event photography, and any other shooting conditions under which you need a fast-aperture short tele.

Fast Autofocus, Compact Build. This lens offers relatively snappy autofocus in a compact size that makes it easy to keep in your bag at all times.', 71000.0, '{"Angle of View":"47°","Brand":"Pentax","Compatibility":"Crop","Dimensions":"Length: 1.5\\"","Filter Style":"non-rotating front element","Focusing System":"Extending front (non-rotating),","Groups/Elements":"6/7","Hood Included":"No","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Mount":"Pentax K","Lens Type":"Telephoto","Maximum Magnification":"0.15x","Mfr. Model Number":"20817","Weather Resistant":"No"}', 'Pentax 50mm lens
