Canon 35mm f/1.4L II
Canon 50mm f/1.2L
Canon 85mm f/1.2L II

The 35mm is great for full-body environmental portraits, while the 50mm is superb for short-portrait work. And the 85mm is arguably one of the best portrait lenses ever made. It’s incredibly sharp even wide open, and its wide aperture blurs the out-of-focus background beautifully.', 904000.0, '{"Brand":"Canon","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Mount":"Canon EF","Lens Type":"Standard and Kit"}', 'Canon 35mm f/1.4L
