The 35mm is great for full-body environmental portraits, while the 50mm is superb for short-portrait work. And the 85mm is arguably one of the best portrait lenses ever made. It’s incredibly sharp even wide open, and its wide aperture blurs the out-of-focus background beautifully.', 639000.0, '{"Brand":"Nikon","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Mount":"Nikon F","Lens Type":"Standard"}', 'Nikon 35 f/1.4G
