INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2657, 2, 219, 'Portrait Lens Package for Sony FE', 'portrait-lens-package-for-sony-fe', 'The Portrait Lens Package for Sony FE makes all those senior sessions, engagement photos, modeling shoots, and other portrait sessions no problem. This package includes:

Sony FE 35mm f/1.4 GM
	Sony FE 50mm f/1.4 GM
	Sony FE 85mm f/1.4 GM

Sony FE 35mm f/1.4 GM. When used on a full-frame camera, this lens provides a wide-angle focal length that’s excellent for street, landscape, and documentary photography. The fast f/1.4 aperture is great for low-light shooting and subject-background isolation, and the rounded eleven-blade diaphragm gives images smooth out-of-focus areas when you desire a shallow depth of field. Using an APS-C camera? You’ll get a 52.5mm focal length.

Sony FE 50mm f/1.4 GM. The  Sony FE 50mm f/1.4 GM offers incredible features suitable for both video and photo shoots. This lens sets itself apart from other 50mm lenses, offering an incredibly fast f/1.4 aperture while maintaining a compact and lightweight nature. Like its predecessor, the FE 50mm f/1.4 ZA, this lens still features the signature bokeh, but similarities stop there. New features include an iris lock switch to prevent the aperture ring from being accidentally moved, an easy-to-read aperture ring with f-stop engraving, and two focus hold buttons for landscape and portrait shots.

Sony FE 85mm f/1.4 GM. The FE 85 GM uses one “XA” extreme aspherical element and three extra-low dispersion elements to minimize spherical and chromatic aberrations, and to produce clear, high-contrast images. The rounded eleven-blade aperture diaphragm produces smooth out-of-focus highlights when you desire a shallow depth of field.', 800000.0, '{"Brand":"Sony","Filter Type":"Screw-On","Focus Type":"Autofocus","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"Full-Frame","Lens Mount":"Sony E","Lens Type":"Standard, Kit, and For Mirrorless","Maximum Aperture":"1.4","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Zoom Type":"Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Sony
FE 35mm f/1.4
GM
