Slide-out mechanism for easy access to cable inputs
Perfect for small DSLRs and mirrorless cameras
Arca-Swiss type connection for broad tripod compatibility

Two-Piece Design. The ProMediaGear 3-inch Universal L-Bracket’s two-piece design lets you remove the vertical piece when you don’t need it, so you can just use the baseplate. The slide-out mechanism with hardened steel rods gives you the flexibility to access cable inputs.

Wide Compatibility. This bracket is perfect for use with small DSLRs and mirrorless cameras. The standard Arca-Swiss type connection makes the plate fully compatible with Arca-Swiss, Kirk, Markins, Really Right Stuff, Induro/Benro, and Wimberley tripod heads. Please note that it’s not compatible with Giottos tripod heads.', 79000.0, '{"Brand":"ProMediaGear","Camera Support Type":"Baseplate","Item Type":"Camera Support"}', 'PLX3
