INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2663, 3, 195, 'ProMediaGear Motor Control System for PMG-DUO Sliders', 'promediagear-motor-control-system-for-pmg-duo-sliders', 'The ProMediaGear Motor Control System for PMG-DUO Sliders is an inexpensive way to add motion control to any shoot. Key features include:

Designed specifically for ProMediaGear sliders
Time-lapse, looping, and linear motion modes
Easy to set up and use
Uses AA batteries

Three Motion Modes. The ProMediaGear Motor Control System for PMG-DUO Sliders gives you the flexibility of three different motion modes: time-lapse, looping, and linear.

Simplicity. Don’t worry about cumbersome components and cabling causing you long setup times. This is our easiest motion-control system to learn and use.

May Require Shutter Release Cable. Depending on your desired mode, you may also need an appropriate 2.5mm shutter release cable for your camera of choice.  To avoid making you pay and sort through a bag of unnecessary cables, we rent all of these separately by camera system. You can find a full list of available options in the Q&A section and / or recommended list on the left-hand side of this page.

Power. The controller uses three AA batteries that you can buy just about anywhere.', 196000.0, '{"Brand":"ProMediaGear","Camera Support Type":"Slider","Item Type":"Camera Support"}', 'Handheld
