Heavy Weight Champ. The Proaim Big Multi-Angle Levelling Wedge Plate guarantees a steady shot with extreme tilt angles for heavier cameras. This plate safely holds up to 44 pounds and features a bubble level to ensure a uniform balance. You’ll find locking mechanisms on both sides that unlock to enable the extreme tilt function up to 90°, and will securely relock at any tilt angle you choose. You’ll mount your camera via the 1/4"-20 and 3/8"-16 screws, but there’s multiple non-threaded mounting points located on this plate.', 71000.0, '{"Brand":"Proaim","Camera Mount":"1/4\\"-20 and 3/8\\"-16 Screws","Camera Support Type":"Baseplate","Dimensions":"8.7 × 4.3″","Item Type":"Camera Support","Material":"Aluminum","Payload":"44 lb","Tripod Mounting Thread":"1/4\\"-20 and 3/8\\"-16"}', 'Proaim
