Dual Charging Solution. The RED DIGITAL CINEMA Compact Dual V-Mount Battery Charger can fully charge up to two REDvolt Micro V-Mount Batteries in under five hours. This vertical charger features simultaneous charging at a rate of 3A. If you have specific compatibility concerns, please contact us.', 86000.0, '{"Brand":"RED","Charge Time":"2 – 98 Wh batteries in under 5 hours","Item Type":"Power","Physical":"Dimensions5.5 × 4.5 × 3″Weight1 lb","Power Type":"Charger"}', 'Compact
Dual
