Enables use of matte boxes, lens supports, and FIZ motors
1/4"-20 & 3/8"-16 camera screws

Optical Heightening. Increase your optical height and add 15mm rod accessories to your KOMODO or KOMODO-X with this RED DIGITAL CINEMA KOMODO Riser Plate! Designed for use with the separately available RED V-RAPTOR Quick Release Platform, this aluminum riser features an Arca-swiss bottom dovetail and 1/4"-20 & 3/8"-16 camera screws.', 82000.0, '{"Brand":"RED","Camera Support Type":"Baseplate","Color":"Black","Compatibility":"RED KOMODO / KOMODO -X REDV-RAPTOR Quick Release Platform Pack","Dimensions":"3.9 × 2.98 × 0.92″","Environmental":"No","Item Type":"Camera Support","Material":"Aluminum","Mfr. Model Number":"#790-0733","Mounting":"1x 1/4\\"-20 Screw1x 3/8\\"-16 Screw","Operating Temperature":"32 to 104°F","Storage Temperature":"-4 to 122°F","Weight":"3.8 oz"}', 'RED
DIGITAL
