Next Gen S35 Sensor. With the RED DIGITAL CINEMA KOMODO-X 6K ST Edition, experience a fully redesigned S35 sensor that offers key improvements to its architectural setup while producing excellent image quality and color science. This sensor also features enhanced shadow detail and color and frame rates up to 80 fps in 6K and up to 120p in 4K.

