IP Connectivity. The KOMODO-X 6K streamlines IP workflows like Virtual Production and live broadcasting using a USB-C interface and an integrated Wi-Fi function. This is easily controlled via the RED Control or Control Pro apps and eliminates the need for a separate remote control. To obtain 6K streaming, we recommend you add a RED Connect License to broadcast over IP directly from the camera.', 3407000.0, '{"Brand":"RED","Camera Mount":"Canon RF","Camera Type":"Cinema","Compatible Media":"RED","Item Type":"Camera","Maximum Video Resolution":"6K","Screen Type":"Touchscreen and Fixed","Sensor Size":"Super35","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"No","Wireless Connectivity":"Wi-Fi and Bluetooth"}', 'KOMODO-X
