INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2699, 1, 199, 'RED DIGITAL CINEMA RANGER MONSTRO 8K VV Brain (Gold Mount)', 'red-digital-cinema-ranger-monstro-8k-vv-brain-gold-mount', 'The RED DIGITAL CINEMA RED RANGER MONSTRO 8K VV (Gold Mount) is a professional grade PL mounted cinema camera designed for demanding use in the studio or on location. Key features include:

8K full-frame CMOS sensor
Aluminum alloy construction
8192 × 4320 recording up to 60 fps
Netflix approved camera

Professional Cinema Production. The RED DIGITAL CINEMA RED RANGER MONSTRO 8K VV (Gold Mount) features a shimmed PL mount that houses the 8K sensor, a larger built-in fan for improved thermal performance, and an integrated Gold Mount battery plate for fuel. This 8K camera solution is ideal for use in high-end production, but is also great for personal and individual use. This camera provides an LCD screen surrounded by control dials and knobs that are customizable for your production needs, an an integrated velcro patch is also included for camera labeling.

Ports and Button Controls. Right underneath the PL mount, you’ll find two microphone inputs: the one located on the right controls channels 1 and 2, and the input located on the left controls channels 3 and 4. On the front-left side of this unit are two 3-pin cable inputs for controlling remote start/stop and run start/stop. Moving to the right side of the camera, you’ll find a red record start/stop button, and two user buttons labeled “1” and “2” on the top and bottom of the record button. Holding both of the user buttons at the same time will eject your RED MINI-MAG SSD, but you do have the ability to program either button to do what you need them to! If you decide to add an EVF or LCD to your rig, a connector can be found on the right side of this unit and both the EVF or LCD are connected using a separately available flush mounted adapter. Attaching a DSMC2 Touch 7-inch LCD is quite simple using the EVF/LCD port on the tip-top of this unit, but older models are also compatible using the separately available LEMO Adapter. As for the additional inputs and outputs, you’ll find find a control port, aux input, three SDI ports (two for full SDI outputs, and one for only monitoring), ethernet port, DC input, timecode and genlock I/O ports, USB port, 5-pin XLR, 2-pin LEMO, and a 3.5mm headphone jack, all on the left side of this unit.

Power Trip. This camera is fueled purely from the included Gold Mount battery plate, but accessories are powered from the 3 AMP D/P-Tap power inputs located directly above the battery plate.

8K MONSTRO VV Sensor. This unit reps an 8K 40.96 × 21.6mm sensor that takes advantage of full-frame lenses, and allows you to record up to 60 fps at full resolution. You’re able to achieve higher frame rates up to 300 fps by windowing the sensor to lower resolutions. This sensor boasts  17 stops of dynamic range which helps represent both deep shadows and bright highlights in the same frame.', 1107000.0, '{"Brand":"RED","Camera Mount":"PL","Camera Type":"Cinema","Compatible Media":"RED","Environmental":"Operating Temperature32 to 104°F  Storage Temperature -4 to 122°F  Operating Humidity0 to 85%","Exposure Control":"Shutter TypeElectronic Rolling Shutter Advertised Dynamic Range17 Stops","General":"Battery TypeGold Mount Tripod Mounting Thread1/4\\"-20 Female3/8\\"-16 Female Accessory Mount17 × 1/4\\"-20 Female Netflix ApprovedYes","Imaging":"Lens MountARRI PL Lens CommunicationYes, Cooke /i  Sensor ResolutionEffective: 35.4 Megapixel (8192 × 4320) Sensor Type40.96 × 21.6 mm (Vistavision) CMOS Built-In ND FilterNone Internal Filter HolderYes Capture TypeStills & Video","Interface":"Media/Memory Card SlotSingle Slot: RED MINI-MAG Video I/O2 x BNC (3G-SDI) Output1 x BNC (Unspecified SDI) Output Audio I/O1 x XLR 5-Pin Mic/Line (+48 V Phantom Power) Input1 × 1/8\\" / 3.5 mm TRS Stereo Headphone Output Power I/O1 x LEMO 2-Pin (11.5 to 17 VDC at 3 A) Output1 x XLR 4-Pin Input1 x USB-A (5 VDC at 1.5 A) Output1 x D-Tap (11.5 to 17 VDC at 3 A) Output1 x LEMO 2-Pin (11.5 to 17 VDC at 1.5 A) Output2 x Fischer 3-Pin (24 VDC at 2.5 A) Output Other I/O1 x LEMO 4-Pin (RS-232) Control Input/Output1 × 9-Pin (Gigabit Ethernet) Input/Output1 x BNC (Genlock) Control Input/Output1 x LEMO 5-Pin (Timecode) Input/Output Wireless2.4 GHz Wi-Fi (802.11b/g) Control","Internal Video Recording Modes":"ProRes 4444XQ2048 × 1080 up to fps ProRes 44442048 × 1080 up to fps ProRes 422 HQ4096 × 2160 up to 29.97 fps2048 × 1080 up to fps ProRes 4224096 × 2160 up to 29.97 fps2048 × 1080 up to fps ProRes 422LT4098 × 2160 up to 29.97 fps2048 × 1080 up to fps REDCODE RAW8192 × 4320 up to 59.94 fps8192 × 3456 up to 75 fps7168 × 3780 up to 59.94 fps7168 × 3024 up to 75 fps6144 × 3240 up to 75 fps6144 × 2592 up to 100 fps5120 × 2700 up to 96 fps5120 × 2160 up to fps4096 × 2160 up to fps4096 × 1728 up to 150 fps3072 × 1620 up to 150 fps3072 × 1296 up to 200 fps2048 × 1080 up to 240 fps2048 × 864 up to 300 fps","Item Type":"Camera","Maximum Video Resolution":"8K","Mfr. Model Number":"#710-0335","Physical":"Material of ConstructionAluminum Dimensions(W x H x D) 7.77 × 6.3 × 6″  Weight7.3 lb","Sensor Size":"VistaVision","Stabilization":"No","Still Image Capture":"Aspect Ratio4:3, 16:9","Video Capture":"Sensor Crop ModesSuper35 / APS-C Fast-/Slow-Motion SupportYes Built-In Microphone TypeStereo Audio Recording2-Channel 24-Bit 48 kHz IP StreamingYes","Weather Sealing":"No","Wireless Connectivity":"Wi-Fi"}', 'RED
