Modular Design. The RED DIGITAL CINEMA V-RAPTOR XL Top Handle with Extensions offers a lightweight and extendable option for carrying your RED V-RAPTOR camera. This modular handle includes 1, 3, and 5" extensions, an elbow unit, and a 15mm monitor mount. It features a start/stop button, multiple 3/8"-16 and 1/4"-20 threads, and wooden inlays.', 339000.0, '{"Brand":"RED","Camera Support Type":"Handle","Item Type":"Camera Support","Mounting":"Attachment MethodNot Specified by ManufacturerRod Ports1 × 15 mm Rod PortAccessory Mounting Multiple x 1/4\\"-20 ThreadMultiple x 3/8\\"-16 ThreadShoe MountingNoneRosettesNoneRail MountingNoneDimensionsNot Specified by ManufacturerWeightNot Specified by Manufacturer","Physical":"Item TypeTopside HandleBuilt-In ControlsRemote Trigger"}', 'V-RAPTOR
