INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2742, 1, 199, 'RED V-RAPTOR XE RF Premium Kit (Gold Mount)', 'red-v-raptor-xe-rf-premium-kit-gold-mount', 'This is a Netflix approved camera! The RED V-RAPTOR XE RF Premium Kit (Gold Mount) includes:

RED V-RAPTOR XE 8K VV for Canon RF
	RED V-RAPTOR tactical top plate with Gold Mount adapter
	RED side ribs for V-RAPTOR
	RED V-RAPTOR quick release platform
	RED V-RAPTOR top handle
	RED DSMC3 Touch 7-inch LCD
	RED PRO CFexpress v4 Type B card reader
	(2) RED PRO 2TB CFexpress v4 Type B memory cards
	(2) Anton Bauer Titon Micro 90 Gold Mount batteries
	Anton Bauer GM2 dual Gold Mount charger

V-RAPTOR XE. The V-RAPTOR XE 8K VV camera from RED delivers the 8K global shutter and compact design of the V-RAPTOR X, while focusing on the core features essential to modern filmmaking. Built on RED’s DSMC3 platform, the XE provides a large-format VV sensor in a lightweight body, capturing 8K video at up to 60 fps with 17+ stops of dynamic range. Balancing high-end performance with class-leading value, the XE omits advanced Global Vision features like Phantom Track and Extended Highlights, but retains the same image quality, workflow flexibility, and robust connectivity that define RED’s V-RAPTOR line.

Gold Mount For V-RAPTOR. Power this V-RAPTOR with the RED V-RAPTOR tactical top plate! Accepting Gold Mount batteries, this top plate and adapter combo secures to the top and back of your V-RAPTOR camera with ease using the included RED Sidewinder multitool.

Side Ribs. The RED side ribs for V-RAPTOR consists of a pair of sturdy aluminum brackets designed to accept RED accessories rather than having accessories attached directly to the V-RAPTOR brain. Each rib is equipped with both 1/4"-20 and 3/8"-16 mounting threads alongside one standard rosette per rib, creating the ultimate mounting expansion for the camera.

Complete QR-Plate Release System. The RED V-RAPTOR quick release platform is a durable and lightweight QR-plate release system that lets you mount and balance the RED V-RAPTOR XE 8K VV on a tripod.

Top Handle. The RED V-RAPTOR top handle is a compact, ergonomic handle that makes it easy to carry the camera. The top and sides of the handle have multiple 1/4"-20 and 3/8"-16 threaded accessory mounting points with anti-twist divots. There’s even a mounting point with anti-twist divots on the front of the handle! A built-in run/stop trigger automatically connects when you secure the top handle to your camera and there is a nice wood inlay for comfort and temperature stability.

Monitor For RED DSMC3. The DSMC3 RED Touch 7.0" LCD offers an HD viewing experience for recording and viewing footage on the V-RAPTOR camera system. The 1920 × 1200 resolution, high pixel density display panel not only provides the optimal experience when viewing footage but also features 100% DCI-P3 Color Gamut coverage for tremendous color accuracy.

Card Reader. The RED PRO CFexpress v4 Type B card reader is a compact reader designed to quickly deliver data from your RED CFexpress v4 Type B memory cards. This reader connects to your host system through its integrated 12.6" USB-C cable and features a 40Gbps USB4 interface that ensures a streamlined data offloading experience.

Official RED CFexpress v4 Type-B Media. The RED PRO 2TB CFexpress v4 Type B memory card was designed by Angelbird in partnership with RED for use with the KOMODO and V-RAPTOR systems. There are two memory cards included in this package.

Compact Power. The Titon 90 Gold Mount battery offers a built-in display, a D-tap port, and a USB port. It has a 98Wh capacity and supports a continuous 10A total draw between the Gold Mount, D-tap, and USB. There are two batteries included in this package.

Dual Vertical Charging. The Anton Bauer GM2 dual Gold Mount charger can fill up the two 98Wh Gold Mount batteries simultaneously in around 6 hours. The charger has a convenient space-saving vertical orientation.', 4789000.0, '{"Brand":"RED","Camera Mount":"Canon RF","Camera Type":"Cinema","Item Type":"Camera"}', 'RED
