Fast Recharging. This version of the Nitecore New i4 Intellicharger can output a maximum of 1500mAh to four AA or AAA rechargeable NiMH batteries. The charger has active current distribution for prioritizing which battery needs charging and how much charge it needs dependent upon on battery capacity.

