microFollowFocus | Black Included. The included microFollowFocus | Black gives you smooth, precision focus control. The rig’s dual rubberized handgrips enable two-handed operation, ensuring steady support for your camera even as you pull focus.', 121000.0, '{"Brand":"Redrock","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Support Type":"Lens Control"}', 'DSLR
