INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2794, 1, 202, 'Ricoh Pentax WG-90', 'ricoh-pentax-wg-90', 'The Ricoh Pentax WG-90 is a dependable, all-weather camera designed to capture stabilized, high-resolution stills and videos in environments where less-rugged cameras fall short. Key features include:

16MP BSI CMOS sensor; 5x optical zoom
Triple anti-shake protection
Six LED ring light
Shock/Freeze/Waterproof

Any Weather Operation. No amount of rain, sleet, or snow can put up a fight against the durable, rugged, everything-proof Ricoh Pentax WG-90. Through its 16MP BSI CMOS sensor and 28mm wide-angle lens with 5x optical zoom, this compact camera captures high-resolution photo and video for both close-up macro and wide range landscape snaps.

Dependable, Heavy-Duty Build. The rugged form of the WG-90 promotes the versatility and security that you’ll appreciate out in the wilderness. Featuring an every-thing proof exterior, this camera is drop-proof from 5 feet up, waterproof up to depths of 46 feet, freeze-proof to temps as low as 14°F, and crush-proof up to 220 lbf (pounds of force). Impressive, I know.

Design and Physical Features. Although this tiny camera has the build to withstand some massive “oopsies”, it only weighs 6.1 ounces! The WG-90 comes equipped with a fixed 2.7-inch LCD display screen with an Outdoor View Setting mode that ensures your image previews are accessible at all times. Alongside its excellent screen visibility, the display screen is also coated with an antireflection film to reduce and minimize pesky glares. Six adjustable LED macro lights form a ring around the lens to provide illumination and flash for closer shots.

Recording Modes, Functions, and Capabilities. The WG-90 boasts Full HD recording at 30 fps in H.264 format, and features High Speed Movie mode to capture slow-motion recordings. A total of 25 shooting modes embrace user creativity, including: Auto Picture  to automatically detect and select the best shooting mode in the moment; Landscape to enhance the grassiest greens and smoother blues; Underwater/Underwater Movie to optimize underwater white balance and reproduce natural nautical colors. This compact camera is fueled for up to 2 hours of continuous use with the included Pentax D-LI92 Battery.', 111000.0, '{"Brand":"Ricoh","Camera Type":"Compact","Compatible Media":"SD","Display":"Display Size2.7\\" Display TypeFixed Non-Touchscreen LCD","Exposure Control":"Shutter SpeedElectronic Shutter: 1/4000 to 1/4 SecondMechanical Shutter: 1/4000 to 1/4 Second Bulb/Time ModeNo ISO/Gain SensitivityNative: 125 to 6400 Metering MethodCenter-Weighted Average, Multi, Spot Exposure Compensation-2 to +2 EV (1/3 EV Steps) White BalancePresets: Auto, Daylight, Fluorescent, Fluorescent (Day White), Fluorescent (Daylight), Fluorescent (White), Manual, Shade, Tungsten Continuous ShootingNo Self-TimerNo Special OptionsFireworks, Fish-Eye Effect, Food, Handheld Night, Landscape, Miniature Effect, Monochrome, Night Portrait, Portrait, Snow, Sports, Toy Camera Effect","Flash":"Built-In Flash/LightYes, Flash & Continuous Flash ModesFlash On, Off, Red-Eye Reduction Effective Flash Range0.66 to 18’ (Wide)0.66 to 11’ (Telephoto) External Flash ConnectionNo","General":"Environmental ResistanceWeather/Water-Resistant to 45.9’ (IPX8) Shockproof5.2’ Crushproof220.46 lbf Operating Conditions14 to 104°F Battery1x D-LI92 Rechargeable Lithium-Ion (Included; Approx. 300 Shots) Shoe MountNo Dimensions (W x H x D)4.8 × 2.4 × 1.2″ Weight6.1 oz (Body Only)","Imaging":"Sensor ResolutionEffective: 16 MegapixelImage Sensor1/2.3\\"-Type CMOS","Interface":"Media/Memory Card SlotSingle Slot: SD/SDHC/SDXC Internal