	82mm protective filter', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2850, 2, 205, 'Rokinon AF 14mm f/2.8 FE for Sony E', 'rokinon-af-14mm-f-2-8-fe-for-sony-e', 'The Rokinon AF 14mm f/2.8 FE for Sony E is an ultra-wide angle lens that offers full-frame support for Sony E-Mount cameras and camcorders. Key features include:

Full- and crop-frame compatible
Excellent sharpness and clarity
Fast, accurate autofocus with manual-focus override
Great for unorthodox, creative images

Ultra-Wide Angle. The Rokinon 14mm provides a 115° angle of view on full-frame Sony E-mount cameras and a 93.9° angle of view on crop-frame Sony E-mount cameras.

Advanced Optics. A new ten-group/fourteen-element optical formula incorporates three aspherical elements and two extra-low dispersion elements help control distortions and aberrations, all while retaining sharpness and clarity at any aperture or focus distance. The Ultra Multi-Coating controls ghosting and flare for a contrasty, color-neutral image.

Autofocus. The built-in autofocus motor works with Sony cameras’ focusing systems to provide fast, accurate AF control, while the manual-focus override lets you make precise adjustments.

Creative Uses. You can take advantage of this ultra-wide angle lens’s extreme angle of view to capture unorthodox images. This type of lens is commonly used for landscape and architectural photography, but It’s able to shoot some rather interesting portraits as well. Its 7.78-inch minimum focusing distance makes it simple to exaggerate perspective.', 175000.0, '{"Angle of View":"113.9°","Aperture Blades":"7, rounded","Brand":"Rokinon","Dimensions":"3.39 × 3.84″ (ø x L)","Filter Type":"Rear Mount","Focal Length":"14-14","Focus Type":"Autofocus","Groups/Elements":"10/14","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"Full-Frame","Lens Mount":"Sony E","Lens Type":"Ultra Wide Angle and For Mirrorless","Maximum Aperture":"2.8","Maximum Magnification":"0.12x","Mfr. Model Number":"IO14AF-E","Minimum Focusing Distance":"7.87\\"","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Weight":"1.11 lb.","Zoom Type":"Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Rokinon
