Advanced Optics. This lens’s nine-group/eleven-element design includes two aspherical elements and two high-refractive index elements help control distortions and aberrations, all while retaining sharpness and clarity at any aperture or focus distance. The Ultra Multi-Coating controls ghosting and flare for a contrasty, color-neutral image, while the nine-blade aperture makes for some nice bokeh.

