INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2887, 2, 205, 'Rokinon Xeen 85mm T1.5 for PL Mount', 'rokinon-xeen-85mm-t1-5-for-pl-mount', 'The Rokinon Xeen lenses are budget-friendly, true cinema lenses that are offered in a variety of focal lengths and lens mounts. This is the 85mm T1.5 for PL-mount camcorders. Key features include:

PL mount
4K+ capture
Multi-coating for accurate and consistent color
Geared focus and aperture rings

PL Mount. We carry Rokinon Xeen lenses in several different mounts, with this one being the PL mount version.

Full-Frame Portrait-Length. The Rokinon Xeen 85mm T1.5 offers full-frame coverage, giving you a budget-friendly portrait-length cinema lens. Its fast T1.5 aperture allows the flexibility to shoot in low light, not to mention depth-of-field control. Keep in mind sensor crop-factors do apply when using smaller than full-frame formats.

4K Resolving Power. Keeping with the market trend, the Xeen lenses support 4K+ capture. Optics are largely the same as the Rokinon Cine DS line of lenses. However, additional multi-coatings have been applied to ensure consistent and accurate color when switching lenses to another in the Xeen line.

True Cinema Lens. Yes, it’s true the Xeen lenses share similarities with the Cine DS lenses. But where they differ is in the build and performance you’d except from a true cinema lens. Their aluminum housing with calibrated, 0.8 pitch geared focus and iris rings offer buttery-smooth operation. Dual scale markings, standardized ring position, and uniformity in physical size across the lineup enable consistency for rigging out your setup with follow focuses and matte boxes.

