Fully Manual. These lenses provide no electronic communication with the camera. All aperture and focus adjustments must be made manually on the lenses themselves. The aperture you select won’t be displayed on the camera, and it won’t show up in the EXIF data.', 1618000.0, '{"Brand":"Rokinon","Filter Type":"Matte Box Mount","Focus Rotation":"200º","Focus Type":"Manual Focus Only","Front Lens Diameter":"114mm","Gearing":"0.8 MOD focus, iris","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"Full-Frame","Lens Mount":"PL","Lens Type":"Ultra Wide Angle, Wide Angle, Standard, Telephoto, Kit, Cine, and For Mirrorless","Mfr. Model Number":"XN14-PL, XN24-PL, XN35-PL, XN50-PL, XN85-PL, XN135-PL","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Zoom Type":"Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Rokinon
