HDMI Male-Micro. Micro-HDMI inputs are typically found on DSLRs. If you’re shooting video on a large camera, you’ll need HDMI Male-Male cables.

Video-capable cameras with micro-HDMI inputs:

Sony Alpha a7S
	Panasonic GH4
