Advanced Optical Formula. This lens’s fifteen-group/eighteen-element optical design includes three aspherical elements and five Special Low-Dispersion elements to minimize chromatic aberrations, vignetting, and color fringing while facilitating maximum sharpness, color accuracy, and clarity. Super multilayer and nano porous coatings on the lens elements help combat ghosting and produce high-contrast, color-neutral images, even in difficult light.

Strong, Yet Svelte. The Sigma 28-45mm is dust- and moisture-resistant so that you can use it in adverse conditions without worry, and there’s a brass bayonet mount for maximum durability. At 6.0 inches long and 2.1 lb., it’s compact and lightweight enough to take on the go.', 300000.0, '{"Angle of View":"75.4° to 51.3°","Brand":"Sigma","General":"Dimensions (ø x L)3.5 × 6″ / 87.8 × 153.4mmWeight)2.1 lb. / 950 g","Hood Included":"Yes","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Mount":"L","Lens Type":"Wide Angle","Macro Reproduction Ratio":"1:4","Mfr. Model Number":"612969","Min Focusing Distance":"11.9\\" / 30.2 cm","Optical Design":"Groups/Elements15/18Aspherical Elements3Special Low-Dispersion Elements5Aperture Blades11, Rounded"}', 'Sigma 28-45mm f/1.8
