Professional-Grade Build. The lens barrel boasts a durable metal construction. The dust- and splash-proof sealing allows for worry-free shooting in adverse situations, with water- and oil-repellent coatings on the front and rear elements to keep them clean. There are easy-to-locate focus and aperture rings, the latter of which has click and lock switches. This rental includes the heavy-duty Sigma TS-151 tripod socket with a removable, replaceable foot, which evenly distributes the lens’s weight to give you flexibility when shooting from a tripod or monopod.', 586000.0, '{"Angle of View":"5º","Aperture Blades":"11","Brand":"Sigma","Dimensions":"4.2 × 9.3″ (ø x L)","Filter Size":"95.0mm","Filter Type":"Screw-On","Focal Length":"500-500","Focus Type":"Autofocus","Groups/Elements":"14/20","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"Full-Frame","Lens Mount":"Sony E","Lens Type":"Supertelephoto and For Mirrorless","Maximum Aperture":"5.6","Maximum Magnification":"0.17x","Mfr. Model Number":"186965","Minimum Focusing Distance":"10.5’","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Weight":"3.0 lb.","Zoom Type":"Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Sigma 500mm f/5.6
