Durable, Weather-Resistant Build. The Sigma 50mm’s Thermally Stable Composite build is dust- and splash-resistant, so that you can use it in adverse conditions. It also boasts a brass bayonet mount for maximum durability and precision. An included petal-type hood helps to prevent flare and protect the lens’s front element.', 300000.0, '{"Angle of View":"46.8°","Aperture Blades":"13, rounded","Brand":"Sigma","Dimensions":"3.2 × 4.4″ (ø x L)","Filter Size":"72.0mm","Filter Type":"Screw-On","Focal Length":"50-50","Focus Type":"Autofocus","Groups/Elements":"12/17","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"Full-Frame","Lens Mount":"Sony E","Lens Type":"Standard and For Mirrorless","Maximum Aperture":"1.2","Maximum Magnification":"0.16x","Mfr. Model Number":"316965","Minimum Focusing Distance":"15.7\\"","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Weight":"1.6 lb.","Zoom Type":"Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Sigma 50mm f/1.2
