Durable Build. Sigma’s Art 70mm is weather sealed, making it dust and splash resistant. It’s made of a Thermally Stable Composite (TSC) material, giving it greater precision and allowing for use in a wide array of temperatures.', 154000.0, '{"Angle of View":"34.3°","Aperture Blades":"9, rounded","Brand":"Sigma","Dimensions":"2.8 × 4-5\\" (ø x L)","Filter Size":"49.0mm","Filter Type":"Screw-On","Focal Length":"70-70","Focus Type":"Autofocus","Groups/Elements":"10/13","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"Full-Frame","Lens Mount":"Sony E","Lens Type":"Telephoto, Macro, and For Mirrorless","Maximum Aperture":"2.8","Maximum Magnification":"1x","Mfr. Model Number":"271965","Minimum Focusing Distance":"10.16\\"","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Weight":"1.25 lb.","Zoom Type":"Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Sigma 70mm f/2.8
