High-Quality Design. The Sigma Cine 65mm T2.5 FF Classic Art Prime offers full-frame coverage, giving you a compact and lightweight cine lens. It’s capable of delivering 6K to 8K resolution, and its T2.5 aperture allows depth-of-field control and low-light shooting flexibility.

