Enables Sigma 300-600mm f/4 DG OS Sports for Sony E Filter Use. The Sigma 300-600mm f/4 Sports for Sony is a fantastic super telephoto zoom, but its design prevents the use of traditional threaded filters. The Sigma drop-in filter gives you a variable ND option.

Reduce Exposure with Ease. The integrated variable ND filter reduces light from about 1.5 to 7EV, allowing you to use slow shutter speeds even during the day. There’s a small wheel at the top of the filter holder that lets you rotate the filter to get the effect you want.', 111000.0, '{"Brand":"Sigma","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Support Type":"Filter"}', 'Sigma
