Customized Calibration.  With four adjustable categories to customize focus distance for prime lenses and sixteen for zoom lenses (4 distances x 4 focal lengths), the USB Dock allows precision calibration for the specific camera / lens setup.  Additionally, when used with certain lenses you can also customize three different AF speed modes, three Optical Stabilizer modes, and constrain focus distances within a specific range.

Sigma Optimization Pro.  The free Sigma Optimization Pro software is simple to use, enabling you to update firmware as well as make focus adjustments on the latest Sigma Global Vision lenses.', 71000.0, '{"Brand":"Sigma","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Mount":"Nikon F","Lens Support Type":"Lens Calibrator"}', 'Sigma
