This rental includes a standard 12V-2A power supply, which connects to the dummy LP-E6’s barrel connection.  This enables continuous power for your monitor.', 82000.0, '{"Brand":"SmallHD","Dimensions":"1.5″ × 1″ × 2.25″","Item Type":"Power","Power Type":"Power Adapter"}', 'Faux
