Hardware kit', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (3364, 6, 218, 'SmallRig VB50 Mini V-Mount Battery (50Wh)', 'smallrig-vb50-mini-v-mount-battery-50wh', 'The SmallRig VB50 Mini V-Mount Battery (50Wh) is an ultracompact, lightweight 50Wh battery used to power handheld cameras, drones, and gimbals. Key features include:

Travel friendly design
Supports up to 12A draw
USB Type-C input/output
USB Type-A output, (2) DC barrel outputs

Compact Fueling. With the SmallRig VB50 Mini V-Mount Battery (50Wh), you are able to power items like the Sony FX9 and the Canon C300 EF in a more compact, lightweight way. The battery can be charged using a standard V-mount charger, an optional D-Tap charger, or by using the USB Type-C input/output with a 45W PD fast charger. This rental only includes the battery, so be sure to check out the recommended section of your screen to ensure you’re grabbing everything you need!

Inputs, Outputs, & Ports. The VB50 provides multiple accessory ports, including one 14.8V D-Tap output, one 8 VDC barrel output, one 12 VDC barrel output, one USB Type-C output, and one USB Type-A output for powering various accessories, cameras, or mobile devices.  A built-in OLED display shows the remaining battery capacity and status.', 100000.0, '{"Battery System":"V-Mount","Brand":"SmallRig","Item Type":"Power","Mfr. Model Number":"#3579","Power Type":"Battery","Weight":"1.1 lb."}', 'VB50
Mini
V-Mount
Battery', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (3365, 2, 103, 'Sony 14mm f/1.8 GM w/ Haida Rear ND Filter Kit', 'sony-14mm-f-1-8-gm-w-haida-rear-nd-filter-kit', 'The Sony 14mm f/1.8 GM w/ Haida Rear ND Filter Kit takes the OG 14mm f/1.8 GM a step further with a pre-installed Haida ND filter holder and four interchangeable ND filters. Key features include:

ND0.9, ND1.2, ND1.8, and ND3.0 filters
K9 optical glass
Dedicated rear lens adapter ring
Filter holder pre-installed

Pro-Grade Ultra-Wide Prime. The FE 14 GM’s fast f/1.8 aperture and ultra-wide focal length make it perfect for shooting starry skies and other expansive night scenes. At f/1.8, you’ll get dramatic, shallow depth of field and excellent performance in low light.

XD Linear Motor Autofocus System. This internal focusing system provides fast, nearly silent, and highly accurate performance that’s great for still and video use. Two dedicated focus hold buttons and an AF/MF switch help to tailor focusing to your shooting needs. There’s also a manual aperture ring that can be “de-clicked” for smooth aperture adjustment when shooting video.

G-Master Series Quality. The GM series is Sony’s premium lens offering. What sets it apart from other Sony lenses is an emphasis on an extremely high resolving power of fifty lines per mm, out-of-focus “bokeh” quality, and a robust, weather-sealed body.

Advanced Optical Design. This lens’s eleven-group/fourteen-element design incorporates two “XA” extreme aspherical elements, one standard aspherical element, and one Super ED element to minimize spherical and chromatic aberrations, and to produce incredibly sharp, high-contrast images. Sony has applied a Nano AR Coating II to each element to help combat surface reflections, flare, and ghosting. The rounded nine-blade aperture produces smooth out-of-focus highlights when you desire a shallow depth of field.

Pre-Installed FIlter Holder. Our dedicated and crafted lens technicians at LensRentals will be securely adding the Haida Rear Lens ND Filter Holder to the back of the 14mm. This rental provides you with individual ND0.9, ND1.2, ND1.8, and ND3 filters.', 429000.0, '{"Angle of View":"114°","Aperture Blades":"9, rounded","Brand":"Haida and Sony","Dimensions":"3.3 × 3.9″ (ø x L)","Filter Type":"Rear Mount","Focal Length":"14-14","Focus Type":"Autofocus","Groups/Elements":"11/14","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"Full-Frame","Lens Mount":"Sony E","Lens Type":"Ultra Wide Angle and For Mirrorless","Maximum Aperture":"1.8","Maximum Magnification":"0.1x","Mfr. Model Number":"SEL14F14GM, HD4762","Minimum Focusing Distance":"9.8\\"","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Weight":"1.0 lb.","Zoom Type":"Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Sony
