Optics. The conversion lens is comprised of five elements in four groups and has minimal effect on image quality. The built-in petal hood helps to minimize lens flare.

Sony FE 28mm f/2 Required. This conversion lens requires the Sony FE 28mm f/2, which is a separate rental item. It will not mount to a camera without this host lens', 68000.0, '{"Angle of View":"92º","Brand":"Sony","Dimensions":"2.8 × 2″ (ø x L)","Focal Length":"21-21","Focus Type":"Manual Focus Only","Groups/Elements":"4/4","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"Full-Frame","Lens Mount":"Sony E and Add-on","Lens Type":"Ultra Wide Angle, Specialty, and For Mirrorless","Maximum Aperture":"2.8","Maximum Magnification":"0.20x","Mfr. Model Number":"SEL075UWC","Minimum Focusing Distance":"7.9\\"","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Weight":"0.92 lb.","Zoom Type":"Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Sony 21mm
