 × 1080 at 23.98/25/29.97/50/59.94/100/120 fps [16 to 100 Mb/s]Internal Recording Modes – XAVC S-I 4:2:2 10-Bit3840 × 2160 at 23.98/25/29.97/50/59.94 fps [240 to 600 Mb/s]1920 × 1080 at 23.98/25/29.97/50/59.94 fps [89 to 222 Mb/s]External Recording Modes – 4:2:2 8/10-Bit via HDMIUHD 4K (3840 × 2160) at 23.98/25/29.97/50/59.94 fpsHD (1920 × 1080p) at 23.98/50/59.94 fpsHD (1920 × 1080i) at 50/59.94 fpsFast-/Slow-Motion SupportYesGamma CurveS Cinetone, Sony S-Log 3Recording LimitNoneBroadcast OutputNTSC/PALIP Streaming – MJPEG, UVC/UAC3840 × 2160 at 12.5p, 14.99p, 25p, 30p1920 × 1080 at 25p, 30p, 50p, 60p1280 × 720 at 25p, 30pBuilt-In Microphone TypeStereoAudio Recording2-Channel 16-Bit 48 kHz LPCM Audio","Viewfinder":"TypeBuilt-In Electronic (OLED)Size0.39\\"Resolution2,359,296 DotEye Point22mmMagnificationApprox. 0.7xDiopter Adjustment-4 to +3","Viewfinder Type":"Electronic","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Wireless Connectivity":"Wi-Fi and Bluetooth"}', 'Sony
