The Sony BP-U70 Battery is a middle ground between the high-capacity Sony BP-U90 Battery and the Sony BP-U60 Battery that comes standard with our Sony camcorders. It offers 75Wh vs. the 56Wh of the BP-U60 and the 85Wh of the BP-U90.

Please note that we also carry the Hawk-Woods BP-98UX BP-U Series Battery, which is more powerful and more compact.

