Power Zoom. The integrated power-zoom control offers variable speed and zoom-rotation direction-reversal capability.

Fast, Accurate Autofocus. A Super Sonic wave Motor drive provides fast, silent autofocus performance.

Optical SteadyShot Image Stabilization. The in-lens stabilizer corrects camera shake.

High-Quality Optics. This lens uses six aspherical elements and three ED elements to minimize distortion and chromatic aberrations. This advanced optical formula offers support for high-resolution images and 4K video capture.', 814000.0, '{"Angle of View":"76-14º30’","Aperture Blades":"7, rounded","Brand":"Sony","Dimensions":"3.7 × 6.6″ (ø x L)","Filter Size":"95.0mm","Filter Type":"Screw-On","Focal Length":"18-110","Focus Type":"Autofocus","Gearing":"0.8 MOD zoom, focus, iris","Groups/Elements":"15/18","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"Super35","Lens Mount":"Sony E","Lens Type":"Wide Angle, Standard, Telephoto, Cine, and For Mirrorless","Maximum Aperture":"4.0","Maximum Magnification":"0.12x","Mfr. Model Number":"SELP18110G","Minimum Focusing Distance":"15.75\\"","Parfocal/Varifocal":"Parfocal","Stabilization":"Yes","Weather Sealing":"No","Weight":"2.4 lb.","Zoom Ratio":"6.1x","Zoom Type":"Variable Focal Length"}', 'Sony
