INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (3460, 2, 219, 'Sony FE 12-24mm f/2.8 GM w/ Haida Rear ND Filter Kit', 'sony-fe-12-24mm-f-2-8-gm-w-haida-rear-nd-filter-kit', 'The Sony FE 12-24mm f/2.8 GM w/ Haida Rear ND Filter Kit takes the OG 12-24mm f/2.8 GM a step further with a pre-installed Haida ND filter holder and four interchangeable ND filters. Key features include:

ND0.9, ND1.2, ND1.8, and ND3.0 filters
K9 optical glass
Dedicated rear lens adapter ring
Filter holder pre-installed

Full-Frame E-Mount. As a part of the G Master line of lenses, the 12-24mm f/2.8 is designed to cover Sony E-mount cameras’ full-frame sensors. It’s also fully compatible with APS-C NEX cameras. This particular rental provides you with this lens, a pre-installed Haida filter holder, and four Haida Rear ND filters, coming in ND0.9, ND1.2, ND1.8, and ND3.0. These filters are interchangeable, and as ND filters, are designed to help filter light through the lens without compromising color accuracy.

Ultra-Wide Zoom. When used on a full-frame camera, this lens’ zoom range is wide. Like really wide. Its field of view ranges from 122° at its widest to 84° at the long end, which means it’s perfect for night scenes and starry skies. With an APS-C sensor camera, you’ll get a focal length equivalent to 18-36mm. The constant f/2.8 aperture and rounded nine-blade diaphragm make it a great choice for low-light shooting while giving you excellent depth-of-field control.

Advanced Optics. The FE 12-24mm f/2.8 GM’s fourteen-group/seventeen-element design includes one aspherical element, three extreme aspherical elements, and two extra-low dispersion elements to minimize spherical and chromatic aberrations, and to produce extremely sharp high-resolution images. Nano AR II coatings keep reflections, flare, and ghosting at bay while maintaining clarity and color fidelity.

XD Linear Motor Autofocus System. The XD Linear Motor system uses four autofocus motors and an internal-focusing design to provide fast, nearly silent, and highly accurate focusing performance that’s great for still and video use. A dedicated focus hold button and AF/MF switch help to tailor focusing to your shooting needs.

High-Quality Build. The FE 12-24mm offers dust- and moisture-resistant sealing for use in less-than-ideal conditions. The all-metal barrel and smooth, responsive, rubberized zoom and manual-focus rings give this lens a solid feel. Its front element has a fluorine coating to help protect it from fingerprints and debris.', 593000.0, '{"Angle of View":"122-84°","Aperture Blades":"9, rounded","Brand":"Sony","Filter Type":"Rear Mount","Focal Length":"12-24","Focus Type":"Autofocus","Groups/Elements":"14/17","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"Full-Frame","Lens Mount":"Sony E","Lens Type":"Wide Angle, Kit, and For Mirrorless","Maximum Aperture":"2.8","Maximum Magnification":"0.14x","Mfr. Model Number":"SEL1224GM","Minimum Focusing Distance":"11.02\\"","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Weight":"1.86 lb.","Zoom Type":"Variable Focal Length"}', 'Sony
