INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (3511, 2, 219, 'Sony FE 85mm f/1.4 GM II', 'sony-fe-85mm-f-1-4-gm-ii', 'The Sony FE 85mm f/1.4 GM II is a professional-grade E-mount prime lens designed for full-frame Sony E-mount mirrorless cameras. It is an upgrade of the esteemed Sony FE 85mm f/1.4 GM. Key features include:

Pro-grade normal/short-telephoto prime
Improved control and video capabilities
20% lighter and 13% smaller than its predecessor
Improved edge-to-edge sharpness, aberration suppression

What’s Changed? The Sony FE 85mm f/1.4 GM II improves on the “Sony FE 85mm f/1.4 GM”:/sony-fe-85mm-f1.4-gm with new lens technology that produces higher resolution at all apertures while also greatly improving focusing performance thanks to an extreme dynamic (XD) linear motor that’s faster, quieter, and more accurate than the Direct Drive Super Sonic wave Motor (DDSSM) system of the prior model. Dual XD linear motors deliver higher thrust that can keep up with the demands of current and future high-speed cameras, with subject tracking improved by as much as 7×. All of this is offered inside a lighter and smaller form factor.

Perfect for Portraits and Filmmaking. With gorgeous bokeh and next-level G Master performance, the Sony FE 85mm f/1.4 GM II is a reliable and agile choice for not only portrait photographers but videographers as well. Focus breathing is minimized and there is added support in the lens for the breathing compensation function in select cine-line cameras. As with its predecessor, the 85mm f/1.4 GM II is equipped with a physical aperture ring that can be de-clicked for silent and smooth aperture changes mid-scene.

Rugged Hybrid Construction. A combination of metal and plastic components were used to make this lens 20% lighter and 13% smaller than the prior model. The 85mm f/1.4 GM II also includes a dust and moisture-resistant design with gaskets at every seam to help protect it in bad weather.

Full-Frame E-Mount. As a part of the FE line of lenses, the Sony FE 85mm f/1.4 GM II is designed for Sony full-frame cameras. It’s also fully compatible with APS-C sensor cameras, on which it’ll provide an effective focal length of approximately 127.5mm.

G-Master Series Quality. The GM series is Sony’s premium lens offering and produces the brand’s highest design standards. What sets GM apart from other Sony lens lines is an emphasis on resolving power so that these lenses are “future proof” and can be used on cameras with extremely high resolutions.

Try it with These E-Mount Cameras. Speed and resolution are where this lens really shines. The subject tracking and overall AF performance makes the 85mm f/1.4 GM II suitable for cameras with 120 frames-per-second (fps) shooting speeds while the updated optics can handle sensors of 40MP and higher. This lens pairs well with the Sony a9 III, the Sony a7R V, and the Sony a1.', 414000.0, '{"Angle of View":"29°","Aperture Blades":"11, rounded","Brand":"Sony","Dimensions":"3.3 ×4.2\\" (ø x L)","Filter Size":"77.0mm","Filter Type":"Screw-On","Focal Length":"85-85","Focus Type":"Autofocus","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"Full-Frame","Lens Mount":"Sony E","Lens Type":"Telephoto and For Mirrorless","Maximum Aperture":"1.4","Maximum Magnification":"0.11x","Mfr. Model Number":"SEL85F14GM2","Minimum Focusing Distance":"31.5\\"","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Weight":"1.4 lb.","Zoom Type":"Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Sony
