INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (3513, 2, 219, 'Sony FE 90mm f/2.8 G OSS Macro', 'sony-fe-90mm-f-2-8-g-oss-macro', 'The Sony FE 90mm f/2.8 G OSS Macro is a full-frame E-mount lens designed for the Sony a7-series cameras. Key features include:

True 1:1 macro reproduction
11-inch minimum focusing distance
Fast, nearly silent autofocus
Optical image stabilization

Full-Frame E-mount. As a part of the FE line of lenses, the FE 90mm f/2.8 GM is designed to cover the Sony a7-series cameras’ full-frame sensors. Since it’s an E-mount lens, it’s also fully compatible with APS-C NEX cameras.

True Macro. When used on a full-frame camera, this lens provides a true 1:1 macro ratio with a 90mm focal length. With an APS-C sensor camera, you’ll still get 1:1 macro reproduction, but the focal length is equivalent to 135mm. The fast f/2.8 aperture enables extremely shallow depth-of-field control at macro focus distances.

Direct-Drive Super Sonic Wave Motor Autofocus System. This internal-focusing system uses piezoelectric elements oscillating at ultrasonic frequencies to provide fast, highly accurate, and nearly silent autofocus performance that’s great for still and video use. The internal-focusing system is crucial to macro work because the front element doesn’t extend or rotate. On the lens barrel itself, there’s a focus hold button and a focus limit switch for improved functionality when shooting both macro and standard images. The focus ring features a clutch design, enabling quick changes from auto to manual focus.

Optical Image Stabilization. The in-lens image stabilization allows you to shoot at slower shutter speeds without having to worry about camera shake.

Advanced Optics. The FE 90mm f/2.8 GM uses one aspherical element and two extra-low dispersion elements to minimize spherical and chromatic aberrations, and to produce clear, high-contrast images. The rounded nine-blade aperture diaphragm produces smooth out-of-focus highlights when you desire a shallow depth of field. Additionally, Nano AR coatings keep flare and ghosting at bay.

High Build Quality. Like the Sony a7-series cameras, the FE 90mm offers dust- and moisture-resistant sealing for use in less-than-ideal conditions. The all-metal barrel and smooth, responsive manual-focus ring give the lens a solid feel.', 250000.0, '{"Angle of View":"27°","Brand":"Sony","Dimensions":"3.11 × 5.14″ (ø x L)","Filter Size":"62.0mm","Filter Type":"Screw-On","Focal Length":"90-90","Focus Type":"Autofocus","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"Full-Frame","Lens Mount":"Sony E","Lens Type":"Telephoto, Macro, and For Mirrorless","Maximum Aperture":"2.8","Maximum Magnification":"1x","Mfr. Model Number":"SEL90M28G","Minimum Focusing Distance":"11.02\\"","Stabilization":"Yes","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Weight":"1.32 lb.","Zoom Type":"Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Sony
