INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (3565, 1, 219, 'Sony PXW-Z300', 'sony-pxw-z300', 'The Sony PXW-Z300 is a broadcast video camera offering 4K60 capture, 17x optical zoom, and an AI focusing processor. This model is an update to the PXW-Z280. Key features include:

Three 1/2"-type Exmor R CMOS sensors
f/1.9 to f/16 aperture
Electronic variable ND filter
RTMP, RTMPS, SRT, and Chunk Transfer

What’s Changed? While the foundational bones of this model are that of the previous-generation Sony PXW-Z280, the PXW-Z300 brings massive updates to the table. Featuring advanced digital imaging technologies, this camcorder is equipped with a redesigned LCD articulating arm, an MI shoe in placement of a viewfinder, a V-Mount side plate for  attachment of accessories like the PDT-FP1 or audio receivers, the latest BIONZ XR processor for higher quality imaging, digital signature embedding, and a HD/4K digital extender.

Optimal Content Creation. The PXW-Z300 sports three 1/2" Exmor RS CMOS sensors to deliver enhanced 4K image quality, rapid readout speeds, and optimal low-light performance. Capable of capturing everything from close-ups to wide angle, this camcorder features a 17x optical zoom that is equivalent to 35mm full-frame 30-515mm lens. The built-in variable ND filter function provides a wide 1/4 to 1/128 ND range and allows you to adjust exposure with the simple twist of a dial.

BIONZ XR Processing and AI Assistance. This camcorder incorporates the latest BIONZ XR image processor in the sensor to produce higher frame rates, faster autofocus, improved ATW control, and excellent noise reduction. AI-assisted autofocus offers precise human-subject recognition, and supports Subject Recognition AF and Real-Time Tracking. With the Auto-Framing function, you can easily recognize your subjects, track them, and keep them centered in frame. If the production gets to be too quick, you can always switch to Full Auto Mode for settings like ND, Iris, Gain, Shutter, and White Balance modes.

Connectivity and More. Featuring built-in 2.4 GHz, 5 GHz Wi-Fi, and an ethernet port, the PXW-Z300 is capable of streaming directly from the camcorder to compatible live streaming services and video sharing sites. If you prefer recording over streaming, you can also easily upload files saved to your memory card straight to a cloud or FTP server. To connect with more external equipment, this camcorder offers HDMI Type-A, USB Type-C, LAN, REMOTE, and various other connectors. This model additionally features SDI and Timecode BNC connections!

Memory and Power. This camcorder accepts separately available CFexpress Type-A and SD UHS-II memory cards through its dual card slot. To fuel up, we include the Sony BC-U1A Charger and Sony BP-U35 Battery, but if you’d like to use a higher capacity battery, this camcorder also accepts Sony BP-U70, Sony BP-U90, and Sony BP-U100 batteries!', 1718000.0, '{"Brand":"Sony","Camera Type":"Camcorder","Compatible Media":"CFexpress Type A and SD","Environmental":"Operating Conditions32 to 104°F Storage Conditions -4 to 140°F","Exposure Control":"Shutter TypeElectronic Rolling Shutter Shutter Speed1/8000 to 64 Seconds ISO/Gain SensitivityGain: -3 to 18 dB (-3 to 42 dB Extended) Signal-to-Noise RatioNot Specified by Manufacturer Minimum Illumination0.0013 Lux at f/1.9 Aperture White BalanceRange: 2000 to 15,000KPresets: ATW","General":"Shoe Mount1x Cold Shoe1x Hot Shoe Tripod Mount1x 1/4\\"-20 Female1x 3/8\\"-16 Female Accessory Mounting Thread2x 1/4\\"-20 Built-In Video LightNo Dimensions (W x H x D)7.2 × 7.9 × 13.1″ Weight5.7 lb (Body Only)6.59 lb (With Battery)","Imaging":"Image Sensor7.6 × 4 mm (1/2\\"-Type) 3-Chip CMOS Sensor ResolutionActual: 12.2 MegapixelEffective: 8.29 Megapixel Image StabilizationOptical in Integrated Lens Built-In ND Filter2 to 7 Stop Electronic ND Filter Capture TypeVideo Only","Interface":"Internal StorageNo Video I/O1x BNC (12G-SDI) Output1x HDMI 2.0 Output Audio I/O\\t2x XLR 3-Pin Microphone Input1x 1/8\\" / 3.5 mm TRS Stereo Headphone Output Power I/O1x USB-C (20VDC at 5 A) Input Other I/O1x BNC (Timecode) Input/Output1x BNC (Genlock, Reference)1x RJ45 (Gigabit Ethernet)1x 2.5 mm Sub-Mini (Remote)1x 1/8\\" / 3.5 mm Control Mobile App CompatibleYes: Android & iOSApp Name: Monitor & Control Global Positioning (GPS, GLONASS, etc.)GPS","Item Type":"Camera","Lens":"Focal Length5.6 to 95.2mm (35mm Equivalent: 30.3 to 515mm) Zoom17x Optical Maximum Aperturef/1.9 Minimum Aperturef/16 Minimum Focus DistanceFrom Front of Lens: 2\\" Control RingsFocusZoomIris","Maximum Video Resolution":"4K","Mfr. Model Number":"#PXW-Z300","Power":"BatterySony BP-U Series Power Consumption ≥48 W","Screen Type":"Touchscreen, Tilt, and Swivel","Sensor Size":"1/2","Stabilization":"Yes","Video Capture":"MP4 Proxy/MXF/XAVC-I/XAVC-L3840 × 2160 at 23.98/25/29.97/50/59.94 fps1920 × 1080p at 23.98/25/29.97/50/59.94 fps1920 × 1080i at 50/60.00 fps HDMI Output3840 × 21601920 × 1080p1920 × 1080i SDI/BNC Output3840 × 21601920 × 1080p1920 × 1080i Broadcast OutputNTSCPAL Fast-/Slow-Motion SupportYes Interval Recording ModesTime-Lapse Video Gamma CurveHDR-HLG, Rec709, Rec2020, S Cinetone, Sony S-Log 3 Built-In MicrophoneStereo Audio RecordingMP4, MXF, XAVC: 4-Channel RTMP, RTMPS, SRT Streaming3840 × 2160 at 25p, 29.97p1920 × 1080 at 25p, 29.97p, 50p, 59.94p1280 × 720 at 25p, 29.97p","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Wireless Connectivity":"Wi-Fi"}', 'Sony
