The NP-BJ1 is a rechargeable 3.7V, 700mAh lithium-ion battery for the Sony RX0 and RX0 II. It can capture approximately 240 stills or between 35 and 60 minutes of video footage on a single charge.', 54000.0, '{"Brand":"Sony","Item Type":"Power","Power Type":"Kit, Battery, and Charger"}', '(1)
