INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (3580, 1, 219, 'Sony VENICE 2 Extension System Mini', 'sony-venice-2-extension-system-mini', 'The Sony VENICE 2 Extension System Mini is a compact and lightweight extension system that separates the 8.6K sensor and lens from the body of the VENICE 2, promoting more shooting opportunities with gimbals and smaller spaces. Key features include:

For VENICE 2 8K and 6K
Built-in gyro sensor with metadata
Drop-in filter set included
Detachable 14.8-foot cable

New Product – Coming Soon.

Place your reservation now! We fill orders on a first-come, first-served basis. Please note that included items and rental cost could change as we finalize this listing.

If the listed rental price increases between your preorder and ship dates, don’t worry—you’ll be locked in at your original pre-order price. And if the price decreases, you’ll still pay the lower price. We’ll always contact you to confirm pricing before we ship your order.

Portable VENICE Capabilities. The Sony VENICE 2 Extension System Mini gives VENICE 2 filmmakers a more suitable option for filming in compact spaces, like cars or on motorcycles, without sacrificing that crisp and sharp 8K quality. This system essentially separates the sensor and lens from the body of the VENICE 2, and through the included 14.8-foot cable, connects directly to the camera.

Mounting Options Galore. After connecting to the camera, your next step is probably figuring out how you’re going to mount or rig. Thanks to it’s lightweight design and 15 mounting points, you can rig on anything from a gimbal of your choice to a suction mount on glass.

Included ND Filters. Despite the size of this system, it still manages to accept the included nine ND filters. The set is comprised of filters in 0.3, 0.6, 0.9, 1.2,1.5, 1.8, 2.1, and 2.4 gradations.

VENICE 6K Compatible. You heard that right! Users with the 6K version of the VENICE 2 now have access to an 8K sensor with the v4.0 firmware update.

Built-In Gyro. The sensor block features a built-in gyro sensor designed to collect title and roll metadata, speeding up post-production editing and workflows.', 4668000.0, '{"Brand":"Sony","Camera Mount":"Sony E and PL","Camera Type":"Cinema","Compatibility":"Sony VENICE 2 8K / VENICE 2 6K","Compatible Media":"AXS","Connectors":"Connector 11x 4-Pin LEMO1x BNC Monitor Input (Unused) Connector 21x 3-Pin Fischer 24 V Input1x 3-Pin Fischer 24 V Output","Item Type":"Camera","Maximum Video Resolution":"8K","Mfr. Model Number":"#CBK-3621XS","Physical":"ColorBlack Cable Length14.8’ Dimensions4.1 × 2.5 × 2.4″ Weight1.2 lb (with Sony E Mount Only)2.31 lb (with PL Adapter)","Sensor Size":"Full-Frame","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"No"}', 'Sony
VENICE 2
Extension
System
Mini', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (3581, 1, 219, 'Sony VENICE 2 with Rialto 2 Camera Extension System', 'sony-venice-2-with-rialto-2-camera-extension-system', 'New Product – Coming Soon.

Place your reservation now! We fill orders on a first-come, first-served basis. Please note that included items and rental cost could change as we finalize this listing.

If the listed rental price increases between your preorder and ship dates, don’t worry—you’ll be locked in at your original pre-order price. And if the price decreases, you’ll still pay the lower price. We’ll always contact you to confirm pricing before we ship your order.

The Sony VENICE 2 with Rialto 2 Camera Extension System includes the Sony VENICE 2 8K Digital Motion Picture Camera paired with the Rialto 2 Camera Extension System.

Full-Frame Cinema. With the likes of ARRI, RED, and Sony in the game, full-frame cinema seems to be here to stay. The Sony VENICE 2 8K Digital Motion Picture Camera is a more than competent option for creating large format, cinema-ready images.

Sony Rialto Camera Extension System 2. Maximize the creative possibilities of your VENICE camera with the addition of the Sony Rialto Camera Extension System 2. Compatible with the VENICE, VENICE 2 6K and VENICE 2 8K, the Rialto Extension System 2 separates the sensor block and lens from the body of the camera, greatly increasing your mobility without any lessening of the full-frame image quality. Ideal for handheld and gimbal use and jib, crane, and car rigs, this compact and lightweight system also enables you to capture shots from tight spaces that were previously inaccessible. The new 9.8 and 39’ tethering cables options transmit wide-bandwidth sensor data over longer distances than the original Rialto system.', 15132000.0, '{"Brand":"Sony","Camera Mount":"PL","Camera Type":"Cinema","Compatible Media":"AXS","Item Type":"Camera","Maximum Video Resolution":"8K","Sensor Size":"Full-Frame","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"No","Wireless Connectivity":"Wi-Fi and Bluetooth"}', 'Sony
