Fast, Accurate Autofocus. The 18-300mm uses two linear motors to autofocus quickly, accurately, smoothly, and quietly, making it ideal for stills and video alike. This focusing system gives you a 5.9-inch minimum focusing distance when fully zoomed out, and a 1:2 maximum magnification ratio at the wide end of the zoom range.

