INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (3697, 2, 227, 'Tamron 70-180mm f/2.8 Di III VC VXD G2 for Nikon Z', 'tamron-70-180mm-f-2-8-di-iii-vc-vxd-g2-for-nikon-z', 'The Tamron 70-180mm f/2.8 Di III VC VXD G2 for Nikon Z is an advanced, flexible short to mid telephoto zoom designed for full-frame Nikon Z-mount cameras. Key features include:

Versatile, fast-aperture short to mid telephoto zoom
Revised optical formula for greater sharpness
Fast, accurate, and nearly silent autofocus
VC image stabilization; weather-resistant build

Fast-Aperture Telephoto Zoom. The Tamron 70-180mm f/2.8 Di III VC VXD G2’s short to mid telephoto zoom range and f/2.8 maximum wide-open aperture make it great for sports and wildlife photography. Its bright maximum aperture gives you excellent depth-of-field control; soft, beautiful bokeh; and consistent brightness throughout the zoom range.

Revised Optical Design. The redesigned fifteen-group/twenty-element optical formula includes an extra-low dispersion element, three low-dispersion elements, two glass-molded aspherical elements, and a hybrid aspherical element to give you sharp, high-contrast images across the image plane. Each lens element has a BBAR-G2 coating that combats ghosting, internal reflections, and flare while helping maintain sharpness and color fidelity even in strong light.

VXD Linear-Motor Autofocus System. The 70-180mm’s VXD linear-motor autofocus system tracks even the most fast-moving subjects quickly, accurately, quietly, and smoothly, making it ideal for still and video use. This lens is compatible with Sony’s Direct Manual Focus function and Eye AF on cameras with those features, and there’s also full-time manual-focus override for even greater precision. An 11.8-inch minimum focusing distance lets you get reasonably close to your subject.

Vibration Compensation. Tamron’s Vibration Compensation system is based around a free-floating element controlled by two gyroscoping sensors that measure horizontal and vertical vibrations and compensate accordingly to eliminate the appearance of camera shake.

Durable Construction. You can use this lens in inclement conditions thanks to its moisture-resistant build. The front element’s fluorine coating protects against smearing and debris.', 271000.0, '{"Brand":"Tamron","Filter Size":"67.0mm","Filter Type":"Screw-On","Focus Type":"Autofocus","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"Full-Frame","Lens Mount":"Nikon Z","Lens Type":"Telephoto","Maximum Aperture":"2.8","Mfr. Model Number":"AFA065Z700","Stabilization":"Yes","Weight":"1.9 lb.","Zoom Type":"Variable Focal Length"}', 'Tamron 70-180mm f/2.8
