The mount is also compatible with the Tamron 50-400mm f/4.5-6.3 Di III VC VXD lens. The dovetail design is compatible with most Arca-type heads and clamps.', 57000.0, '{"Brand":"Tamron","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Support Type":"Support Bracket"}', 'Just the tripod mount', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (3707, 5, 227, 'Tamron TAMRON-LINK', 'tamron-tamron-link', 'The Tamron TAMRON-LINK connects to the USB-C port on compatible lenses and pairs with the Tamron Lens Utility app for wireless control of your lens from your smartphone up to 16’ away. Control features include: digital follow focus, ring stopper, astro focus lock, and focus time lapse. You can also remotely adjust the focus ring direction and button assignment. Your Tamron lens must be equipped with a USB-C port for this to work. See if your lens is compatible with Tamron’s Supported Features by Lens checker.', 54000.0, '{"Brand":"Tamron","Dimensions":"1 × 0.28 × 0.26″","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Support Type":"Lens Control","Mfr. Model Number":"TL-01","Weight":"0.00625 lb."}', 'Tamron
TAMRON-LINK', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (3708, 5, 227, 'Tamron TAP-in Console for Canon', 'tamron-tap-in-console-for-canon', 'The Tamron TAP-in Console is a lens dock capable of lens calibration, fine-tuning, and firmware updates for select Tamron EF-mount lenses. Key features include:

Focus Fine-Tuning
VC Modifications
Great value

Focus Fine-Tuning. The TAP-in Console offers the ability to make micro adjustments to fine tune focus, implement a focus distance limiter to constrain near/far distances, and even fine-tune the sensitivity of the focus ring.

Vibration Compensation Modifications. The tap in allows you to choose between three different image stabilization modes on lenses with support for Tamron VC. Switch between viewfinder prioritization, stabilization during shooting, and an option to balance stabilization between the viewfinder and captured images.

Compatible Lenses. The Tamron EF-mount lenses currently supported include: 70-200mm f/2.8 / 24-70mm f/2.8 / 150-600mm f/5-6.3

Firmware Updates. The TAP-in can also keep your primes current with any new firmware released from Tamron.', 57000.0, '{"Brand":"Tamron","Camera Mount":"Canon EF","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Support Type":"Lens Calibrator"}', 'TAP-in
