INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (3732, 5, 230, 'Teradek RT CTRL.3 Compact Lens Control w/ MOTR.S', 'teradek-rt-ctrl-3-compact-lens-control-w-motr-s', 'The Teradek RT CTRL.3 Compact Lens Control w/ MOTR.S efficiently controls your lens’ FIZ functions with the included lens controller, receiver, and lens motor add-on. Key features include:

Bluetooth 2.4 GHz
Built-in lens mapping and data storage
3-channel lens control
297 teeth per second

Feel free to click any of the below highlighted links for additional information and specifications!

The Teradek RT CTRL.3 Compact Lens Control w/ MOTR.S includes:

Teradek RT CTRL.3 3-Axis Wireless Lens Controller
	Teradek RT MDR.S 3-Axis Lens Control Receiver w/ Bluetooth
	Teradek RT MOTR.S Lens Motor Add-on

FIZ Friendly. Pairing nicely with Teradek RT transmitters and receivers, this Teradek RT CTRL.3 3-Axis Wireless Lens Controller wirelessly controls the FIZ functions of your lens from up to 5,000-feet away outdoors, and 500-feet indoors. Its lightweight design makes it an easy companion on your production set, and it can be powered by a single Canon LP-E6N battery for up to 36 hours.

Knobs N’ Bobs. The CTRL.3 features a touch-sensitive zoom joystick, a fluid focus knob, a mappable iris slider, customizable wheels, and FIZ limit buttons.

Built-In Lens Mapping. This lens motor include built-in lens mapping, which will enable the lens to auto-calibrate to the included pre-marked lens rings, and save you time from manually calibrating every lens.

SmallHD and Select Camera Compatible. When paired with a SMallHD monitor, the CTRL.3 will display lens data overlays that gives you immediate visual access to focal distance, focal length, iris, zoom, and more. Additionally, the CTRL.3 can run stop/start control on RED’s EPIC, SCARLET, WEAPON, and RAVEN cameras, ARRI’s ALEXA and AMIRA cameras, and many more!

Teradek RT App. Through the Teradek RT app for iOS, you can manage, update, and configure each aspect of your RT system. Need an iOS device? We have iPads available here!

Wireless FIZ Control. Wirelessly control up to three Teradek RT FIZ motors from 5000-feet away with the included Teradek RT MDR.S 3-Axis Lens Control Receiver w/ Bluetooth! This ultracompact receiver sports a 6-pin port that allows you to trigger run/stop on your camera, and a 3-pin port for the included 3-pin to D-Tap and 3-pin to 2-pin cables.

Display and Controls. A small OLED screen on the front of the receiver displays your battery and motor information. Right underneath, you have access to buttons to toggle menu, display, link, and motors. Additionally, the external antenna can be replaced and customized to your production needs.

MOTR.S Lens Motor. The Teradek RT MOTR.S Lens Motor Add-on is an ultra-compact and lightweight lens motor designed to control the focus, iris, and zoom (FIZ) functions of your lens. As small as it is speedy, the MOTR.S boasts a maximum torque of 0.95nm and a maximum speed of 297 teeth per second. It features a rod clamp that accepts both 15mm and 19mm rods, and includes one 0.8 MOD lens gear.

4-Pin Straight-Angle Motor Cable. The Teradek RT 4-Pin MOTR.X / S Lens Motor Cable 24in provides you with two 4-pin connectors on each end. When attached, the cable faces downwards and can then be used to daisy-chain to another motor.', 1264000.0, '{"Brand":"Teradek","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Support Type":"Lens Control"}', 'Teradek
