ColorCore Technology. Seen in Tiffen’s higher quality filters, the ColorCore process controls the color and density of their filters, ensuring more exact degrees of filtration.

Common Uses. Neutral Density filters are commonly used for slowing shutter speeds to capture movement (waterfalls, clouds, cars, etc.), as well as allowing the use of wider apertures in bright conditions to decrease depth-of-field.', 93000.0, '{"Brand":"Tiffen","Filter Format":"Screw-On","Filter Type":"Neutral Density","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Support Type":"Filter"}', 'Just the filter', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
