INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (3803, 5, 232, 'Tiffen Multi Rota Tray Variable Neutral Density Kit', 'tiffen-multi-rota-tray-variable-neutral-density-kit', 'The Tiffen Multi Rota Tray Variable Neutral Density Kit is a single geared rotating tray for matte box use that simulates a variable ND thru included rotating 138mm and fixed 4 × 5.65-inch circular polarizer filters. Key features include:

6mm ARRI R2-standard 4 × 5.65-inch filter tray
Rotating 138mm circular polarizer filter
Fixed 4 × 5.65-inch circular polarizer filter
Three-in-One: Variable ND, Polarizer & Warm/Cool FX

Rotating Tray. The Tiffen Multi Rota Tray Variable Neutral Density Kit’s single-geared rotating tray lets you simultaneously use and rotate the included geared 138mm circular polarizer filter and fixed 4 × 5.65-inch circular polarizer filter.

Three Filter-Effect Combinations. This kit gives you three filter-effect combinations. You can use the 138mm CP filter on its own, or you can add the fixed 4 × 5.65-inch CP filter for up to six stops of variable neutral density.  Additionally, depending on the direction the tray and 4 × 5.65-inch CP filter are facing, it can also produce a warming / cooling effect.

Versatility. The 6mm ARRI R2-standard 4 × 5.65-inch tray is ideal for matte boxes without a rotating filter stage and cases in which a non-rotating stage requires a secondary rotating filter stage. The tray’s geared wheel gives you precision control either by hand or with a follow focus’s 0.8 MOD (32 pitch) gear wheel, and tray engravings allow easily recreate-able filtration.

Compatibility. The Multi Rota Tray is not compatible with all matte boxes.  Currently our compatible matte boxes include the OConnor O-Box WM Matte Box (front drop-in filter stage), Wooden Camera UMB-1 Swing Away Matte Box and Wooden Camera UMB-1 Clamp On Matte Box.  For a list of officially compatible matte boxes, check Tiffen’s Compatibility List.

Storage Case Included. This kit comes in a durable, compartmentalized case that makes it easy to store and transport the tray and filters.', 221000.0, '{"Brand":"Tiffen","Filter Format":"4×5.6","Filter Type":"Neutral Density","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Support Type":"Filter","Thickness":"0.24\\" (6 mm), ARRI R2 standard","Tray Size":"4 × 5.65″"}', 'Tiffen
