15mm Rod Accessories. For follow focuses, matte boxes, and other rod-mount accessories, there are two 15mm rods and a 15mm rod holder included with this package.', 189000.0, '{"Brand":"Tilta","Camera Cage":"Mounting\\nRod Standard15 mm LWS Spacing Included Rods2x 7.9\\" 15 mm Aluminum Rod Battery Plate TypeNo Accessory MountingMultiple Anti-Twist 1/4\\"-20 Female ThreadMultiple Anti-Twist 3/8\\"-16 Female Thread Tripod Mounting1/4\\"-20 Female Thread, 3/8\\"-16 Female Thread Rod PortsTop Plate2x 15 mm Rod Port Baseplate2x 15 mm Rod Port Shoe MountingNoRosettes Side Plate1x ARRI Rosette w/ M6 Female Thread Cable ClampNo\\n  General\\nSupport TypeBaseplate, Cage, Handheld Support, Rod Support System Grip TypeTopside Handgrip Camera CompatibilitySony BURANO MaterialsAluminum Dimensions16.5 × 9.5 × 6″ Weight4.9 lb","Camera Support Type":"Cage","Item Type":"Camera Support"}', 'Tilta
