INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (3835, 3, 233, 'Tilta Camera Cage for Canon C400 Advanced Kit', 'tilta-camera-cage-for-canon-c400-advanced-kit', 'The Tilta Camera Cage for Canon C400 Advanced Kit is a modular cage system designed to protect and add mounting points to the Canon C400. Key features include:

Manfrotto quick-release bottom plate
Durable aluminum and steel construction
Side ARRI rosette
NATO rail, 1/4"-20 and 3/8"-16 threads

Cage Base Kit. The main component of the Tilta Camera Cage for Canon C400 Advanced Kit is the sturdy, aluminum Camera Cage Base Kit from Tilta. This cage consists of a top plate, left and right side arm plates, a Manfrotto-type quick release bottom plate, and a multifunctional back plate. These components feature an ARRI-style rosette, a NATO rail, and multiple anti-twist 1/4"-20 and 3/8"-16 threads for any accessories you consider adding.

Top Handle. To top off the cage, you’re also provided with a cheese-plate style Tilta Top Handle. This handle easily secures to the cage via four 1/4"-20 screws, while multiple 1/4"-20 and 3/8"-16 threads, a cold shoe mount, and a 15mm rod mount are available for accessory mounting.

VCT Compatibility. The rear locking pin of the VCT system on the shoulder mount is placed on a nato rai for adjustment to ensure compatibility with multiple VCT adapter plate systems, including the Zacuto VCT Tripod Plate) and Sony VCT-14 Quick-Release Tripod Adapter.

Included Rods and Shoulder Pad Baseplate. To wrap this bundle up, you’re provided with two 7.9-inch Tilta 15mm Carbon Fiber Rods and the Tilta Quick Release Shoulder Pad Baseplate, which allows you to easily switch between tripod and handheld shooting.  The baseplate provides front and rear 15mm LWS rod clamps, an integrated shoulder pad, and two ARRI-standard rosettes on either side for attaching separately available handgrips.', 186000.0, '{"Brand":"Tilta","Camera Support Type":"Cage","Dimensions":"6.34 × 5.91 × 6.26″","Item Type":"Camera Support","Material":"Aluminum Alloy, Silicone"}', 'Tilta
