INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (3844, 3, 233, 'Tilta Full Camera Cage for Blackmagic PYXIS 6K', 'tilta-full-camera-cage-for-blackmagic-pyxis-6k', 'The Tilta Full Camera Cage for Blackmagic PYXIS 6K is a modular cage system designed to protect and add mounting points to the Blackmagic PYXIS camera. Key features include:

Top, side arm, and bottom plates
Durable aluminum construction
Side plate with SSD quick release
Quick-release dovetail plate

Modular Mounting. Add a variety of accessories to your PYXIS camera with this Tilta Full Camera Cage for Blackmagic PYXIS 6K! We have the PYXIS available in L-Mount, PL Mount, and EF Mount!

Animal in a Cage. This cage is made up of several different components, all of which can be removed and added as needed. You’re provided with left/right side arm panels, a bottom plate, a top plate, and a side SSD plate, along with an integrated shoe mount, NATO rails, an ARRI-style rosette, 1/4"-20 threads, and 3/8"-16 anti-twist threads.

Additionals and Extras. The included SSD plate is equipped with a slot that accepts SSD’s ranging from  2.05 to 2.36-inches wide and 0.47-inches thick, while a quick-release lever allows you lock and remove the drive at a moment’s notice. The Manfrotto-type quick-release dovetail easily monts your camera to whatever rig setup you have, and attaches to the PYXIS using a bottom thread that aligns perfectly with the optical center of the camera.', 79000.0, '{"Brand":"Tilta","Camera Support Type":"Cage","General":"Support TypeCage Grip Type\\tNo Camera CompatibilityBlackmagic PYXIS 6K Cinema Box Camera","Item Type":"Camera Support","Mounting":"Battery Plate TypeNo Accessory MountingMultiple 1/4\\"-20 Female ThreadMultiple 3/8\\"-16 Female ThreadMultiple ARRI Anti-Twist 3/8\\"-16 Female Thread Tripod MountingBaseplate1/4\\"-20 Female Thread, 3/8\\"-16 Female Thread Quick Release Plate1/4\\"-20 Female Thread, 3/8\\"-16 Female Thread, Manfrotto 501 Shoe Mounting2x Cold Shoe Rosettes1x ARRI Rosette w/ M6 Female Thread Rail Mounting3x NATO Rail","Physical":"MaterialsAluminum, Stainless Steel Dimensions8.6 × 5.5 × 5.4″"}', 'Tilta
