INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (3845, 3, 233, 'Tilta Full Camera Cage for Canon C70 (Black)', 'tilta-full-camera-cage-for-canon-c70-black', 'The Tilta Full Camera Cage for Canon C70 (Black) provides a variety of mounting options in an unobtrusive, form-fitting design for a Canon C70. Key features include:

Full Surround Cage
ARRI-style rosette, 1/4"-20, and 3/8"-16, & cold shoe accessory mounts
NATO rail
For Canon C70

Canon C70 Compatibility. The Tilta Full Camera Cage for Canon C70 (Black) is a full cage for the Canon EOS C70 Cinema Camera that provides extra mounting options on every side of the Canon C70 in a lightweight, unobtrusive form factor.

Full-Surround Cage. This cage consists of two side plates, a top plate, and a bottom plate that come together to form a compact, full enclosure cage, providing camera protection from all sides without obstructing camera ports, buttons, or the display.

Accessory Mounting Solutions. This cage features multiple 1/4"-20 and 3/8"-16 mounting threads, one shoe mount, and a NATO rail for mounting accessories such as a light, monitor, side handle, top handle, or rod support. There is also one ARRI-style rosette on the bottom of the cage to mount an optional handle for vertical shooting or other extension options. The bottom features an Arca-type quick release plate and multiple 1/4"-20 mounting threads for attaching to a tripod, baseplate, or gimbal. The included lens adapter support allows you to use this cage with the Canon EF-EOS R 0.71x Mount Adapter and EF mount lenses on the C70.', 64000.0, '{"Brand":"Tilta","Camera Support Type":"Cage","Item Type":"Camera Support","Mounting Options":"Accessory Mounts1/4\\"-20 threaded holes3/8\\"-16 threaded holes(1) ARRI Rosette w/ M6 threaded holeCamera Plate Mounts1/4\\"-20 tripod thread"}', 'Canon
C70 cage
