RED KOMODO Compatibility. The Tilta Full Camera Cage for RED KOMODO is a lightweight, aluminum cage for the RED KOMODO 6K. Please note that this cage is not compatible with RED DSMC2 cameras.

Full-Surround Cage. This cage consists of two side plates, a top plate, and a bottom plate that come together to form a compact, full enclosure cage, providing camera protection from all sides without obstructing camera ports, buttons, or the display.

Accessory Mounting Solutions. This cage includes a cold shoe mount placed front and center and side plates with rows of 1/4"-20 and 3/8"-16 threaded holes for mounting a variety of common accessories. Each side plate also comes with two integrated ARRI-style rosettes while the bottom plate features 1/4"-20 threaded holes for mounting to tripods.', 79000.0, '{"Brand":"Tilta","Camera Support Type":"Cage","Item Type":"Camera Support","Mounting Options":"Accessory Mounts1/4\\"-20 threaded holes 3/8\\"-16 threaded holes(4) ARRI Rosette w/ M6 threaded holeCamera Plate Mounts1/4\\"-20 tripod thread","Physical":"Materialsaluminum, stainless steel"}', 'Camera cage base
