Battery Plate Only. Since we don’t include a battery with this rental, you may need to snag one to complete your setup. If you do, you can find plenty of options in the Recommended section on your screen, or click here for our entire selection!

Mounting Menace. This battery plate mounts directly to the camera cage of your choice via its 1/4"-20 screw with anti-twist pins. Once the plate is mounted, fear not of slippage and scratches thanks to its soft, padded bottom.', 46000.0, '{"Brand":"Tilta","General":"Camera Power MethodConnector, Dummy Battery Inputs/Outputs1x 2.1 mm Coaxial1x 2.5 mm Coaxial1x USB-A1x USB-C Plate Front / Battery MountSony L-Series Plate Rear Mount1/4\\"-20 Female Number of Battery Bays1 Material of ConstructionAluminum, Stainless Steel IndicatorLED","Item Type":"Power","Physical":"Dimensions3.6 × 1.9 × 0.9″ Weight4.2 oz","Power":"Power InputUSB-C: VDC Power OutputDC Jack: 12 VDC at 2 ADC Jack: 8 VDC at 3 AUSB-A: 5 VDC at 2.1 AUSB-C: VDC","Power Type":"Battery Plate"}', 'Tilta
