INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (3856, 6, 233, 'Tilta Micro Gold Mount Battery Plate for Ring Grip', 'tilta-micro-gold-mount-battery-plate-for-ring-grip', 'The Tilta Micro Gold Mount Battery Plate for Ring Grip allows you to power a gimbal and its accessories directly from a Tilta Ring Grip using separately available cine batteries. Key features include:

Works exclusively with the Tilta Ring Grip system
Attaches to any ring grip accessory power port
Supports hot-swappable, continuous power
Compatible with optional Micro Gold Mount batteries

Extended Power for Tilta Ring Grip. The Tilta Micro Gold Mount Battery Plate for Ring Grip allows you to extend the operating time of your RS 2 gimbal and attached accessories using a high-capacity professional battery. The plate accepts a single Micro Gold Mount battery, which is not included with the rental. If you need a battery, we have several options here that are available as separate rental items.

Compact, Continuous Power. The Tilta Ring Grip accepts up to four battery plates in addition to a DJI Ronin BG30 and supports hot-swapping for continuous shooting throughout the day. The plate is made of aluminum-alloy and stainless steel, and weighs a mere 0.41 lbs, keeping your rig light, but rugged.

Micro Gold Mount Compatibility. This plate is designed for use with Micro Gold Mount batteries that are less than 115mm in length and less than 60mm thick. Please note, standard sized gold mount batteries can only be mounted to the top arm. Need a V-Mount Plate? If you’d prefer a V-Mount compatible battery plate, we also offer the Tilta V-Mount Battery Plate for Ring Grip.', 82000.0, '{"Battery System":"Gold Mount","Brand":"Tilta","Dimensions":"5 × 4 × 2.5 inches","Item Type":"Power","Power Type":"Battery Plate"}', 'Micro
Gold
Mount plate for
Ring
Grip
Mounting clamp
	2.5mm driver', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (3857, 5, 233, 'Tilta Mirage 95mm Variable ND', 'tilta-mirage-95mm-variable-nd', 'The Tilta Mirage Variable ND is a proprietary, 1-9 stop, single geared rotating VND filter / tray combo designed for the Tilta Mirage Matte Box and select system extensions. Key features include:

Designed for Mirage matte box and select accessories
0.3 ~ 2.7 neutral density to reduce exposure up to 9 stops
Dual built-in hard stops prevent X-pattern creep
Gradual adjustments by hand or optional wireless motor

Made for Tilta Mirage. The Tilta Mirage is a modular component matte box system that utilizes a proprietary 95mm clamp and circular filter style to provide a versatile, ultra lightweight alternative to conventional screw-on filters. This VND module is the Tilta 95mm circular standard flagship and requires a compatible Mirage matte box or Lightweight Filter Clamp-On Adapter for use.

Nine Stop Neutral Density. The variable 0.3 – 2.7 ND range reduces image exposure by 1 to 9 stops, allowing you to keep the iris wide open for a shallow depth of field, abide by the 180° rule regarding shutter speed, and optimize your ISO to boost dynamic range. An integrated ND wheel supports gradual adjustments by hand, and wireless control is possible when used with an optional micro motor and controller.

Full Range Color Fidelity. The VND is based on collaborative PL + CPL technology, and is equipped with a large axis between filter elements, to prevent color cast and help produce accurate color renditions even at its maximum density. The module is equipped with built-in hard stops to help prevent that pesky X-Pattern Cross Shadow creep. To prevent vignetting, Tilta reccomends ND 0.3-2.1 for wide lenses and ND 2.1-2.7 for focal lengths beyond 35mm.', 68000.0, '{"Brand":"Tilta","Compatibility":"Tilta Mirage Matte Box, Tilta Lightweight Filter Clamp-On Adapter, Tilta Advanced Control Knob for Mirage Matte Box, Tilta Mirage Wireless Motor, and Tilta Stackable Circle Filter Tray for Mirage (95mm)","Filter Format":"95mm Mirage","Filter Type":"Neutral Density","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Support Type":"Filter","Mfr. Model Number":"MB-T16-VND","Performance":"Stop Reduction1-9Optical Density0.3 ~ 2.7"}', 'Tilta
Mirage 95mm
VND filter
Case', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (3858, 5, 233, 'Tilta Mirage Matte Box', 'tilta-mirage-matte-box', 'The Tilta Mirage is a budget-friendly, modular matte box system that’s durable enough for daily use on your camera rig and lightweight enough for gimbal or drone work. This rental is for the clamp-on matte box only. Key features include:

Multifunctional clip-on matte box with top flag
Fits 95mm lens diameter, 4x threaded adapter rings included
Compatible with 4 × 5.65″ filters and select circular filters
Lightweight, aerodynamic design for stability while shooting

Modular Design. The Tilta Mirage Matte Box’s modular design gives you plenty of configuration options. You can use it in a pared-back configuration with only the 95mm filter holder and lens clamp; you can add the included lens hood or the included top flag; or you can also add the optional 95mm variable ND module, available as a separate rental item.

Designed With the Wind in Mind. The matte box’s body has integrated vents that reduce wind resistance to aid airflow and improve stability when shooting at high speeds, such as on a drone or in a fast-moving car.

Tilta 95mm Circular Standard. This matte box uses Tilta’s 95mm circular filter system and gives you coverage for lenses with up to a 95mm outer lens-barrel diameter. Circular filters are significantly lighter than traditional filters—they weigh about a quarter as much as traditional 4 × 5.65-inch glass filters.', 57000.0, '{"Brand":"Tilta","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Support Type":"Matte Box","Mount":"95mm clamp","Physical":"Dimensions6.5 × 4.5 × 1.3″164 × 115 × 33 mm (Removable Hood)Weight6.3 oz179 g"}', 'Tilta
Mirage
Matte
Box
Top flag
Circular filter tray
	67mm adapter ring
	72mm adapter ring
	77mm adapter ring
	82mm adapter ring', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (3859, 5, 233, 'Tilta Mirage Motorized VND Kit', 'tilta-mirage-motorized-vnd-kit', 'The Tilta Mirage Motorized VND Kit is a modular component system based around the durable, lightweight Tilta Mirage matte box, motor, wireless remote, and VND module. Key features include:

Modular matte box for 95mm circular filters
Built-in vents reduce wind resistance
Mounts directly to 67/72/77/82mm lens threads or 15mm rods
Matte box, motor, remote, and other accessories included

Modular Design. The Tilta Mirage Motorized VND Kit is based around the Tilta Mirage Matte Box, which has a modular design that gives you plenty of configuration options. You can use it in a pared-back configuration with only the 95mm filter holder and lens clamp. You can add the included wireless motor system; variable ND module; 15mm LWS rod support; lens hood; top flag; or 67mm, 72mm, 77mm, or 82mm lens adapters, in addition to a whole host of accessories that aren’t included with this rental.

Variable Neutral-Density System. This rental includes a VND module that lets you precisely adjust the ND effect from 0.3 to 2.7 stops. The module has built-in hard stops between ND 0.3 to 2.7 to help prevent that pesky X-pattern shadow from appearing. The variable ND module has no color shift for natural colors, and it has a larger axis between the filter elements. To prevent vignetting, Tilta recommends using ND 0.3 to 2.1 for wide lenses and ND 2.1 to 2.7 for focal lengths beyond 35mm.

Wireless Motor System. You can mount the Tilta Mirage Wireless Motor to the VND unit and use the included Wireless Controller to remotely change the amount of ND when your camera is mounted on a stabilizer or gimbal, or when you need smooth adjustment without disturbing the camera in the middle of a take. You can also control the VND’s motor with Tilta’s Nucleus-M Wireless Lens Control System in addition to the included wireless remote. The Wireless Controller mounts via NATO rail and can control the Nucleus M and its Nano motor in addition to the included wireless motor. In addition, you can use the included Nucleus Nano Motor Mounting Bracket to secure the Nucleus Nano motor directly to the VND module. The standard wireless range is roughly 328 feet.

Additional Features. The matte box’s body has integrated vents that reduce wind resistance to aid airflow and improve stability when shooting at high speeds, such as on a drone or in a fast-moving car. This kit uses Tilta’s 95mm circular filter system gives you coverage for lenses with up to a 95mm outer lens-barrel diameter. Circular filters are significantly lighter than traditional filters—they weigh about a quarter as much as traditional 4 × 5.65-inch glass filters.', 129000.0, '{"Brand":"Tilta","Filter Format":"95mm Mirage","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Support Type":"Matte Box"}', 'Tilta
