1/4"-20 & cold shoe mounting points
Power accessories via USB-C & DC outputs
Mounts using handwheel NATO connector
L-series battery slot

Double The Power. Add this Tilta Nucleus Nano II Power Handle to your Nucleus Nano II to control FIZ functions for even longer. It attaches to the Nano via the via the pogo connector.

