We rent the Tilta Nucleus-M Battery Charger to add an additional charger to the Tilta Nucleus-M Wireless Lens Control System for charging spare EBL 18650 3.7v 3000mAh Li-ion Rechargeable Batteries. Please note that if you are renting a Nucleus-M follow focus system from us, one battery charger will be included.', 36000.0, '{"Brand":"Tilta","Item Type":"Power","Power Input":"100-240 VAC, 50/60 Hz, 0.15 A 5 VDC, 2 A","Power Output":"4.2 VDC, 650 mAh","Power Type":"Charger"}', 'Charger
