INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (3875, 5, 233, 'Tilta Nucleus-M II Ultimate Kit', 'tilta-nucleus-m-ii-ultimate-kit', 'The Tilta Nucleus-M II Ultimate Kit is a comprehensive bundle designed for precision four-channel lens control. This kit provides impressive updates to the Nucleus-M. Key features include:

Two lens drive motors; 15 & 19mm mounts
Handwheel; Right & left handgrips
Dedicated interference-resistant channel
128 lens data presets with hand unit

What’s Changed? This reimagined Tilta Nucleus-M II Ultimate Kit retains a couple characteristics of its predecessor, like the damping adjustment and menu shortcut layout, but brings several impressive upgrades to the table. Featuring an adjustable handwheel tension, higher torque, built-in lens mapping, four control options, upgraded lens motors, and much more, the Nucleus-M II is the product of your wireless lens control dreams.

Smaller, Sleeker Design. Externally, the components of the Nucleus-M II system promote a sleek, modular, and uniform style. The hand controller sports a large 2.4" touchscreen, and a detachable electronic focus marking disc that supplies digital functionality. The two redesigned lens motors offer a streamlined user interface, LED indicators, an updated PID 2.0 algorithm with a 0.02 second delay-free response time, 15mm and 19mm rod mounts, and a more compact design for seamless rig integration.

Broad Compatibility. Not only is this system backward compatible with the original Nucleus-M system, the Nucleus-M II can also be used with the Nucleus Nano II system, the Mirage Motor, the Blackmagic Camera App, and both Tilta & DJI ecosystems.

Handgrips, Controls, and More. This bundle includes two left and right ergonomic handgrips that you can easily to configure to your comfort, whether you’re shooting handheld or on a stabilizer. With four-channel control over, focus, iris, zoom, and geared filters, the Nucleus-M II is an excellent solution for users searching for robust channels and precision focusing.

Power, Presets, Protection. The handwheel controller and handgrips are all fueled for 8-12 hours by the included NP-F batteries. If a power outage occurs during your production, you can sleep tight knowing that this system offers Power Loss Protection to maintain your MARK point and RANG memory settings. Alongside that protection, the handwheel controller is capable of storing up to 128 data presets, allowing you to recall your previous settings in just seconds.', 696000.0, '{"Brand":"Tilta","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Support Type":"Lens Control","Mfr. Model Number":"#WLC-T06","Receiver / Motor":"BluetoothYes Included Drive Gear0.5 / 0.8 MOD Rod StandardMotor: 15 mm Single RodMotor: 19 mm Single Rod Included Motors2 Motor ModelNucleus-M II Maximum Peak TorqueNot Specified by Manufacturer [Component] I/O1 x LEMO 7-Pin Input1 x LEMO 7-Pin Output Battery TypeNo"}', 'Tilta
