Quiet, Powerful Motor. The brushless lens motor included in this Tilta Nucleus-M Motor Add-On Kit features standard, 0.8 mod, 35-tooth, 32-pitch gearing and three levels of torque control for wide compatibility with geared cinema lenses and lens gear adapters.

15mm & 19mm Compatible. This lens gear will attach to a 19mm rail system or a 15mm rail system with the included bushing installed.

Daisy-Chained Design. We include a 22-inch motor-to-motor cable for daisy chaining this lens motor from a Tilta Nucleus-M Wireless Lens Control System. Please note that a Nucleus-M system will be required to make use of this add-on kit.', 104000.0, '{"Brand":"Tilta","Gear Mod and Pitch":"Gear Mod0.8Gear Pitch32Gear Teeth35Face Width0.4 in","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Support Type":"Lens Control","Maximum Operating Range":"1640 ft","Mfr. Model Number":"WLC-T03-M1","Physical":"Rod Compatibility19mm, 15mmWeight7.8 ozDimensions4.50 × 3.25 × 1.38″Operating Temperature-4 to 122°F / -20 to 50°C"}', 'Tilta
