Quiet, Powerful Motor. The brushless lens motor included in this kit features standard, 0.8 mod, 35-tooth, 32-pitch gearing and three levels of torque control for wide compatibility with geared cinema lenses and lens gear adapters. The lens motor will attach to a 19mm rail system or a 15mm rail system with the included bushing installed.

