Battery Life. We include a pair of batteries will allow operation for up to 10 hours on a single charge. If you need spare batteries, we rent the EBL 18650 3.7v 3000mAh Li-ion Rechargeable Battery 2-pack. The lens motor will require a d-tap power source, and please note that a d-tap power source is not included with this rental.', 186000.0, '{"Brand":"Tilta","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Support Type":"Lens Control","Motor":"Dimensions4.50 × 3.25 × 1.38″ Weight6.7 oz Rod Compatibility 15mm 19mm","Power Supply":"Battery Type18650Battery Quantities(2) Right Grip","Remote Controller":"Dimensions6.9 × 3.3 × 2.3″” Weight 12.5 oz.","Wireless":"Operating Frequency2.4 GHz Transmission Distance Approximately 1000’ line of sight"}', 'Right handgrip
