Hardware
Kit', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (3898, 3, 233, 'Tilta Universal 15mm LWS Baseplate for V-RAPTOR and PYXIS', 'tilta-universal-15mm-lws-baseplate-for-v-raptor-and-pyxis', 'The Tilta Universal 15mm LWS Baseplate for V-RAPTOR and PYXIS enables you to attach two 15mm rods for additional accessories. Key features include:

Dual 15mm LWS rod clamps
1/4"-20 and 3/8"-16 mounting threads
Compatible with 19mm baseplate
Compatible with Tilta-Standard dovetail

15mm LWS Universal Baseplate. The Tilta Universal 15mm LWS Baseplate for V-RAPTOR and PYXIS enables use of rod-based accessories, like a follow focus or matte box, on your RED V-RAPTOR cinema camera rig using two 15mm rods. This unit uses a quick release connection, customized for the V-RAPTOR Camera Cage and PYXIS Camera Cage, making it insanely easy to install or remove.

Locking Toggle and Mounting. A 1/4"-20 thread and 3/8"-16 thread are included on this baseplate to allow compatibility with third-party quick release systems. The integrated locking toggle helps lock the cage in place to avoid detaching at the wrong moment, and also includes a receiver underneath the baseplate to connect to Tilta or ARRI dovetails.

Rods Not Included. You’ll need your own or to rent 15mm rods to use rail mounted accessories with this baseplate. We have a pair of 15mm 8 inch rods available here if you need to add them to your order!', 79000.0, '{"Brand":"Tilta","Camera Support Type":"Baseplate","Compatibility":"RED V-RAPTOR","General":"MaterialsAluminum, Steel Dimensions6.5 × 4.5 × 4″ Weight0.8 lb","Item Type":"Camera Support","Mounting":"Rod Standard15 mm LWS / 60 mm Spacing Battery Plate TypeNone Accessory MountingMultiple x 1/4\\"-20 Thread, Multiple x 3/8\\"-16 Thread Tripod Mounting1/4\\"-20 Thread, 3/8\\"-16 Thread Rod Ports2 × 15 mm Rod Port Shoe MountingNone RosettesNone"}', 'Tilta 15mm
LWS
Manfrotto
Baseplate', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (3899, 6, 233, 'Tilta V-Mount Battery Plate for Ring Grip', 'tilta-v-mount-battery-plate-for-ring-grip', 'The Tilta V-Mount Battery Plate for Ring Grip allows you to power a gimbal and its accessories directly from a Tilta Ring Grip using separately available V-Mount batteries. Key features include:

Works exclusively with the Tilta Ring Grip system
Attaches to any ring grip accessory power port
Supports hot-swappable, continuous power
Compatible with optional V-Mount batteries

Extended Power for Tilta Ring Grip. The Tilta V-Mount Battery Plate for Ring Grip allows you to extend the operating time of your RS 2 gimbal and attached accessories using a high-capacity professional battery. The plate accepts a single, standard V-Mount battery, which is not included with the rental. If you need a battery, we have several options here that are available as separate rental items.

Combos for Compact, Continuous Power. The Tilta Ring Grip accepts up to four battery plates in addition to a DJI Ronin BG30 and supports hot-swapping for continuous shooting throughout the day. The plate is made of aluminum-alloy and stainless steel, and weighs a mere 0.41 lbs, keeping your rig light, but rugged.

V-Mount Compatibility. This plate is compatible with most V-Mount batteries but we recommend micro or low profile batteries to keep your load light and movements unobstructed. Need a Gold Mount Plate? If you’d prefer a Gold-Mount compatible battery plate, we also offer the Tilta Micro Gold Mount Battery Plate for Ring Grip.', 82000.0, '{"Battery System":"V-Mount","Brand":"Tilta","Item Type":"Power","Power Type":"Battery Plate"}', 'V-Mount battery plate for
Ring
Grip
Mounting clamp
	2.5mm driver', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
