INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (3911, 5, 234, 'Tokina 86mm Cinema PRO IRND Filter Kit (5-7 Stop)', 'tokina-86mm-cinema-pro-irnd-filter-kit-5-7-stop', 'The Tokina 86mm Cinema PRO IRND Filter Kit (5-7 Stop) is a set of high-quality infrared-absorbing neutral-density filters designed for use with high-end cinema cameras.

The Tokina 86mm Cinema PRO IRND Filter Kit (5-7 Stop) includes:

Tokina 86mm PRO IRND 1.5
	Tokina 86mm PRO IRND 1.8
	Tokina 86mm PRO IRND 2.1

Designed for High-End Cinema Cameras. Most light-sensitive high-end cinema cameras don’t include built-in low-pass or IR-cut filters, but many manufacturers recommend using IRND filters on their cine cameras. While many currently available IRND filters adversely affect image quality, with color shifting and white-balance alteration being particular concerns, the Tokina 86mm PRO IRND Filters are designed to precisely control the amount of light entering the lens without affecting the color.

High-Quality Build. These filters have a metallic ND vapor deposition coating on both sides of their professional-grade optical glass, creating high precision and maximum neutrality. The Tokina 86mm PRO IRND 1.5 provides 5 stops of ND, the Tokina 86mm PRO IRND 1.8 provides 6 stops of ND, and the Tokina 86mm PRO IRND 2.1 provides 7 stops of ND.

86mm Filter Thread. These filters are designed for lenses with 86mm filter threads. They’re standard-depth filters, so do watch for vignetting on wide-angle lenses.

Assistant Camera Utility Belt and Basic Tool Set
	X-Rite ColorChecker Passport Photo
	Denecke TS-C Compact Time Code Slate', 171000.0, '{"Brand":"Tokina","Filter Format":"Screw-On","Filter Type":"Neutral Density","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Support Type":"Filter"}', 'Tokina 86mm
