INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (3916, 2, 234, 'Tokina Cinema 25-75mm T2.9 (EF)', 'tokina-cinema-25-75mm-t2-9-ef', 'The Tokina Cinema 25-75mm T2.9 (EF) is a versatile parfocal cine zoom designed for cameras using Super 35 and select larger-sized sensors. Key features include:

Versatile telephoto zoom in a compact build
Advanced optical design
Standardized focus and iris ring positions
Parfocal design for minimal focus breathing and image shift

Canon EF Mount. We carry this Cinema ATX lens in a couple of different mounts. This is the Canon EF-mount version.

Versatile Cine Zoom. The Tokina Cinema 25-75mm T2.9 boasts a highly versatile zoom range in a compact build. Its 2.4-foot minimum focusing distance lets you get tight close-ups, even while you’re at a comfortable distance from your subject.

Nine-Blade Aperture. A clickless nine-bladed iris produces exceptional round bokeh in out-of-focus areas. Such luxurious bokeh gives you a dreamy look when shooting wide open.

High-Quality Optical Design. The 25-75mm’s fifteen-group/eighteen-element design renders sharp, high-contrast images while combating flare, ghosting, and diffraction. Each lens element has a multilayer coating to further help reduce aberrations.

Standardized Features. All the lenses in Tokina’s Cinema series have the same 95mm front diameters, 0.8 pitch gears, 86mm filter threads, and focus and iris ring positions. This allows for super-fast lens changes just by swinging your matte box and dropping your follow focus without moving their positions. Markings in feet appear on both sides making it easy for ACs and focus-pullers to do their jobs.

Minimal Focus Breathing and Image Shift. The Cinema-series lenses’ parfocal design lets them retain focus while avoiding breathing and image shift. We wish all cinema lenses would hold their breath as well as these Tokinas.', 746000.0, '{"Brand":"Tokina","Gear Mod and Pitch":"Focus: 0.8 MOD / 32 Pitch\\nIris: 0.8 MOD / 32 Pitch\\nZoom: 0.8 MOD / 32 Pitch","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Mount":"Canon EF","Lens Type":"Standard"}', 'Tokina 25-75mm
