	Tokina Cinema Vista 105mm T1.5

Sony E-Mount. We carry this Vista Vision lens set in several different mounts. This is the Sony E-mount version.

This six-lens kit ships in a custom hard case and includes a single 15mm lens support. Please note, 15mm rods are not included with this rental but are available as separate rental items.

