High-Quality Optics. The thirteen-group/fifteen-element optical formula includes three aspherical elements, three glass-molded low-dispersion elements, and a bulbous front element to reduce chromatic aberrations and distortion. Each individual element has a multi-coating to combat flare and ghosting while maintaining high contrast and accurate color fidelity.', 150000.0, '{"Brand":"Tokina","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Mount":"Nikon F","Lens Type":"Ultra Wide Angle and Wide Angle"}', 'Tokina opera 16-28mm
