1/4"20 screw on top

This handgrip features a 1/4"-20 screw on top for attaching your camera, and a 1/4"-20 thread on the bottom for mounting on a tripod or other support. Constructed from an aluminum alloy, the BG-2 Power Bank Handgrip comes with a USB Type-A to Type-C charging cable, as well as a Type-A to Type-C USB Adapter.', 36000.0, '{"Battery":"6800 mAh","Brand":"Ulanzi","Connectivity":"(1) USB Type-C\\n(1) USB Type-A","Dimensions":"4.92 × 1.26″ / 12.5 × 3.2 cm","Item Type":"Power","Power Type":"Portable Power"}', 'Powerbank handgrip
