Working with a long arm jib and the zoom control cable won’t reach?  Sounds like you need this cable right here. It’s 50 feet long, and it has a 2.5mm male and 2.5mm female connections, offering compatibility with any zoom control with the same.', 39000.0, '{"Brand":"Varizoom","Cable Type":"Control","Item Type":"Cable","Length":"50.0’"}', 'Just the cable', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
