PL mount, ultra-wide cine lens
Great for landscape, outdoor, and tight interior shooting
High-quality optics for distortion-free images
122° angle of view, 7-inch close focus, 0.8 mod cine gears

PL Mount. This 12mm cinema lens was designed for use on PL-mount cameras. It can cover both standard 35mm and Super35 image sensors. Its image circle will cover full-frame, VistaVision, and Arri Alexa LF sized sensors and smaller.

Ultra-Wide Cine Lens. The Venus Optics Laowa 12mm T2.9 Zero-D Cine’s ultra-wide 122° angle of view makes it great for landscape shooting, outdoor photography, and working in interior locations where space is at a premium.

Virtually Distortion-Free. This lens’s rectilinear ten-group/sixteen-element optical design keeps distortion at an absolute minimum, a rarity for an ultra-wide lens. Its seven-blade aperture gives you pleasing bokeh; unique wide and shallow depth of field; and an extremely close seven-inch focusing distance.

