Advanced optical design; next to no distortion
Accurate, fully manual focusing

PL Mount. This wide-angle close-up lens was designed for use on PL-mount cameras. It can cover both standard 35mm and Super 35 image sensors.

Optimized for Video Use. This “cine mod” version of the lens features geared aperture and focus rings. Please note, due to the height of the PL mount on most cinema cameras, it is unlikely that a standard follow focus configuration will work with this lens. If you need to be able to use a follow focus on your shoot, contact us and a tech will be happy to demo your combination of gear out and confirm compatibility before you rent.

Wide-Angle Macro Lens. The Venus Optics Laowa 24mm Probe Lens’s unique design gives you a larger-than-life 2:1 maximum magnification and a 0.8-inch working distance. As a wide-angle lens, it gives you greater depth of field than standard telephoto macros. This means you get less subject isolation and more background detail.

