Fully Manual Lens. This is a fully manual lens that provides no electronic communication with the camera. You must manually make all aperture and focus adjustments on the lens itself, and lens information is not transferred through EXIF data.

Looking for a More Robust Alternative? If you’re looking for a more feature-rich probe lens for creative shoots, check out the Venus Optics Laowa 24mm T14 2x PeriProbe for ARRI PL, which includes interchangeable 0° direct-view and 90° periscope modules.', 379000.0, '{"Angle of View":"85°","Aperture Blades":"7","Brand":"Venus Optics","Dimensions":"2.4 × 15.6″ (ø x L)","Focal Length":"24-24","Focus Rotation":"360º","Focus Type":"Manual Focus Only","Front Lens Diameter":"20mm","Gearing":"0.8 MOD focus, iris","Groups/Elements":"19/27","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"Full-Frame","Lens Mount":"PL","Lens Type":"Wide Angle, Macro, Specialty, Cine, and For Mirrorless","Maximum Aperture":"14.0","Maximum Magnification":"2x","Mfr. Model Number":"VE2414PL","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Weight":"1.0 lb.","Zoom Type":"Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Venus
