High-Quality Optics. This lens’s ten-group/fourteen-element design includes three low-dispersion elements that help to eliminate chromatic aberrations and color fringing while keeping images sharp and color-accurate.

Fully Manual Lens. The 65mm f/2.8 is a fully manual lens. Its internal-focusing design means that it maintains its overall length during use, while its nine-blade aperture produces pleasing bokeh. The lens barrel includes focus-distance and depth-of-field scales for precision control.', 111000.0, '{"Angle of View":"24.4°","Aperture Blades":"9","Brand":"Venus Optics","Dimensions":"2.2 × 3.9″ (ø x L)","Filter Size":"52.0mm","Filter Type":"Screw-On","Focal Length":"65-65","Focus Type":"Manual Focus Only","Groups/Elements":"10/14","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"APS-C","Lens Mount":"Fuji X","Lens Type":"Telephoto, Macro, and For Mirrorless","Maximum Aperture":"2.8","Maximum Magnification":"2x","Mfr. Model Number":"VE6528FX","Minimum Focusing Distance":"6.69\\"","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"No","Weight":"0.74 lb.","Zoom Type":"Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Venus
