Ultra-Fast Standard Prime. The Venus Optics Laowa Argus 33mm f/0.95 CF APO’s combination of standard focal length and ultra-fast aperture makes it excellent for low-light photography, astrophotography, narrative videography, and portraiture with shallow depth of field.

High-Quality Optics. This lens’s apochromatic nine-group/fourteen-element optical design includes one aspherical element, one extra-low dispersion element, and three ultra-high refraction elements that combine to help eliminate chromatic aberrations and color fringing while keeping images sharp.

Fully Manual Lens. The 33mm f/0.95 is a fully manual lens. Its internal-focusing design means that it maintains its overall length during use, and its long focus throw and minimal breathing are ideal for video applications. Its nine-blade aperture produces pleasing bokeh, and the stepless aperture ring ensures smooth exposure transitions. The lens barrel includes focus-distance and depth-of-field scales for precision control.', 107000.0, '{"Angle of View":"46.2°","Aperture Blades":"9","Brand":"Venus Optics","Dimensions":"2.8 × 3.3″ (ø x L)","Filter Size":"62.0mm","Filter Type":"Screw-On","Focal Length":"33-33","Focus Type":"Manual Focus Only","Groups/Elements":"9/14","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"APS-C","Lens Mount":"Sony E","Lens Type":"For Mirrorless and Standard","Maximum Aperture":"0.95","Mfr. Model Number":"VE3395SE","Minimum Focusing Distance":"13.8\\"","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"No","Weight":"1.3 lb.","Zoom Type":"Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Venus
