INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (4144, 2, 243, 'Venus Optics Laowa Nanomorph 28-55mm T2.9 E (Silver Flare)', 'venus-optics-laowa-nanomorph-28-55mm-t2-9-e-silver-flare', 'The Venus Optics Laowa Nanomorph 28-55mm T2.9 E (Silver Flare) is a compact, Super 35 anamorphic zoom lens that produces a silver flare around light sources, and is designed for use with Sony E-mount cameras. Key features include:

S35 sensor coverage; Full-frame compatible
T2.9 to T22 aperture
0.8 MOD focus, iris & zoom gears
9-blade iris

Make It Cinematic. Filmmakers and videographers rejoice, your choices for anamorphic zoom lenses just expanded! The Venus Optics Laowa Nanomorph 28-55mm T2.9 E (Silver Flare) supplies users with a compact and lightweight option for capturing footage in a widescreen ratio of 2.4:1, with a constant 1.5X squeeze ratio, 17.7-inch minimum focusing distance, and a particularly cool silver flare around light sources.

Super 35 Sony E-Mount. This lens is designed for use on E-mount cameras. Its 31.5mm image circle works best with Super 35 sensor cameras, but will work just fine with a full-frame cameras, if you’re okay with some slight vignette around your imaging!

Advanced Optical Design. This lens’s 15-group/21-element optical design allows you to capture sharp, detailed images throughout its focal length, and its nine-blade aperture gives you pleasing oval bokeh and a unique wide and shallow depth of field.

Professional-Grade Cinema Housing. The aperture, focus, and zoom rings all boast standard 0.8 mod gears so that you can easily install a follow-focus system. The 100° zoom throw and 270° focus throw ensures precision movement, and the 41° aperture rotation allows for exacting depth-of-field control. This lens’s relatively lightweight and compact design means you can use it for hand-held shooting, and on gimbals, shoulder rigs, car rigs, and more.

Uniform Design. All of the Laowa Nanomorph lenses have uniform gear positions so that you can switch among different focal lengths with ease, while their standard 80mm front diameters and 77mm filter threads let you use common matte boxes and filters.', 586000.0, '{"Anamorphic Squeeze":"1.5x","Angle of View":"56.7-30.7°","Aperture Blades":"9","Brand":"Venus Optics","Dimensions":"3.3 × 7.4″ (ø x L)","Filter Size":"77.0mm","Filter Type":"Screw-On and Matte Box Mount","Focal Length":"28-55","Focus Rotation":"270º","Focus Type":"Manual Focus Only","Front Lens Diameter":"80mm","Gearing":"0.8 MOD focus, iris, zoom","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"Super35 and APS-C","Lens Mount":"Sony E","Lens Type":"Cine, Standard, Anamorphic, and For Mirrorless","Maximum Aperture":"2.9","Mfr. Model Number":"VE2855ES","Minimum Focusing Distance":"1.47’","Parfocal/Varifocal":"Parfocal","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"No","Weight":"3.3 lb.","Zoom Ratio":"1.96x","Zoom Type":"Variable Focal Length"}', 'Venus
