Optics and Mechanics. Through one ultra-precision aspherical lens, three extra-low dispersion lenses, and nine high refractive index lenses, this 85mm lens is effective in minimizing close range distortion and chromatic aberrations. Overall, the inner workings of the lens features fifteen elements in ten groups, and an 11-blade diaphragm pulls focus to your subject with a creamy, round, and soft bokeh (yes, even in low light!). Its dual Hyper VCM motors delivers smooth, fast autofocus with advanced face and eye detection, ensuring your subject stays in proper focus.

All-Weather Durable Design. Constructed entirely from metal, this lens merges durability with a lightweight structure. The entire construction is dust and splash-proof, while the front-most lens element is coated with a water- and stain-resistant film to repel fingerprints and water drops!

Controls, Functions, More. The lens barrel sports one customizable Fn button, a click switch, and a focus limiter that all team up to give you immediate access to all of the control you need. Additionally, the front filter thread accepts 82mm filters to further drive creative style.', 171000.0, '{"Angle of View":"28°","Aperture Blades":"11","Brand":"Viltrox","Dimensions":"3.3 × 4.3″ (ø x L)","Filter Size":"77.0mm","Filter Type":"Screw-On","Focal Length":"85-85","Focus Type":"Autofocus","Groups/Elements":"11/15","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"Full-Frame","Lens Mount":"Sony E","Lens Type":"For Mirrorless and Telephoto","Maximum Aperture":"1.4","Maximum Magnification":"0.13x","Mfr. Model Number":"#AF 85/1.4 FE","Minimum Focusing Distance":"2.6’","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Weight":"1.8 lb.","Zoom Type":"Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Viltrox
