Try it with These Z-Mount Cameras. If matching by style, the Voigtlander Nokton 50mm f/1.0 pairs well with the vintage aesthetic of the Nikon Zf, but it will attach to any Z-mount camera, including APS-C/crop-frame sensor cameras, such as the retro-looking Nikon Zfc, where the lens will provide an equivalent 75mm focal length.', 382000.0, '{"Brand":"Voigtlander","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Mount":"Nikon Z","Lens Type":"Standard"}', 'Voigtlander
