Shortens Minimum Focusing Distance. What sets this adapter apart from others is the focusing helicoid that lets you reduce the mounted lens’s minimum focus distance. By using a focusing design, you can adjust the helicoid back to 0 to regain infinity focus.', 89000.0, '{"Brand":"Voigtlander","Camera Mount":"Sony E","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Mount":"Leica M","Lens Support Type":"Mount Adapter"}', 'Just the adapter', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
