Simple clamp-on installation
Durable rubber and stainless steel design

Holds One Filter. The Wooden 4 × 5.65 Zip Box (110-115mm) holds a single 4 × 5.65-inch filter and will fit lenses with a 110-115mm front diameter. This includes most Zeiss CP.2, Rokinon Xeen, and Canon CN-E Cine Primes. If you’re unsure about compatibility, you can check any of our cine lenses’ Specs sections.

Lightweight. The Zip Box is a lightweight, flexible rubber matte box alternative. This makes it ideal for gimbal work while keeping your rig compact.

Wide-Angle Compatibility. Once seated, the filter sits just 1.5mm away from the lens, meaning that you can avoid vignetting even at wide angles.

Simple Installation. To install the Zip Box, simply flex its rubber body to snugly fit around the filter(s), then tighten the thumbscrew to clamp it onto the lens.', 71000.0, '{"Brand":"Wooden Camera","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Support Type":"Matte Box"}', 'Just the
