Corrected Camera Height. The Wooden Camera Top Mount Kit for RED KOMODO adjusts a RED KOMODO 6K to the optimal lens height for adding accessories and fits in within the camera’s footprint. The baseplate also adds 1/4"-20 mounting points to the camera base.

15mm Accessories. The baseplate comes equipped with LWS spaced 15mm rod bracket to allow mounting of most 15mm lens accessories such as follow focuses, matte boxes, and supports.

No Top Plate. This rental is only for the KOMODO compatible baseplate. If you would also like a top handle with monitor and cheese plate mount, you’ll need to add the Wooden Camera Top Mount Kit for RED KOMODO separately.', 114000.0, '{"Brand":"Wooden Camera","Camera Support Type":"Baseplate","Item Type":"Camera Support","Mounting Options":"(2) ARRI-standard rosette\\n1/4\\"-20 threaded hole"}', 'Lower dovetail
