Sleek & Functional Design. This adapter is designed to enable focusing to infinity and is constructed from a durable yet lightweight aluminum alloy.  The 1/4"-20 thread allows you to attach a lens support to reduce strain on the camera mount, while three lever tabs provide a grip for rotating the adapter’s lens lock. The included LPL-mount cap protects the interior of your camera when no lens is mounted.', 129000.0, '{"Brand":"Wooden Camera","Camera Mount":"Canon RF","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Mount":"LPL","Lens Support Type":"Mount Adapter","Physical":"MaterialAluminumTripod Mounting Thread1/4\\"-20 FemaleDimensionsH: 3.2 x W: 3.2 x D: 1.8\\" Weight7.6 oz"}', 'Wooden
