Bracket for
DSMC2
	1/4-20
Shoe
Mount
	(2)
Wooden 6" 15mm
Rods
Hardware kit', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (4296, 6, 254, 'Wooden Camera Gold Mount Micro Battery Slide', 'wooden-camera-gold-mount-micro-battery-slide', 'This Wooden Camera Gold Mount Micro Battery Slide attaches to your rig using a 15mm rod clamp and provides Gold Mount power to your camera via two D-Tap connections. Key features include:

1/4"-20 and 3/8"-16 threads
Plate slides up and down
Two D-Tap ports
9A resettable fuse

Good As Gold. Add this Wooden Camera Gold Mount Micro Battery Slide to your rig to supply Gold Mount power to your camera through the plate’s two D-Tap connections! This plate slides up and down until it’s perfectly positioned on your rig, where you can then tighten it into place using the attached lever. Additionally featured is a 9A fuse is that can be reset as needed!

15mm Rod Mounting. To attach the plate to your tripod- or shoulder-mounted rig, you’ll find a dual 15mm rod clamp on the bottom, and to accommodate additional accessories, you have access to multiple 1/4"-20 and 3/8"-16 threads on the back of the plate and on the rod clamp.', 118000.0, '{"Battery System":"Gold Mount","Brand":"Wooden Camera","General":"Plate Front / Battery MountMicro Gold Mount Plate Rear Mount15 mm Rod Clamp Number of Battery Bays1 Accessory Mounting1/4\\"-20 Female, 3/8\\"-16 Female IndicatorLED","Item Type":"Power","Physical":"Dimensions5.1 × 4.3 × 2″ Weight9.2 oz","Power":"Power InputMicro Gold Mount: VDC Maximum Load9 A Power OutputD-Tap: VDC","Power Type":"Battery Plate"}', 'Wooden
