Manual Aperture and Focus. This adapter provides no electronic communication between the camera and lens. You must make all aperture and focus adjustments manually on the lens itself. The aperture you select won’t be displayed on the camera, and it won’t show up in the EXIF data.', 125000.0, '{"Autofocus":"Manual Focus Only","Brand":"Wooden Camera","Camera Mount":"Sony E","Dimensions":"4″ × 4″ × 3″","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Mount":"PL","Lens Support Type":"Mount Adapter","Stabilization":"No","Tripod Mount":"1/4\\"-20"}', 'Adapter
