INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (4319, 3, 254, 'Wooden Camera Pass-Through Top Plate for RED DSMC2', 'wooden-camera-pass-through-top-plate-for-red-dsmc2', 'The Wooden Camera Pass-Through Top Plate for RED DSMC2 is a top plate designed to work with RED DSMC2 cameras to pass through top handle and monitor signals while providing additional mounting points for accessories.

Works with Weapon, Epic-W, Scarlet-W, and Raven cameras
Passthrough of top handle and monitor signals
RED spaced 1/4-20 & 3/8-16 threads
Four ARRI standard accessory mounts

Designed For Use With RED DSMC2 Camera Brains. The Wooden Camera Pass-Through Top Plate is a top plate designed to work with RED Weapon, Epic-W, Scarlet-W, and Raven cameras to pass through the 26pin LCD connection and 3pin trigger handle interface connection found on the top of RED DSMC2 camera bodies.

A Plethora Of 1/4-20 & 3/8-16 Threads. In usual Wooden Camera fashion, this top plate has an abundance of 1/4-20 and 3/8-16 threaded holes in RED’s standard spacing. This plate also adds four ARRI standard mounting points for accessories utilizing that connection.

Pairs Well With Other Wooden Accessories. As with past Wooden hardware, this piece works well with Wooden accessories like NATO rails and handles to customize your rig in just the way that fits your production or shooting style. We recommend the Easy Riser Baseplate for DSMC2 Cameras to complete the ensemble and add support for 15mm rods.', 111000.0, '{"Attachment Size":"1/4-20, 3/8-16, and ARRI Standard","Brand":"Wooden Camera","Camera Support Type":"Baseplate","Item Type":"Camera Support"}', 'Just the top plate', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (4320, 3, 254, 'Wooden Camera Pro Accessory Kit for RED KOMODO (Gold Mount)', 'wooden-camera-pro-accessory-kit-for-red-komodo-gold-mount', 'The Wooden Camera Pro Accessory Kit for RED KOMODO (Gold Mount) preps a RED KOMODO for 15mm rod accessories, 1/4" & 3/16" screw mounted accessories, and Gold Mount power. Key features include:

Designed for the RED KOMODO 6K cinema camera
12-inch, 15mm, pass-through rods
Adjustable top handle w/ 15mm LWS rod support
Quick release plate, dovetail, and monitor mount included

For the RED KOMODO. The Wooden Camera Pro Accessory Kit for RED KOMODO (Gold Mount) is tailored to fit the RED KOMODO 6K line of cinema cameras and will not work with other makes or models.

Baseplate With Pass-Through Rods. The baseplate design adds LWS-spaced 15mm rail support to your camera, and the Arca-style quick-release plate and ARRI standard dovetail clamp make swapping support quick and easy. This rental includes a pair of 12-inch, 15mm rods. Please note that we don’t include a Stainless Steel 1/4-20 Threaded Support Post, and it must be rented separately.

Top Mount Kit. This pro accessory kit includes a top plate designed to fit the KOMODO that adds an Arca-style plate mount and multiple threaded holes for accessories. The top mount includes a a depth-adjustable top handle with attached 15mm LWS spaced rail mounts and a row of 1/4"-20 and 3/8"-16 mounting points.

Monitor Mount. This kit includes a monitor mount that can be attached directly to the Arca-Swiss style top plate or to the sideways-oriented 15mm rod mount on the top handle. The mount attaches to monitors via 1/4"-20 screw and offers tilt adjustment.

Gold Mount Power. This kit also includes a Wooden Gold Mount Battery Slide that greatly extends the battery life while still allowing access to one of the camera’s integrated Canon BP-9 series battery slots for adding accessories like the Wooden Camera B-Box. The battery slide comes equipped with three d-tap ports and pass-through DC power.', 382000.0, '{"Brand":"Wooden Camera","Camera Support Type":"Accessory Kit","Item Type":"Camera Support"}', 'Gold
Mount battery slide
Top mount kit
15mm
LWS baseplate
