Designed for easy multi shoe and battery compartment access

For Sony FX3 / FX3 and stock XLR Handle Unit. The Wooden Open Cage Accessory Kit for Sony FX3 / FX3A / FX30 is tailored to fit Sony’s FX3, FX3A, and FX30 camcorders, and is custom-built for camera configurations utilizing Sony’s stock XLR-H1 handle unit.

Baseplate. Integrate 15mm rod support systems at the correct lens height for your Sony camera using this LW 15mm Baseplate from Wooden Camera. The quick release baseplate has dual 15mm rod ports that have two locking thumbscrews to tighten or release the system.

XLR Cheese Plate. This Wooden Camera Cheese-Style Plate attaches to your Sony FX3/A/30’s XLR handle to expand its mounting capabilities. Multiple 1/4"-20 and 3/8"-16 threads on the plate allow you to attach articulating arms for on-camera monitors, among other accessories. A cold shoe mount can accommodate a wireless transmitter or shotgun microphone.

Convenient Surroundings. This kit combines a half cage and handgrip to create a rugged and versatile support accessory system that protects your camera like a full-surround camera cage when paired with your camera’s XLR Handle Unit. Please note, this rental does not include a top handle.', 200000.0, '{"Brand":"Wooden Camera","Camera Support Type":"Accessory Kit","Compatibility":"Sony FX3Sony FX3ASony FX30","Item Type":"Camera Support"}', 'Wooden
