INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (4381, 3, 254, 'Wooden Unified Accessory Kit for BMPCC 6K G2 / Pro (V-Mount)', 'wooden-unified-accessory-kit-for-bmpcc-6k-g2-pro-v-mount', 'The Wooden Unified Accessory Kit for BMPCC 6K G2 / Pro (V-Mount) enables a professional setup for cinema production with your Blackmagic Pocket Cinema Camera 6K G2 or 6K Pro. Key features include:

15-inch, 15mm, pass-through rods
Designed for Blackmagic Pocket Cinema Camera 6K G2/Pro
Adjustable top or side handle
Quick release plate, dovetail, and HDMI angled adapter included

Blackmagic Business. The Wooden Unified Accessory Kit for BMPCC 6K G2 / Pro (V-Mount) is designed for a BlackMagic 6K G2 or 6K Pro camera. If you need something similar for other versions of the BMPCC, check out the Wooden Unified Base Accessory Kit for BMPCC 6K Pro or the Wooden Unified Base Accessory Kit for BMPCC4K/6K.

Unified Baseplate With Pass-Through Rods. The Wooden Unified Baseplate design adds LWS spaced 15mm rail support to your camera, and the dual-purpose quick-release plate or dovetail clamp make swapping support quick and easy. This rental includes a pair of 15-inch, 15mm rods. Please note that we don’t include the Stainless Steel 1/4"-20 Threaded Support Post, and it must be rented separately.

Unified Camera Cage. This kit includes a cage tailored to fit the Blackmagic Pocket Cinema Camera 6K Pro EF and PL, and the 6K G2 that adds multiple 1/4" & 3/8" threaded holes around the camera body for threaded accessories. This kit includes a top handle for quick transition from tripod to run-and-gun shooting.

V-Mount Powered. This kit includes a V-Mount battery plate for fueling your rig. We suggest the Anton Bauer Dionic XT90 V-Mount Battery, but there’s plenty of options! If you need a Gold Mount version of this product, check out the Wooden Unified Accessory Kit for BMPCC 6K Pro.', 511000.0, '{"Brand":"Wooden Camera","Camera Support Type":"Accessory Kit","Item Type":"Camera Support"}', 'Wooden 15mm
