Slide, But Secure. With the Wooden V-Mount Battery Slide Pro for Sony FX9, ending filming for a dead battery is of the past. This battery slide enhances your experience tenfold by allowing a quick hot swap if your BP-U battery gets too low. Even with the battery plate attached, you’ll still have full access to the battery compartment on the camera. The battery plate position can be adjusted by loosening a lever and sliding the plate, and is slim enough to fit with the FX9 in a standard camera case!

D-Tap Tough. This battery plate features three D-Tap outputs for power accessories, and allows the camera to keep filming without interruption with a digital fuse that monitors the individual D-Tap ports and disables them if they exceed 3.8 amps. If it exceeds, the FX9 keeps on truckin’, and a red warning light on the side will flash on. Just remove the power cable, hit the reset button directly above the previously mentioned light, and reattach the power cable. Bada bing bada boom.', 114000.0, '{"Brand":"Wooden Camera","General":"Camera Power MethodConnector Inputs/Outputs3 x D-Tap Plate Front / Battery MountV-Mount Number of Battery Bays1","Item Type":"Power","Physical":"Dimensions7 × 3 × 1.75″ Weight0.77 lb","Power Type":"Battery Plate"}', 'Wooden
