Compatibility. The Z CAM Lens Mount for E2 Flagship Series (PL) is designed for the Z Cam E2-S6, E2-F6, E2-F8, and E2-M4 cameras and allows users to natively connect standard cinema PL mount lenses to their camera.

Durable Build. Easy Install. This lightweight lens mount is machined to provide a secure, locking connection between your lens and camera and is easily installed with four screws and an allen wrench.', 68000.0, '{"Brand":"Z Cam","Camera Mount":"Micro 4/3","Item Type":"Lens Support","Lens Mount":"PL","Lens Support Type":"Mount Adapter"}', 'PL lens mount
