If you’re using an FS100 or small-body DSLR (i.e. one without a “built-in” battery grip), you’ll also need to rent a Zacuto Z-Spacer to raise the camera to the proper height.', 150000.0, '{"Brand":"Zacuto","Camera Support Type":"Baseplate","Item Type":"Camera Support","Weight Capacity":"45 lbs."}', 'Universal
