Plate
	(2) 6.5" 15mm rods
	1/4-20" camera screw
	3/8-16" camera screw', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (4442, 3, 257, 'Zacuto VCT Pro Tripod Dock', 'zacuto-vct-pro-tripod-dock', 'The Zacuto VCT Pro Tripod Dock lets you easily take your camera off the VCT Pro Baseplate (separate rental item) and mount it onto a tripod, dolly, steadicam, or other device. The VCT Pro Top Plate slides off the baseplate with the push of a lever and into the dock quickly and easily. You can then securely mount your camera on the dock with a twist of its mini ratcheting lever.

The dock attaches to your tripod or device via 1/4"-20 and 3/8”-16 mounting screw holes centered in the bottom of the plate.', 64000.0, '{"Brand":"Zacuto","Camera Support Type":"Baseplate","Item Type":"Camera Support"}', 'VCT
Pro
Tripod
Dock', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (4443, 3, 257, 'Zacuto VCT Tripod Plate', 'zacuto-vct-tripod-plate', 'Zacuto’s VCT Tripod Plate can adapt a standard video tripod head to accommodate VCT-14 camera plates. This plate accepts Zacuto’s VCT Universal Baseplate for Recoil rigs.

The Zacuto VCT Tripod Plate is a quick-release plate designed for accepting wedge-style mounts like those found on Sony’s VCT-FSA5 and VCT-FS7 shoulder mounts, and Zacuto’s VCT Recoil kits.

This strong and fast quick-release system is designed for serious loads. There’s no need to worry about the security of your camera rig when you’re using the Zacuto VCT.', 114000.0, '{"Brand":"Zacuto","Camera Support Type":"Baseplate","Item Type":"Camera Support"}', 'Just the tripod plate', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (4444, 3, 257, 'Zacuto Z CAM E2 Series Flagship Cage', 'zacuto-z-cam-e2-series-flagship-cage', 'The Zacuto Z CAM E2 Series Flagship Cage is a modular, formfitting cage for select Z Cam E2 Series cameras that adds accessory mounts while protecting your camera in a full-cage enclosure. Key features include:

For Z Cam E2 Flagship cameras
ARRI-style rosettes and Z-Rails
1/4-20 and  3/8-16 accessory mounts
Arca Swiss-style bottom plate

E2 Flagship Compatibility. The Zacuto Z CAM E2 Series Flagship Cage is a durable yet lightweight cage for the Z CAM E2, E2-S6, E2-F6, and E2-M4 cameras. Please note, this cage is not compatible with the Z Cam E2C.

Z Cam Coverage. This cage consists of two side plates, a top plate, and a bottom plate that come together to form a compact, full enclosure cage, providing camera protection from all sides without obstructing camera ports, buttons, or the display. This kit also includes independent HDMI and USB protector clamps to ensure cable security as needed.

Accessory Mounting Solutions. The Z Cam E2 cage includes NATO compatible Z-Rails along the top and side plates with rows of 1/4"-20 and 3/8"-16 threaded holes for mounting a variety of common accessories. Each side plate also comes with integrated ARRI-style rosettes while the bottom plate features 1/4"-20 and 3/8"-16 threads for mounting to larger rigs and a built-in Arca-Swiss style base.', 54000.0, '{"Brand":"Zacuto","Camera Support Type":"Cage","Compatibility":"Z CAM E2, E2-F6, Z CAM E2-F8, Z CAM E2-S6, Z CAM E2-M4","Item Type":"Camera Support","Mounting Options":"Accessory Mounts1/4\\"-20 threaded holes 3/8\\"-16 threaded holesTop and side NATO railsCamera Plate MountsArca-Swiss Plate1/4\\"-20 tripod thread3/8\\"-16 tripod thread"}', 'Bottom
