Full-Frame Wide Angle. Designed with the full-frame Sony E-mount cameras in mind, the Batis 25mm f/2 gives you a true wide-angle option for the system. It has a 82º angle of view with minimal distortion, making it ideal for architecture, landscape, and interior photography. The fast f/2 aperture gives you low-light shooting capability and shallow depth of field.

Autofocus. While the Loxia line gives you great manual-focus/aperture lenses, the Batis line provides you with autofocus capability. Its linear motor offers fast, nearly silent performance.

