High-Quality Build. Like other Zeiss offerings, the Batis line features great build quality. Cosmetically, they look quite similar to the Touits, with their metal construction and rubberized focus rings. However, the Batis lenses can boast dust- and weather-sealed construction for peace of mind in inclement shooting conditions.

Compatible Cameras. This lens is compatible with the Sony a9, a7R III, a7 III, and a7S II cameras.', 207000.0, '{"Angle of View":"82º","Aperture Blades":"9, rounded","Brand":"Zeiss","Dimensions":"3.19 × 3.07″ (ø x L)","Filter Size":"67.0mm","Filter Type":"Screw-On","Focal Length":"25-25","Focus Type":"Autofocus","Groups/Elements":"8/10","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Format":"Full-Frame","Lens Mount":"Sony E","Lens Type":"Wide Angle and For Mirrorless","Maximum Aperture":"2.0","Maximum Magnification":"0.19x","Mfr. Model Number":"2103-750","Minimum Focusing Distance":"7.87\\"","Stabilization":"No","Weather Sealing":"Yes","Weight":"0.73 lb.","Zoom Type":"Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Zeiss
