Advanced optical design for high-quality images
Excellent low-light performance; shallow depth of field
Manual focus with internal-focusing mechanism
High-quality all-metal build

High-Quality Optics. The Zeiss ZE 28mm f/1.4 Otus APO Distagon for Canon features a complex Distagon optical formula to ensure the highest image quality. This lens uses APO optics to ensure optimum color performance and image contrast.

High Resolving Power. The Otus line of lenses is designed for high-resolution full-frame DSLRs. The advanced optics produce the highest possible image sharpness across the image plane at all apertures.

Fast Aperture. Wide Angle. The f/1.4 aperture provides stellar low-light performance with a shallow depth-of-field.

Premium Build. An all-metal lens housing gives the ZE 28mm f/1.4 Otus a premium feel. Its rubberized manual focus ring offers precision focus adjustment and highly visible focus-scale markings that are easy to see even in very low light.', 536000.0, '{"Brand":"Zeiss","Item Type":"Lens","Lens Mount":"Canon EF","Lens Type":"Wide Angle"}', 'Lens
