	1/4"-20 tripod adapter', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (4658, 1, 261, 'Zoom Q8n-4K Handy Video Recorder', 'zoom-q8n-4k-handy-video-recorder', 'The Zoom Q8n-4K Handy Video Recorder is a compact 4K camcorder designed for content creators, musicians, and filmmakers who favor simple and convenient recording solutions. Key features include:

Records up to UHD 4K video at 30 fps
Detachable X/Y condenser microphone
Selectable wide-angle 150° lens
Record separate audio/video tracks

Small but Handy. The Zoom Q8n-4K Handy Video Recorder weighs less than a pound, captures high-quality audio and video, is easy to use, and is affordable. It even features a flip-out color LCD and a detachable microphone. Rather than packing feature after feature that most content creators might never use, the Q8n-4K focuses on delivering high quality audio and video as seamlessly and conveniently as possible.

4K/30 FPS Footage. The Zoom Q8n comfortably records UHD 4K at 30 fps, and the f/2.8 aperture keeps the image clear even in moody studio lighting. The wide angle lens has a native 150° FOV, but with five selectable FOV options, you can frame tighter, close up shots with ease. The Q8n can function as a USB webcam, and features a micro-HDMI port for use with external monitors.

Ease of Use. 5 scene modes are available for common lighting situations, and the Q8n can use ambient lighting to pick whichever works best wherever you record. To make things even more simple, recording footage is as simple as pressing a button, and the LCD screen flips out for selfie-style recording. Compatible with microSD cards up to 512GB, you can safely record an entire rehearsal or show onto a single card without worrying about running out of space. Please note, recording times will vary based on video resolution and battery life. The Q8n features a rechargeable battery with a max runtime of 2.5 hours.

High Quality Audio. The Zoom Q8n features 2 stereo condenser microphones arranged in an X/Y pattern. Audio can be recorded with video or as separate WAV files up to 24-bit/96 kHz, allowing it to function as a 4-channel audio recorder. Audio functions include auto gain, a low-cut filter, two phantom-powered XLR inputs with a switchable -20 dB pad for external recording, and a headphone output for audio monitoring.', 132000.0, '{"Angle of View":"150°","Audio Recording":"WAV: 96.0 kHz\\nWAV: 48.0 kHz\\nWAV: 44.1 kHz","Brand":"Zoom","Camera Type":"Compact","Channels":"4.0-Channel","Compatible Media":"microSD","Display":"Non-Articulating Flip-Out LCD","Display Size":"2\\"","Inputs/Outputs":"VideoMicro-HDMI OutputAudio2 × 3-Pin XLR Mic/Line (+48 V Phantom Power) Input1/8\\" / 3.5 mm TRS Stereo Headphone/Line OutputPowerUSB Type-C InputOtherUSB Type-C Data/Video Output (Shared with Power Input)USB Type-A Control Input","Item Type":"Camera","Maximum Video Resolution":"4K","Mounting":"1/4\\"-20 Female","Screen Resolution":"320 × 240","Screen Type":"Touchscreen and Tilt","Sensor":"1/2.3\\"-Type CMOS Sensor","Sensor Size":"1-Inch","Video Format":"3840 × 2160 at 24/25/30 fps (H.264/AVC, MPEG-4)1920 × 1080 at 24/25/30/50/60 fps (MOV via H.264/AVC, MPEG-4)1280 × 720 at 24/25/30/50/60 fps (MOV via H.264/AVC, MPEG-4)","Weather Sealing":"No"}', 'Zoom
